/* 四级词汇海豚版的例句（第五十五次优化），按词条编号 i 存，并进 IELTS_RICH（rich() 先查它，编号和单词都对得上才用）。
   多数沿用《四级词汇2022版》里同一个词的例句，其余是整理时新写的，见 src/cet4d/Lxx.tsv。 */
window.IELTS_RICH=window.IELTS_RICH||{};Object.assign(window.IELTS_RICH,{
43001:{"w":"sincere","e":"Please accept my sincere thanks for all the help you gave me last year.","t":"去年您给了我那么多帮助，请接受我**真诚**的感谢。"},
43002:{"w":"statistic","e":"The writer pointed out that the employment statistic was deceptive.","t":"作者指出这个就业**统计数据**不可信。"},
43003:{"w":"label","e":"Always read the label on the bottle carefully before you take any medicine.","t":"吃任何药之前，都要仔细阅读瓶子上的**标签**。"},
43004:{"w":"mood","e":"She was in a good mood all day because her best friend was coming to visit.","t":"她一整天**心情**都很好，因为她最好的朋友要来看她。"},
43005:{"w":"pregnant","e":"The tablets are not given to children under 12 years of age or pregnant or breastfeeding women.","t":"12岁以下的儿童以及处于**妊娠期**或哺乳期的妇女禁用此药。"},
43006:{"w":"slim","e":"I like her slim and pretty hands so much.","t":"我非常喜欢她那双**纤细**美丽的手。"},
43007:{"w":"static","e":"Some people get static in their hair.","t":"有些人的头发会产生**静电**。"},
43008:{"w":"sector","e":"Nowadays more women are being employed in the business sector.","t":"现在，就职于商业**部门**的女性越来越多。"},
43009:{"w":"status","e":"The chart shows the amount of leisure time enjoyed by men and women of different employment status.","t":"这张图表显示了不同职业**身份**的男性和女性享有多少闲暇时间。"},
43010:{"w":"senator","e":"The senator gave a speech about education and promised to build more schools in rural areas.","t":"那位**参议员**发表了关于教育的演讲，承诺在农村地区修建更多学校。"},
43011:{"w":"detection","e":"Early detection of the disease can greatly improve a patient's chances of a full recovery.","t":"疾病的早期**发现**能大大提高病人完全康复的机会。"},
43012:{"w":"steady","e":"The van is making steady progress through the dark night.","t":"货车在黑夜中**平稳**行驶。"},
43013:{"w":"hobby","e":"My father's hobby is growing vegetables in the small garden behind our house.","t":"我爸爸的**业余爱好**是在屋后的小菜园里种菜。"},
43014:{"w":"statue","e":"There is a bronze statue of the famous poet in the middle of the park.","t":"公园中央有一座这位著名诗人的青铜**雕像**。"},
43015:{"w":"include","e":"Sports administrators' duties include booking playing fields with local councils.","t":"体育管理员的职责**包括**向地方委员会预订比赛场馆。"},
43016:{"w":"considering","e":"Considering how little time she had, she did a very good job on the report.","t":"**考虑到**她时间很少，这份报告她做得非常好。"},
43017:{"w":"lad","e":"The young lad who delivers our newspapers every morning is only fifteen years old.","t":"每天早上给我们送报纸的那个**小伙子**才十五岁。"},
43018:{"w":"bride","e":"The bride wore a beautiful white dress and smiled at all the guests.","t":"**新娘**穿着一件漂亮的白色婚纱，向所有客人微笑。"},
43019:{"w":"resistance","e":"The villagers showed strong resistance to the plan to build a factory near the river.","t":"村民们强烈**抵制**在河边建工厂的计划。"},
43020:{"w":"equip","e":"Underground offices in Japan are equipped with \"virtual\" windows and mirrors.","t":"日本的地下办公室**装有**虚拟的窗户和镜子。"},
43021:{"w":"cycle","e":"My father cycles to work every day, even when it is raining hard.","t":"我父亲每天**骑车**上班，下大雨也不例外。"},
43022:{"w":"prime","e":"He's a prime candidate to captain the team this season.","t":"他是本赛季队长的**最佳**人选。"},
43023:{"w":"frown","e":"My father frowned when he saw my poor marks in the math exam.","t":"爸爸看到我数学考试的低分时**皱起眉头**。"},
43024:{"w":"saucer","e":"She put the cup back on its saucer and smiled at her guest.","t":"她把杯子放回**茶托**上，对客人笑了笑。"},
43025:{"w":"ambassador","e":"The new ambassador arrived in Beijing last week and met several government leaders.","t":"新任**大使**上周抵达北京，会见了几位政府领导人。"},
43026:{"w":"fasten","e":"The driver must fasten his seat belt before driving.","t":"司机在开车前必须**系好**安全带。"},
43027:{"w":"skillful","e":"She is a skillful driver who stays calm even on busy mountain roads.","t":"她开车很**娴熟**，即使在繁忙的山路上也很冷静。"},
43028:{"w":"derive","e":"France derives three quarters of its electricity from nuclear power.","t":"法国四分之三的电力**来自**核能。"},
43029:{"w":"software","e":"You need to install this software on your computer before you can join the online class.","t":"你需要先在电脑上安装这个**软件**，才能参加网课。"},
43030:{"w":"civilization","e":"Ancient Egypt was one of the earliest civilizations, famous for its pyramids and temples.","t":"古埃及是最早的**文明**之一，以金字塔和神庙闻名。"},
43031:{"w":"sponsor","e":"He is the main sponsor of the conference.","t":"他是这次会议的主要**发起者**。"},
43032:{"w":"stir","e":"You'd better give the coffee a stir before you drink it.","t":"喝咖啡之前最好先**搅拌**一下。"},
43033:{"w":"overhead","e":"Please put your bags in the overhead lockers before the plane takes off.","t":"飞机起飞前，请把包放进**头顶上的**行李柜里。"},
43034:{"w":"proportion","e":"A large proportion of the students in our class go to school by bike.","t":"我们班骑自行车上学的学生占很大**比例**。"},
43035:{"w":"distribution","e":"A society can achieve a fair distribution of resources only under conditions of economic growth.","t":"只有在经济增长的前提下，社会才可能对资源进行公平**分配**。"},
43036:{"w":"clash","e":"The two groups of fans clashed outside the stadium after the football match.","t":"足球比赛结束后，两群球迷在体育场外**发生冲突**。"},
43037:{"w":"mental","e":"Health is a complete state of physical, mental and social well-being.","t":"健康是生理、**心理**以及交际情况的一种整体良好状态。"},
43038:{"w":"flexible","e":"Cars easily surpass trains or buses as a flexible and convenient mode of personal transport.","t":"小汽车轻易地超越火车和公共汽车，成为一种**灵活**、便利的个人交通工具。"},
43039:{"w":"grant","e":"The loan is intended to supplement the grant for living costs.","t":"这笔贷款是打算用来补充生活费**补助金**的。"},
43040:{"w":"punch","e":"The robber punched the shopkeeper on his head and stole the cash.","t":"盗贼**重击**了店主的头部而后抢走了现金。"},
43041:{"w":"solution","e":"It took time to find a solution to the problem.","t":"找到解决该问题的**方法**需要时间。"},
43042:{"w":"bond","e":"The bond between the two brothers grew stronger after their father died.","t":"父亲去世后，兄弟俩之间的**联系**更紧密了。"},
43043:{"w":"result","e":"She was very happy with the result of her final exam this term.","t":"她对这学期期末考试的**结果**很满意。"},
43044:{"w":"panel","e":"A panel of five teachers will choose the winner of the speech contest.","t":"一个由五位老师组成的**评审小组**将选出演讲比赛的冠军。"},
43045:{"w":"staff","e":"Managers estimate staff productivity in terms of their working hours.","t":"经理通过**职员**的工作时间来评估他们的生产效率。"},
43046:{"w":"client","e":"Physical fitness instructors prepare exercise routines to suit the individual client's age and level of fitness.","t":"健身教练会根据每一位**学员**的年龄和健康层次安排他（或她）的常规训练。"},
43047:{"w":"ministry","e":"People can call the Ministry of Justice for free legal advice.","t":"人们可以打电话到司法**部**进行免费的法律咨询。"},
43048:{"w":"intermediate","e":"Students who have reached an intermediate level benefit from learning general English skills.","t":"那些英语水平达到**中级**的学生从英语综合技能学习中受益匪浅。"},
43049:{"w":"steamer","e":"In the old days, people crossed the river on a slow steamer.","t":"过去，人们乘坐慢悠悠的**轮船**过河。"},
43050:{"w":"supreme","e":"Winning the gold medal was the supreme moment of her long career as a swimmer.","t":"赢得金牌是她漫长游泳生涯中**最重要**的时刻。"},
43051:{"w":"guitar","e":"My brother plays the guitar in a small band at his university.","t":"我哥哥在大学的一个小乐队里弹**吉他**。"},
43052:{"w":"option","e":"To increase the output of crops per acre, a farmer's easiest option is to use fertilisers and pesticides.","t":"为增加每英亩农作物的产量，农民最简单的**选择**是使用肥料和杀虫剂。"},
43053:{"w":"describe","e":"The lecturer describes four processes which may contribute to the extinction of a species.","t":"演讲者**描述**了可能导致一个物种灭绝的四个过程。"},
43054:{"w":"comprehensive","e":"His account of the meeting was most comprehensive.","t":"他对会议的叙述**面面俱到**。"},
43055:{"w":"dormitory","e":"Most first-year students live in the dormitory on campus and share a room with three others.","t":"大多数一年级学生住在校园**宿舍**里，和另外三个人合住一间。"},
43056:{"w":"limb","e":"A strong wind broke a large limb off the old tree in our garden last night.","t":"昨晚一阵大风把我们花园里那棵老树的一根大**树枝**吹断了。"},
43057:{"w":"presence","e":"The presence of so many reporters at the airport made the young singer very nervous.","t":"机场有那么多记者**在场**，让这位年轻歌手非常紧张。"},
43058:{"w":"attitude","e":"We've been looking at the attitudes of various social and cultural groups towards the management of their personal finances.","t":"我们一直关注不同的社会和文化群体对个人理财的**看法**。"},
43059:{"w":"circumstance","e":"Under no circumstances should you leave small children alone in the car.","t":"无论在什么**情况**下，都不要把小孩单独留在车里。"},
43060:{"w":"appliance","e":"On Wednesdays, I repair electrical appliances free of charge.","t":"每逢周三，我都给人免费修理**电器**。"},
43061:{"w":"steep","e":"It's very steep here and the surface is a little slippery.","t":"这儿很**陡**，地面还有点滑。"},
43062:{"w":"core","e":"Trust and honesty are at the core of a long and happy friendship.","t":"信任和诚实是长久而美好的友谊的**核心**。"},
43063:{"w":"cushion","e":"She put a soft cushion behind her back and sat down to read.","t":"她在背后放了个软**靠垫**，坐下来看书。"},
43064:{"w":"agency","e":"Her mother works for a government agency that helps people find jobs.","t":"她妈妈在一个帮人找工作的政府**部门**工作。"},
43065:{"w":"assistant","e":"The employees felt that their assistant manager was closer to them than the manager.","t":"和经理相比，员工们感觉**助理**经理与他们更亲近。"},
43066:{"w":"emergency","e":"If it's an emergency, you can phone at any time.","t":"如果发生**紧急情况**，你可以随时来电。"},
43067:{"w":"steer","e":"He steered his car very carefully along the narrow mountain roads.","t":"他非常小心地**驾**车行驶在狭窄的山路上。"},
43068:{"w":"mess","e":"After the party, the living room was in a terrible mess, with cups and plates everywhere.","t":"聚会结束后，客厅里**一片狼藉**，到处都是杯子和盘子。"},
43069:{"w":"solve","e":"Technology alone cannot solve the problem of vehicle pollution.","t":"仅仅靠技术不可能**解决**机动车辆带来的污染问题。"},
43070:{"w":"scandal","e":"The scandal destroyed the government's image completely.","t":"这件**丑闻**完全毁了政府的形象。"},
43071:{"w":"minus","e":"The temperature in the mountains dropped to minus twenty degrees last night.","t":"昨晚山里的气温降到了**零下**二十度。"},
43072:{"w":"definite","e":"I have no definite plans for my future.","t":"我对未来并没有**明确的**规划。"},
43073:{"w":"incredible","e":"The facts have been distorted to an incredible degree.","t":"事实已被歪曲到**不可信**的地步了。"},
43074:{"w":"politician","e":"The young politician promised to create more jobs if people voted for him.","t":"这位年轻的**政治家**承诺，如果人们投票给他，他会创造更多就业机会。"},
43075:{"w":"cautious","e":"We should be more cautious not to make any mistakes in our papers.","t":"我们要更加**小心**以避免在试卷上出现任何错误。"},
43076:{"w":"abroad","e":"More and more Chinese students choose to study abroad after they finish high school.","t":"越来越多的中国学生高中毕业后选择**出国**留学。"},
43077:{"w":"royal","e":"Thousands of people came to watch the royal wedding in front of the palace.","t":"数千人来到王宫前观看**王室**婚礼。"},
43078:{"w":"prayer","e":"Before every meal, the old woman says a short prayer to give thanks for her food.","t":"每顿饭前，那位老妇人都会做一个简短的**祷告**，为食物表示感谢。"},
43079:{"w":"detective","e":"The detective searched the room carefully and finally found an important clue under the bed.","t":"**侦探**仔细搜查了房间，终于在床底下找到了一条重要线索。"},
43080:{"w":"barber","e":"I go to the barber every month to have my hair cut short.","t":"我每个月都去**理发师**那里把头发剪短。"},
43081:{"w":"nest","e":"A pair of birds built a nest in the tree outside my window.","t":"一对鸟在我窗外的树上筑了个**鸟巢**。"},
43082:{"w":"stiff","e":"We felt stiff after a long walk.","t":"走了很长一段路后，我们感觉腿脚**发僵**。"},
43083:{"w":"stocking","e":"On cold winter days, she wears thick stockings under her skirt to keep her legs warm.","t":"寒冷的冬天，她在裙子里面穿厚厚的**长筒袜**来给腿保暖。"},
43084:{"w":"domestic","e":"The evidence we have suggests that domestic trade was greater than external trade at all periods.","t":"我们掌握的证据表明，无论在哪个时期，**国内**贸易都要比对外贸易发达。"},
43085:{"w":"stimulate","e":"Why don't we try massaging the feet to stimulate blood flow?","t":"我们为什么不试试按摩双足来**促进**血液循环呢？"},
43086:{"w":"delegate","e":"Each country sent three delegates to the meeting on climate change in Paris.","t":"每个国家派了三名**代表**参加在巴黎举行的气候变化会议。"},
43087:{"w":"chest","e":"At the very bottom of the chest were his carving tools.","t":"在**储物箱**的最底部有他的雕刻工具。"},
43088:{"w":"fame","e":"The young singer won fame all over the country after just one song on TV.","t":"这位年轻歌手只在电视上唱了一首歌，就在全国赢得了**名声**。"},
43089:{"w":"highlight","e":"You'd better underline or highlight new words in this paragraph.","t":"你最好把这个段落中的生词画线或用**高亮标出**。"},
43090:{"w":"airline","e":"This airline offers cheap flights from Beijing to many cities in Southeast Asia.","t":"这家**航空公司**提供从北京飞往东南亚许多城市的廉价航班。"},
43091:{"w":"consume","e":"Big cars consume much more fuel than small ones, so they cost more to run.","t":"大车比小车**消耗**的油多得多，所以使用成本更高。"},
43092:{"w":"depression","e":"The economic depression of the 1930s and the Second World War prevented the advanced ideas from being widely realized.","t":"20世纪30年代的经济**萧条**和第二次世界大战阻碍了先进思想的传播，使其不能得到广泛认识。"},
43093:{"w":"rebel","e":"Teenagers often rebel against their parents' rules as they try to become more independent.","t":"青少年在努力变得更独立的过程中，常常**不服从**父母定的规矩。"},
43094:{"w":"accelerate","e":"The leader lost ground as the rest of the runners accelerated.","t":"领先者在其余赛跑者**加速**时逐渐失去了优势。"},
43095:{"w":"signature","e":"Please put your signature at the bottom of the form before you hand it in.","t":"交表之前，请在表格底部**签名**。"},
43096:{"w":"satisfactory","e":"The manager said my work this year was satisfactory, but he hoped I could do even better.","t":"经理说我今年的工作**令人满意**，但希望我能做得更好。"},
43097:{"w":"lightning","e":"We saw a flash of lightning and then heard loud thunder over the hills.","t":"我们看到一道**闪电**，接着听到山那边传来响亮的雷声。"},
43098:{"w":"atmosphere","e":"The atmosphere at the party was warm and friendly, and everyone enjoyed themselves.","t":"聚会上**气氛**温馨友好，大家都玩得很开心。"},
43099:{"w":"stem","e":"As the axe cut through the stem, the tree fell.","t":"斧子砍断**树干**时，树倒了下来。"},
43100:{"w":"sting","e":"A bee stung my arm while I was picking flowers in the garden.","t":"我在花园里摘花时，一只蜜蜂**蜇伤**了我的胳膊。"},
43101:{"w":"evaluate","e":"We evaluated the students' skills on the basis of test results.","t":"我们在考试成绩的基础上对学生的技能进行**评估**。"},
43102:{"w":"render","e":"Thousands of people were rendered homeless by the terrible earthquake.","t":"可怕的地震**使得**成千上万的人们流离失所。"},
43103:{"w":"bound","e":"Because these courses start every Monday, there's bound to be one that fits in with your academic, personal or professional commitments.","t":"因为这些课程每周一都开，所以**一定**有适合你学习、针对你个人或工作内容的课程。"},
43104:{"w":"rescue","e":"Several school children were rescued from the burning building.","t":"几名小学生被从燃烧的大楼里成功**救出**。"},
43105:{"w":"object","e":"The teacher asked us to name the objects on the table in English.","t":"老师让我们用英语说出桌上**物品**的名称。"},
43106:{"w":"rouse","e":"The loud noise from the street roused me from a deep sleep at midnight.","t":"半夜街上的巨大噪声把我从熟睡中**惊醒**了。"},
43107:{"w":"personality","e":"If you are in a role for long, it eventually becomes part of you, part of your personality.","t":"如果你长久地处于一个角色中，最终它将成为你的一部分，成为你**个性**的一部分。"},
43108:{"w":"gardener","e":"The gardener waters the flowers in the park every morning before people arrive.","t":"**园丁**每天早上在游人到来之前给公园里的花浇水。"},
43109:{"w":"cultivate","e":"This banana is the first type to be cultivated here.","t":"这种香蕉是这里最早**种植**的品种。"},
43110:{"w":"latter","e":"The latter part of the film was much more exciting than the beginning.","t":"这部电影的**后半**部分比开头精彩得多。"},
43111:{"w":"shrink","e":"Employees found their time on the job shrinking to 8 hours daily.","t":"雇员们发现他们的工作时间已经**减少**到每天八小时。"},
43112:{"w":"material","e":"Glass is the great building material of the future.","t":"玻璃是未来重要的建筑**材料**。"},
43113:{"w":"parliament","e":"The exhibition met with great opposition from Parliament.","t":"这次展览遭到了**国会**的强烈反对。"},
43114:{"w":"parade","e":"Thousands of people lined the streets to watch the parade on National Day.","t":"国庆节那天，成千上万的人站在街道两旁观看**游行**。"},
43115:{"w":"personnel","e":"All personnel were asked to participate in the meeting.","t":"此次会议要求全体**员工**参加。"},
43116:{"w":"input","e":"The machine needs a regular input of energy to keep running smoothly.","t":"这台机器需要定期**输入**能量才能平稳运转。"},
43117:{"w":"rumour","e":"There is a rumour that our school will close next year, but nobody knows if it's true.","t":"有**谣言**说我们学校明年要关闭，但没人知道是不是真的。"},
43118:{"w":"display","e":"The windows display postcards and greeting cards designed by women artists for New Year.","t":"橱窗**陈列**着女艺术家们为新年设计的明信片和贺卡。"},
43119:{"w":"partial","e":"Parents should not be partial to any one of their children.","t":"父母不该对某个孩子**偏心**。"},
43120:{"w":"rug","e":"The cat likes to sleep on the soft rug in front of the fire.","t":"猫喜欢睡在炉火前那块柔软的**小地毯**上。"},
43121:{"w":"particle","e":"This type of smoke contains more, smaller particles and is therefore more likely to be deposited deep in the lungs.","t":"这种烟含有更多更小的**颗粒**，因此更可能沉淀到肺部深处。"},
43122:{"w":"loyalty","e":"Trade discounts may be used as a competitive stratagem to secure customer loyalty.","t":"商业折扣可以用作保持顾客**忠诚度**的一种竞争策略。"},
43123:{"w":"establish","e":"You may have to establish new eating habits in order to keep healthy.","t":"为了保持健康，你需要**养成**一些新的饮食习惯。"},
43124:{"w":"frog","e":"On summer nights we could hear the frogs singing in the fields near our house.","t":"夏天的夜里，我们能听到房子附近田里的**青蛙**在叫。"},
43125:{"w":"calendar","e":"Their five-year-old son is able to use the calendar to count how many days until his birthday.","t":"他们五岁的儿子能用**日历**数出离他的生日还有多少天。"},
43126:{"w":"primarily","e":"The new library is designed primarily for students, but anyone in the town can use it.","t":"新图书馆**主要**是为学生设计的，但镇上任何人都可以使用。"},
43127:{"w":"impression","e":"Could you tell us something about your first impression of the town when you arrived?","t":"你能不能告诉我当你初到这个小镇时，你的第一**印象**是什么？"},
43128:{"w":"overlook","e":"It is easy to overlook small mistakes when you are writing an essay in a hurry.","t":"匆忙写作文时，很容易**忽视**一些小错误。"},
43129:{"w":"kindness","e":"I will never forget the kindness of the stranger who helped me find my way.","t":"我永远不会忘记那位帮我找路的陌生人的**好意**。"},
43130:{"w":"biology","e":"In biology class today, we looked at plant cells under a microscope.","t":"今天的**生物**课上，我们用显微镜观察了植物细胞。"},
43131:{"w":"debate","e":"There's a debate in the meeting room about next year's budget.","t":"会议室里（大家）就来年的预算产生了**争论**。"},
43132:{"w":"breast","e":"The little bird has a red breast and a short black tail.","t":"这只小鸟有着红色的**胸脯**和短短的黑尾巴。"},
43133:{"w":"drunk","e":"He was too drunk to drive, so his friend took him home in a taxi.","t":"他**喝醉**了，不能开车，所以朋友打车送他回了家。"},
43134:{"w":"stoop","e":"The old man stooped to pick up the coin that had fallen on the floor.","t":"老人**弯腰**捡起掉在地上的硬币。"},
43135:{"w":"sticky","e":"My fingers are sticky from that candy bar.","t":"糖块把我的手指弄得**黏糊糊**的。"},
43136:{"w":"barrier","e":"When she first moved to Japan, the language barrier made it hard to make friends.","t":"她刚搬到日本时，语言**障碍**让她很难交到朋友。"},
43137:{"w":"ballet","e":"My daughter has been taking ballet lessons since she was five years old.","t":"我女儿从五岁起就一直在上**芭蕾舞**课。"},
43138:{"w":"boost","e":"Apparently, stock prices were boosted by the President's recovery report and supportive policies from the government.","t":"显而易见，股票价格随着总统的经济复苏报告和政府的扶持政策而一路**上扬**。"},
43139:{"w":"stock","e":"Sorry, this jacket is out of stock in your size, but we will get more next week.","t":"抱歉，这件夹克您穿的尺码没有**现货**了，下周会再到货。"},
43140:{"w":"fund","e":"They provide funds for zoos in underdeveloped countries.","t":"他们为不发达国家的动物园提供**资金**。"},
43141:{"w":"fisherman","e":"The old fisherman goes out to sea every morning before the sun comes up.","t":"那位老**渔夫**每天早上太阳升起前就出海。"},
43142:{"w":"cube","e":"Cut the potatoes into small cubes and boil them for about ten minutes.","t":"把土豆切成小**方块**，煮十分钟左右。"},
43143:{"w":"acceptance","e":"The teacher's quick acceptance of our idea for the class trip made us very happy.","t":"老师很快**接受**了我们的班级旅行想法，这让我们很开心。"},
43144:{"w":"interpretation","e":"My interpretation of the drama was rather superficial.","t":"我对戏剧的**理解**相当肤浅。"},
43145:{"w":"submerge","e":"The city was submerged by the flood.","t":"这座城市被洪水**淹没**了。"},
43146:{"w":"mayor","e":"The mayor promised to build two new parks in the city next year.","t":"**市长**承诺明年在城里新建两座公园。"},
43147:{"w":"string","e":"She tied the box with a piece of red string and wrote her friend's name on it.","t":"她用一根红色的**细绳**把盒子捆好，在上面写上了朋友的名字。"},
43148:{"w":"credit","e":"Students need to earn at least 120 credits before they can graduate from this university.","t":"学生至少要修满120个**学分**才能从这所大学毕业。"},
43149:{"w":"equation","e":"The teacher wrote a simple equation on the board and asked us to solve it.","t":"老师在黑板上写了一个简单的**方程式**，让我们来解。"},
43150:{"w":"illustrate","e":"The diagram illustrates the information provided in paragraphs B-F of the reading.","t":"该图**说明**了阅读材料中B~F段出现的信息。"},
43151:{"w":"surroundings","e":"Those who could afford to live in more pleasant surroundings moved out.","t":"那些支付得起更舒适的**环境**的人都搬了出去。"},
43152:{"w":"routine","e":"Walking the dog in the park before breakfast has become part of my daily routine.","t":"早饭前去公园遛狗已经成了我每天的**惯例**。"},
43153:{"w":"helpful","e":"Thank you for your advice; it was really helpful when I was looking for a job.","t":"谢谢你的建议，我找工作时它真的很**有用**。"},
43154:{"w":"stove","e":"My mother is cooking a big pot of soup on the stove for dinner.","t":"妈妈正在**炉子**上煮一大锅汤当晚饭。"},
43155:{"w":"ripe","e":"When one banana is ripe, it will give off a gas which then helps all the others to ripen.","t":"当一根香蕉**成熟**了，它便会释放出一种气体催熟其他香蕉。"},
43156:{"w":"leak","e":"There is a leak in the roof, so we put a bucket under it when it rains.","t":"屋顶有个**漏洞**，所以下雨时我们在下面放个桶。"},
43157:{"w":"submit","e":"All students must submit their essays to the teacher before Friday afternoon.","t":"所有学生必须在周五下午之前把论文**提交**给老师。"},
43158:{"w":"prove","e":"Scientists have proved that regular exercise can help people sleep better at night.","t":"科学家已经**证明**，经常锻炼能帮助人们晚上睡得更好。"},
43159:{"w":"product","e":"This company sells its products in more than thirty countries around the world.","t":"这家公司的**产品**销往全球三十多个国家。"},
43160:{"w":"carrier","e":"Some people are carriers of the virus but never feel sick themselves.","t":"有些人是这种病毒的**携带者**，自己却从来不觉得难受。"},
43161:{"w":"likewise","e":"My father works hard every day, and my mother does likewise at her hospital.","t":"我爸爸每天努力工作，妈妈在医院里也**同样如此**。"},
43162:{"w":"strip","e":"She cut the paper into long strips and used them to make a basket.","t":"她把纸剪成长长的**纸条**，用来编了一个篮子。"},
43163:{"w":"imply","e":"His silence seemed to imply that he did not agree with our plan.","t":"他的沉默似乎**暗示**他不同意我们的计划。"},
43164:{"w":"crude","e":"The tribesmen still use bows, arrows and crude digging sticks.","t":"该部落成员依然使用弓箭和**粗糙**的挖掘棍。"},
43165:{"w":"stripe","e":"This skirt has a red stripe around the edge.","t":"这条裙子的边上有一圈红色**条纹**。"},
43166:{"w":"strain","e":"Reading in poor light for hours can strain your eyes and give you a headache.","t":"在昏暗的光线下连续看几个小时书会使眼睛**过度疲劳**，还会让你头疼。"},
43167:{"w":"explore","e":"Architects began to explore ways of creating buildings using the latest technology.","t":"建筑师开始**探索**利用最新技术来建造房屋的方法。"},
43168:{"w":"communicate","e":"Good teachers communicate clearly with their students and encourage them to ask questions in class.","t":"好老师会和学生清楚地**沟通**，并鼓励他们在课堂上提问。"},
43169:{"w":"developmental","e":"This report looks at the developmental problems facing poor countries in Africa.","t":"这份报告研究了非洲贫穷国家面临的**发展**问题。"},
43170:{"w":"overnight","e":"It rained heavily overnight, so the roads were still wet when we left for school.","t":"**整夜**都在下大雨，所以我们去上学时路面还是湿的。"},
43171:{"w":"following","e":"Please read the passage carefully and then answer the following questions in English.","t":"请仔细阅读这篇短文，然后用英语回答**下列**问题。"},
43172:{"w":"consist","e":"Each hour consists of 50-minute tuition and a 10-minute break.","t":"每小时的内容**包括**50分钟的讲解和10分钟的休息。"},
43173:{"w":"strategy","e":"The Ottawa Charter presents fundamental strategies and approaches in achieving health for all.","t":"《渥太华宪章》提出了实现全民健康的基本**策略**和方法。"},
43174:{"w":"consumer","e":"Many consumers feel that government and business have taken on the environmental agenda.","t":"许多**消费者**认为政府和商家已经将环保提上了日程。"},
43175:{"w":"strap","e":"This strap on my briefcase is broken.","t":"我公文包的这根**带子**断了。"},
43176:{"w":"straw","e":"The little girl drank her orange juice through a long paper straw.","t":"小女孩用一根长长的纸**吸管**喝橙汁。"},
43177:{"w":"emotional","e":"Mother is the essential part in a family for which she often provides emotional support.","t":"母亲是一个家庭中非常重要的成员，她常常要为整个家庭提供**情感**支持。"},
43178:{"w":"efficient","e":"The financial analyst found efficient ways for the company to save money.","t":"财务分析师找到了能够**有效**地替公司省钱的方法。"},
43179:{"w":"bind","e":"The laws must bind everyone, high and low, or they are not laws at all.","t":"法律必须**约束**所有人，不论贵贱，否则根本就不能算是法律。"},
43180:{"w":"craft","e":"This region is a diverse agricultural area, rich in historic sites, arts and crafts.","t":"该地区为多种农作物种植带，且具有众多的历史遗址，艺术形式丰富，**手工艺**发达。"},
43181:{"w":"accommodation","e":"If you are booking accommodation through the school, your course and accommodation deposit will be $200.","t":"如果你通过学校预订**食宿**，你的课程和膳宿押金是200美元。"},
43182:{"w":"hedge","e":"A tall hedge around the garden keeps out the wind and the noise from the road.","t":"花园四周高高的**树篱**挡住了风和马路上的噪声。"},
43183:{"w":"institute","e":"The Language Institute provides student support, welfare and activities services.","t":"语言**学院**为学生提供资助、福利和活动服务。"},
43184:{"w":"stream","e":"The leaves were washed by rain into streams and rivers.","t":"树叶被雨水冲进了**小溪**与河流中。"},
43185:{"w":"bearing","e":"The old soldier still had the proud bearing of a man who once led an army.","t":"这位老兵依然保持着曾经统率过军队的人那种骄傲的**举止**。"},
43186:{"w":"indispensable","e":"A good dictionary is indispensable for anyone who wants to learn a foreign language.","t":"对任何想学外语的人来说，一本好词典都是**必不可少**的。"},
43187:{"w":"layer","e":"Between the islands there was a layer of soft mud.","t":"在小岛之间有一**层**软泥。"},
43188:{"w":"suppose","e":"I suppose you're going to tell me the whole history of banana growing now, aren't you?","t":"我**猜**你是打算现在给我讲解香蕉种植的整个历史，对吗？"},
43189:{"w":"scheme","e":"The government has been funding a loans scheme for students in higher education since September 1990.","t":"自1990年9月起，政府就开始为大学生贷款**计划**提供资金。"},
43190:{"w":"exclaim","e":"\"What a beautiful view!\" she exclaimed when she reached the top of the hill.","t":"她登上山顶时**惊呼**道：“多美的景色啊！”"},
43191:{"w":"access","e":"The only access to the farmhouse is a narrow road through the forest.","t":"去那座农舍的唯一**通道**是一条穿过森林的窄路。"},
43192:{"w":"scale","e":"The city is planning a large-scale project to plant trees along all its main roads.","t":"这座城市正计划开展一项大**规模**工程，在所有主干道两旁种树。"},
43193:{"w":"representative","e":"Your examiner is a Student Union representative.","t":"你的主考官是学生会**代表**。"},
43194:{"w":"remain","e":"Only a few students remained in the classroom after the bell rang.","t":"铃声响后，教室里只**剩下**几个学生。"},
43195:{"w":"replace","e":"The new fuel is as inefficient as the one they have replaced.","t":"这种新型燃料和被它们**取代**的燃料一样效率低下。"},
43196:{"w":"forecast","e":"The economic report forecast a sharp drop in unemployment for the next year.","t":"据经济报告**预测**，来年的失业人数将明显减少。"},
43197:{"w":"abstract","e":"Thus, we concluded that the blind interpret abstract shapes as sighted people do.","t":"于是，我们得出结论：盲人与视力正常者对**抽象**形状的理解是一样的。"},
43198:{"w":"bark","e":"Our neighbour's dog barks constantly.","t":"邻居家的狗总是**叫**个不停。"},
43199:{"w":"discipline","e":"Sports Studies as a discipline is still comparatively new.","t":"体育研究仍是一个相对较新的**学科**。"},
43200:{"w":"stretch","e":"After sitting at his desk for hours, he stood up and stretched his arms.","t":"在书桌前坐了几个小时后，他站起来**伸展**了一下手臂。"},
43201:{"w":"accustom","e":"If you go abroad for further study, it will take a period of time for you to accustom yourself to the new environment, the new culture and all the new rules and regulations.","t":"如果你出国留学，那么你需要花上一些时间让自己**习惯**新的环境、新的文化和所有新的规则与制度。"},
43202:{"w":"neutral","e":"The feminist took neutral ground during the first interview.","t":"这名女权主义者在第一次采访中采取了**中立**的态度。"},
43203:{"w":"approximate","e":"I would like to know the approximate price of this car.","t":"我想了解一下这辆车的**大概**价位。"},
43204:{"w":"database","e":"The library keeps the names of all its books in a large database.","t":"图书馆把所有藏书的书名存在一个大型**数据库**里。"},
43205:{"w":"interpret","e":"I wanted to discover whether there were differences in how the blind and the sighted interpreted colours.","t":"我希望可以发现失明者与有视力者对颜色的**描述**是否有所不同。"},
43206:{"w":"striking","e":"The most striking thing about the new library is its huge glass roof.","t":"新图书馆最**引人注目**的是它巨大的玻璃屋顶。"},
43207:{"w":"elevate","e":"John has been elevated to manager.","t":"约翰已被**提升**为经理。"},
43208:{"w":"knot","e":"He tied a knot in the rope so that it would not slip through his hands.","t":"他在绳子上打了一个**绳结**，这样绳子就不会从手里滑脱。"},
43209:{"w":"abuse","e":"Some officials abuse their power to get money and gifts from local businesses.","t":"一些官员**滥用**职权，从当地企业那里收取钱财和礼物。"},
43210:{"w":"impulse","e":"Mary bought the dress on impulse.","t":"玛丽一时**冲动**买了这件衣服。"},
43211:{"w":"desirable","e":"Selecting the right person for the job involves more than identifying the essential or desirable range of skills.","t":"为一份工作选择合适的人选，不能只看此人是否拥有胜任这份工作的基本技能和**理想的**专长。"},
43212:{"w":"journalism","e":"After graduating, she decided to work in journalism and joined a local newspaper.","t":"毕业后，她决定从事**新闻工作**，加入了一家地方报社。"},
43213:{"w":"fireplace","e":"On cold winter nights, the whole family sat around the fireplace and told stories.","t":"寒冷的冬夜，全家人围坐在**壁炉**旁讲故事。"},
43214:{"w":"promote","e":"The band has gone on tour to promote their new album.","t":"这个乐队已开始巡回**宣传**他们的新唱片。"},
43215:{"w":"maiden","e":"In the old story, a brave prince saves a beautiful maiden from a dragon.","t":"在那个古老的故事里，一位勇敢的王子从恶龙手中救出了一位美丽的**少女**。"},
43216:{"w":"gown","e":"The bride wore a long white gown and carried a small bunch of flowers.","t":"新娘穿着一件白色的长**礼服**，手里捧着一小束花。"},
43217:{"w":"calorie","e":"A small bottle of cola contains about two hundred calories, so I try not to drink it.","t":"一小瓶可乐含有约两百**卡路里**的热量，所以我尽量不喝。"},
43218:{"w":"haul","e":"The fishermen hauled their heavy boat up onto the beach before the storm.","t":"暴风雨来临前，渔民们把沉重的船**用力拖**上了沙滩。"},
43219:{"w":"criterion","e":"Success in studying at school is not an appropriate criterion of achievement in life.","t":"在学校里学习好并不是衡量人生成就的一个恰当的**标准**。"},
43220:{"w":"beforehand","e":"The experiment will last for one year. Beforehand, several months are devoted to planning.","t":"试验将持续一年的时间。**在此之前**，要用几个月的时间制订计划。"},
43221:{"w":"congress","e":"The congress called on the local governments to reopen schools after the war.","t":"战后，**国会**号召地方政府重开学校。"},
43222:{"w":"talent","e":"She showed a great talent for music when she was only five years old.","t":"她年仅五岁时就显示出了非凡的音乐**才能**。"},
43223:{"w":"charity","e":"I have some things to give to the local charity in a box in the front room.","t":"前厅有个盒子，里面装了些东西，我准备捐给当地的**慈善机构**。"},
43224:{"w":"bump","e":"The policeman ran after the thief, bumping against people in his hurry.","t":"那个警察追赶小偷，匆忙中**撞到**了人。"},
43225:{"w":"comparison","e":"In comparison with last year, this summer has been much cooler and wetter.","t":"和去年**相比**，今年夏天凉快得多，雨也多得多。"},
43226:{"w":"entitle","e":"As a member of the museum you would be entitled to use the members' lounge for refreshments.","t":"作为博物馆的会员，你**有权**在会员休息室内享用茶点。"},
43227:{"w":"stroke","e":"People who suffer strokes on the left side of the brain usually lose their power of speech.","t":"左脑**中风**的人常常会丧失语言能力。"},
43228:{"w":"stuff","e":"The premium coffee like the stuff we're drinking now is from a type of bean called Arabica.","t":"特级咖啡，就像我们现在喝的**东西**，是由一种叫阿拉比卡的咖啡豆制成的。"},
43229:{"w":"span","e":"The workers completed the building within the span of three months.","t":"工人们在三个月的**时间**内建成了这栋大楼。"},
43230:{"w":"ingredient","e":"Flour, eggs and sugar are the main ingredients of this simple cake.","t":"面粉、鸡蛋和糖是这种简单蛋糕的主要**原料**。"},
43231:{"w":"brow","e":"He wiped the sweat from his brow after working in the sun all morning.","t":"在太阳下干了一上午活后，他擦了擦**额头**上的汗。"},
43232:{"w":"pea","e":"My mother cooked rice, chicken and some fresh green peas for dinner last night.","t":"昨晚妈妈做了米饭、鸡肉和一些新鲜的**豌豆**当晚餐。"},
43233:{"w":"arbitrary","e":"The workers were angry about the manager's arbitrary decision to cut their holidays without any reason.","t":"经理毫无理由就**专断地**决定削减工人们的假期，让他们很生气。"},
43234:{"w":"infer","e":"I infer from your letter that you have not made up your mind yet.","t":"我从你的信中**推断**出你还没下定决心。"},
43235:{"w":"subsequent","e":"This incident was of great importance in the subsequent development of events.","t":"这一事件对**后续**事态的发展影响重大。"},
43236:{"w":"pinch","e":"Add a pinch of salt to the soup and stir it well before serving.","t":"上菜前，往汤里加**一撮**盐，搅拌均匀。"},
43237:{"w":"grand","e":"The grand old hotel by the lake has been welcoming guests for over a hundred years.","t":"湖边那座**宏伟**的老酒店已经接待客人一百多年了。"},
43238:{"w":"instruct","e":"PE teachers instruct students how to exercise, play sports, and do other recreational activities correctly and safely.","t":"体育老师**指导**学生们如何安全正确地锻炼、做运动以及进行其他娱乐活动。"},
43239:{"w":"exploit","e":"Our company was quick to exploit a money-making opportunity provided by the government.","t":"我们公司很快就**抓住**了政府提供的赚钱机会。"},
43240:{"w":"stress","e":"Bookstores now abound with manuals describing how to manage time and cope with stress.","t":"现在书店里有很多关于如何安排时间、缓解**压力**的手册。"},
43241:{"w":"spite","e":"He put the house up for sale out of spite at his family.","t":"他将房子出售是出于对家人的**怨恨**。"},
43242:{"w":"action","e":"We must take action now to protect our rivers and lakes from pollution.","t":"我们必须现在就采取**行动**，保护河流和湖泊免受污染。"},
43243:{"w":"journalist","e":"The young journalist traveled to the small village to report on the flood.","t":"这位年轻的**记者**前往那个小村庄报道洪灾。"},
43244:{"w":"slender","e":"Many families are still living on slender earnings.","t":"许多家庭仍然靠**微薄**的收入度日。"},
43245:{"w":"ash","e":"The volcanic ash caused a lot of damage in the village.","t":"火山**灰**给村庄造成了很大的破坏。"},
43246:{"w":"supply","e":"Underground water sources in Australia supply about 18% of the total water consumption.","t":"澳大利亚用水**供给**的18%来自地下水。"},
43247:{"w":"automobile","e":"Henry Ford helped make the automobile cheap enough for ordinary families to buy.","t":"亨利·福特让**汽车**的价格降到了普通家庭买得起的水平。"},
43248:{"w":"rope","e":"The climbers tied themselves together with a long rope before they started up the mountain.","t":"登山者在出发上山前用一根长**绳子**把彼此系在一起。"},
43249:{"w":"penetrate","e":"The sunlight could not penetrate the thick forest, so it was dark inside.","t":"阳光无法**透入**茂密的森林，所以林子里很暗。"},
43250:{"w":"behavior","e":"The teacher praised the boy for his good behavior in class and gave him a small prize.","t":"老师表扬了这个男孩在课堂上的良好**表现**，还给了他一个小奖品。"},
43251:{"w":"bulk","e":"The bulk of the work was finished before the holiday, so we could relax.","t":"**大部分**工作在假期前就完成了，所以我们可以放松一下。"},
43252:{"w":"subject","e":"I'm giving some thoughts to a new book on a different subject.","t":"我在构思一本不同**题材**的新书。"},
43253:{"w":"envy","e":"Many of my classmates envy me because my father often takes me abroad on holiday.","t":"班上很多同学都**羡慕**我，因为爸爸常带我出国度假。"},
43254:{"w":"independent","e":"Mary was an independent-minded student.","t":"玛丽是个有**独立**见解的学生。"},
43255:{"w":"pole","e":"The flag was raised to the top of the pole as the students sang the national anthem.","t":"学生们唱国歌时，国旗升到了**旗杆**顶端。"},
43256:{"w":"substance","e":"Tobacco contains 43 cancer-causing substances.","t":"烟草中含有43种致癌**物质**。"},
43257:{"w":"board","e":"The teacher wrote the new words on the board and asked us to copy them.","t":"老师把生词写在**黑板**上，让我们抄下来。"},
43258:{"w":"raw","e":"Always wash your hands after touching raw meat, before you cook anything else.","t":"接触**生的**肉以后一定要先洗手，再做别的菜。"},
43259:{"w":"contest","e":"She won first prize in the school singing contest held last Friday afternoon.","t":"她在上周五下午举行的学校歌唱**比赛**中获得了一等奖。"},
43260:{"w":"recall","e":"She tried hard to recall what the man looked like, but it was too dark.","t":"她努力**回忆**那个男人的样子，但当时太黑了。"},
43261:{"w":"embassy","e":"Your visa application is being processed at the UK Embassy.","t":"你的签证正由英国**大使馆**办理。"},
43262:{"w":"spit","e":"It is rude to spit in the street, so please use a tissue instead.","t":"在街上**吐痰**是不礼貌的，请用纸巾。"},
43263:{"w":"studio","e":"The singer spent three months in the studio recording her new album.","t":"这位歌手在**录音室**里待了三个月，录制她的新专辑。"},
43264:{"w":"carpenter","e":"The carpenter made a beautiful wooden table and four chairs for our new kitchen.","t":"**木匠**为我们的新厨房做了一张漂亮的木桌和四把椅子。"},
43265:{"w":"mutual","e":"They soon discovered a mutual interest in music.","t":"很快，他们发现他们对音乐有着**共同**的兴趣。"},
43266:{"w":"grave","e":"Every spring, the family visits their grandmother's grave and brings fresh flowers.","t":"每年春天，这家人都会带着鲜花去祖母的**坟墓**前祭扫。"},
43267:{"w":"appropriate","e":"Personality questionnaires are used by many companies to put people in appropriate areas of work.","t":"很多公司通过性格测试的方式把员工安排到**合适的**工作岗位上。"},
43268:{"w":"dorm","e":"Four students share a small dorm room on the third floor of the building.","t":"四个学生合住在这栋楼三层的一间小**宿舍**里。"},
43269:{"w":"eve","e":"On the eve of the exam, she went to bed early to get enough sleep.","t":"考试**前夜**，她早早上床睡觉，以保证睡眠充足。"},
43270:{"w":"protein","e":"Eggs, milk and fish are all good sources of protein for growing children.","t":"鸡蛋、牛奶和鱼都是长身体的孩子获取**蛋白质**的好来源。"},
43271:{"w":"substantial","e":"The smoke experienced daily by many people is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on the heart and lungs.","t":"很多人日常所吸入的（香烟）烟雾就足以对他们的心脏和肺产生**巨大**的副作用。"},
43272:{"w":"formal","e":"They held the first formal international meeting on the subject.","t":"他们就这一主题举行了第一届**正式**的国际会议。"},
43273:{"w":"enlarge","e":"The new headmaster enlarged his office and installed expensive carpet.","t":"新校长**扩充**了他的办公室，并铺上了昂贵的地毯。"},
43274:{"w":"meanwhile","e":"Tina's due to arrive on Sunday. Meanwhile, what do we do?","t":"蒂娜定于星期天到，**这期间**我们做什么呢？"},
43275:{"w":"absorb","e":"Trees can absorb carbon dioxide.","t":"树木可以**吸收**二氧化碳。"},
43276:{"w":"inherit","e":"She inherited her mother's beautiful voice and loves singing in the school choir.","t":"她**遗传**了妈妈的好嗓子，很喜欢在学校合唱团唱歌。"},
43277:{"w":"desire","e":"Many old folks desire to learn English in China.","t":"在中国，很多老年人都**想**学英语。"},
43278:{"w":"sensitive","e":"My skin is very sensitive to the sun, so I always wear a hat in summer.","t":"我的皮肤对阳光很**敏感**，所以夏天总戴着帽子。"},
43279:{"w":"chemist","e":"The famous chemist spent most of her life studying how plants turn sunlight into food.","t":"这位著名的**化学家**一生大部分时间都在研究植物如何把阳光转化为养分。"},
43280:{"w":"breakthrough","e":"A brilliant intellectual breakthrough does not ensure that the transition is made from theory to practice.","t":"重大的学术**突破**并不能保证从理论到实践的成功转变。"},
43281:{"w":"ability","e":"Classes are organised according to ability level.","t":"根据**能力**水平进行分班。"},
43282:{"w":"drain","e":"After the heavy rain, it took hours for the water to drain from the streets.","t":"大雨过后，街上的水过了好几个小时才**流走**。"},
43283:{"w":"administer","e":"The personnel director administers the attendance policy.","t":"人事经理**负责**考勤。"},
43284:{"w":"fairy","e":"In the story, a kind fairy helps the poor girl go to the prince's party.","t":"故事里，一位善良的**小仙子**帮助穷女孩去参加王子的舞会。"},
43285:{"w":"conflict","e":"Friction management means handling conflicts in a positive and constructive manner.","t":"摩擦管理就是指用一种积极的、有建设性的方式来处理**冲突**。"},
43286:{"w":"bamboo","e":"Pandas spend most of the day eating bamboo in the forests of Sichuan.","t":"大熊猫一天大部分时间都在四川的森林里吃**竹子**。"},
43287:{"w":"insane","e":"The prisoner has been slowly going insane and he can not recognize his parents now.","t":"这名犯人在监狱里慢慢变得有些**精神失常**了，现在已经无法认出自己的父母。"},
43288:{"w":"architecture","e":"Tourists love this old town for its beautiful architecture and quiet narrow streets.","t":"游客们喜爱这座古镇美丽的**建筑风格**和安静狭窄的街道。"},
43289:{"w":"lame","e":"Saying you were too busy is a lame excuse for not calling your parents for months.","t":"说自己太忙所以几个月不给父母打电话，这个借口**站不住脚**。"},
43290:{"w":"kin","e":"He has no close kin, so his friends took care of him when he was ill.","t":"他没有关系近的**亲属**，所以生病时是朋友们照顾他。"},
43291:{"w":"junk","e":"Our garage is full of old junk that nobody has used for years.","t":"我们的车库里堆满了**无用的东西**，好几年都没人用过了。"},
43292:{"w":"watertight","e":"Keep your phone in a watertight bag when you go on the boat trip.","t":"坐船游玩时，把手机放进**防水**袋里。"},
43293:{"w":"zoology","e":"She chose to study zoology at university because she has always loved wild animals.","t":"她在大学选择学**动物学**，因为她一直很喜欢野生动物。"},
43294:{"w":"yell","e":"The coach yelled at the players to run faster in the last few minutes of the game.","t":"比赛最后几分钟，教练对着球员们**大喊**，让他们跑快点。"},
43295:{"w":"veto","e":"The president vetoed the new tax law because he thought it was unfair to workers.","t":"总统**否决**了新税法，因为他认为这对工人不公平。"},
43296:{"w":"update","e":"The TV station gives viewers an update on the storm every hour.","t":"电视台每小时向观众播报一次风暴的**最新消息**。"},
43297:{"w":"trigger","e":"A small mistake by the driver triggered an accident that blocked the road for hours.","t":"司机的一个小失误**引发**了一场事故，道路被堵了好几个小时。"},
43298:{"w":"interaction","e":"Scientists are studying the interaction between different chemicals in the human body.","t":"科学家正在研究人体内不同化学物质之间的**相互作用**。"},
43299:{"w":"microphone","e":"The speaker tapped the microphone to check that it was working before she began.","t":"演讲者开讲前轻敲了一下**话筒**，看看它是否好用。"},
43300:{"w":"harness","e":"The government plans to harness the river to stop floods and bring water to the farms.","t":"政府计划**治理**这条河，以防止洪水并为农田供水。"},
43301:{"w":"menu","e":"The waiter handed us the menu and asked whether we wanted something to drink first.","t":"服务员递给我们**菜单**，问我们要不要先喝点什么。"},
43302:{"w":"subtract","e":"When you subtract the cost of food and rent, there is little money left each month.","t":"**减去**伙食费和房租后，每个月就剩不下多少钱了。"},
43303:{"w":"acknowledge","e":"He finally acknowledged that he had made a mistake and said sorry to his team.","t":"他终于**承认**自己犯了错，并向团队道了歉。"},
43304:{"w":"frustrate","e":"This is the place where we frustrated the enemy.","t":"我们就是在此处**挫败**了敌人。"},
43305:{"w":"pace","e":"Life in big cities moves at a fast pace, and people are always busy.","t":"大城市的生活**节奏**很快，人们总是很忙。"},
43306:{"w":"passion","e":"My father has a passion for old music and collects records from the 1960s.","t":"我父亲**酷爱**老歌，收藏了许多二十世纪六十年代的唱片。"},
43307:{"w":"belief","e":"The belief that rain and murky weather make people more unhappy is borne out by a study in Belgium.","t":"人们**相信**雨天和阴沉的天气会让人更加忧郁，这种想法已被比利时的一项研究所证实。"},
43308:{"w":"gesture","e":"Sometimes you may simply bow, or make no gesture at all, when you're introduced to a stranger.","t":"在介绍你和陌生人认识时，你可以微微点头，也可以不做任何**动作**。"},
43309:{"w":"genuine","e":"The shop promised that all the leather bags it sold were genuine, not cheap copies.","t":"这家店保证所卖的皮包都是**真的**，不是廉价仿品。"},
43310:{"w":"civilize","e":"Many people believe that education helps to civilize a society and make it better.","t":"很多人认为，教育有助于让社会变得**文明**，变得更好。"},
43311:{"w":"loop","e":"These tunnels must loop around and connect.","t":"这些隧道一定是**成环状**的，而且是相通的。"},
43312:{"w":"imaginary","e":"When she was little, my daughter had an imaginary friend who lived in her bedroom.","t":"我女儿小时候有一个**想象中的**朋友，住在她的卧室里。"},
43313:{"w":"preface","e":"The author explains in the preface why she decided to write a book about her grandmother.","t":"作者在**序言**里解释了她为什么决定写一本关于自己祖母的书。"},
43314:{"w":"sheer","e":"Mary won the skating competition by sheer luck.","t":"玛丽能在这次滑冰比赛中获胜**纯属**运气好。"},
43315:{"w":"prompt","e":"Bob's dislike for hot weather prompted him to move north.","t":"鲍勃不喜欢炎热的天气，这**促使**他迁往北方。"},
43316:{"w":"chemical","e":"The chemicals will contaminate water resources when drained into the river.","t":"这些**化学物质**如果被排放到河里会污染水源。"},
43317:{"w":"diversity","e":"The study of primitive peoples has discovered a great diversity of customs, values, feelings, and thoughts.","t":"对原始人类的研究发现其在风俗习惯、价值观、 情感以及思想上具有丰富的**多样性**。"},
43318:{"w":"lucky","e":"We were lucky to find a taxi so quickly in the heavy rain.","t":"下着大雨，我们很快就打到了出租车，真是**幸运**。"},
43319:{"w":"invitation","e":"Thank you for your kind invitation to dinner, but I'm afraid I'm busy that evening.","t":"谢谢你热情**邀请**我吃晚饭，不过那天晚上我恐怕没空。"},
43320:{"w":"cupboard","e":"Please put the clean plates and bowls back in the kitchen cupboard after dinner.","t":"晚饭后请把洗干净的盘子和碗放回厨房的**橱柜**里。"},
43321:{"w":"confidence","e":"Winning the speech contest gave her the confidence to speak in front of large groups.","t":"赢得演讲比赛让她有了在众人面前讲话的**信心**。"},
43322:{"w":"auto","e":"His uncle has worked in an auto factory in Changchun for over twenty years.","t":"他叔叔在长春一家**汽车**厂工作了二十多年。"},
43323:{"w":"sore","e":"He's had so many colds and sore throats recently.","t":"他最近常常感冒，嗓子也经常**痛**。"},
43324:{"w":"suburb","e":"The hotel in Sydney's southern suburbs is the closest to Sydney Airport.","t":"位于悉尼南**郊**的这家酒店是距离悉尼机场最近的酒店。"},
43325:{"w":"purse","e":"She opened her purse and took out some coins to pay for the bus ticket.","t":"她打开**钱包**，拿出几枚硬币买了公交车票。"},
43326:{"w":"raid","e":"The police raided the house at dawn and found a large amount of stolen goods.","t":"警察在黎明时**突袭**了那栋房子，发现了大量赃物。"},
43327:{"w":"fearful","e":"The little girl was fearful of the big dog and hid behind her mother.","t":"小女孩**害怕**那只大狗，躲到了妈妈身后。"},
43328:{"w":"blank","e":"Would you mind my asking about your salary? Or we can leave it blank.","t":"你介意我问一下你的薪水吗？或者我们也可以把这一项**空着**。"},
43329:{"w":"lower","e":"The lower end of the valley has become one huge camp site.","t":"这条河谷**下游**的出口处已经变成了一个巨大的营地。"},
43330:{"w":"intelligence","e":"The scientists are using genetics to improve the intelligence of mice.","t":"科学家们正在利用基因技术提高老鼠的**智力**。"},
43331:{"w":"courtyard","e":"The children played games in the courtyard while their parents cooked dinner.","t":"父母做晚饭时，孩子们在**院子**里玩游戏。"},
43332:{"w":"comment","e":"Customers' comments, both positive and negative, are recorded by staff and are collated regularly to identify opportunities for improvement of products.","t":"员工记录来自顾客的正反两方面**意见**，（公司）定期整理核查这些意见，以确定是否能根据意见来提高产品的质量。"},
43333:{"w":"crush","e":"Be careful not to crush my glasses in the bag.","t":"小心别把我包里的眼镜给**压碎**了。"},
43334:{"w":"rural","e":"Technological advance will bring about the decline of rural industries and an increase in urban populations at the same time.","t":"科技进步将会导致**农村**产业的衰退，同时会带来城市人口的增长。"},
43335:{"w":"distress","e":"The news of the accident caused great distress to the families of the passengers.","t":"事故的消息给乘客家属带来了巨大的**痛苦**。"},
43336:{"w":"finding","e":"The findings of the study show that sleep is important for students' memory.","t":"这项研究的**发现**表明，睡眠对学生的记忆很重要。"},
43337:{"w":"discourage","e":"Heavy rain discouraged many people from going to the football match on Saturday.","t":"周六的大雨**阻止**了很多人去看足球赛。"},
43338:{"w":"publicity","e":"The company launched a publicity campaign on a large scale.","t":"这家公司发起了一场大规模的**宣传**活动。"},
43339:{"w":"membership","e":"You can pay the membership fee by cheque.","t":"你可以用支票交**会员**费。"},
43340:{"w":"rainbow","e":"After the storm, a beautiful rainbow appeared in the sky over the lake.","t":"暴风雨过后，湖面上空出现了一道美丽的**彩虹**。"},
43341:{"w":"spin","e":"This action spins a series of gears.","t":"这个操作使一连串的齿轮**旋转**起来。"},
43342:{"w":"dean","e":"At the top of the faculty is a dean.","t":"**院长**是学院里的一把手。"},
43343:{"w":"slide","e":"For frequent usage, the drawers slide in and out easily.","t":"由于频繁使用，抽屉很容易**滑**进滑出。"},
43344:{"w":"museum","e":"We spent the whole afternoon at the science museum looking at old machines and robots.","t":"我们在科学**博物馆**里待了一整个下午，参观旧机器和机器人。"},
43345:{"w":"eyebrow","e":"He raised one eyebrow in surprise when he heard the strange news.","t":"听到这个奇怪的消息，他吃惊地扬起一边**眉毛**。"},
43346:{"w":"removal","e":"I saw a removal van outside your house yesterday afternoon.","t":"昨天下午我看见你家屋外停着一辆**搬家**卡车。"},
43347:{"w":"outstanding","e":"She was given a prize for her outstanding work in helping poor children.","t":"她因在帮助贫困儿童方面的**杰出**工作而获奖。"},
43348:{"w":"badge","e":"Are there any marks or badges on your briefcase that make it stand out?","t":"你的公文包上是否有什么记号或**标记**能让它区别于其他公文包？"},
43349:{"w":"missing","e":"The police are still looking for the missing child who left school on Monday.","t":"警方仍在寻找那个周一离开学校后**失踪**的孩子。"},
43350:{"w":"rent","e":"This house rents for RMB 5,000 a month.","t":"这房子月**租**5,000人民币。"},
43351:{"w":"cyberspace","e":"Millions of messages travel through cyberspace every second, connecting people all over the world.","t":"每秒都有数以百万计的信息在**网络空间**中传递，把世界各地的人联系起来。"},
43352:{"w":"graph","e":"The graph shows that the number of visitors rose quickly after the new bridge opened.","t":"这张**图表**显示，新桥通车后游客数量迅速增加。"},
43353:{"w":"housing","e":"The city government is building more cheap housing for young workers and students.","t":"市政府正在为年轻工人和学生建造更多廉价**住房**。"},
43354:{"w":"irrigate","e":"Farmers in this dry area use water from the river to irrigate their fields.","t":"这个干旱地区的农民用河水**灌溉**农田。"},
43355:{"w":"fortnight","e":"We are going to spend a fortnight at my grandparents' house in July.","t":"七月我们要去爷爷奶奶家住**两星期**。"},
43356:{"w":"rack","e":"Please put your bags on the rack above your seat before the train leaves.","t":"火车开动前，请把包放在座位上方的**行李架**上。"},
43357:{"w":"juicy","e":"These oranges are sweet and juicy, so the children ate them all at once.","t":"这些橙子又甜又**多汁**，孩子们一下子就全吃光了。"},
43358:{"w":"disgust","e":"Many people looked at the dirty kitchen with disgust and refused to eat there.","t":"许多人**厌恶**地看着脏兮兮的厨房，拒绝在那里吃饭。"},
43359:{"w":"complain","e":"John complains that the resource centre has limited opening hours.","t":"约翰**抱怨**说信息中心的开放时间有限。"},
43360:{"w":"lass","e":"The little lass at the shop always greets customers with a sweet smile.","t":"店里那个小**女孩**总是带着甜甜的微笑招呼顾客。"},
43361:{"w":"allow","e":"Students are not allowed to use their mobile phones during the final exam.","t":"期末考试期间学生不**允许**使用手机。"},
43362:{"w":"lung","e":"Smoking does great harm to your lungs, so you'd better give it up now.","t":"吸烟对你的**肺部**危害很大，你最好现在就戒掉。"},
43363:{"w":"factual","e":"The task is intended to test your skills of skimming for factual information.","t":"该任务旨在测试你略读**事实**信息的能力。"},
43364:{"w":"devote","e":"She devoted most of her free time to helping the old people in her neighbourhood.","t":"她把大部分空闲时间都**奉献给**了照顾社区里的老人。"},
43365:{"w":"deny","e":"He denied breaking the window, but his little sister said she saw him do it.","t":"他**否认**打破了窗户，但他妹妹说她亲眼看见是他干的。"},
43366:{"w":"axis","e":"The earth turns on its axis once every twenty-four hours, giving us day and night.","t":"地球每二十四小时绕**地轴**自转一圈，形成了白天和黑夜。"},
43367:{"w":"empire","e":"The Roman Empire once controlled large parts of Europe, Africa and Asia.","t":"罗马**帝国**曾经控制着欧洲、非洲和亚洲的大片地区。"},
43368:{"w":"rid","e":"The new medicine finally rid him of the terrible headaches he had suffered for years.","t":"这种新药终于让他**摆脱**了折磨他多年的剧烈头痛。"},
43369:{"w":"forum","e":"The school held an online forum where parents could share their views on homework.","t":"学校举办了一个线上**论坛**，让家长们就家庭作业发表看法。"},
43370:{"w":"gut","e":"It takes guts to stand up in front of the whole school and speak your mind.","t":"站在全校面前说出自己的想法需要**勇气**。"},
43371:{"w":"habitat","e":"They have focused their research on habitats they believe have escaped human influence.","t":"他们已将研究重心放在他们认为不受人类影响的物种**栖息地**上。"},
43372:{"w":"quota","e":"Your sales are always below quota.","t":"你们的销售量总是低于**定额**。"},
43373:{"w":"reap","e":"If you study hard now, you will reap the rewards when you take the exam.","t":"如果你现在努力学习，考试的时候就会**得到**回报。"},
43374:{"w":"ozone","e":"The ozone layer high above the earth protects us from the sun's harmful light.","t":"地球高空的**臭氧**层保护我们免受阳光中有害光线的伤害。"},
43375:{"w":"paperback","e":"The paperback is much cheaper than the hardcover, so I bought it for my trip.","t":"**平装本**比精装本便宜得多，所以我买了一本带着去旅行。"},
43376:{"w":"scent","e":"Doctors mix light, sounds, breezes and scents to stimulate the patients.","t":"医生同时采用光、声音、微风和**香味**来刺激病人。"},
43377:{"w":"briefcase","e":"My father put his papers and laptop into his briefcase and left for work.","t":"爸爸把文件和笔记本电脑装进**公文包**，就去上班了。"},
43378:{"w":"subway","e":"It is much faster to take the subway than a taxi during rush hour.","t":"在高峰时段，坐**地铁**比打车快多了。"},
43379:{"w":"specialist","e":"The professor is one of the world's leading specialists in the field.","t":"这位教授是该领域内的顶级**专家**。"},
43380:{"w":"reckon","e":"I reckon it will take us about two hours to drive to the beach from here.","t":"我**估计**从这里开车到海边大约要两个小时。"},
43381:{"w":"magnet","e":"The new shopping center has become a magnet for young people at weekends.","t":"新购物中心像**磁铁**一样，周末吸引着年轻人。"},
43382:{"w":"rotate","e":"The earth rotates once every 24 hours, which gives us day and night.","t":"地球每 24 小时**自转**一周，于是有了白天和黑夜。"},
43383:{"w":"reception","e":"The students' dormitory is to the right of the reception desk.","t":"学生宿舍在**接待处**的右边。"},
43384:{"w":"defect","e":"The company called back thousands of cars because of a defect in the brakes.","t":"由于刹车存在**缺陷**，这家公司召回了数千辆汽车。"},
43385:{"w":"rod","e":"The workers used a long metal rod to open the heavy window near the roof.","t":"工人们用一根长长的金属**杆子**打开了屋顶附近那扇沉重的窗户。"},
43386:{"w":"jury","e":"After two days of discussion, the jury decided that the young man was not guilty.","t":"经过两天的讨论，**陪审团**裁定那个年轻人无罪。"},
43387:{"w":"attribute","e":"The global increase in greenhouse gases has been largely attributed to industrial pollution in developed countries.","t":"全球温室气体的增加主要**归咎于**发达国家的工业污染。"},
43388:{"w":"suck","e":"The baby sucked milk from the bottle and soon fell asleep in her arms.","t":"宝宝从奶瓶里**吸**着奶，很快就在她怀里睡着了。"},
43389:{"w":"glory","e":"The team returned home in glory after winning the national football championship.","t":"球队赢得全国足球冠军后**光荣**归来。"},
43390:{"w":"release","e":"The thief was released on bail.","t":"窃贼交了保释金后**获释**。"},
43391:{"w":"negative","e":"This policy had a negative effect on their business.","t":"这一政策给他们的生意带来了**消极**影响。"},
43392:{"w":"mist","e":"Early in the morning, the hills behind the village were covered in a light mist.","t":"清晨，村子后面的山丘笼罩在一层**薄雾**中。"},
43393:{"w":"succession","e":"She has won the award for the third year in succession.","t":"这是她**连续**第三年获得此奖项。"},
43394:{"w":"suffer","e":"They all suffer from chronic back pain.","t":"他们都**患有**慢性背部疼痛。"},
43395:{"w":"congratulate","e":"I wanted to congratulate you all on having passed the exam.","t":"大家都通过了考试，我向你们**表示祝贺**。"},
43396:{"w":"chip","e":"Electronic chips recorded the presence of a vehicle in a given high traffic area at a given time.","t":"电子**芯片**记录了特定时间内，车辆在某一繁忙路段的通行情况。"},
43397:{"w":"sufficient","e":"It takes only 10 to 20 minutes of exposure to sunlight a day to ensure sufficient vitamin D production.","t":"一天只需接受10到20分钟的阳光照射便可使身体产生**足够**的维生素D。"},
43398:{"w":"sum","e":"The sum of all the money we raised at the school fair was over five thousand yuan.","t":"我们在学校义卖会上筹到的钱**总数**超过了五千元。"},
43399:{"w":"similar","e":"My sister and I have very similar tastes in music, food and clothes.","t":"我和姐姐在音乐、食物和衣服上的品味非常**相似**。"},
43400:{"w":"court","e":"The two neighbors finally took their argument about the fence to court.","t":"两个邻居最终把关于篱笆的争执闹上了**法庭**。"},
43401:{"w":"execute","e":"The plan was carefully made, but it was poorly executed by the new manager.","t":"这个计划制定得很周密，但新经理**执行**得很糟糕。"},
43402:{"w":"maintain","e":"Health promotion programs and policies would help people maintain healthy behaviors and lifestyles.","t":"健康促进计划和方针能够帮助人们**保持**健康的生活习惯和生活方式。"},
43403:{"w":"curl","e":"The cat curled up on the sofa and soon fell asleep in the warm sun.","t":"猫**蜷缩**在沙发上，在温暖的阳光下很快睡着了。"},
43404:{"w":"essay","e":"You have to complete a 3,000-word essay on the topic.","t":"你需要就该主题写一篇3,000字的**文章**。"},
43405:{"w":"privilege","e":"Education is not a privilege of some people but a right of all citizens.","t":"受教育不是某些人的**特权**，而是所有公民的权利。"},
43406:{"w":"bureau","e":"The university's careers bureau is open from nine to five and offers free advice on job applications.","t":"大学的就业指导**办公室**从九点开放到五点，免费为求职申请提供建议。"},
43407:{"w":"route","e":"This map shows the route across the mountains.","t":"这张地图上有穿越群山的**路线**。"},
43408:{"w":"dull","e":"We all think his tutorial topic is dull.","t":"我们都认为他的辅导主题令人**乏味**。"},
43409:{"w":"moist","e":"The earthworm lives in moist and warm soil.","t":"蚯蚓生活在**潮湿**温暖的土壤里。"},
43410:{"w":"merit","e":"One merit of this small car is that it uses very little oil.","t":"这辆小汽车的一个**优点**是非常省油。"},
43411:{"w":"provoke","e":"The new rule provoked strong anger among parents, who felt it was unfair to their children.","t":"这项新规定**激起**了家长们的强烈愤怒，他们认为这对孩子不公平。"},
43412:{"w":"relative","e":"They now live in relative comfort.","t":"他们现在过得**比较**舒适。"},
43413:{"w":"local","e":"We had lunch at a small local restaurant near the old town square.","t":"我们在老城广场附近一家小小的**本地**餐馆吃了午饭。"},
43414:{"w":"function","e":"The dams store water for a variety of functions.","t":"大坝贮存的水**用途**广泛。"},
43415:{"w":"suggestion","e":"Thank you for your suggestion; we will try a different way next time.","t":"谢谢你的**建议**，下次我们会换个方法试试。"},
43416:{"w":"compromise","e":"After a long talk, my parents reached a compromise about where to spend the holiday.","t":"经过长谈，我父母在去哪里度假的问题上达成了**妥协**。"},
43417:{"w":"substitute","e":"It is better for a company to employ more workers because people are available to substitute for absent staff.","t":"对公司来说，多雇用一些员工大有好处，因为有足够的人手去**替代**缺勤人员。"},
43418:{"w":"restless","e":"The children grew restless after sitting in the car for four hours.","t":"在车里坐了四个小时后，孩子们变得**焦躁不安**。"},
43419:{"w":"rally","e":"Thousands of people attended a rally in the city square to call for cleaner air.","t":"成千上万的人参加了在城市广场举行的**集会**，呼吁改善空气质量。"},
43420:{"w":"extreme","e":"One mistake we often make when stricken with extreme back pain is to go to bed and stay there.","t":"当背部出现**剧**痛时我们经常犯的一个错误就是上床躺着。"},
43421:{"w":"delivery","e":"The shop offers free delivery to your home for any order over one hundred yuan.","t":"这家商店对满一百元的订单提供免费**送货**上门服务。"},
43422:{"w":"feather","e":"The little bird has bright red and yellow feathers on its head.","t":"这只小鸟头上长着鲜艳的红黄色**羽毛**。"},
43423:{"w":"orbit","e":"There have been hundreds of satellites put into orbit round the earth this year.","t":"今年数以百计的人造卫星被送入环绕地球的**轨道**。"},
43424:{"w":"claim","e":"Many people claim they feel better in negatively charged air.","t":"很多人**称**处在富含负离子的空气中让他们感觉更舒服。"},
43425:{"w":"characterize","e":"Hot summers and cold winters characterize the weather in this part of China.","t":"夏季炎热、冬季寒冷是中国这一地区天气的**特征**。"},
43426:{"w":"allowance","e":"My parents give me a weekly allowance of fifty yuan for lunch and bus fares.","t":"父母每周给我五十元**零用钱**，用来吃午饭和坐公交。"},
43427:{"w":"suicide","e":"Schools should teach students where to get help, because suicide is a serious problem among young people.","t":"学校应该告诉学生到哪里寻求帮助，因为**自杀**是青少年中的一个严重问题。"},
43428:{"w":"explode","e":"The experts have thought of a way to explode the dynamite below this building.","t":"专家们已经想出了一种方法来**引爆**这幢楼下的炸药。"},
43429:{"w":"component","e":"It is often easier to check individual components before assembly takes place in many manufacturing processes.","t":"在许多生产工序中，在组装之前先检查单个**零部件**通常更容易。"},
43430:{"w":"dip","e":"He dipped a piece of bread into the hot soup before putting it in his mouth.","t":"他把一块面包在热汤里**蘸了蘸**，然后放进嘴里。"},
43431:{"w":"aware","e":"Most ecologists were aware that the areas of Amazonia they were working in had been shaped by human settlement.","t":"大多数生态学家**意识到**他们研究的亚马孙地区已经受到人类居住的影响。"},
43432:{"w":"interrupt","e":"Please don't interrupt me when I am talking on the phone with my boss.","t":"我和老板打电话时请不要**打断**我。"},
43433:{"w":"profit","e":"Some firms are even downsizing as their profits climb.","t":"一些公司甚至在**利润**上升时还裁员。"},
43434:{"w":"upgrade","e":"With the increase in terrorist attacks, more and more international airports plan to upgrade the safety check systems.","t":"随着恐怖主义袭击的增加，越来越多的国际机场计划**升级**安检系统。"},
43435:{"w":"external","e":"The evidence we have suggests that domestic trade was greater than external trade at all periods.","t":"我们掌握的证据表明，无论在哪个时期，国内贸易都要比**对外**贸易发达。"},
43436:{"w":"lease","e":"Could I ask how long the lease is?","t":"我能问一下**租期**是多久？"},
43437:{"w":"vendor","e":"I bought a hot sweet potato from a street vendor on my way home.","t":"我在回家路上从一个街头**小贩**那里买了一个热红薯。"},
43438:{"w":"somehow","e":"I lost my keys this morning, but somehow I managed to get into the house.","t":"今天早上我把钥匙弄丢了，但**不知怎么地**还是进了家门。"},
43439:{"w":"disposal","e":"The main use of water in most families is washing and waste disposal.","t":"在大多数家庭中，水的主要用途是洗漱和废物**处理**。"},
43440:{"w":"surge","e":"When the doors opened, the crowd surged into the shop to buy cheap phones.","t":"门一开，人群就**蜂拥**进商店抢购便宜的手机。"},
43441:{"w":"declaration","e":"This declaration seemed to calm the discontented party members somewhat.","t":"这项**声明**似乎让那些心存不满的党派成员稍微平静了点。"},
43442:{"w":"appeal","e":"The police have appealed to the public for information about the missing boy.","t":"警方已**呼吁**公众提供有关那个失踪男孩的信息。"},
43443:{"w":"tablet","e":"The doctor told me to take two tablets after each meal for a week.","t":"医生让我一周内每餐饭后服两粒**药片**。"},
43444:{"w":"distribute","e":"The teacher distributed the test papers to the students at exactly nine o'clock.","t":"老师九点整把试卷**分发**给了学生。"},
43445:{"w":"cart","e":"The farmer loaded the cart with apples and drove his horse to the market.","t":"农夫把苹果装上**马车**，赶着马去了集市。"},
43446:{"w":"proverb","e":"An old proverb says that a friend in need is a friend indeed.","t":"一句古老的**谚语**说：患难见真情。"},
43447:{"w":"stable","e":"The society will remain stable over the long term.","t":"社会将保持长期**稳定**。"},
43448:{"w":"recite","e":"Every student had to recite a short poem in front of the whole class.","t":"每个学生都要在全班同学面前**背诵**一首短诗。"},
43449:{"w":"nutrition","e":"Females are more conscious of food nutrition.","t":"女性更关注食品**营养**。"},
43450:{"w":"odour","e":"The odour of burning plastic came from the factory and spread across the whole town.","t":"燃烧塑料的**气味**从工厂飘出，弥漫了整个小镇。"},
43451:{"w":"lunar","e":"Scientists are studying lunar rocks brought back to Earth by the spacecraft.","t":"科学家正在研究宇宙飞船带回地球的**月球**岩石。"},
43452:{"w":"mainstream","e":"His radical views place him outside the mainstream of American politics.","t":"他的激进观点使他脱离了美国政治的**主流**。"},
43453:{"w":"hyphen","e":"You need a hyphen when you write numbers such as twenty-one in words.","t":"用英文单词写 twenty-one 这样的数字时，需要加**连字符**。"},
43454:{"w":"idiom","e":"Learning a few common idioms will make your spoken English sound more natural.","t":"学几个常用**习语**会让你的英语口语听起来更自然。"},
43455:{"w":"gender","e":"Jobs should be open to everyone, no matter what their gender or age is.","t":"工作岗位应该向所有人开放，不论其**性别**或年龄。"},
43456:{"w":"continuity","e":"Having the same teacher for all three years helps give students continuity in their learning.","t":"三年都由同一位老师教，有助于保持学生学习的**连续性**。"},
43457:{"w":"corporate","e":"Many young graduates hope to find a stable corporate job in a big city.","t":"许多年轻毕业生希望在大城市找到一份稳定的**公司**工作。"},
43458:{"w":"aside","e":"She put her book aside and went to answer the door when someone knocked.","t":"有人敲门时，她把书放到**一边**，去开门了。"},
43459:{"w":"opportunity","e":"The film gave them an opportunity to let their imaginations run wild.","t":"电影给了他们一个放任想象力纵情驰骋的**机会**。"},
43460:{"w":"glance","e":"She glanced at her watch and realized she was late for the bus.","t":"她**看了一眼**手表，发现自己赶不上公交车了。"},
43461:{"w":"grain","e":"Farmers in this area grow rice, wheat and other kinds of grain on their land.","t":"这个地区的农民在地里种植水稻、小麦和其他**谷物**。"},
43462:{"w":"lag","e":"Western banks still lag behind financial institutions in most other regions of the country.","t":"西部地区的银行仍然**落后**于这个国家其他大部分地区的金融机构。"},
43463:{"w":"bloody","e":"The boxer had a bloody nose after the first round of the fight.","t":"第一回合过后，那名拳击手的鼻子**流血**了。"},
43464:{"w":"kettle","e":"She filled the kettle with water and put it on the stove to make tea.","t":"她把**水壶**灌满水，放到炉子上烧水泡茶。"},
43465:{"w":"sunset","e":"We sat on the beach and watched the beautiful sunset over the sea.","t":"我们坐在海滩上，看着海上美丽的**日落**。"},
43466:{"w":"fierce","e":"The fierce dog barked at us and tried to jump over the garden fence.","t":"那条**凶猛的**狗冲我们狂叫，还想跳过花园的篱笆。"},
43467:{"w":"faulty","e":"The shop agreed to give me a new phone because the one I bought was faulty.","t":"商店同意给我换一部新手机，因为我买的那部**有故障**。"},
43468:{"w":"fade","e":"His smile faded as he heard the answer.","t":"听到这个答案，他脸上的笑容**渐渐消失**了。"},
43469:{"w":"paragraph","e":"Read the first paragraph of the story and tell me what the main idea is.","t":"读一读故事的第一个**段落**，告诉我它的大意。"},
43470:{"w":"highly","e":"This doctor is highly respected by her patients because she always listens carefully to them.","t":"这位医生**非常**受病人尊敬，因为她总是认真倾听他们的话。"},
43471:{"w":"singular","e":"In English, the singular form of \"children\" is \"child\", which many beginners forget.","t":"在英语中，children 的**单数**形式是 child，很多初学者会忘记。"},
43472:{"w":"enquire","e":"If you have any question, you are welcome to call the Students' Union to enquire.","t":"有任何问题，欢迎致电学生会**询问**。"},
43473:{"w":"summary","e":"Tina gave a summary of the activity last night.","t":"蒂娜昨晚给出了活动的**概要**。"},
43474:{"w":"beneath","e":"Shall we have a rest in the shade beneath these trees?","t":"我们在树阴**下**休息一下好吗？"},
43475:{"w":"preparation","e":"The team has been training hard in preparation for the big game.","t":"为了**准备**这场重要比赛，球队一直在刻苦训练。"},
43476:{"w":"conservation","e":"We just set up a new wildlife conservation programme here.","t":"我们刚刚在这里启动了一个新的野生动物**保护**项目。"},
43477:{"w":"recreation","e":"As you can see, the building you are in now contains this main lounge, the dining room and the recreation room.","t":"如你所见，你现在所在的这幢大楼包括主休息室、餐厅和**娱乐**室。"},
43478:{"w":"justice","e":"The families of the victims went to court because they wanted justice for their children.","t":"受害者家属上了法庭，因为他们想为孩子讨回**公道**。"},
43479:{"w":"enroll","e":"More than three hundred new students enrolled at the university this autumn.","t":"今年秋天有三百多名新生在这所大学**入学**。"},
43480:{"w":"procession","e":"The soldiers lined the route of the procession.","t":"士兵们沿**游行**的道路排成一列。"},
43481:{"w":"drip","e":"Water kept dripping from the roof for an hour after the heavy rain stopped.","t":"大雨停了以后，水还从屋顶上不停地**滴下**，滴了一个小时。"},
43482:{"w":"summit","e":"A gigantic explosion tore much of the volcano's summit to fragments.","t":"巨大的爆炸几乎将火山**山顶**全部炸成碎片。"},
43483:{"w":"tackle","e":"The government must take quick action to tackle the problem of air pollution.","t":"政府必须迅速采取行动，**处理**空气污染问题。"},
43484:{"w":"emit","e":"Older trucks, buses and taxis emit excessive levels of smoke and fumes.","t":"老式卡车、公交车和出租车**排放**出过量的烟和废气。"},
43485:{"w":"reward","e":"Those employees who never take sick leave think that they should be rewarded.","t":"那些从来不请病假的员工认为他们应该因此得到**奖励**。"},
43486:{"w":"hell","e":"Living next to the noisy building site was hell for the whole family.","t":"住在嘈杂的建筑工地旁边，对全家人来说简直是**地狱**。"},
43487:{"w":"superficial","e":"Luckily, the cut on his hand was only superficial and healed in a few days.","t":"幸运的是，他手上的伤口只是**表面**的，几天就好了。"},
43488:{"w":"specialize","e":"My cousin is studying medicine and wants to specialize in children's heart problems.","t":"我表哥在学医，想**专攻**儿童心脏疾病。"},
43489:{"w":"proof","e":"Can you provide any proof of identity?","t":"你能提供任何身份**证明**吗？"},
43490:{"w":"sole","e":"His sole motive was to make her happy.","t":"他**唯一**的动机就是让她高兴。"},
43491:{"w":"available","e":"We hope that ostrich meat will be available soon and before long will be as cheap as beef.","t":"我们希望不久就可以**买到**鸵鸟肉，而且希望它的价格不久就会变得和牛肉一样便宜。"},
43492:{"w":"resort","e":"The east coast resorts are only a short twenty-minute drive from here.","t":"从这儿开车去东海岸的**度假胜地**只需短短20分钟。"},
43493:{"w":"folk","e":"Country folk often get up early to work on their farms before the heat of the day.","t":"乡下的**人们**常常趁天热之前早起去农田干活。"},
43494:{"w":"structure","e":"The biologist is giving a lecture on cellular structures.","t":"那位生物学家正在做一个有关细胞**结构**的讲座。"},
43495:{"w":"broom","e":"He took a broom and swept the leaves off the front steps.","t":"他拿起一把**扫帚**，把门前台阶上的落叶扫掉了。"},
43496:{"w":"rank","e":"Our school is ranked among the top ten in the city for science teaching.","t":"我们学校的理科教学**位列**全市前十。"},
43497:{"w":"resident","e":"It's completely free as long as you're a resident here.","t":"只要你是这里的**住户**，就可以完全免费（享受这项服务）。"},
43498:{"w":"recruit","e":"You are among the two hundred staff recruited to help look after the old.","t":"你是被**招聘**来帮忙照顾老年人的200名员工之一。"},
43499:{"w":"motor","e":"The small boat is powered by an electric motor, so it makes almost no noise on the lake.","t":"这艘小船由电动**马达**驱动，所以在湖上几乎没有噪音。"},
43500:{"w":"boundary","e":"Mount St. Helens is located along the boundary of two of the moving plates that make up the Earth's crust.","t":"圣海伦斯火山位于组成地壳的两大移动板块的**边界线**上。"},
43501:{"w":"contrast","e":"There is a sharp contrast between the busy city center and the quiet villages nearby.","t":"热闹的市中心和附近安静的村庄形成了鲜明的**对比**。"},
43502:{"w":"airport","e":"We need to leave home by six o'clock if we want to reach the airport on time.","t":"要想准时到**机场**，我们得六点前出门。"},
43503:{"w":"radical","e":"The new manager made radical changes, and the company became completely different within a year.","t":"新经理进行了**彻底的**改革，一年之内公司就完全变了样。"},
43504:{"w":"sunshine","e":"After a week of rain, the children were happy to play in the warm sunshine.","t":"下了一周的雨之后，孩子们很高兴能在温暖的**阳光**下玩耍。"},
43505:{"w":"enclose","e":"The farmer enclosed his land and kept cattle away from his crops.","t":"农民在田地四周**筑起围栏**，以使牛群远离庄稼。"},
43506:{"w":"leading","e":"She is one of the leading scientists in the field of clean energy.","t":"她是清洁能源领域的**主要**科学家之一。"},
43507:{"w":"introduction","e":"By way of introduction, I shall give you the background of the subject.","t":"通过**介绍**，我将向你讲述该学科的相关背景。"},
43508:{"w":"bounce","e":"Don't bounce on the bed, you'll break the springs!","t":"别在床上乱**蹦**，你会把弹簧弄断的。"},
43509:{"w":"rag","e":"He cleaned the dirty window with an old rag and some soapy water.","t":"他用一块旧**破布**和一些肥皂水把脏窗户擦干净了。"},
43510:{"w":"ancestor","e":"My ancestors were farmers who lived in this small village for hundreds of years.","t":"我的**祖先**是农民，在这个小村子里生活了几百年。"},
43511:{"w":"occasion","e":"It should have been an occasion for rejoicing, but she could not feel any real joy.","t":"原本应该是高兴的**时刻**，她却丝毫未感到真正的快乐。"},
43512:{"w":"prescribe","e":"Doctors diagnose before they prescribe a drug.","t":"医生在**开药**前要先对病人进行诊断。"},
43513:{"w":"split","e":"The party split up into several groups.","t":"这个党派**分裂**成几个集团。"},
43514:{"w":"determine","e":"Your hard work now will determine how well you do in the final exam.","t":"你现在的努力将**决定**你期末考试考得怎么样。"},
43515:{"w":"demonstrate","e":"Crick and Watson demonstrated the structure of the DNA molecule in their academic papers.","t":"克里克和沃森在他们的学术论文中**论证**了DNA的分子结构。"},
43516:{"w":"painful","e":"My knee was so painful after the race that I could hardly walk home.","t":"跑完比赛后我的膝盖非常**疼痛**，几乎走不回家。"},
43517:{"w":"freshman","e":"As a freshman, Tom often got lost on the large campus during his first month.","t":"作为**大一新生**，汤姆刚来的第一个月常常在偌大的校园里迷路。"},
43518:{"w":"manner","e":"The teacher spoke to the nervous new student in a kind and gentle manner.","t":"老师用亲切温和的**方式**跟紧张的新同学说话。"},
43519:{"w":"interest","e":"Many young people are showing a lot of interest in higher education.","t":"很多年轻人对高等教育很**感兴趣**。"},
43520:{"w":"gamble","e":"Bob might show up on time, but I wouldn't gamble on it.","t":"鲍勃也许会准时露面，但我不想**冒这个险**。"},
43521:{"w":"sunrise","e":"We got up early and climbed the hill to watch the sunrise over the sea.","t":"我们早早起床，爬上山去看海上**日出**。"},
43522:{"w":"noticeable","e":"There has been a noticeable improvement in her English since she moved to London.","t":"自从搬到伦敦以后，她的英语有了**显而易见**的进步。"},
43523:{"w":"hug","e":"She gave her mother an affectionate hug after winning the prize.","t":"获奖后，她紧紧地**拥抱**了母亲。"},
43524:{"w":"construct","e":"The city plans to construct a new bridge across the river next year.","t":"这座城市计划明年在河上**建造**一座新桥。"},
43525:{"w":"graduate","e":"Nowadays, there are not many job opportunities which graduates can look forward to.","t":"现在，本科**毕业生**所能期望的就业机会并不多。"},
43526:{"w":"imperial","e":"We visited the old imperial palace, where emperors lived for hundreds of years.","t":"我们参观了那座古老的**帝王**宫殿，几百年来皇帝们一直住在那里。"},
43527:{"w":"railway","e":"The new railway between the two cities will cut the journey time to just one hour.","t":"两座城市之间的新**铁路**将把路程时间缩短到仅一个小时。"},
43528:{"w":"superb","e":"The mountains of the central island provide superb ski facilities in winter.","t":"岛屿中部的山脉为冬天滑雪提供了**绝佳的**场地。"},
43529:{"w":"loophole","e":"The rich businessman used a loophole in the law to avoid paying taxes.","t":"那个富商钻了法律的**空子**来逃税。"},
43530:{"w":"manipulate","e":"Computers are very efficient at manipulating information.","t":"计算机在**处理**信息方面效率极高。"},
43531:{"w":"ornament","e":"The exhibition wall is covered with paintings and ornaments.","t":"这面展示墙上挂满了油画和**装饰物**。"},
43532:{"w":"paradox","e":"It is a paradox that the more choices people have, the less happy they sometimes feel.","t":"人们的选择越多，有时反而越不快乐，这真是一个**悖论**。"},
43533:{"w":"awe","e":"The children looked up in awe at the huge dinosaur bones in the museum.","t":"孩子们**惊叹**地仰望着博物馆里巨大的恐龙骨架。"},
43534:{"w":"bail","e":"The man was released on bail and must return to court next month.","t":"那名男子获**保释**出狱，下个月必须再次出庭。"},
43535:{"w":"cane","e":"My grandfather has walked with a cane since he hurt his leg last winter.","t":"爷爷去年冬天伤了腿以后，一直拄着**手杖**走路。"},
43536:{"w":"geology","e":"The geology varies a good deal from region to region even in one country.","t":"即使是在同一个国家，不同地区的**地况**也极为不同。"},
43537:{"w":"coverage","e":"We all wait for the live coverage of the results of the bombing trial.","t":"我们都等着看这起爆炸审判结果的现场**报道**。"},
43538:{"w":"statement","e":"The statement contradicts the views of the writer.","t":"这些**陈述**与作者的观点相反。"},
43539:{"w":"excursion","e":"Our family took a two-week excursion to France.","t":"我们一家人去法国**旅行**了两周。"},
43540:{"w":"mild","e":"The thief just got a mild punishment.","t":"小偷只受到了**轻微**的惩罚。"},
43541:{"w":"award","e":"She won an award for her excellent work in helping poor children.","t":"她因帮助贫困儿童的出色工作而获得了一个**奖项**。"},
43542:{"w":"ignorant","e":"She is very ignorant about her own job.","t":"她非常**不了解**自己的工作。"},
43543:{"w":"surgery","e":"They perform surgery between 9:00 and 11:30 every weekday.","t":"他们在每个工作日的9:00到11:30做**手术**。"},
43544:{"w":"bold","e":"It was a bold decision to leave her safe job and start her own business.","t":"辞掉稳定的工作去自己创业，这是一个**勇敢的**决定。"},
43545:{"w":"county","e":"Our county has built three new schools and a large hospital in the past five years.","t":"过去五年里，我们**县里**新建了三所学校和一座大医院。"},
43546:{"w":"leisure","e":"Some people believe that children's leisure activities must be educational, otherwise they are a complete waste of time.","t":"一些人认为，孩子们的**休闲**活动必须具有教育意义，否则纯粹是浪费时间。"},
43547:{"w":"so-called","e":"The so-called expert on TV knew very little about the subject he was discussing.","t":"电视上那位**所谓的**专家，对他讨论的话题知之甚少。"},
43548:{"w":"condense","e":"This article has been adapted and condensed from the article by William and Slater.","t":"这篇文章改编自威廉姆和斯莱特的文章，并进行了**精简**。"},
43549:{"w":"accomplish","e":"We must accomplish the task before noon.","t":"我们必须在中午之前**完成**这项任务。"},
43550:{"w":"superior","e":"Researchers found that a word without a picture is superior to a word plus a picture in terms of reading efficiency.","t":"研究人员发现，就阅读效率而言，不配图画的文字比配有图画的文字的阅读效率**更高**。"},
43551:{"w":"heal","e":"The wound took months to heal.","t":"这个伤口花了几个月才**愈合**。"},
43552:{"w":"plug","e":"Always pull out the plug before you clean the coffee machine in the kitchen.","t":"清洁厨房里的咖啡机之前，一定要先拔掉**插头**。"},
43553:{"w":"sunlight","e":"Plants need plenty of sunlight and water to grow well in the garden.","t":"植物需要充足的**阳光**和水才能在花园里长得好。"},
43554:{"w":"asset","e":"Organizations should recognize that their employees are a significant part of their financial assets.","t":"公司应该承认员工是其**财产**的重要组成部分。"},
43555:{"w":"surplus","e":"After the good harvest, the farmers sold their surplus rice at the market in town.","t":"丰收之后，农民们把**多余的**大米拿到镇上的集市去卖。"},
43556:{"w":"alternative","e":"The coal industry should be abandoned in favour of alternative energy sources.","t":"应该用其他的**替代**能源来取代煤炭业。"},
43557:{"w":"involve","e":"No city can be simply a port but must be involved in a variety of other activities.","t":"没有哪个城市能够单纯作为港口，它必然还**含有**其他多种功能。"},
43558:{"w":"presentation","e":"We'd better fix the problem before the presentation.","t":"我们最好在做**报告**之前解决这个问题。"},
43559:{"w":"kingdom","e":"The king ruled his small kingdom wisely, and his people lived in peace for many years.","t":"国王把他的小**王国**治理得很好，百姓们多年来安居乐业。"},
43560:{"w":"rear","e":"Mary's office is next to the rear entrance.","t":"玛丽的办公室挨着**后**门。"},
43561:{"w":"surround","e":"The small lake is surrounded on all sides by tall trees and green hills.","t":"这个小湖四面被高大的树木和青山**围绕**。"},
43562:{"w":"mobile","e":"Many cities now have mobile libraries that bring books to people in small villages.","t":"许多城市现在都有**流动**图书馆，把书送到小村庄的人们手中。"},
43563:{"w":"hollow","e":"The old tree was hollow inside, and a family of birds had made their home there.","t":"那棵老树里面是**空心**的，一窝鸟在那里安了家。"},
43564:{"w":"private","e":"May I ask you a private question?","t":"我能问你一个**私人**问题吗？"},
43565:{"w":"damn","e":"Damn, I forgot my keys again and now I can't get into the house!","t":"**该死**，我又忘带钥匙了，现在进不了家门！"},
43566:{"w":"charter","e":"There's the Ticket Shop, where you can get inexpensive charter flights.","t":"那是票务窗口，在那里你可以买到便宜的**包机**航班票。"},
43567:{"w":"bulb","e":"The bulb in the kitchen has gone out, so we need to buy a new one.","t":"厨房的**灯泡**坏了，我们得买个新的。"},
43568:{"w":"storage","e":"We use the small room under the stairs for storage of old books and clothes.","t":"我们把楼梯下面的小房间用来**存放**旧书和旧衣服。"},
43569:{"w":"shallow","e":"The water at this end of the pool is shallow, so it is safe for small children.","t":"游泳池这一头是**浅水**区，小孩子在这里玩很安全。"},
43570:{"w":"meaning","e":"If you don't know the meaning of a word, look it up in a dictionary.","t":"如果你不知道一个词的**意思**，就查查词典。"},
43571:{"w":"erroneous","e":"It seems that the boy is under the erroneous impression that the pretty girl is in love with him.","t":"看起来这个男孩子是**误**以为那个漂亮女孩爱上他了。"},
43572:{"w":"procedure","e":"I hate these cumbersome administrative procedures.","t":"我讨厌这些麻烦的行政**手续**。"},
43573:{"w":"annual","e":"All students at the college are entitled to become members of the Sports Centre for an annual fee of $200.","t":"在校大学生只需交200美元的**年**费，就可以成为运动中心的会员。"},
43574:{"w":"supplement","e":"A student loan is intended to supplement living costs of students.","t":"学生贷款旨在**补贴**学生的生活费用。"},
43575:{"w":"controversial","e":"The appearance of individual buildings is often controversial.","t":"私人建筑的外观常常会引起**争议**。"},
43576:{"w":"eliminate","e":"Regular exercise and a healthy diet can help eliminate many common health problems.","t":"规律运动和健康饮食有助于**消除**许多常见的健康问题。"},
43577:{"w":"locate","e":"The college is located at London Road.","t":"这所大学**位于**伦敦路。"},
43578:{"w":"curve","e":"Drive slowly here, because there is a sharp curve in the road ahead.","t":"这里要慢点开，因为前面有个很急的**弯道**。"},
43579:{"w":"horn","e":"The young goat has two small horns growing on top of its head.","t":"这只小山羊头顶上长着两只小**犄角**。"},
43580:{"w":"cabin","e":"We spent our summer holiday in a small wooden cabin by the lake.","t":"我们在湖边一间木头**小屋**里度过了暑假。"},
43581:{"w":"spiritual","e":"Reading good books can meet our spiritual needs as well as teach us new things.","t":"读好书既能满足我们的**精神**需求，又能教给我们新知识。"},
43582:{"w":"dam","e":"The new dam on the river provides electricity for the whole city.","t":"河上新建的**水坝**为整座城市供电。"},
43583:{"w":"receiver","e":"She picked up the receiver and heard her mother's voice on the line.","t":"她拿起**听筒**，听到了电话那头妈妈的声音。"},
43584:{"w":"astonish","e":"The news astonished everyone.","t":"这个消息使所有人**大吃一惊**。"},
43585:{"w":"challenge","e":"The greatest challenge in this respect is time.","t":"这一方面面临的最大**挑战**是时间问题。"},
43586:{"w":"support","e":"My parents have always supported my dream of becoming a doctor, even when it seemed hard.","t":"我父母一直**支持**我当医生的梦想，即使在看起来很难的时候。"},
43587:{"w":"fold","e":"He decided to fold up Phoebe's massage table.","t":"他决定把菲比的按摩桌**折叠**起来。"},
43588:{"w":"alike","e":"My twin sisters look so alike, but they have very different hobbies and friends.","t":"我的双胞胎妹妹长得非常**相像**，但她们的爱好和朋友很不一样。"},
43589:{"w":"Bible","e":"The Bible has been translated into hundreds of languages around the world.","t":"《**圣经**》已被翻译成世界上几百种语言。"},
43590:{"w":"alert","e":"Police asked people to stay alert and report anything unusual at the train station.","t":"警方要求人们在火车站保持**警觉**，发现异常情况就报告。"},
43591:{"w":"phenomenon","e":"The greenhouse effect is a natural phenomenon.","t":"温室效应是一种自然**现象**。"},
43592:{"w":"assign","e":"In that country, more land is assigned to car use than to housing.","t":"那个国家的土地更多地被**指定**为停车之用，而不是建造住宅。"},
43593:{"w":"condition","e":"The research ignored the social and environmental conditions affecting health.","t":"这一研究忽略了影响人类健康的社会环境和自然**环境**。"},
43594:{"w":"survey","e":"A recent survey of staff found that 90 percent welcomed having clothing which reflected the corporate identity.","t":"最近的一项员工**调查**发现，90％的员工欣然接受穿能够反映企业形象的工装。"},
43595:{"w":"episode","e":"I stayed up late last night to watch the final episode of my favorite TV series.","t":"昨晚我熬夜看了我最喜欢的电视剧的最后**一集**。"},
43596:{"w":"segment","e":"The first segment of the TV program was about healthy food for children.","t":"这档电视节目的第一**部分**讲的是儿童健康食品。"},
43597:{"w":"curtain","e":"She opened the curtains and let the morning sunshine into the room.","t":"她拉开**窗帘**，让清晨的阳光照进房间。"},
43598:{"w":"fatal","e":"Driving too fast on icy roads can lead to a fatal accident.","t":"在结冰的路上开快车可能导致**致命的**事故。"},
43599:{"w":"cabbage","e":"My grandmother grows cabbage and carrots in the small garden behind her house.","t":"我奶奶在屋后的小菜园里种了**卷心菜**和胡萝卜。"},
43600:{"w":"household","e":"I've been investigating four new household gadgets and sorting out their advantages and disadvantages.","t":"我已就四种**家居**新产品做了调查，并将它们的优缺点分门别类。"},
43601:{"w":"pad","e":"The secretary always puts a pad by the telephone for taking notes.","t":"秘书总是在电话机旁放一个**便笺本**以便做记录。"},
43602:{"w":"condemn","e":"Many countries condemned the attack on the hospital and called for peace.","t":"许多国家**谴责**了对医院的袭击，并呼吁和平。"},
43603:{"w":"medal","e":"She proudly showed us the medal she won in the school swimming race.","t":"她自豪地给我们看她在学校游泳比赛中赢得的**奖牌**。"},
43604:{"w":"conference","e":"I'm going to a conference in London.","t":"我要去伦敦参加一个**会议**。"},
43605:{"w":"swing","e":"The bus swung sharply to the left.","t":"公共汽车猛地**拐**向左边。"},
43606:{"w":"invest","e":"Supermarkets are able to invest millions of pounds in powerful computers which tell them what sells best.","t":"超市可**投资**数百万英镑用于购买功能强大的计算机，这些计算机能告诉他们什么最畅销。"},
43607:{"w":"issue","e":"They care about environmental issues but their concern does not affect their spending habits.","t":"他们关心环境**问题**，但这种关心并没有影响他们的消费习惯。"},
43608:{"w":"ideal","e":"She is the ideal person for the job.","t":"她是这项工作的**最佳**人选。"},
43609:{"w":"survive","e":"For most animal species, individuals are less likely to survive and reproduce.","t":"对于大多数动物物种来说，个体似乎不太可能**存活**以及繁衍后代。"},
43610:{"w":"swallow","e":"The pill is quite big, so drink some water to help you swallow it.","t":"这颗药片挺大，喝点水会更容易**吞咽**。"},
43611:{"w":"arrest","e":"The police arrested the man who had stolen bikes from the school car park.","t":"警察**逮捕**了那个从学校停车场偷自行车的男子。"},
43612:{"w":"awkward","e":"There was an awkward silence after he asked her how old she was.","t":"他问她多大年纪之后，场面陷入了一阵**尴尬的**沉默。"},
43613:{"w":"interior","e":"The interior of the old church is much brighter than it looks from the outside.","t":"这座老教堂的**内部**比从外面看起来亮堂得多。"},
43614:{"w":"landscape","e":"The landscape around the lake is so beautiful that many artists come here to paint.","t":"湖周围的**风景**非常美，许多画家来这里写生。"},
43615:{"w":"synthetic","e":"This jacket is made of synthetic material, so it is light and dries quickly after rain.","t":"这件夹克是用**合成**材料做的，所以很轻，淋雨后也干得快。"},
43616:{"w":"analyse","e":"Scientists analyse the water from the river to see if it is safe to drink.","t":"科学家**分析**河水，看看它是否可以安全饮用。"},
43617:{"w":"represent","e":"In this famous painting, the white bird represents peace and hope for the future.","t":"在这幅名画中，白鸟**象征**着和平和对未来的希望。"},
43618:{"w":"manufacture","e":"Many automobile makers no longer manufacture cheap models.","t":"很多汽车制造商不再**大量生产**低价位车型。"},
43619:{"w":"hazard","e":"Traffic pollution is a major health hazard.","t":"交通污染是主要的健康**公害**。"},
43620:{"w":"audience","e":"The audience clapped loudly when the young pianist finished playing the last piece.","t":"年轻的钢琴家弹完最后一首曲子时，**听众**热烈鼓掌。"},
43621:{"w":"curse","e":"He cursed loudly when he missed the last bus home on a cold night.","t":"在一个寒冷的夜晚错过了回家的末班车，他大声**咒骂**起来。"},
43622:{"w":"miracle","e":"The doctor said that Mary's recovery was a miracle.","t":"医生说玛丽能够康复是个**奇迹**。"},
43623:{"w":"switch","e":"Can you turn on the light? The switch is next to the door.","t":"你能把灯打开吗？**开关**就在门旁边。"},
43624:{"w":"suspect","e":"Scientists suspected it to be a comet.","t":"科学家**怀疑**它是一颗彗星。"},
43625:{"w":"sway","e":"For centuries the empire held sway over much of the region, controlling its trade routes and ports.","t":"几个世纪以来，这个帝国**统治**着该地区的大部分地方，控制着那里的贸易路线和港口。"},
43626:{"w":"sword","e":"The brave soldier pulled out his sword and stood in front of the castle gate.","t":"勇敢的士兵拔出**宝剑**，站在城堡大门前。"},
43627:{"w":"suspend","e":"The party representative suspended the talk with the government.","t":"该党代表**暂停**了和政府的对话。"},
43628:{"w":"editorial","e":"The newspaper published an editorial asking the city to build more parks for children.","t":"这家报纸发表了一篇**社论**，呼吁市政府为孩子们多建公园。"},
43629:{"w":"fibre","e":"Fruit and vegetables contain a lot of fibre, which is good for your stomach.","t":"水果和蔬菜含有大量**纤维**，对肠胃有好处。"},
43630:{"w":"tide","e":"We waited on the beach until the tide went out and the rocks appeared.","t":"我们在海滩上一直等到**潮水**退去，礁石露了出来。"},
43631:{"w":"librarian","e":"The librarian helped me find a book about the history of our city.","t":"**图书馆管理员**帮我找到了一本关于我们城市历史的书。"},
43632:{"w":"symbol","e":"The sounds of boat whistles and the moving tides are symbols of a port city.","t":"汽笛声和海浪声是港口城市的**象征**。"},
43633:{"w":"crossing","e":"Always use the crossing near the school when you walk across this busy road.","t":"走过这条繁忙的马路时，一定要走学校附近的**人行横道**。"},
43634:{"w":"kid","e":"My neighbor's two kids often play football in the park after school.","t":"我邻居家的两个**孩子**放学后常在公园踢足球。"},
43635:{"w":"sanction","e":"The school has not yet sanctioned the students' plan to hold a concert.","t":"学校还没有**批准**学生们举办音乐会的计划。"},
43636:{"w":"tour","e":"We took a two-hour tour of the old city and learned a lot about its history.","t":"我们在老城**游览**了两个小时，了解了很多它的历史。"},
43637:{"w":"partner","e":"In English class, we practise speaking with a partner for ten minutes every day.","t":"英语课上，我们每天和**搭档**练习口语十分钟。"},
43638:{"w":"bucket","e":"The farmer put a big bucket under the tap and filled it with clean water.","t":"农夫在水龙头下放了一个大**水桶**，装满了清水。"},
43639:{"w":"fascinate","e":"The very style of the old house fascinates.","t":"这个老房子的风格本身就**令人着迷**。"},
43640:{"w":"swear","e":"Before giving evidence, you must swear what you're going to say is true.","t":"作证前，你必须**宣誓**保证所说一切皆属实。"},
43641:{"w":"spot","e":"You'll spot the cinema right next to the underground station.","t":"你会**发现**这家电影院就在地铁站旁边。"},
43642:{"w":"cope","e":"Books are available to help employees cope with stress.","t":"书籍有助于员工**应对**压力。"},
43643:{"w":"center","e":"The new library is in the center of the city, close to the main station.","t":"新图书馆在市**中心**，离火车总站很近。"},
43644:{"w":"pension","e":"Even hourly employees receive benefits—such as pension contributions and medical insurance—that are not tied to the number of hours they work.","t":"即使小时工也享受**养老金**和医疗保险等福利，但这些福利与他们工作的时长没有关系。"},
43645:{"w":"gap","e":"There is a big gap between the rich and the poor in many large cities today.","t":"如今在许多大城市，贫富之间存在很大的**差距**。"},
43646:{"w":"tidy","e":"Her room is always clean and tidy, with every book in its place.","t":"她的房间总是干净**整洁**，每本书都放在该放的地方。"},
43647:{"w":"beggar","e":"A poor beggar sat outside the station asking people for some money.","t":"一个可怜的**乞丐**坐在车站外向人讨钱。"},
43648:{"w":"oppose","e":"Some environmentalists have opposed economic development of any kind.","t":"一些环保主义者**反对**任何形式的经济发展。"},
43649:{"w":"passport","e":"This country is working to stop the illegal sale of its passports to suspected terrorists.","t":"这一国家正在阻止向有恐怖分子嫌疑的人非法出售该国**护照**。"},
43650:{"w":"liable","e":"He is liable to be punished as a violator.","t":"他**可能**因为违规而受罚。"},
43651:{"w":"deadline","e":"If you can't meet a deadline for an essay, you should go and see your lecturers.","t":"如果你不能在**截止日期**前交论文，就应该去找你的老师（说明情况）。"},
43652:{"w":"swell","e":"It was the pressure inside the mountain that made it swell.","t":"山体内部的压力使它**膨胀**。"},
43653:{"w":"bunch","e":"He picked me a bunch of flowers.","t":"他给我采了一**束**花。"},
43654:{"w":"automatic","e":"The automatic doors at the supermarket open as soon as someone walks toward them.","t":"超市的**自动**门一有人走近就会打开。"},
43655:{"w":"link","e":"Benefits and hours spent on the job are not necessarily linked.","t":"工作所得与所付出的时间不是必然**相关**的。"},
43656:{"w":"management","e":"Good time management helps students finish their homework and still have time to relax.","t":"良好的时间**管理**能帮助学生完成作业，还能有时间放松。"},
43657:{"w":"joint","e":"The Universities of Oxford and Cambridge recently held joint conferences to discuss the rapid decline in literacy among their undergraduates.","t":"牛津大学和剑桥大学近日召开**联合**会议，讨论两校大学生文化素养迅速下降的问题。"},
43658:{"w":"brave","e":"The brave young man jumped into the river to save a child who was drowning.","t":"那个**勇敢的**年轻人跳进河里，救起了一个溺水的孩子。"},
43659:{"w":"session","e":"This course is made up of 15 sessions.","t":"这门课共上15**节**。"},
43660:{"w":"surrender","e":"I'd rather make the gravest of mistakes than surrender my own judgment.","t":"我宁可酿成大错，也不愿**放弃**自己的判断。"},
43661:{"w":"swift","e":"Beijing has cheap, swift and effective public transport.","t":"北京的公共交通便宜、**快捷**且高效。"},
43662:{"w":"delicious","e":"My grandmother makes delicious dumplings every time we visit her during the Spring Festival.","t":"每年春节我们去看奶奶，她都会包**美味的**饺子。"},
43663:{"w":"rude","e":"It is rude to talk loudly on your phone while others are reading in the library.","t":"别人在图书馆看书时大声打电话是很**不礼貌**的。"},
43664:{"w":"prohibit","e":"Smoking is prohibited on most occasions.","t":"大多数场合都**禁止**吸烟。"},
43665:{"w":"breeze","e":"The systems mix light, sounds, breezes and scents to stimulate people who spend long periods below ground.","t":"该系统综合了光线、声音、**微风**和香味来刺激长期待在地下的人。"},
43666:{"w":"faint","e":"I heard a faint sound of music coming from the house next door.","t":"我听到隔壁传来**隐约的**音乐声。"},
43667:{"w":"approve","e":"You can begin making purchases immediately after your application is approved.","t":"你的申请得到**批准**后，马上就可以购买了。"},
43668:{"w":"imitate","e":"Children like to imitate adults.","t":"儿童喜欢**模仿**大人。"},
43669:{"w":"culture","e":"Learning a foreign language is a good way to understand the culture of another country.","t":"学习外语是了解另一个国家**文化**的好方法。"},
43670:{"w":"conclusion","e":"After a long discussion, we came to the conclusion that the plan would cost too much.","t":"经过长时间讨论，我们得出**结论**：这个计划花费太大。"},
43671:{"w":"sympathy","e":"I have a lot of sympathy for people who lost their homes in the flood.","t":"我非常**同情**在洪水中失去家园的人。"},
43672:{"w":"halfway","e":"We ran out of petrol halfway home and had to walk the rest of the way.","t":"我们在回家的**半路**上没油了，只好走完剩下的路。"},
43673:{"w":"bang","e":"The door closed with a loud bang and woke the baby up.","t":"门“砰”地一声**巨响**关上了，把宝宝吵醒了。"},
43674:{"w":"advantage","e":"I suppose your survey has the advantage of more detailed information.","t":"我认为你调查的**优势**在于拥有更加详细的资料。"},
43675:{"w":"missile","e":"The guidance systems didn't work and the missile couldn't hit its target.","t":"制导系统失灵了，所以**导弹**没能命中目标。"},
43676:{"w":"curious","e":"Further observation by astronomers revealed two curious facts.","t":"天文学家经过进一步观察发现了两个**奇怪**的现象。"},
43677:{"w":"considerable","e":"It took a considerable amount of time to clean the house after the party.","t":"聚会结束后，打扫房子花了**相当多的**时间。"},
43678:{"w":"cast","e":"The whole cast of the play came onto the stage to thank the audience.","t":"这部剧的**全体演员**都走上舞台向观众致谢。"},
43679:{"w":"pulse","e":"The nurse held my wrist and took my pulse before the doctor came in.","t":"医生进来之前，护士握着我的手腕给我量了**脉搏**。"},
43680:{"w":"spur","e":"Whenever the official holidays approach, many supermarkets spur the sales by means of promotion.","t":"每当法定假日临近，许多超市就通过促销活动来**刺激**销售。"},
43681:{"w":"Marxist","e":"The professor has written several books about Marxist ideas on economics and society.","t":"这位教授写过几本书，讨论**马克思主义**的经济和社会思想。"},
43682:{"w":"encounter","e":"We encountered heavy rain on our way up the mountain, so we turned back.","t":"我们上山途中**遇到**了大雨，只好返回。"},
43683:{"w":"infant","e":"The young mother carried her sleeping infant carefully onto the crowded bus.","t":"年轻的妈妈小心地抱着熟睡的**婴儿**上了拥挤的公交车。"},
43684:{"w":"prior","e":"This degree course needs no prior qualifications.","t":"这种学位课程不需要**先决**条件。"},
43685:{"w":"concern","e":"What most concerns me is I'm still not doing very well on my homework.","t":"最让我**担心**的是我现在还不能很好地完成家庭作业。"},
43686:{"w":"banner","e":"On the wall is the banner welcoming the friends of Italian Opera.","t":"墙上挂着一条欢迎意大利歌剧团的朋友们的**横幅**。"},
43687:{"w":"dye","e":"She decided to dye her hair brown before starting her new job.","t":"开始新工作之前，她决定把头发**染成**棕色。"},
43688:{"w":"preposition","e":"Many students find it hard to choose the right preposition when they write in English.","t":"许多学生在用英语写作时，觉得很难选对**介词**。"},
43689:{"w":"symptom","e":"This disease has some symptoms similar to a cold.","t":"这种病的某些**症状**与感冒的相似。"},
43690:{"w":"onion","e":"Cutting onions always makes my eyes water, so I wear glasses in the kitchen.","t":"切**洋葱**总让我流眼泪，所以我在厨房里戴着眼镜。"},
43691:{"w":"pond","e":"The children like to feed the ducks in the pond near the school.","t":"孩子们喜欢在学校附近的**池塘**边喂鸭子。"},
43692:{"w":"pillar","e":"The roof of the old temple is held up by four huge stone pillars.","t":"这座古庙的屋顶由四根巨大的石头**柱子**支撑着。"},
43693:{"w":"seal","e":"Please seal the envelope and stick an eight-cent stamp on it.","t":"请**封好**信封并贴上一张8分邮票。"},
43694:{"w":"reinforce","e":"The workers used steel bars to reinforce the old bridge before the heavy trucks passed.","t":"在重型卡车通过之前，工人们用钢条**加固**了那座旧桥。"},
43695:{"w":"outcome","e":"Some environmentalists worry about this outcome.","t":"一些环境保护主义者对这个**结果**表示担心。"},
43696:{"w":"saint","e":"My mother is so patient with everyone that her friends call her a saint.","t":"我妈妈对每个人都很耐心，朋友们都叫她**圣人**。"},
43697:{"w":"authorize","e":"Only the manager can authorize you to use the company car on weekends.","t":"只有经理才能**授权**你周末使用公司的车。"},
43698:{"w":"journey","e":"The train journey from Beijing to Shanghai now takes only about five hours.","t":"从北京到上海的火车**旅程**现在只需要大约五个小时。"},
43699:{"w":"hesitate","e":"Mary hesitated before she answered this question because she didn't know what to say.","t":"玛丽在回答这个问题前**犹豫**了一下，因为她不知道要说什么。"},
43700:{"w":"rail","e":"Hold on to the rail when you walk down these steep stairs.","t":"走下这段陡峭的楼梯时，要扶好**栏杆**。"},
43701:{"w":"forehead","e":"She touched her son's forehead to see if he had a fever.","t":"她摸了摸儿子的**额头**，看他是否发烧。"},
43702:{"w":"crawl","e":"The baby can't walk yet, but she can crawl quickly across the floor.","t":"宝宝还不会走路，但她能在地板上飞快地**爬行**。"},
43703:{"w":"pat","e":"The coach gave each player a pat on the back after the game.","t":"比赛结束后，教练在每个队员背上**轻拍**了一下。"},
43704:{"w":"conscience","e":"After lying to his best friend, he had a guilty conscience for many days.","t":"对好朋友撒谎后，他很多天都受到**良心**的谴责。"},
43705:{"w":"contribute","e":"Every student in our class contributed some money to help the family who lost their home in the fire.","t":"我们班每个同学都**捐**了些钱，帮助那户在火灾中失去家园的人家。"},
43706:{"w":"rational","e":"The boss made a rational decision in the end.","t":"老板最终做出了**合理**的决定。"},
43707:{"w":"precise","e":"Can you give me the precise time when the train will arrive at the station?","t":"你能告诉我火车到站的**准确**时间吗？"},
43708:{"w":"cigarette","e":"My uncle finally gave up cigarettes after his doctor warned him about his lungs.","t":"医生提醒他注意肺部健康后，我叔叔终于戒掉了**香烟**。"},
43709:{"w":"flee","e":"Citizens were forced to flee the besieged city.","t":"居民们被迫**逃离**这座被围困的城市。"},
43710:{"w":"cable","e":"The street is blocked off because workers are laying telephone cables.","t":"因为工作人员正在铺设电话**线**，所以这条街被封锁了。"},
43711:{"w":"immense","e":"The new bridge was an immense project that took ten years and thousands of workers to finish.","t":"这座新桥是一项**巨大的**工程，花了十年时间、动用了数千名工人才完成。"},
43712:{"w":"executive","e":"Kate, a former teacher, is now an executive for a charity.","t":"凯特从前是一位教师，现在是一个慈善团体**管理者**。"},
43713:{"w":"screw","e":"He screwed the painting onto the wall.","t":"他**用螺丝钉**把画固定在墙上。"},
43714:{"w":"outer","e":"Take off the outer leaves of the cabbage before you wash and cook it.","t":"洗菜做菜之前，先把卷心菜**外层**的叶子剥掉。"},
43715:{"w":"tag","e":"Before you buy the jacket, check the price on the tag inside the collar.","t":"买这件夹克之前，先看看领子里**标签**上的价格。"},
43716:{"w":"gang","e":"A gang of young men attacked the police station with machine guns.","t":"**一群**手持机关枪的年轻人袭击了警察局。"},
43717:{"w":"revolutionary","e":"The smartphone was a revolutionary invention that changed the way people live and work.","t":"智能手机是一项**革命性**的发明，改变了人们的生活和工作方式。"},
43718:{"w":"means","e":"Plants can defend themselves by using both physical and chemical means.","t":"植物可以通过物理以及化学的**方法**保护自己。"},
43719:{"w":"favor","e":"Most of the students favor the plan to have a longer lunch break.","t":"大多数学生**赞同**延长午休时间的计划。"},
43720:{"w":"fabric","e":"My mother bought some soft cotton fabric to make a new dress for my sister.","t":"妈妈买了些柔软的棉**布料**，给妹妹做一条新裙子。"},
43721:{"w":"nephew","e":"My nephew is only six, but he can already read simple English books.","t":"我**侄子**才六岁，但已经能读简单的英文书了。"},
43722:{"w":"constitute","e":"The lid constitutes twenty-five percent of the can's total weight.","t":"盖子**占**罐子总重的25％。"},
43723:{"w":"ridge","e":"We walked along the narrow ridge and enjoyed the view of the valleys on both sides.","t":"我们沿着狭窄的**山脊**行走，欣赏两边山谷的风景。"},
43724:{"w":"motivate","e":"Pictures are used to help motivate children to read because they are beautiful and eye-catching.","t":"图片因其美丽和引人注目而被用来**激发**孩子们的阅读兴趣。"},
43725:{"w":"squeeze","e":"I made the toast and squeezed orange juice every morning.","t":"我每天早上都烤面包、**榨**橙汁。"},
43726:{"w":"mass","e":"Mass use of motor vehicles has killed or injured millions of people.","t":"机动车的**大量**使用已造成数百万人伤亡。"},
43727:{"w":"system","e":"Our school has a new system for students to borrow books online from the library.","t":"我们学校有了一套新**系统**，学生可以在网上向图书馆借书。"},
43728:{"w":"competent","e":"This new manager was really competent.","t":"新任经理的确很**能干**。"},
43729:{"w":"failure","e":"The plan ended in failure because nobody was willing to pay for it.","t":"这项计划以**失败**告终，因为没有人愿意为它出钱。"},
43730:{"w":"tedious","e":"The audience became sleepy because of the speaker's tedious story.","t":"演讲者**冗长乏味**的故事使得听众昏昏欲睡。"},
43731:{"w":"scarcely","e":"I could scarcely believe my eyes when I saw my old friend at the airport.","t":"在机场看到老朋友时，我**简直不**敢相信自己的眼睛。"},
43732:{"w":"consistent","e":"The survey results are entirely consistent with our earlier research.","t":"调查的结果与我们早期的研究结果完全**一致**。"},
43733:{"w":"anxious","e":"He is anxious to enter the competition.","t":"他**急切**希望能加入比赛。"},
43734:{"w":"clay","e":"The children made small animals out of clay in the art class.","t":"美术课上，孩子们用**黏土**捏了些小动物。"},
43735:{"w":"nowhere","e":"I looked for my keys everywhere, but they were nowhere to be found.","t":"我到处找钥匙，可**哪儿都**找不到。"},
43736:{"w":"famine","e":"Millions of people died during the famine because there was no rain for three years.","t":"因为三年没有下雨，数百万人在那场**饥荒**中死去。"},
43737:{"w":"intelligent","e":"The most intelligent students do additional reading to supplement the material in the textbook.","t":"最**聪明**的学生通过课外阅读来补充课本的内容。"},
43738:{"w":"sympathetic","e":"Lena just needed someone who would lend a sympathetic ear to her.","t":"丽娜只需要有人能**同情地**听她诉诉苦。"},
43739:{"w":"fundamental","e":"The fundamental conditions and resources for health are peace, education, food, a viable income, and a stable ecosystem.","t":"和平、教育、食物、足以维持生计的收入和稳定的生态系统是健康的**基本**条件和源泉。"},
43740:{"w":"conductor","e":"When the conductor raised his hands, the whole orchestra began to play the music.","t":"**指挥**一举起双手，整个乐团就开始演奏。"},
43741:{"w":"sketch","e":"He quickly sketched the view from the window.","t":"他很快**勾勒**出了窗外的风景。"},
43742:{"w":"plural","e":"In English, most nouns form their plural by adding the letter s at the end.","t":"在英语里，大多数名词的**复数**是在词尾加字母 s 构成的。"},
43743:{"w":"garlic","e":"My grandmother adds a lot of garlic to almost every dish she cooks.","t":"我奶奶几乎每道菜都放很多**大蒜**。"},
43744:{"w":"calm","e":"The pilot managed to bring the aircraft and its 50 passengers down safely in the calm waters of the bay.","t":"飞行员成功地将飞机降落在**风平浪静**的海湾中，确保了50名乘客的安全。"},
43745:{"w":"anticipate","e":"We need someone who can anticipate and respond to changes in the fashion industry.","t":"我们需要一个能**预见**时装业变化并能应对这些变化的人。"},
43746:{"w":"temporary","e":"Coal mining makes only temporary use of the land and produces no toxic chemical wastes.","t":"煤矿开采只是**暂时**使用这片土地，不会产生任何有毒的化学废弃物。"},
43747:{"w":"tame","e":"The birds in the park are so tame that they eat bread from your hand.","t":"公园里的鸟很**驯服**，会从你手上吃面包。"},
43748:{"w":"teenager","e":"Many teenagers spend more than three hours a day on their phones.","t":"许多**青少年**每天花三个多小时在手机上。"},
43749:{"w":"recognize","e":"I hadn't seen her for ten years, but I recognized her as soon as she smiled.","t":"我十年没见过她了，但她一笑我就**认出**了她。"},
43750:{"w":"cancel","e":"Could you please call the dentist at 816-25285 and cancel the appointment for me?","t":"你能拨打816-25285帮我**取消**和牙医的预约吗？"},
43751:{"w":"compress","e":"You should compress these large photo files before you send them to your teacher by email.","t":"用电子邮件发给老师之前，你应该把这些大的照片文件**压缩**一下。"},
43752:{"w":"puzzle","e":"Her strange answer puzzled everyone in the room, and nobody knew what to say.","t":"她那奇怪的回答让屋里的每个人都感到**迷惑**，没人知道该说什么。"},
43753:{"w":"pray","e":"After months of dry weather, the farmers prayed for rain to save their crops.","t":"经过几个月的干旱，农民们**祈求**下雨来挽救庄稼。"},
43754:{"w":"pepper","e":"Only a dash of pepper is enough for the dish.","t":"这道菜只需放一点儿**胡椒粉**就可以了。"},
43755:{"w":"absolute","e":"There is no absolute standard for beauty.","t":"美没有**绝对**的标准。"},
43756:{"w":"target","e":"Everyone should have a target in mind for the first year of college life.","t":"每个人在大学生活的第一年都应该有个**目标**。"},
43757:{"w":"discharge","e":"The factory was fined for discharging dirty water into the river near the village.","t":"这家工厂因向村子附近的河里**排放**污水而被罚款。"},
43758:{"w":"frank","e":"Will you be frank with me about this matter?","t":"在这件事上你能不能**坦白**地跟我说？"},
43759:{"w":"camel","e":"Camels can travel for days across the desert without drinking any water.","t":"**骆驼**可以在沙漠中走上好几天，一点水都不喝。"},
43760:{"w":"temper","e":"He was in a good temper this morning because his team had won the game.","t":"他今天早上**心情**很好，因为他的球队赢了比赛。"},
43761:{"w":"hip","e":"My grandmother fell and hurt her hip, so she walks with a stick now.","t":"我奶奶摔了一跤，伤了**髋部**，所以现在要拄拐杖。"},
43762:{"w":"technician","e":"The technician came to our office and fixed the broken printer in ten minutes.","t":"**技术员**来到我们办公室，十分钟就修好了坏掉的打印机。"},
43763:{"w":"extensive","e":"Extensive underground water resources are available over more than half of Australia's land area.","t":"在澳大利亚，超过一半的地域中**广泛**分布着可利用的地下水资源。"},
43764:{"w":"polish","e":"He spent an hour polishing his old leather shoes before the important job interview.","t":"重要的求职面试前，他花了一个小时把旧皮鞋**擦亮**。"},
43765:{"w":"setting","e":"The quiet setting of the school, far from busy roads, helps students focus on their studies.","t":"学校远离繁忙的马路，**环境**安静，有助于学生专心学习。"},
43766:{"w":"amuse","e":"The clown amused the children with funny tricks at the birthday party.","t":"生日聚会上，小丑用滑稽的把戏**逗乐**了孩子们。"},
43767:{"w":"tangible","e":"The new rules have brought tangible benefits to people living in the area.","t":"新规定给这一地区的居民带来了**实际的**好处。"},
43768:{"w":"technique","e":"A new style of architecture was made possible by new materials and construction techniques.","t":"新的建筑材料和建筑**技术**使新的建筑风格得以实现。"},
43769:{"w":"current","e":"The current price of this phone is much lower than it was last year.","t":"这款手机**目前**的价格比去年低多了。"},
43770:{"w":"temptation","e":"You should resist the temptation of the food.","t":"你要抵制住食物的**诱惑**。"},
43771:{"w":"tax","e":"The government plans to raise the tax on cigarettes to stop people from smoking.","t":"政府计划提高香烟的**税款**，以减少吸烟的人。"},
43772:{"w":"mask","e":"Many people wear a mask on the bus to avoid catching a cold.","t":"许多人在公交车上戴**口罩**，以免感冒。"},
43773:{"w":"disguise","e":"The thief disguised himself as a delivery man to get into the building.","t":"小偷**假扮**成快递员混进了大楼。"},
43774:{"w":"emerge","e":"A new style of architecture emerged to reflect more idealistic notions for the future.","t":"一种新的建筑风格**出现**了，它反映了未来更为理想的建筑理念。"},
43775:{"w":"musician","e":"The young musician played the piano so well that everyone stood up to clap.","t":"那位年轻的**音乐家**钢琴弹得太好了，大家都站起来鼓掌。"},
43776:{"w":"glue","e":"I've prepared this so that I don't get glue everywhere.","t":"我已经有所准备，这样就不会把**胶水**弄得到处都是。"},
43777:{"w":"capable","e":"The bridge is capable of carrying 150-tonne trucks.","t":"这座桥**能够**承受载重150公吨的卡车。"},
43778:{"w":"temple","e":"We visited an old temple on the mountain and listened to the bells ring.","t":"我们参观了山上一座古老的**庙宇**，听到了钟声。"},
43779:{"w":"solemn","e":"Kit made a solemn vow that he would always stand beside me.","t":"基特**郑重**起誓，说他将永远支持我。"},
43780:{"w":"technology","e":"Modern technology has made it much easier for people to keep in touch with friends.","t":"现代**技术**让人们与朋友保持联系变得容易多了。"},
43781:{"w":"decay","e":"The wooden bridge was unsafe due to decay.","t":"这座木桥**腐烂**了，不安全。"},
43782:{"w":"tend","e":"Women tend to research thoroughly before applying for positions or attending interviews.","t":"在申请职位或是参加面试前，女性**往往**会（对应聘公司及职位）进行全面彻底的了解。"},
43783:{"w":"selfish","e":"It was selfish of him to eat all the cake without saving any for his sister.","t":"他把蛋糕全吃了，一点也没给妹妹留，真是太**自私**了。"},
43784:{"w":"authentic","e":"This small restaurant serves authentic Sichuan food cooked by two chefs from Chengdu.","t":"这家小餐馆供应由两位成都厨师烹制的**正宗**川菜。"},
43785:{"w":"ancient","e":"The ancient Greeks used lenses to concentrate the sun's rays on dry leaves to light fire.","t":"**古**希腊人用透镜将太阳光聚集在干树叶上生火。"},
43786:{"w":"cucumber","e":"She cut a fresh cucumber into thin slices and added it to the salad.","t":"她把一根新鲜**黄瓜**切成薄片，加进了沙拉里。"},
43787:{"w":"feedback","e":"Employee feedback is reviewed daily and some suggestions will be implemented within 48 hours.","t":"员工**反馈**信息每天都会被查看，一些建议会在48小时之内被采纳实施。"},
43788:{"w":"effective","e":"Which advertisement is the most effective?","t":"哪一种广告最**有效**？"},
43789:{"w":"per","e":"Tickets cost twenty dollars per person, and children under six can get in free.","t":"门票**每位**二十美元，六岁以下的儿童可以免费入场。"},
43790:{"w":"accordance","e":"The building was designed in accordance with the city's new safety rules.","t":"这栋楼是**依照**城市新的安全规定设计的。"},
43791:{"w":"channel","e":"We're doing some market research for a new television channel starting in two years' time.","t":"我们正在为日后两年内开通一个新的电视**频道**做市场调查。"},
43792:{"w":"participate","e":"More and more women are participating in politics.","t":"越来越多的女性**投身**政治。"},
43793:{"w":"perceive","e":"While I was examining the small stars, I perceived one that appeared visibly larger than the rest.","t":"我观察那些小星星时，**发现**有一颗明显比其他的大。"},
43794:{"w":"hospitalize","e":"She was hospitalized for a week after she broke her leg in a car accident.","t":"她在一场车祸中摔断了腿，**住院**治疗了一周。"},
43795:{"w":"primitive","e":"Studies of primitive societies suggest that the earliest method of making fire was through friction.","t":"对**原始**社会的研究表明，人们最早是通过摩擦生火的。"},
43796:{"w":"environment","e":"We should all do something to protect the environment, such as using less plastic.","t":"我们都应该为保护**环境**做点事，比如少用塑料。"},
43797:{"w":"adult","e":"Children under twelve must be with an adult when they swim in this pool.","t":"十二岁以下的儿童在这个泳池游泳时必须有**成年人**陪同。"},
43798:{"w":"consent","e":"Children under sixteen need their parents' consent to join the school trip abroad.","t":"十六岁以下的孩子参加学校的出国旅行需要得到父母的**同意**。"},
43799:{"w":"crime","e":"Without the death penalty our lives are less secure and violent crime will increase.","t":"如果没有死刑，我们的生命会更不安全，暴力**犯罪**活动也将增加。"},
43800:{"w":"enhance","e":"Organisations provide a range of opportunities for women to enhance their skills.","t":"一些组织为妇女提供大量**提高**她们技能的机会。"},
43801:{"w":"organize","e":"Our class organized a trip to the mountains to celebrate the end of the exams.","t":"为庆祝考试结束，我们班**组织**了一次山区旅行。"},
43802:{"w":"pigeon","e":"An old man was feeding the pigeons in the square in front of the station.","t":"一位老人在车站前的广场上喂**鸽子**。"},
43803:{"w":"arrival","e":"The arrival of the new English teacher made all the students very excited.","t":"新英语老师的**到来**让所有学生都很兴奋。"},
43804:{"w":"drama","e":"Our class will perform a drama about friendship at the school festival next month.","t":"下个月我们班将在学校艺术节上表演一部关于友谊的**戏剧**。"},
43805:{"w":"cement","e":"The workers mixed sand, water and cement to build the new wall.","t":"工人们把沙子、水和**水泥**混在一起砌新墙。"},
43806:{"w":"brief","e":"The manager gave a brief talk to welcome the new workers on their first day.","t":"经理在新员工上班第一天作了**简短**的欢迎讲话。"},
43807:{"w":"miserable","e":"Many female patients have completely given up exercise because the pain makes them so miserable.","t":"很多女性病人已经完全放弃了锻炼，因为疼痛让她们极其**痛苦**。"},
43808:{"w":"magnificent","e":"The garage around the corner contains the magnificent old Rolls-Royce which used to belong to George.","t":"街角的车库里停着一辆**华丽的**老式劳斯莱斯，它曾经是乔治的。"},
43809:{"w":"ambition","e":"Bob's ambition was to study medicine.","t":"鲍勃**有志于**学医。"},
43810:{"w":"fur","e":"Our cat has soft white fur and loves to sleep in the sun.","t":"我们家的猫长着白色的**软毛**，喜欢在阳光下睡觉。"},
43811:{"w":"investigate","e":"We must investigate and understand the link between environment and health.","t":"我们必须**研究**并了解环境与健康之间的联系。"},
43812:{"w":"outline","e":"The guide gave us a brief outline of the museum's history.","t":"导游向我们简要**概述**了这座博物馆的历史。"},
43813:{"w":"antique","e":"My grandmother collects antiques, and her house is full of old clocks and vases.","t":"我奶奶收藏**古董**，她家里满是旧钟表和花瓶。"},
43814:{"w":"painter","e":"The painter needed three days to finish the walls of our new classroom.","t":"**油漆工**花了三天时间才把我们新教室的墙刷完。"},
43815:{"w":"distinguish","e":"Young children sometimes find it hard to distinguish between what is real and what is not.","t":"小孩子有时很难**分辨**什么是真的、什么是假的。"},
43816:{"w":"innovative","e":"The company is famous for its innovative products, such as phones that can fold in half.","t":"这家公司以**创新**产品闻名，比如可以对折的手机。"},
43817:{"w":"infinite","e":"The teacher showed infinite patience with the slow learners in her class.","t":"老师对班上学得慢的学生表现出**无限的**耐心。"},
43818:{"w":"shortcoming","e":"Everyone has shortcomings, so we should be patient with the people around us.","t":"每个人都有**缺点**，所以我们应该对身边的人多些耐心。"},
43819:{"w":"replacement","e":"Our math teacher is ill, so the school has found a replacement for the next two weeks.","t":"我们的数学老师病了，学校找了一位**代课老师**来上接下来两周的课。"},
43820:{"w":"moderate","e":"The people can bear moderate price increases in the market.","t":"人们能够忍受市场上**适度**的涨价。"},
43821:{"w":"oversee","e":"You must appoint someone to oversee the project.","t":"你得指派某个人**监督**这个项目。"},
43822:{"w":"inner","e":"She looked calm, but her inner feelings were full of fear before the exam.","t":"考试前她看上去很平静，但**内心**充满了恐惧。"},
43823:{"w":"atomic","e":"Atomic energy powers the submarine.","t":"**原子**能给潜艇提供动力。"},
43824:{"w":"auditorium","e":"More than five hundred parents came to the school auditorium to watch the music show.","t":"五百多位家长来到学校**礼堂**观看音乐演出。"},
43825:{"w":"clerk","e":"The clerk at the hotel desk gave us our room keys and a map of the city.","t":"酒店前台的**职员**给了我们房间钥匙和一张城市地图。"},
43826:{"w":"tender","e":"Chicken is tender and delicious.","t":"鸡肉肉**嫩**味美。"},
43827:{"w":"homosexual","e":"The law now protects homosexual couples from being treated unfairly at work.","t":"现在法律保护**同性恋**伴侣在工作中不受不公平对待。"},
43828:{"w":"liquor","e":"David got hooked on hard liquor.","t":"戴维喝**烈酒**成瘾。"},
43829:{"w":"anchor","e":"When a ship anchors, it means sailors can stay in the town for a short time to live as locals.","t":"轮船**抛锚**，意味着船员们可以在小镇稍作停留，过一下当地人的生活。"},
43830:{"w":"banquet","e":"The city held a banquet to welcome the famous players after they won the cup.","t":"球员们夺冠后，市里举办了一场**宴会**欢迎这些著名球员。"},
43831:{"w":"presently","e":"The manager is presently on holiday, but she will be back next Monday.","t":"经理**目前**在休假，下周一回来。"},
43832:{"w":"mystery","e":"There is still a lot of mystery about how the ancient city disappeared.","t":"这座古城是如何消失的，仍然有很多**神秘**之处。"},
43833:{"w":"excel","e":"She has always excelled at math and won several prizes in national competitions.","t":"她一直**擅长**数学，在全国比赛中得过好几次奖。"},
43834:{"w":"gene","e":"Scientists have found a gene that may explain why some people live longer than others.","t":"科学家发现了一种**基因**，它或许能解释为什么有些人比别人长寿。"},
43835:{"w":"associate","e":"People always associate noise with headaches, and for most of us excessive noise creates the conditions for a headache.","t":"人们总是把噪音和头痛**联系**在一起，对于我们大多数人来说，过多的噪音是引起头痛的原因。"},
43836:{"w":"crocodile","e":"At the zoo, we saw a huge crocodile lying in the sun by the water.","t":"在动物园里，我们看到一条巨大的**鳄鱼**躺在水边晒太阳。"},
43837:{"w":"security","e":"Such insurance plan can offer your families financial security in the event of the loss of properties.","t":"这种保险计划可以在你失去财产的情况下向你的家人提供经济**保障**。"},
43838:{"w":"legal","e":"The Union has its own officers who can give advice on legal problems.","t":"该协会拥有自己的人员，负责给**法律**事务提供建议。"},
43839:{"w":"deprive","e":"The accident deprived him of his feet.","t":"这场意外事故使他**失去**了双脚。"},
43840:{"w":"nerve","e":"It took a lot of nerve for her to stand up and sing in front of the whole school.","t":"她敢站起来在全校面前唱歌，需要很大的**胆量**。"},
43841:{"w":"affect","e":"No activity affects more of the earth's surface than farming.","t":"耕种是对地表**影响**最大的人类活动。"},
43842:{"w":"municipal","e":"The municipal government plans to build three new parks in the city next year.","t":"**市政**府计划明年在城里新建三座公园。"},
43843:{"w":"greedy","e":"Don't be so greedy, Tom, and leave some of the cake for your little sister.","t":"汤姆，别那么**贪吃**，给你妹妹留点蛋糕。"},
43844:{"w":"tense","e":"When pain strikes, we attempt to keep the back as immobile as possible, which makes the muscles tense up.","t":"当疼痛来袭时，我们尽最大努力保持背部不动，这样会使肌肉**紧绷**。"},
43845:{"w":"overdue","e":"The landlord is not very pleased because the rent is overdue.","t":"因为房租**过期未付**，房东不是很高兴。"},
43846:{"w":"essential","e":"It is essential that the glass be thicker on the outside than on the inside.","t":"外层的玻璃应该比内层的玻璃厚，这一点**很重要**。"},
43847:{"w":"comedy","e":"I really like to watch some of the old comedy shows.","t":"我真想看一些以前的**喜剧**表演。"},
43848:{"w":"formulate","e":"She cannot formulate her idea in a few words.","t":"她无法用几句话**阐明**自己的思想。"},
43849:{"w":"decorate","e":"We moved into our new apartment before it was decorated.","t":"新公寓还没有**装修**，我们就搬进去了。"},
43850:{"w":"flour","e":"My mother mixed flour, eggs and milk to make pancakes for breakfast.","t":"妈妈把**面粉**、鸡蛋和牛奶混在一起，做早餐吃的煎饼。"},
43851:{"w":"incentive","e":"The company offers extra pay as an incentive for workers to finish the project early.","t":"公司提供额外报酬作为**激励**，让员工提前完成项目。"},
43852:{"w":"excess","e":"I am burdened with an excess of public attention.","t":"公众的**过度**关注使我感到不堪重负。"},
43853:{"w":"collision","e":"Nobody was hurt in the collision between the bus and the truck this morning.","t":"今天早上公交车和卡车发生了**碰撞**，但没有人受伤。"},
43854:{"w":"refrain","e":"The survey finds that the majority of people can refrain from smoking in public places such as theaters and museums.","t":"调查发现，在剧院和博物馆这类公共场所大多数人能够**克制**住不抽烟。"},
43855:{"w":"compare","e":"How are the expectations of today's school leavers different compared with those of the previous generation?","t":"与上一届**相比**，现在毕业生的期望有何不同？"},
43856:{"w":"absent","e":"Why were you absent from my birthday party yesterday?","t":"你昨天怎么**没来**参加我的生日派对呢？"},
43857:{"w":"attic","e":"We found a box of old family photos in the attic of my grandparents' house.","t":"我们在祖父母家的**阁楼**里找到了一箱老家庭照片。"},
43858:{"w":"fuel","e":"Such fuels produce far less carbon dioxide than coal or oil.","t":"这些**燃料**所产生的二氧化碳要比煤和石油产生的少得多。"},
43859:{"w":"critical","e":"Getting enough sleep is critical for students who want to do well in their exams.","t":"对想考好的学生来说，睡眠充足**至关重要**。"},
43860:{"w":"barbecue","e":"Membership gives wide access to activities like basketball and football as well as barbecues and other social functions.","t":"会员可以参加各种活动，诸如打篮球、踢足球、**烧烤**以及其他社交集会。"},
43861:{"w":"command","e":"The officer commanded his soldiers to stay where they were until morning.","t":"军官**命令**士兵们原地待到天亮。"},
43862:{"w":"paw","e":"The little dog hurt its paw when it stepped on a piece of broken glass.","t":"小狗踩到一块碎玻璃，弄伤了**爪子**。"},
43863:{"w":"canteen","e":"Most students eat lunch in the school canteen because the food is cheap.","t":"大多数学生在学校**食堂**吃午饭，因为饭菜便宜。"},
43864:{"w":"plastic","e":"Many supermarkets no longer give free plastic bags to customers who buy food.","t":"许多超市不再给买食品的顾客免费提供**塑料**袋。"},
43865:{"w":"crew","e":"The rescue crew is still looking for survivors.","t":"救援**队**仍然在寻找生还者。"},
43866:{"w":"nap","e":"My grandmother usually takes a short nap after lunch to feel fresh in the afternoon.","t":"我奶奶午饭后通常会**小睡**一会儿，好让下午精神饱满。"},
43867:{"w":"characteristic","e":"Many characteristics, such as height and intelligence, result not from the action of genes alone.","t":"诸如身高、智力等这些**特征**并不完全是基因作用的结果。"},
43868:{"w":"flesh","e":"The knife cut through his glove and into the flesh of his hand.","t":"刀子割穿手套，划进了他手上的**肉**里。"},
43869:{"w":"flaw","e":"The only flaw in his plan was that it would cost far too much money.","t":"他的计划唯一的**缺陷**是花费太高了。"},
43870:{"w":"pressure","e":"His father's blood pressure is a little high.","t":"他父亲的血**压**有点高。"},
43871:{"w":"innocent","e":"The police finally found the real thief and agreed that the young man was innocent.","t":"警察终于找到了真正的小偷，承认那个年轻人是**清白的**。"},
43872:{"w":"nearby","e":"We had dinner at a nearby restaurant because we were too tired to cook.","t":"我们太累了，不想做饭，就在**附近的**一家餐馆吃了晚饭。"},
43873:{"w":"excitement","e":"The excitement died down.","t":"**激动**的情绪已经平息了。"},
43874:{"w":"propose","e":"I understand that Bob is familiar with Manchester Park and propose letting him show you around.","t":"我知道鲍勃对曼彻斯特公园很熟，**建议**让他带你去逛逛。"},
43875:{"w":"millimetre","e":"The rain this week was heavy: more than 100 millimetres fell in just two days.","t":"本周雨下得很大：短短两天降雨量就超过了100**毫米**。"},
43876:{"w":"insert","e":"Insert your ticket into the machine, and the gate will open automatically.","t":"把车票**插入**机器，闸门就会自动打开。"},
43877:{"w":"former","e":"The world's food production will move from Western Europe to the former communist countries and parts of the developing world.","t":"世界粮食生产将从西欧转移到**前**社会主义国家和一些发展中国家。"},
43878:{"w":"elbow","e":"His forearms were black and blue from wrist to elbow.","t":"他的小臂从手腕到**肘部**又青又紫。"},
43879:{"w":"stack","e":"Dishes are stacked up in a drying rack.","t":"盘子被**堆放**在一个烘干架上。"},
43880:{"w":"consumption","e":"Fuel consumption and exhaust emissions depend on which cars are preferred and how they are driven.","t":"**耗**油量和排气量取决于用户偏爱的车型及其驾驶方式。"},
43881:{"w":"mate","e":"Many seabirds return to the same island every year to mate and raise their young.","t":"许多海鸟每年都会回到同一个岛上**交配**并养育后代。"},
43882:{"w":"accuse","e":"She accused her brother of eating all the cake while she was out.","t":"她**指责**弟弟趁她出门时把蛋糕全吃光了。"},
43883:{"w":"terminal","e":"There is an ink jet printer attached to each terminal.","t":"每一个**终端**都连接有一台喷墨打印机。"},
43884:{"w":"textile","e":"From the seventeenth century, the company began to export textiles to North America.","t":"从17世纪起，这家公司就开始向北美出口**纺织品**。"},
43885:{"w":"reveal","e":"The new report reveals that many young people spend more than six hours a day on their phones.","t":"新报告**显示**，许多年轻人每天花六个多小时看手机。"},
43886:{"w":"casual","e":"You can wear casual clothes to the party; there is no need for a suit.","t":"你可以穿**非正式的**服装去参加聚会，不必穿西装。"},
43887:{"w":"frame","e":"The tall buildings have been made possible by the development of light steel frames and safe passenger lifts.","t":"轻型钢**框架**和安全客梯的改良使得高层建筑的建造成为可能。"},
43888:{"w":"pack","e":"Before moving to the new flat, we packed our clothes and books into two big boxes.","t":"搬到新公寓之前，我们把衣服和书**打包**装进了两个大箱子。"},
43889:{"w":"tough","e":"Kangaroo meat is darker in colour and tougher than that of rabbit.","t":"与兔肉相比，袋鼠肉颜色较深且肉质**较老**。"},
43890:{"w":"blend","e":"The music gradually blended into the city noises.","t":"音乐逐渐和城市的噪音**混杂**在了一起。"},
43891:{"w":"guilty","e":"I felt guilty about forgetting my best friend's birthday party last Saturday.","t":"上周六我忘了最好朋友的生日聚会，心里很**内疚**。"},
43892:{"w":"pursue","e":"After college she went to Paris to pursue her dream of becoming a fashion designer.","t":"大学毕业后，她去了巴黎**追求**成为时装设计师的梦想。"},
43893:{"w":"misunderstand","e":"Please don't misunderstand me, because I was only trying to help you with your work.","t":"请别**误会**我，我只是想帮你干活。"},
43894:{"w":"payment","e":"You can make the payment online or at any bank before the end of the month.","t":"你可以在月底前在网上或在任何一家银行**付款**。"},
43895:{"w":"oral","e":"We will have an oral English test next week, so I practice speaking every day.","t":"我们下周有英语**口试**，所以我每天都练习说英语。"},
43896:{"w":"lap","e":"The little girl sat on her grandmother's lap and listened to a story.","t":"小女孩坐在奶奶的**膝上**听故事。"},
43897:{"w":"astronomy","e":"My brother became interested in astronomy after he saw the stars through a telescope.","t":"我哥哥用望远镜看过星星以后，就对**天文学**产生了兴趣。"},
43898:{"w":"territory","e":"We must realize that Antarctic territory belongs to everyone.","t":"我们必须意识到南极的**领土**属于大家。"},
43899:{"w":"notion","e":"Many people still hold the notion that boys are better at math than girls.","t":"很多人仍然持有男孩数学比女孩好的**观念**。"},
43900:{"w":"induce","e":"Nothing could induce me to give up my plan to study abroad next year.","t":"什么都不能**诱使**我放弃明年出国留学的计划。"},
43901:{"w":"mere","e":"The little girl was a mere five years old when she first played the piano on stage.","t":"这个小女孩第一次登台弹钢琴时**仅仅**五岁。"},
43902:{"w":"hatred","e":"The film shows how hatred between two families can destroy young lives.","t":"这部电影展示了两个家族之间的**仇恨**如何毁掉年轻人的生活。"},
43903:{"w":"mule","e":"The farmer used a mule to carry heavy bags of rice up the mountain path.","t":"农民用一头**骡子**把一袋袋沉重的大米驮上山路。"},
43904:{"w":"gross","e":"Agriculture and its supporting industries account for around 20% of our Gross National Product.","t":"农业及其辅助产业占我国国民生产**总**值的20%左右。"},
43905:{"w":"durable","e":"These boots are cheap but durable, so I have worn them for five winters.","t":"这双靴子便宜又**耐用**，所以我已经穿了五个冬天。"},
43906:{"w":"basement","e":"We keep our old bikes and boxes of books in the basement of the house.","t":"我们把旧自行车和一箱箱书放在房子的**地下室**里。"},
43907:{"w":"tone","e":"I could tell from her tone that she was not happy with my answer.","t":"从她的**语气**我能听出她对我的回答不满意。"},
43908:{"w":"employee","e":"The company has over five hundred employees, and most of them work in the city.","t":"这家公司有五百多名**员工**，其中大多数在城里工作。"},
43909:{"w":"forthcoming","e":"This is the list of forthcoming books.","t":"这是**即将**出版的书籍目录。"},
43910:{"w":"indication","e":"The dark clouds were a clear indication that a storm was coming soon.","t":"乌云清楚地**表明**暴风雨快要来了。"},
43911:{"w":"sausage","e":"For breakfast I had two eggs, a sausage and a glass of milk.","t":"早餐我吃了两个鸡蛋、一根**香肠**，喝了一杯牛奶。"},
43912:{"w":"hinder","e":"The survey reveals that most of the candidates' job applications have been hindered by their lack of relevant working experience.","t":"调查显示，大部分求职者因缺乏相关的工作经验而导致其工作申请**受阻**。"},
43913:{"w":"embrace","e":"The mother embraced her son tightly when he came home after two years abroad.","t":"儿子在国外待了两年回到家，妈妈紧紧地**拥抱**了他。"},
43914:{"w":"theme","e":"The main theme of the film is the friendship between a boy and his dog.","t":"这部电影的**主题**是一个男孩和他的狗之间的友谊。"},
43915:{"w":"despatch","e":"The company will despatch your order within two days after you pay online.","t":"你在网上付款后，公司会在两天内**发出**你订购的商品。"},
43916:{"w":"integration","e":"Learning the local language helps the integration of newcomers into the community.","t":"学习当地语言有助于新来的人**融入**社区。"},
43917:{"w":"colleague","e":"I often have lunch with my colleagues in the small restaurant near our office.","t":"我常和**同事**在办公室附近的小餐馆吃午饭。"},
43918:{"w":"ethnic","e":"China has fifty-six ethnic groups, and each has its own customs and festivals.","t":"中国有五十六个**民族**，每个民族都有自己的风俗和节日。"},
43919:{"w":"numerous","e":"Numerous overseas visitors have come to see how the program works.","t":"**众多**海外游客到这里来观看这个项目是如何运作的。"},
43920:{"w":"dramatic","e":"There has been a dramatic rise in the number of people shopping online in recent years.","t":"近年来，网上购物的人数**急剧**增长。"},
43921:{"w":"nasty","e":"Many people feel that it's dangerous to ride the subway—there have been some nasty attacks.","t":"很多人认为乘坐地铁很危险，因为地铁上发生过一些**可怕**的袭击。"},
43922:{"w":"launch","e":"China launched a new weather satellite into space from a base in the northwest yesterday.","t":"昨天中国从西北的一个基地**发射**了一颗新的气象卫星。"},
43923:{"w":"spacecraft","e":"The spacecraft carried three astronauts and landed safely after six months in space.","t":"这艘**宇宙飞船**载着三名宇航员，在太空停留六个月后安全着陆。"},
43924:{"w":"batch","e":"The batch number is printed on the bottom of each jar.","t":"每个罐子的瓶底都印有生产**批**号。"},
43925:{"w":"discount","e":"For those of you who are up and about early in the morning, we are introducing a 50 percent \"morning discount\" this year.","t":"今年，我们将为你们这些早起的人推出五折的“早间**折扣**”。"},
43926:{"w":"preserve","e":"As a doctor, my profession is to preserve life, and to prevent disease from developing.","t":"身为一名医生，我的职责是**保护**生命以及阻止疾病恶化。"},
43927:{"w":"cracker","e":"I usually eat a few crackers with cheese when I get hungry in the afternoon.","t":"下午饿的时候，我通常会就着奶酪吃几块**薄脆饼干**。"},
43928:{"w":"incline","e":"After the long illness, he was inclined to stay at home rather than go out.","t":"大病一场后，他**倾向于**待在家里，而不愿出门。"},
43929:{"w":"import","e":"China imports a lot of oil from other countries every year to meet its energy needs.","t":"中国每年从其他国家**进口**大量石油，以满足能源需求。"},
43930:{"w":"oversight","e":"Because of an oversight, my name was left off the list of winners.","t":"由于一时**疏忽**，我的名字被漏在了获奖名单之外。"},
43931:{"w":"liberal","e":"My parents are quite liberal and let me choose my own friends and clothes.","t":"我父母**心胸宽大**，让我自己选择朋友和衣服。"},
43932:{"w":"bankrupt","e":"The theatre went bankrupt with over ten billion dollars of debt last January.","t":"去年一月份，那家剧院因负债超过一百亿美元而**破产**。"},
43933:{"w":"astronaut","e":"The astronaut spent six months on the space station doing scientific experiments.","t":"这名**宇航员**在空间站待了六个月，做科学实验。"},
43934:{"w":"marry","e":"My cousin is going to marry her boyfriend next spring in their hometown.","t":"我表姐明年春天要在老家**嫁给**她男朋友。"},
43935:{"w":"cartoon","e":"My little brother watches cartoons for an hour every evening after dinner.","t":"我弟弟每天晚饭后看一小时**动画片**。"},
43936:{"w":"deteriorate","e":"Air quality in many of the world's major cities has deteriorated.","t":"世界上很多大城市的空气质量**越来越糟糕**。"},
43937:{"w":"constitution","e":"The new constitution protects the right of every citizen to speak freely.","t":"新**宪法**保护每个公民自由发表意见的权利。"},
43938:{"w":"romantic","e":"They had a romantic dinner by the sea to celebrate ten years of marriage.","t":"他们在海边吃了一顿**浪漫**的晚餐，庆祝结婚十周年。"},
43939:{"w":"enlighten","e":"Would you enlighten me on your plans for the future?","t":"能否给我**讲讲**你未来的计划？"},
43940:{"w":"tolerate","e":"Younger people tend to tolerate noise better than their elders.","t":"年轻人比年长者更能**承受**噪音。"},
43941:{"w":"barrel","e":"The farmer collects rainwater in a large barrel behind his old house.","t":"农夫用他老房子后面的一个大**水桶**收集雨水。"},
43942:{"w":"bachelor","e":"Tom is working towards a Bachelor of Science degree at the University of Cambridge.","t":"汤姆正在剑桥大学攻读理学**学士**学位。"},
43943:{"w":"intellectual","e":"The development of literacy has far-reaching effects on general intellectual development.","t":"文化素质的提高对于人类整体**智力**的发展有着深远的影响。"},
43944:{"w":"settle","e":"After they retired, my grandparents settled in a small town by the sea.","t":"退休后，我的祖父母在海边的一个小镇**安了家**。"},
43945:{"w":"aptitude","e":"Each branch of this company had employees of comparable aptitudes.","t":"该公司的所有分公司都雇用**能力**相当的员工。"},
43946:{"w":"amateur","e":"My uncle is an amateur photographer who takes pictures of birds every weekend.","t":"我叔叔是一名**业余**摄影师，每个周末都去拍鸟。"},
43947:{"w":"hopeful","e":"The first results of the new medicine look hopeful, and doctors plan to test it on more patients.","t":"这种新药的初步结果看起来很**有希望**，医生们计划在更多病人身上进行试验。"},
43948:{"w":"entrepreneur","e":"The owner of the company is an American entrepreneur.","t":"这家公司的老板是一位美国**企业家**。"},
43949:{"w":"mushroom","e":"The profit of this company is expected to mushroom to $50 million by 2030.","t":"这家公司的利润到2030年有望**猛增**到五千万美金。"},
43950:{"w":"criminal","e":"The discontent may lead more youths into criminal behaviour.","t":"这种不满情绪可能会导致更多的年轻人走上**犯罪**之路。"},
43951:{"w":"heighten","e":"The news that the river was rising heightened people's fear of a flood.","t":"河水上涨的消息**增加**了人们对洪水的恐惧。"},
43952:{"w":"lavatory","e":"Could you tell me the way to the lavatory, please?","t":"请问去**盥洗室**怎么走？"},
43953:{"w":"elect","e":"Our class will elect a new monitor next Monday after the teacher's speech.","t":"下周一老师讲话后，我们班将**选举**一名新班长。"},
43954:{"w":"furthermore","e":"The hotel is close to the beach. Furthermore, its rooms are clean and cheap.","t":"这家酒店离海滩很近。**此外**，它的房间又干净又便宜。"},
43955:{"w":"entire","e":"Hughes claims that in the twenty-first century, consumers will be encouraged to think more about the entire history of the products and services they buy.","t":"休斯声称，21世纪消费者将受到鼓励多考虑他们所购买的产品和服务的**整个**历史。"},
43956:{"w":"downward","e":"House prices in the town have shown a downward trend for the past three years.","t":"过去三年里，镇上的房价呈**下降**趋势。"},
43957:{"w":"insurance","e":"I'd like to get insurance for the contents of my home.","t":"我想给我家的财物上**保险**。"},
43958:{"w":"chamber","e":"The leaders of the two countries met in a small chamber at the back of the palace.","t":"两国领导人在宫殿后面的一间小**会议室**里会面。"},
43959:{"w":"liquid","e":"Water, milk and oil are all liquids, but they do not mix in the same way.","t":"水、牛奶和油都是**液体**，但它们混合的情况不一样。"},
43960:{"w":"category","e":"After the final interview, potential recruits were divided into three categories.","t":"经过最后的面试，可能入选的新成员被分成三**类**。"},
43961:{"w":"realm","e":"The book takes young readers into the realm of science and discovery.","t":"这本书把年轻读者带进了科学与发现的**领域**。"},
43962:{"w":"clue","e":"If you do not know a word, you can look to the picture in this book for a clue to its meaning.","t":"如果你碰到不认识的单词，可以通过书中的插图找**线索**来推测它的意思。"},
43963:{"w":"refine","e":"She spent the whole weekend refining her speech for the English contest.","t":"她花了整个周末来**完善**自己的英语比赛演讲稿。"},
43964:{"w":"capture","e":"The police captured the thief after a long chase through the busy streets.","t":"警察在繁忙的街道上追了很久，终于**抓获**了小偷。"},
43965:{"w":"jazz","e":"My father loves jazz and often plays old records on Sunday afternoons.","t":"爸爸很喜欢**爵士乐**，常在星期天下午放老唱片。"},
43966:{"w":"thick","e":"The walls of the old castle are so thick that it stays cool inside in summer.","t":"古堡的墙**厚实**得很，夏天里面依然凉快。"},
43967:{"w":"baseball","e":"My cousin in America plays baseball with his friends every weekend in the park.","t":"我在美国的表哥每个周末都和朋友在公园里打**棒球**。"},
43968:{"w":"conjunction","e":"Seat belts are more effective when used in conjunction with air bags.","t":"安全带和安全气囊**一起**使用，效果更好。"},
43969:{"w":"minority","e":"Only a minority of the students in our class walk to school; most take the bus.","t":"我们班只有**少数**学生步行上学，大多数人坐公交。"},
43970:{"w":"ratio","e":"The male to female ratio of volunteers is 4 to 5.","t":"志愿者中男女**比例**为4比5。"},
43971:{"w":"lord","e":"In the old days, the lord owned all the land around the castle.","t":"在过去，**领主**拥有城堡周围的所有土地。"},
43972:{"w":"sorrow","e":"Carolyn's eyes filled with sorrow at thinking of how she had treated Kevin and lost him forever.","t":"想到自己那样对待凯文并永远地失去了他，卡罗琳的眼中充满了**悲伤**。"},
43973:{"w":"boring","e":"The film was so boring that half of the people fell asleep before the end.","t":"这部电影太**无聊**了，一半的人没看完就睡着了。"},
43974:{"w":"therapy","e":"We are beginning to realise the unique benefits of relaxation therapy in curing back pain.","t":"我们正开始认识到放松**疗法**对背痛具有独特的疗效。"},
43975:{"w":"thinking","e":"The new manager's thinking on this problem is quite different from ours.","t":"新经理对这个问题的**想法**跟我们很不一样。"},
43976:{"w":"crowd","e":"A large crowd gathered outside the stadium, waiting for the famous singer to arrive.","t":"大批**人群**聚集在体育场外，等待那位著名歌手的到来。"},
43977:{"w":"cease","e":"The music ceased, and the audience broke into applause.","t":"音乐**停**了，观众爆发出热烈的掌声。"},
43978:{"w":"quiz","e":"Our English teacher gives us a short quiz every Friday to check our new words.","t":"英语老师每周五都给我们一次**小测验**，检查我们的生词。"},
43979:{"w":"sample","e":"The main thing is to make sure we have the right size sample, not too big or too small.","t":"最主要是确保我们有合适的**样本**量，不能太大也不能太小。"},
43980:{"w":"variable","e":"The decision involves a large number of variables with complex relationships.","t":"这个决定涉及很多关系复杂的**变量**。"},
43981:{"w":"airplane","e":"The airplane landed safely in spite of the strong wind and heavy rain.","t":"尽管风大雨急，**飞机**还是安全降落了。"},
43982:{"w":"estate","e":"My accountant estimated the value of my estate.","t":"我的会计师评估了我的**个人财产**值。"},
43983:{"w":"identity","e":"You must show your student card to prove your identity before entering the exam room.","t":"进考场前，你必须出示学生证来证明自己的**身份**。"},
43984:{"w":"thirsty","e":"After playing basketball for two hours, the boys were hot and thirsty.","t":"打了两个小时篮球后，男孩们浑身发热，**口渴**难耐。"},
43985:{"w":"threat","e":"Pollution from factories is a serious threat to the health of people living nearby.","t":"工厂排放的污染对附近居民的健康构成严重**威胁**。"},
43986:{"w":"obligation","e":"Every government has the right and obligation to run its own internal affairs well.","t":"每一任政府都有管理好国家内政的权利和**职责**。"},
43987:{"w":"platform","e":"Please stand behind the yellow line while you wait for the train on the platform.","t":"在**站台**上候车时，请站在黄线后面。"},
43988:{"w":"ashore","e":"After three weeks at sea, the sailors were happy to go ashore.","t":"在海上航行三周后，水手们很高兴能**上岸**。"},
43989:{"w":"consult","e":"You do not need to consult your doctor immediately if the tablets give you a side-effect.","t":"如果药片对你产生副作用，不必立即**咨询**医生。"},
43990:{"w":"merchant","e":"The rich merchant made his fortune by selling silk and tea to Europe.","t":"这位富有的**商人**靠向欧洲出售丝绸和茶叶发了财。"},
43991:{"w":"belly","e":"The cat lay on its back in the sun and let me rub its soft belly.","t":"猫仰面躺在阳光下，让我揉它软软的**肚子**。"},
43992:{"w":"anyway","e":"It was raining heavily, but we decided to go for a walk anyway.","t":"雨下得很大，但我们**无论如何**还是决定去散步。"},
43993:{"w":"fertile","e":"The east of this region is flatter and more low-lying, with fertile soils.","t":"这一地区的东部土壤**肥沃**，地势较为平坦，海拔也比较低。"},
43994:{"w":"ethic","e":"My father has a strong work ethic and has never been late for work in thirty years.","t":"我父亲恪守职业**道德准则**，三十年来上班从没迟到过。"},
43995:{"w":"scan","e":"Customers at some banks will have to present their faces for scanning before they can enter the building.","t":"某些银行需要客户经过面部**扫描**才可以进入。"},
43996:{"w":"particularly","e":"Mary was particularly fond of bananas.","t":"玛丽**特别**爱吃香蕉。"},
43997:{"w":"gorgeous","e":"We had gorgeous weather for the whole trip, with blue skies and warm sunshine every day.","t":"整个旅途天气**极好**，每天都是蓝天和暖阳。"},
43998:{"w":"lemon","e":"I like to drink warm water with a slice of lemon every morning.","t":"我喜欢每天早上喝一杯加了一片**柠檬**的温水。"},
43999:{"w":"crisis","e":"In the U.S., energy-efficient homes became popular after the oil crisis.","t":"美国在经历了石油**危机**之后，节能型房屋就开始变得深受欢迎。"},
44000:{"w":"crab","e":"The children watched a small crab walk sideways across the wet sand.","t":"孩子们看着一只小**螃蟹**横着爬过湿漉漉的沙滩。"},
44001:{"w":"agent","e":"We booked our holiday through a travel agent, who found us a cheap hotel near the beach.","t":"我们通过旅游**代理**订了假期，他帮我们在海边找了家便宜的酒店。"},
44002:{"w":"thorough","e":"The doctor gave me a thorough check and said there was nothing wrong with my heart.","t":"医生给我做了一次**彻底**的检查，说我的心脏没有任何问题。"},
44003:{"w":"dew","e":"In the early morning, the grass in the garden was wet with dew.","t":"清晨，花园里的草被**露水**打湿了。"},
44004:{"w":"modernization","e":"The modernization of farming has made it possible to grow more food with fewer workers.","t":"农业**现代化**让人们能用更少的劳动力种出更多粮食。"},
44005:{"w":"forth","e":"The children ran back and forth across the playground, laughing and shouting.","t":"孩子们笑着叫着，在操场上**来回**奔跑。"},
44006:{"w":"haze","e":"The city was covered in a grey haze, so we could not see the mountains.","t":"城市笼罩在一片灰色的**烟雾**中，我们看不见远处的山。"},
44007:{"w":"climate","e":"The warm and wet climate of southern China is good for growing rice and tea.","t":"中国南方温暖湿润的**气候**适合种植水稻和茶叶。"},
44008:{"w":"retreat","e":"The soldiers had to retreat when they saw that the enemy army was much larger.","t":"士兵们发现敌军人数多得多，只好**撤退**。"},
44009:{"w":"ample","e":"There is ample time to finish the work, so you don't need to hurry.","t":"完成这项工作的时间很**充足**，所以你不用着急。"},
44010:{"w":"addition","e":"The new library is a great addition to our school, and students love studying there.","t":"新图书馆是我们学校一处很棒的**新增设施**，学生们都爱在那儿学习。"},
44011:{"w":"jungle","e":"Many kinds of wild animals and colorful birds live deep in the jungle.","t":"许多种野生动物和色彩艳丽的鸟儿生活在**丛林**深处。"},
44012:{"w":"berry","e":"We picked some wild berries on the hill and ate them on our way home.","t":"我们在山上摘了些野**浆果**，在回家路上吃掉了。"},
44013:{"w":"integrate","e":"The researchers don't know how to integrate the two actions.","t":"研究者不知该如何将这两种行为**融为一体**。"},
44014:{"w":"relevant","e":"You should support your arguments with examples and relevant evidence.","t":"你应该用实例和**相关**证据来支持你的论点。"},
44015:{"w":"apparatus","e":"This apparatus has been thoroughly tested.","t":"这套**设备**已经过全面测试。"},
44016:{"w":"exterior","e":"We painted the exterior walls of the house white to keep it cool in summer.","t":"我们把房子的**外部**墙面刷成了白色，让它夏天保持凉爽。"},
44017:{"w":"admit","e":"Bill was forced to admit that he had cheated on the test.","t":"比尔被迫**承认**他在考试中作弊了。"},
44018:{"w":"betray","e":"If you treat him as a friend, he will treat you well and will never betray you.","t":"如果你把他当作朋友，他就会对你很好而且绝对不会**背叛**你。"},
44019:{"w":"thereby","e":"Mary became an American citizen, thereby gaining the right to vote.","t":"玛丽成了美国公民，**因此**得到了投票权。"},
44020:{"w":"thoughtful","e":"It's so thoughtful of you to offer to drop me off at the train station.","t":"你主动提出开车送我去火车站，真是太**体贴**了。"},
44021:{"w":"counterpart","e":"The Chinese foreign minister met his American counterpart in Beijing on Monday.","t":"中国外长周一在北京会见了美国**外长**。"},
44022:{"w":"architect","e":"Among mathematicians and architects, left-handers tend to be more common.","t":"在数学家和**建筑师**中，惯用左手者往往更为常见。"},
44023:{"w":"apartment","e":"They live in a small apartment on the tenth floor of an old building.","t":"他们住在一栋旧楼十层的一套小**公寓**里。"},
44024:{"w":"diabetes","e":"Eating too much sugar over many years can increase your risk of getting diabetes.","t":"多年摄入过多的糖会增加患**糖尿病**的风险。"},
44025:{"w":"therefore","e":"It was raining heavily that morning; therefore, the school sports day was put off.","t":"那天上午下着大雨，**因此**学校运动会推迟了。"},
44026:{"w":"carbon","e":"Diamonds and pencil leads are both made of carbon, though they look very different.","t":"钻石和铅笔芯虽然看起来很不一样，但都是由**碳元素**构成的。"},
44027:{"w":"webcast","e":"More than a million people watched the live webcast of the concert last night.","t":"昨晚有一百多万人观看了这场音乐会的**网络直播**。"},
44028:{"w":"handful","e":"Only a handful of students stayed in the classroom after the bell rang.","t":"铃响后，只有**少数**几个学生留在教室里。"},
44029:{"w":"afterward","e":"We had dinner at a small restaurant and went for a walk afterward.","t":"我们在一家小餐馆吃了晚饭，**后来**又去散了步。"},
44030:{"w":"humanity","e":"Climate change is one of the biggest problems facing humanity in the twenty-first century.","t":"气候变化是21世纪**人类**面临的最大问题之一。"},
44031:{"w":"loyal","e":"Our dog is very loyal and waits for my father at the door every evening.","t":"我们家的狗非常**忠诚**，每天晚上都在门口等爸爸。"},
44032:{"w":"constant","e":"The old man needs constant care because he cannot walk or cook by himself.","t":"那位老人需要**不断的**照料，因为他不能自己走路或做饭。"},
44033:{"w":"enrich","e":"Reading good books can enrich your life and open your mind to new ideas.","t":"读好书能**丰富**你的生活，让你接受新的想法。"},
44034:{"w":"drift","e":"The small boat lost its engine and drifted slowly out to sea during the night.","t":"夜里，小船失去了动力，慢慢**漂流**到了海上。"},
44035:{"w":"sustain","e":"Thousands of lakes are so polluted that they can no longer sustain fish life.","t":"数千个湖泊受到非常严重的污染，已无法再**维持**鱼类的生存。"},
44036:{"w":"appreciate","e":"I deeply appreciate your care, but I'm fine now.","t":"我对你的关心深表**感激**，但是现在我很好。"},
44037:{"w":"normally","e":"I normally get up at seven, but on Sundays I sleep until nine.","t":"我**通常**七点起床，但星期天会睡到九点。"},
44038:{"w":"horsepower","e":"This small car has a 90 horsepower engine and uses very little petrol.","t":"这辆小汽车装有90**马力**的发动机，非常省油。"},
44039:{"w":"bean","e":"My mother bought some fresh green beans at the market and cooked them for dinner.","t":"妈妈在市场买了些新鲜的**豆角**，做了晚饭。"},
44040:{"w":"dismiss","e":"As sales declined, the manager had to dismiss several workers.","t":"由于销售额下跌，经理不得不**解雇**一些员工。"},
44041:{"w":"suspicion","e":"The man's strange behavior at the bank raised the suspicion of the police.","t":"那个男人在银行的奇怪举动引起了警察的**怀疑**。"},
44042:{"w":"elastic","e":"A rubber band is elastic, so it goes back to its shape after you stretch it.","t":"橡皮筋**有弹性**，拉长以后会恢复原状。"},
44043:{"w":"deputy","e":"While the manager is away on holiday, his deputy will take charge of the office.","t":"经理休假期间，由他的**副手**负责办公室的事务。"},
44044:{"w":"prospect","e":"Mary is one of the best prospects for this position.","t":"玛丽是这个职位最有希望的**候选人**之一。"},
44045:{"w":"presumably","e":"The lights in his room are off, so presumably he has already gone to bed.","t":"他房间的灯关了，**大概**他已经睡了。"},
44046:{"w":"acre","e":"My uncle owns a farm of about fifty acres where he grows corn and vegetables.","t":"我叔叔有一个大约五十**英亩**的农场，种着玉米和蔬菜。"},
44047:{"w":"conduct","e":"The students conducted a survey to find out how much time people spend on their phones.","t":"学生们**进行**了一项调查，想弄清人们花多少时间玩手机。"},
44048:{"w":"bargain","e":"This coat was a real bargain; I bought it for half the usual price.","t":"这件外套真是件**特价货**，我只花了平时一半的价钱就买下了。"},
44049:{"w":"contract","e":"Both sides should abide by the contract.","t":"双方都应该遵守**合同**。"},
44050:{"w":"lawn","e":"Every Saturday morning, my father cuts the lawn in front of our house.","t":"每周六早上，爸爸都会修剪我们家门前的**草坪**。"},
44051:{"w":"significant","e":"Modifications to houses come at a significant cost to the home buyers.","t":"房屋改造对购房人来说是一笔**不菲**的开销。"},
44052:{"w":"anniversary","e":"My parents went out for a special dinner to celebrate their twentieth wedding anniversary.","t":"我父母出去吃了一顿特别的晚餐，庆祝他们结婚二十**周年**。"},
44053:{"w":"transmit","e":"All the documents have been transmitted electronically to the printing centre.","t":"所有文件已经被以电子方式**传送**至印刷中心。"},
44054:{"w":"throat","e":"I have had a sore throat since yesterday, so it hurts when I swallow food.","t":"我从昨天起**喉咙**就疼，咽东西的时候很难受。"},
44055:{"w":"mainland","e":"The ferry carries tourists between the small island and the mainland every morning.","t":"渡轮每天早上在小岛和**大陆**之间运送游客。"},
44056:{"w":"cellar","e":"We keep potatoes and apples in the cool, dark cellar under the house.","t":"我们把土豆和苹果存放在房子下面阴凉黑暗的**地窖**里。"},
44057:{"w":"extend","e":"I extended my tour for another week here.","t":"我把在这里的旅行时间**延长**了一周。"},
44058:{"w":"expose","e":"Doctors warn that you should not expose your skin to strong sunlight for too long.","t":"医生提醒，皮肤不要在强烈的阳光下**暴露**太久。"},
44059:{"w":"slip","e":"Tom slipped on the ice and broke his leg.","t":"汤姆在冰上**滑了一跤**，摔断了腿。"},
44060:{"w":"beverage","e":"Hot beverages such as tea and coffee are served free in the hotel lobby.","t":"酒店大堂免费提供茶和咖啡等热**饮料**。"},
44061:{"w":"policy","e":"The school has a new policy that students must not bring phones to class.","t":"学校出台了一项新**政策**，学生不得带手机进教室。"},
44062:{"w":"influential","e":"The female President is one of the most influential figures in local politics.","t":"这位女总统是当地政坛上最**有影响力**的人物之一。"},
44063:{"w":"container","e":"Please put the rest of the soup in a plastic container and keep it in the fridge.","t":"请把剩下的汤装进塑料**容器**里，放进冰箱。"},
44064:{"w":"machinery","e":"The farm bought some new machinery to help the workers harvest the wheat faster.","t":"农场买了一些新**机器**，帮工人们更快地收割小麦。"},
44065:{"w":"handle","e":"She handled the angry customer calmly and solved his problem in a few minutes.","t":"她冷静地**处理**了那位生气的顾客的事，几分钟就解决了他的问题。"},
44066:{"w":"chief","e":"Paula is the chief counsellor at Liverpool's famous pain clinic.","t":"波拉是利物浦著名的疼痛治疗诊所的**首席**顾问。"},
44067:{"w":"exert","e":"He had to exert all his strength to push the heavy car off the road.","t":"他得**用尽**全力才能把那辆沉重的汽车推离路面。"},
44068:{"w":"persuasive","e":"Her speech was so persuasive that everyone agreed to support her plan.","t":"她的演讲很**有说服力**，大家都同意支持她的计划。"},
44069:{"w":"instant","e":"For an instant, I thought I saw my old friend in the crowd.","t":"有一**瞬间**，我以为在人群中看到了老朋友。"},
44070:{"w":"collection","e":"The textile collection of the museum is the largest in the world.","t":"这家博物馆**收藏**的纺织品是全世界最多的。"},
44071:{"w":"aircraft","e":"The airport was closed for two hours, so no aircraft could take off or land.","t":"机场关闭了两个小时，所以没有**飞机**能起飞或降落。"},
44072:{"w":"thrust","e":"He thrust his cold hands deep into his pockets to keep them warm.","t":"他把冻僵的双手深深地**插进**口袋里取暖。"},
44073:{"w":"gasoline","e":"The price of gasoline has gone up again, so more people are taking the bus.","t":"**汽油**价格又涨了，所以更多人开始坐公交车。"},
44074:{"w":"thrive","e":"Those societies thrived there for more than 1,000 years before the arrival of Europeans.","t":"在欧洲人到来之前，那些社会已经**繁荣**了一千多年。"},
44075:{"w":"thumb","e":"She cut her thumb while she was cooking dinner in the kitchen.","t":"她在厨房做晚饭时切到了**大拇指**。"},
44076:{"w":"dispose","e":"Please dispose of your rubbish in the bins at the gate before you leave the park.","t":"离开公园前，请把垃圾**处理**好，扔进门口的垃圾桶。"},
44077:{"w":"harm","e":"Too much sugar can harm your teeth, so try to eat fewer sweets.","t":"吃太多糖会**损害**牙齿，所以尽量少吃甜食。"},
44078:{"w":"honey","e":"My mother often adds a spoonful of honey to my tea when I have a sore throat.","t":"我嗓子疼的时候，妈妈常往我的茶里加一勺**蜂蜜**。"},
44079:{"w":"arouse","e":"The strange noise outside the window soon aroused the curiosity of the little children.","t":"窗外奇怪的声音很快**引起**了小孩子们的好奇心。"},
44080:{"w":"encourage","e":"My parents always encourage me to try new things and learn from my mistakes.","t":"我父母总是**鼓励**我尝试新事物，并从错误中学习。"},
44081:{"w":"enforce","e":"The police will strictly enforce the new law against using phones while driving.","t":"警方将严格**执行**禁止开车时使用手机的新法规。"},
44082:{"w":"rage","e":"He flew into a rage when he found that his new car had been damaged.","t":"他发现新车被弄坏了，顿时陷入**狂怒**。"},
44083:{"w":"prominent","e":"The new library is the most prominent building in the town, and you can see it from far away.","t":"新图书馆是镇上最**突出的**建筑，老远就能看见。"},
44084:{"w":"ease","e":"She passed the driving test with ease on her first try last week.","t":"上周她第一次考驾照就**轻而易举**地通过了。"},
44085:{"w":"inward","e":"She smiled at the guests, but felt an inward fear she could not explain.","t":"她对客人们微笑着，却感到一种说不清的**内心**恐惧。"},
44086:{"w":"signal","e":"The teacher raised her hand as a signal for the class to be quiet.","t":"老师举起手，作为让全班安静下来的**信号**。"},
44087:{"w":"thunder","e":"We heard a loud crash of thunder, and then heavy rain began to fall.","t":"我们听到一声响亮的**雷声**，接着就下起了大雨。"},
44088:{"w":"series","e":"This series of lectures is organized by the Students' Union.","t":"这**一系列**演讲由学生会组织。"},
44089:{"w":"recession","e":"Many factories closed during the recession, and thousands of workers lost their jobs.","t":"经济**衰退**期间，许多工厂倒闭，成千上万的工人失去了工作。"},
44090:{"w":"dignity","e":"Even when he lost his job, the old man kept his dignity and never complained to anyone.","t":"即使丢了工作，那位老人也保持着自己的**尊严**，从不向任何人抱怨。"},
44091:{"w":"roast","e":"Roast dinner sounds ordinary but it is really tasty.","t":"**烧烤**大餐听起来很普通，但味道的确很好。"},
44092:{"w":"commitment","e":"This commitment has been clearly defined in the act.","t":"这项法案中明确定义了这一**义务**的内容。"},
44093:{"w":"monument","e":"A monument was built in the town square to remember the soldiers who died in the war.","t":"镇广场上建了一座**纪念碑**，纪念在战争中牺牲的士兵。"},
44094:{"w":"timber","e":"Forests are cut down for timber.","t":"森林被砍伐成**木材**。"},
44095:{"w":"monitor","e":"After the operation, doctors monitored the patient's heart rate day and night.","t":"手术后，医生日夜**检测**病人的心率。"},
44096:{"w":"assess","e":"Teachers assess students' progress through tests, homework and discussions in class every term.","t":"老师每学期通过考试、作业和课堂讨论来**评价**学生的进步。"},
44097:{"w":"reluctant","e":"The little boy was reluctant to leave the park, so his mother promised to come back tomorrow.","t":"小男孩**不情愿**离开公园，所以妈妈答应明天再来。"},
44098:{"w":"bin","e":"Please put your empty bottles in the green bin next to the door.","t":"请把空瓶子放进门边的绿色**垃圾箱**里。"},
44099:{"w":"allege","e":"The police alleged that the man was murdered but they have not given proof yet.","t":"警方**宣称**这个人被谋杀了，但是他们还没有给出证据。"},
44100:{"w":"bias","e":"A good judge must make decisions without any bias against people from poor families.","t":"好法官做判决时，不能对穷人家庭出身的人抱有任何**偏见**。"},
44101:{"w":"fossil","e":"The scientists found the fossil of a small dinosaur in the rocks near the river.","t":"科学家在河边的岩石里发现了一只小恐龙的**化石**。"},
44102:{"w":"garment","e":"This silk garment should be washed by hand in cold water, not in a machine.","t":"这件丝绸**衣服**应该用冷水手洗，不能用洗衣机洗。"},
44103:{"w":"accountable","e":"Parents are accountable for the safety of their young children when they are at home.","t":"孩子在家时，父母要对他们的安全**负责**。"},
44104:{"w":"spark","e":"Sparks flew from the campfire and landed on the dry grass nearby.","t":"营火里**火星**四溅，落在附近的干草上。"},
44105:{"w":"panic","e":"Don't panic if you get lost; just stay where you are and call your parents.","t":"如果迷了路，不要**惊慌失措**，待在原地给父母打电话。"},
44106:{"w":"petroleum","e":"This newly discovered substance can burn like petroleum.","t":"这种新发现的物质可以像**石油**一样燃烧。"},
44107:{"w":"mug","e":"I drink a large mug of hot coffee every morning before work.","t":"我每天早上上班前都要喝一**大杯**热咖啡。"},
44108:{"w":"blanket","e":"It is so strange that this hotel does not provide sheets, blankets, or towels.","t":"这家旅馆不提供被单、**毯子**和毛巾，真是奇怪。"},
44109:{"w":"alley","e":"There are many blind alleys in this town.","t":"这个镇子里有很多死**胡同**。"},
44110:{"w":"interact","e":"Group work can give employees a chance to interact and to share ideas.","t":"分组工作可以给员工一个**相互协作**和交流的机会。"},
44111:{"w":"license","e":"You have to be at least eighteen to get a driver's license in China.","t":"在中国，你必须年满十八岁才能考取驾驶**执照**。"},
44112:{"w":"consultant","e":"Marketing consultants have been gathering information about customers' shopping habits.","t":"市场**顾问**一直在收集有关消费者购物习惯的资料。"},
44113:{"w":"nationality","e":"Can you show any proof of your nationality?","t":"你能出示可以证明你**国籍**的证件吗？"},
44114:{"w":"upright","e":"Please keep your seat upright while the plane is taking off and landing.","t":"飞机起飞和降落时，请将座椅保持**竖直**。"},
44115:{"w":"algebra","e":"Our maths teacher explained the algebra problem step by step on the blackboard.","t":"数学老师在黑板上一步一步讲解了那道**代数**题。"},
44116:{"w":"foundation","e":"The workers spent two months laying the foundations of the new hospital.","t":"工人们花了两个月为新医院打**地基**。"},
44117:{"w":"author","e":"The author of this book spent five years living in a small village in Africa.","t":"这本书的**作者**在非洲的一个小村庄里住了五年。"},
44118:{"w":"naked","e":"In this old painting, a naked baby is sleeping peacefully in his mother's arms.","t":"这幅古画里，一个**光着身子**的婴儿正安静地睡在母亲怀里。"},
44119:{"w":"gulf","e":"Many oil ships pass through the gulf every day on their way to Asia.","t":"每天都有许多油轮经过这个**海湾**驶往亚洲。"},
44120:{"w":"mission","e":"The astronauts' mission is to repair the old satellite and return safely to Earth.","t":"宇航员的**任务**是修好那颗旧卫星，然后安全返回地球。"},
44121:{"w":"centigrade","e":"At sea level, water boils at 100 degrees centigrade, as we learned in class.","t":"我们在课上学过，在海平面上，水在100**摄氏**度时沸腾。"},
44122:{"w":"assistance","e":"The farmers are to receive financial assistance to help see them through the severe drought.","t":"农民们将得到经济**援助**，以帮助他们度过这场严重的旱灾。"},
44123:{"w":"growth","e":"Children need enough sleep and healthy food every day for their normal growth.","t":"孩子们每天需要充足的睡眠和健康的食物来保证正常**生长**。"},
44124:{"w":"Celsius","e":"Today the temperature in the city reached 38 degrees Celsius, so most people stayed indoors.","t":"今天城里气温达到 38 **摄氏度**，所以大多数人都待在室内。"},
44125:{"w":"combat","e":"The state government is spending millions of dollars in its attempt to combat gun abuse.","t":"州政府花费数百万美元试图**防止**滥用枪支。"},
44126:{"w":"attack","e":"Passive smoking causes between 30,000 and 60,000 deaths from heart attacks each year in the United States.","t":"在美国，被动吸烟每年导致三到六万人死于心脏病**发作**。"},
44127:{"w":"precaution","e":"As a precaution, always back up your important files before you update your computer.","t":"为了**预防**万一，更新电脑前一定要备份重要文件。"},
44128:{"w":"exhibit","e":"Some of the exhibits at the museum are very precious.","t":"这个博物馆的一些**展品**非常珍贵。"},
44129:{"w":"furnish","e":"You can get free advice on furnishing your home from the interior designer.","t":"你可以从室内设计师那儿免费获得关于家居**装潢**的建议。"},
44130:{"w":"allocate","e":"The school allocated a small room to the students for their music club.","t":"学校给学生们的音乐社**拨出**了一个小房间。"},
44131:{"w":"donation","e":"The work of the charity is funded by voluntary donations.","t":"这家慈善机构工作所需资金是人们自愿**捐赠**的。"},
44132:{"w":"pretend","e":"Many people pretend that they understand modern art.","t":"很多人都**假装**自己懂得现代艺术。"},
44133:{"w":"certificate","e":"We provide a four-month certificate course, but you should be aware that this is designed for those who are employed.","t":"我们提供为期四个月的**资格认证**课程，但是你要明白这一课程是专为在职人员开设的。"},
44134:{"w":"fragment","e":"The plate fell on the kitchen floor and broke into many small fragments.","t":"盘子掉在厨房地板上，摔成了许多小**碎片**。"},
44135:{"w":"concentrate","e":"I can't concentrate on my homework when the TV is on in the next room.","t":"隔壁房间开着电视时，我没法**专心**写作业。"},
44136:{"w":"agenda","e":"The first item on the agenda for today's meeting is the plan for the school sports day.","t":"今天会议**议程**上的第一项是学校运动会的计划。"},
44137:{"w":"reverse","e":"The court reversed its earlier decision after the police found some important new evidence.","t":"警方发现了一些重要的新证据后，法院**推翻**了之前的判决。"},
44138:{"w":"institution","e":"The Royal Society is a scientific institution that was set up in London in 1660.","t":"英国皇家学会是1660年在伦敦成立的一个科学**协会**。"},
44139:{"w":"bypass","e":"If we take the bypass, we'll avoid the town centre.","t":"我们走**旁道**的话，就能绕开镇中心。"},
44140:{"w":"apply","e":"If you would like more information on how to apply for a student loan, then you should contact The Student Loans Company.","t":"如果你想获得更多有关**申请**学生贷款的信息，那么你应该和学生贷款公司联系。"},
44141:{"w":"flat","e":"My aunt lives in a small flat on the third floor of an old building.","t":"我姑姑住在一栋旧楼三层的一套小**单元房**里。"},
44142:{"w":"alongside","e":"A small river runs alongside the road that leads to our village.","t":"一条小河在通往我们村的那条路**旁边**流过。"},
44143:{"w":"reform","e":"The government plans to reform the school system so that students have less homework.","t":"政府计划**改革**学校制度，让学生的作业少一些。"},
44144:{"w":"tissue","e":"She took a tissue from her bag and wiped her tears away.","t":"她从包里拿出一张**纸巾**，擦掉了眼泪。"},
44145:{"w":"conventional","e":"Most people prefer conventional housing now.","t":"现在很多人偏爱**传统**式的住宅。"},
44146:{"w":"generally","e":"People in this area generally eat rice rather than bread for breakfast.","t":"这个地区的人早餐**通常**吃米饭而不是面包。"},
44147:{"w":"delicate","e":"These delicate glass cups must be washed carefully by hand, not in the machine.","t":"这些**易碎的**玻璃杯必须小心地用手洗，不能用机器洗。"},
44148:{"w":"topic","e":"The weather is always a safe topic when you talk with people you have just met.","t":"和刚认识的人聊天时，天气总是个安全的**话题**。"},
44149:{"w":"electron","e":"An electron is a tiny particle that carries a negative electric charge.","t":"**电子**是一种带负电荷的微小粒子。"},
44150:{"w":"upper","e":"Helen lived on the upper floor.","t":"海伦住在楼**上**。"},
44151:{"w":"renew","e":"I need to renew my passport before my trip to Japan next month.","t":"下个月去日本之前，我得**续签**护照。"},
44152:{"w":"distinct","e":"Why do humans, alone among all animal species, display a distinct left- or right-handedness?","t":"为什么唯独人类和其他动物不一样，会出现**独特**的惯用左手或右手现象呢？"},
44153:{"w":"gram","e":"This small bar of chocolate weighs 100 grams and costs about ten yuan in the shop.","t":"这块小巧克力重100**克**，在店里卖十块钱左右。"},
44154:{"w":"torch","e":"When the lights went out, we used a torch to find the stairs.","t":"灯灭了以后，我们用**手电筒**找到了楼梯。"},
44155:{"w":"priority","e":"For many parents, keeping their children safe is always their top priority.","t":"对许多父母来说，孩子的安全始终是最**优先考虑的事**。"},
44156:{"w":"crown","e":"The queen wore a gold crown covered with jewels at the ceremony.","t":"女王在典礼上戴着一顶镶满珠宝的金**王冠**。"},
44157:{"w":"clap","e":"The audience began to clap loudly when the little girl finished her song.","t":"小女孩唱完歌后，观众们开始大声**鼓掌**。"},
44158:{"w":"elementary","e":"This book is for elementary learners who know only a few hundred English words.","t":"这本书是给只认识几百个英语单词的**初级**学习者看的。"},
44159:{"w":"title","e":"The title of her new book is short, but it tells you a lot about the story.","t":"她新书的**标题**很短，却透露了很多故事内容。"},
44160:{"w":"conservative","e":"The obstacle to our development has been conservative local authorities.","t":"**保守**的地方当局一直是我们发展的障碍。"},
44161:{"w":"towel","e":"After swimming, he dried himself with a large towel and sat in the sun.","t":"游泳之后，他用一条大**毛巾**擦干身子，坐在阳光下。"},
44162:{"w":"convey","e":"His poem conveyed a sense of sorrow.","t":"他的诗**表达**了一种悲伤的情感。"},
44163:{"w":"costume","e":"The children wore colorful animal costumes for the school play last Friday afternoon.","t":"上周五下午，孩子们穿着色彩鲜艳的动物**服装**参加学校的演出。"},
44164:{"w":"opera","e":"We went to see a famous Italian opera at the new theater last weekend.","t":"上周末我们去新剧院看了一部著名的意大利**歌剧**。"},
44165:{"w":"mount","e":"The old man slowly mounted the stairs to his flat on the fifth floor.","t":"老人慢慢地**登上**楼梯，回到五楼的家。"},
44166:{"w":"diagnose","e":"The doctor diagnosed her illness as a bad cold and told her to rest at home.","t":"医生**诊断**她得了重感冒，让她在家休息。"},
44167:{"w":"digital","e":"I bought a digital camera so that I could share my photos online easily.","t":"我买了一台**数码**相机，这样就能方便地在网上分享照片。"},
44168:{"w":"toast","e":"I usually have toast with butter and a glass of milk for breakfast.","t":"我早餐通常吃抹了黄油的**烤面包**，再喝一杯牛奶。"},
44169:{"w":"layout","e":"The noise factor will have to be taken into consideration with the layout of the houses.","t":"噪音因素必须被纳入房屋**设计**的考虑范围之内。"},
44170:{"w":"artistic","e":"We'll see many artistic works depicting the major events of her life.","t":"我们将看到很多描写她一生主要事件的**艺术**作品。"},
44171:{"w":"popularity","e":"Online shopping has gained great popularity among young people in China in recent years.","t":"近年来，网购在中国年轻人中越来越**流行**。"},
44172:{"w":"auxiliary","e":"The hospital has an auxiliary power supply in case the electricity goes off.","t":"医院有**后备**电源，以防停电。"},
44173:{"w":"elderly","e":"The city offers free bus rides to elderly people who are over seventy years old.","t":"这座城市为七十岁以上的**老年**人提供免费公交乘车服务。"},
44174:{"w":"amongst","e":"The old house was hidden amongst tall trees at the end of the road.","t":"那座老房子隐藏在路尽头的一片高树**之中**。"},
44175:{"w":"major","e":"In Mexico city, vehicle pollution is a major health hazard.","t":"在墨西哥城，交通污染是人们健康的一个**主要**威胁。"},
44176:{"w":"crack","e":"There is a long crack in the wall, so we must ask someone to repair it.","t":"墙上有一道长长的**裂缝**，我们得找人来修。"},
44177:{"w":"slice","e":"I brought you a slice of pizza.","t":"我给你带了**一块**比萨。"},
44178:{"w":"legislation","e":"The government passed new legislation to protect wild animals and their homes.","t":"政府通过了保护野生动物及其栖息地的新**法规**。"},
44179:{"w":"mortgage","e":"My parents took out a mortgage to buy their first house twenty years ago.","t":"二十年前，我父母申请了**按揭贷款**，买下了他们的第一套房子。"},
44180:{"w":"dairy","e":"Milk, butter and cheese are all dairy products that many children eat every day.","t":"牛奶、黄油和奶酪都是很多孩子每天吃的**乳制品**。"},
44181:{"w":"copyright","e":"The writer still owns the copyright of her first novel, published in 1990.","t":"这位作家仍然拥有她1990年出版的第一部小说的**版权**。"},
44182:{"w":"overthrow","e":"The people rose up and tried to overthrow the cruel king who had ruled them for years.","t":"人民奋起反抗，试图**推翻**统治他们多年的残暴国王。"},
44183:{"w":"prose","e":"The writer is famous for her beautiful prose about life in the countryside.","t":"这位作家以描写乡村生活的优美**散文**而闻名。"},
44184:{"w":"renovate","e":"They plan to renovate the old house before moving in next spring.","t":"他们打算明年春天搬进去之前把这座老房子**翻新**一下。"},
44185:{"w":"bully","e":"When confronted with bullying and threats, some people will choose to give in or keep silent.","t":"当面对**恐吓**和威胁时，一些人选择屈服或沉默。"},
44186:{"w":"addict","e":"My uncle is a coffee addict and drinks at least six cups every day.","t":"我叔叔喝咖啡**成瘾**，每天至少喝六杯。"},
44187:{"w":"Confucian","e":"Respect for parents and teachers is an important Confucian idea in Chinese culture.","t":"尊敬父母和师长是中国文化中一个重要的**儒家**思想。"},
44188:{"w":"memorize","e":"It took me a whole evening to memorize all the new words in this unit.","t":"我花了一整个晚上才**记住**这个单元所有的新单词。"},
44189:{"w":"Christ","e":"Many people believe that Christ was born in a small town called Bethlehem.","t":"许多人相信**基督**出生在一个叫伯利恒的小镇。"},
44190:{"w":"equality","e":"Many people have fought for equality between men and women at work.","t":"许多人一直在为职场上的男女**平等**而奋斗。"},
44191:{"w":"assume","e":"Ecologists have assumed that tropical ecosystems were shaped entirely by natural forces.","t":"生态学家**设想**热带生态系统完全是由自然的力量形成的。"},
44192:{"w":"evidence","e":"As an international student you will need to provide evidence that you can fund yourself for however long your course lasts.","t":"作为国际学生，你需要提供**证据**，证明无论课程持续多长时间你都有足够的资金维持学业。"},
44193:{"w":"jealous","e":"Tom is jealous of anyone who talks to his girlfriend.","t":"汤姆对每个和他女友说话的人都心存**妒意**。"},
44194:{"w":"process","e":"Reforming the educational system will be a difficult process.","t":"教育制度的改革将是一个艰难的**过程**。"},
44195:{"w":"mechanic","e":"The article gave the readers a summary of the life of a mechanic.","t":"这篇文章向读者简略介绍了一个**机修工**的生活。"},
44196:{"w":"dominate","e":"Cities cease to be port cities when other functions dominate.","t":"当城市的其他功能**占统治地位**时，它就不再是港口城市了。"},
44197:{"w":"lick","e":"The little dog licked my hand to say hello when I came home.","t":"我回家时，小狗**舔了舔**我的手，跟我打招呼。"},
44198:{"w":"trace","e":"The origin of modern architecture can be traced back to the social and technological changes of the 18th and 19th centuries.","t":"现代建筑的起源可**追溯**到18、19世纪出现的社会和科技变革。"},
44199:{"w":"inspect","e":"The general inspected the troops.","t":"将军**检阅**了军队。"},
44200:{"w":"overcome","e":"With the help of her friends, she overcame her fear of speaking in public.","t":"在朋友们的帮助下，她**克服**了当众讲话的恐惧。"},
44201:{"w":"expand","e":"The goal of university should be to expand the minds of students.","t":"大学的目标应该是**开阔**学生的视野。"},
44202:{"w":"lorry","e":"A large lorry full of vegetables was stuck in the traffic on the bridge.","t":"一辆装满蔬菜的大**卡车**被堵在了桥上。"},
44203:{"w":"awful","e":"The food at the restaurant was awful.","t":"这家饭店的食物很**糟糕**。"},
44204:{"w":"laughter","e":"The room was filled with laughter when the little boy began to dance.","t":"小男孩开始跳舞时，房间里充满了**笑声**。"},
44205:{"w":"cue","e":"The actor got his cue from the director.","t":"那位男演员从导演那里得到了一些**提示**。"},
44206:{"w":"motion","e":"For years Newton had been curious about the cause of the orbital motion of the moon and planets.","t":"多年来，牛顿一直对月球和行星轨道**运动**的成因好奇。"},
44207:{"w":"compass","e":"Nearly two thousand years have passed since the invention of the compass, which is the pride of Chinese people.","t":"**指南针**的发明是中国人的骄傲，距今已有差不多两千年的历史。"},
44208:{"w":"transfer","e":"Her company is going to transfer her to its new office in Shanghai next month.","t":"她的公司打算下个月把她**调往**上海的新办事处。"},
44209:{"w":"crucial","e":"The presence of human beings is crucial to the survival of the forest.","t":"人类的存在对森林的存活**至关重要**。"},
44210:{"w":"lean","e":"Please don't lean against that old door, because it might open suddenly.","t":"请不要**斜靠**在那扇旧门上，它可能会突然打开。"},
44211:{"w":"farewell","e":"We bid our old friends farewell.","t":"我们向老友们**告别**。"},
44212:{"w":"priest","e":"The priest visits the sick people in the village hospital every Sunday afternoon.","t":"**牧师**每个星期天下午都去村里的医院看望病人。"},
44213:{"w":"minister","e":"The education minister visited our school and talked with teachers about the new exams.","t":"教育**部长**参观了我们学校，和老师们谈了新的考试。"},
44214:{"w":"revenue","e":"A new strategy for pricing known as \"revenue management\" is now being used by many large companies.","t":"现在许多大公司都采用一项名为“**收入**管理”的新定价策略。"},
44215:{"w":"transparent","e":"The box is made of transparent plastic, so you can see what is inside.","t":"这个盒子是用**透明**塑料做的，所以你能看到里面装的东西。"},
44216:{"w":"duration","e":"The school was used as a hospital for the duration of the war.","t":"整个战争**期间**这所学校都被用作医院。"},
44217:{"w":"transform","e":"The Internet has transformed the way people shop, work and talk to each other.","t":"互联网**彻底改变**了人们购物、工作和交流的方式。"},
44218:{"w":"illegal","e":"The police arrested the old lady for illegal possession of drugs.","t":"警方以**非法**持有毒品为由逮捕了这位老妇人。"},
44219:{"w":"comprehension","e":"The teacher's task of improving comprehension is made harder by influences outside the classroom.","t":"老师提高学生**理解力**的工作因为课堂外的影响而变得更加困难。"},
44220:{"w":"hay","e":"The farmer gave the horses some hay and fresh water in the evening.","t":"傍晚，农夫给马喂了些**干草**和清水。"},
44221:{"w":"fancy","e":"Maureen tiptoed around the room in her fancy shoes.","t":"莫林穿上她那双**精致**的鞋，踮着脚尖在房间里走来走去。"},
44222:{"w":"tradition","e":"Individuals often find it hard to escape from the role that cultural traditions have defined for them.","t":"人们经常发现难以摆脱文化**传统**给自己限定的角色。"},
44223:{"w":"advocate","e":"Some architects advocated the use of masonry in the construction of skyscrapers.","t":"一些建筑师**提倡**采用石工技术建造摩天大楼。"},
44224:{"w":"conscious","e":"She was conscious that everyone in the room was looking at her new dress.","t":"她**意识到**屋里的每个人都在看她的新裙子。"},
44225:{"w":"compete","e":"A series of tests and interviews eventually left 280 applicants competing for the 120 advertised positions.","t":"经过一系列的测试和面试之后，最终留下280名申请者来**竞争**招聘广告上的120个职位。"},
44226:{"w":"modify","e":"The teacher asked me to modify my essay because some of the sentences were too long.","t":"老师让我**修改**一下作文，因为有些句子太长了。"},
44227:{"w":"transport","e":"Better integration of transport systems is highly desirable and made more feasible by modern computers.","t":"人们迫切要求**运输**系统进一步一体化，而现代计算机使这一要求更易实现。"},
44228:{"w":"goodness","e":"She believes in the goodness of people and is always ready to help strangers.","t":"她相信人性的**善良**，总是乐于帮助陌生人。"},
44229:{"w":"complicated","e":"The other hat we made was more complicated.","t":"我们制作的另外一顶帽子更加**复杂**。"},
44230:{"w":"album","e":"My mother keeps all our family photos in a big old album.","t":"妈妈把我们所有的家庭照片都放在一本旧的大**相册**里。"},
44231:{"w":"tragedy","e":"The fire was a terrible tragedy, and the whole town came together to help the families.","t":"这场火灾是一场可怕的**悲剧**，全镇的人都来帮助受害的家庭。"},
44232:{"w":"historic","e":"There are a number of historic ships docked in the harbour.","t":"这个港湾停泊了很多**具有历史意义**的船舶。"},
44233:{"w":"biography","e":"I am reading a biography of Steve Jobs that tells the story of his whole life.","t":"我正在读一本史蒂夫·乔布斯的**传记**，书里讲了他的一生。"},
44234:{"w":"offend","e":"I didn't mean to offend you; I was only trying to give you some honest advice.","t":"我不是有意**冒犯**你，只是想给你一些诚恳的建议。"},
44235:{"w":"specify","e":"It is not necessary to specify quantity when ordering beer.","t":"预定啤酒时无需**指定**数量。"},
44236:{"w":"cereal","e":"I usually have a bowl of cereal with milk for breakfast before school.","t":"我上学前通常吃一碗加牛奶的**麦片**当早餐。"},
44237:{"w":"tractor","e":"The farmer drove his old red tractor across the muddy field early in the morning.","t":"一大早，农夫开着他那辆旧的红色**拖拉机**穿过泥泞的田地。"},
44238:{"w":"translation","e":"The Chinese translation of this famous English novel came out last month.","t":"这部著名英文小说的中文**译本**上个月出版了。"},
44239:{"w":"bumper","e":"The car behind us hit our back bumper, but luckily nobody was hurt.","t":"后面那辆车撞上了我们的后**保险杠**，幸好没人受伤。"},
44240:{"w":"instinct","e":"It is instinct that makes salmon swim upstream to lay eggs.","t":"大马哈鱼洄游产卵是出于**本能**。"},
44241:{"w":"prosperous","e":"Thanks to tourism, this small fishing village has become a prosperous town.","t":"多亏了旅游业，这个小渔村已经变成了一座**繁荣的**小镇。"},
44242:{"w":"proficient","e":"After living in Beijing for three years, he became proficient in Chinese.","t":"在北京住了三年后，他已经**精通**中文了。"},
44243:{"w":"retire","e":"In this hospital, children under 16 don't need to pay, and the same thing goes for people who have retired.","t":"在这家医院，16岁以下的儿童免费就诊，**退休**人员也可享受同等待遇。"},
44244:{"w":"baggage","e":"We waited almost an hour at the airport before our baggage finally arrived.","t":"我们在机场等了将近一个小时，**行李**才终于到了。"},
44245:{"w":"repay","e":"You should repay principal and interest.","t":"你应该**偿还**本金和利息。"},
44246:{"w":"professional","e":"Sports psychologists spend time with professional athletes helping them approach competition with a positive mental attitude.","t":"运动心理学家花时间帮助**职业**运动员以一种积极的心态去迎接挑战。"},
44247:{"w":"pour","e":"She poured some hot water into the cup and added a tea bag.","t":"她往杯子里**倒入**一些热水，又放了个茶包。"},
44248:{"w":"bulletin","e":"We listened to the news bulletin on the radio to find out about the storm.","t":"我们收听了电台的**简明新闻**，了解暴风雨的情况。"},
44249:{"w":"bullet","e":"The police found a bullet in the wall of the shop after the robbery.","t":"抢劫案发生后，警察在商店的墙上发现了一颗**子弹**。"},
44250:{"w":"transmission","e":"Washing your hands often can help stop the transmission of colds at school.","t":"勤洗手有助于阻止感冒在学校里**传播**。"},
44251:{"w":"certainty","e":"I can say with certainty that he will come to the party tonight.","t":"我可以**确定地**说，他今晚会来参加聚会。"},
44252:{"w":"trail","e":"We followed a narrow trail through the forest and reached the lake by noon.","t":"我们沿着一条狭窄的**小径**穿过森林，中午时分到达了湖边。"},
44253:{"w":"obtain","e":"Today fibre optics are used to obtain a clearer image of smaller objects.","t":"现在，纤维光学被用于**获取**较小物体的更清晰图像。"},
44254:{"w":"dilemma","e":"She faced a dilemma: take the well-paid job in another city or stay near her family.","t":"她陷入了**两难境地**：是去外地接受那份高薪工作，还是留在家人身边。"},
44255:{"w":"prosperity","e":"After years of hard work, the small town finally enjoyed peace and prosperity.","t":"经过多年的努力，这个小镇终于迎来了和平与**繁荣**。"},
44256:{"w":"enthusiasm","e":"She shows great enthusiasm for the movie.","t":"她对这部电影表现出极大的**热情**。"},
44257:{"w":"cosmos","e":"The scientist has spent her whole life studying the stars and the cosmos.","t":"这位科学家一生都在研究星星和**宇宙**。"},
44258:{"w":"minor","e":"Don't worry, it's only a minor problem, and we can fix it in a few minutes.","t":"别担心，这个问题**不大**，我们几分钟就能解决。"},
44259:{"w":"assemble","e":"All components were assembled in the front workshop.","t":"所有部件都是在前面的车间**组装**的。"},
44260:{"w":"integrity","e":"He is a man of integrity who never tells lies, even when the truth hurts.","t":"他是一个**正直**的人，从不说谎，即使说实话会伤人。"},
44261:{"w":"apologize","e":"Tom apologized to his teacher for being late for class again this morning.","t":"汤姆因为今天早上上课又迟到，向老师**道歉**了。"},
44262:{"w":"slope","e":"The children ran down the grassy slope behind the school, laughing and shouting.","t":"孩子们又笑又叫地跑下学校后面长满青草的**斜坡**。"},
44263:{"w":"preventive","e":"Washing your hands often is a simple preventive measure against colds and other illnesses.","t":"勤洗手是一种简单的**预防性**措施，可以防止感冒和其他疾病。"},
44264:{"w":"pants","e":"My pants are too long, so my mother cut them a little shorter.","t":"我的**裤子**太长了，妈妈就帮我剪短了一点。"},
44265:{"w":"equivalent","e":"At that time, the cost of a bulb was equivalent to half a day's pay for the average worker.","t":"那时，一个灯泡的成本**相当于**普通工人半天的工资。"},
44266:{"w":"monetary","e":"The government has changed its monetary policy in order to control rising prices.","t":"政府调整了**货币**政策，以控制物价上涨。"},
44267:{"w":"shortage","e":"The development project was welcomed because of Holland's chronic shortage of land.","t":"由于荷兰土地长期**短缺**，这一开发项目在荷兰大受欢迎。"},
44268:{"w":"secondary","e":"It took us three hours to decide the primary and secondary targets of this term.","t":"我们花了三个小时才确定了这个学期的主要目标和**次要**目标。"},
44269:{"w":"chill","e":"The group asks for a specially designed camping cool box, which will keep food and drinks chilled.","t":"这个团体在寻求一种设计独特的野营冷藏箱，用以**冷藏**食物和饮料。"},
44270:{"w":"confine","e":"It's important not to confine yourself to reading on your subject.","t":"不要**仅限于**阅读本专业的书籍，这一点很重要。"},
44271:{"w":"abundant","e":"This area has abundant rainfall, so farmers can grow rice twice a year.","t":"这个地区雨水**充裕**，农民一年可以种两季水稻。"},
44272:{"w":"flood","e":"The heavy rain caused a flood that cut off several villages for days.","t":"大雨引发了**洪水**，几个村子好几天与外界隔绝。"},
44273:{"w":"gymnasium","e":"The students have their PE classes in the gymnasium when it rains.","t":"下雨时，学生们在**体育馆**上体育课。"},
44274:{"w":"faith","e":"People have to have faith in their ability to carry out the task their boss has set them.","t":"大家必须**相信**自己有能力完成老板布置的任务。"},
44275:{"w":"species","e":"Between 1968 and 1982, the country imported about 50 different species of dung beetle, from Asia, Europe and Africa.","t":"在1968年到1982年间，该国从亚洲、欧洲和非洲进口了大约50种不同**种类**的蜣螂。"},
44276:{"w":"academy","e":"She studied painting at the academy of fine arts for four years before becoming an artist.","t":"她在美术**学院**学了四年绘画，后来成了一名艺术家。"},
44277:{"w":"attraction","e":"The beautiful beaches are the main attraction of the island for visitors.","t":"美丽的海滩是这座岛对游客最大的**吸引力**。"},
44278:{"w":"contemporary","e":"The museum has a large collection of contemporary art from young Chinese painters.","t":"这家博物馆收藏了大量中国青年画家的**当代**艺术作品。"},
44279:{"w":"recorder","e":"The reporter put a small recorder on the table before the interview began.","t":"采访开始前，记者在桌上放了一台小**录音机**。"},
44280:{"w":"navy","e":"Her brother joined the navy after high school and now works on a large ship.","t":"她哥哥高中毕业后加入了**海军**，现在在一艘大船上工作。"},
44281:{"w":"assistant","e":"The employees felt that their assistant manager was closer to them than the manager.","t":"和经理相比，员工们感觉**助理**经理与他们更亲近。"},
44282:{"w":"sour","e":"The milk has turned sour because I forgot to put it in the fridge.","t":"牛奶**变酸**了，因为我忘了把它放进冰箱。"},
44283:{"w":"tremendous","e":"The new bridge has made a tremendous difference to people living on the island.","t":"新大桥给岛上居民的生活带来了**极大的**变化。"},
44284:{"w":"necessity","e":"Out of necessity or out of interest, people return to school for the common goal of self-improvement.","t":"不管是出于**需要**还是兴趣，人们重返学校都是为了一个共同的目标——提高自己。"},
44285:{"w":"fruitful","e":"The fruitful land along the river produces enough rice to feed the whole region.","t":"河边**肥沃**的土地出产的大米足够养活整个地区。"},
44286:{"w":"dominant","e":"The dominant idea, raised by 64% of the pupils, was that rainforests provide animals with habitats.","t":"64%的学生提出的**主流**观点是，热带雨林为动物提供了栖息地。"},
44287:{"w":"scare","e":"The loud thunder scared the little girl, and she ran to her mother.","t":"响亮的雷声把小女孩**吓坏**了，她跑向了妈妈。"},
44288:{"w":"expectation","e":"The company failed to meet shareholders' expectations.","t":"公司没有满足股东的**期望**。"},
44289:{"w":"harden","e":"Leave the cake in the fridge for two hours until the chocolate on top hardens.","t":"把蛋糕放进冰箱两小时，直到上面的巧克力**变硬**。"},
44290:{"w":"transportation","e":"There is a need for huge improvement in public transportation.","t":"公共**交通系统**需要大幅度的提高和改善。"},
44291:{"w":"disappear","e":"The sun disappeared behind the clouds, and it suddenly became cold and dark.","t":"太阳**消失**在云层后面，天突然变得又冷又暗。"},
44292:{"w":"trend","e":"In your opinion, will this trend continue into the future?","t":"依你看，这种**趋势**在未来还会继续吗？"},
44293:{"w":"scientific","e":"This morning I want to tell you about a recent scientific discovery dealing with the relation between plants and animals.","t":"今天上午我想告诉你们关于动植物关系的一项新近的**科学**发现。"},
44294:{"w":"trash","e":"Please take out the trash before you go to school this morning.","t":"今天早上上学前请把**垃圾**拿出去倒掉。"},
44295:{"w":"elaborate","e":"The children spent a whole week preparing an elaborate birthday cake for their mother.","t":"孩子们花了整整一个星期，为妈妈准备了一个**精心制作的**生日蛋糕。"},
44296:{"w":"regardless","e":"Regardless of the theory or model that we choose, a reduction in population size decreases the genetic diversity of a population.","t":"**无论**我们选择何种理论或研究样本，人口减少都会降低该种群的基因多样性。"},
44297:{"w":"bleed","e":"My nose began to bleed after I was hit by the ball during the game.","t":"比赛中我被球砸到后，鼻子开始**流血**。"},
44298:{"w":"bat","e":"At night, bats fly out of the cave to look for insects to eat.","t":"夜里，**蝙蝠**飞出洞穴寻找昆虫吃。"},
44299:{"w":"create","e":"The economic recovery created more jobs.","t":"经济复苏**带来**了更多的工作机会。"},
44300:{"w":"carrot","e":"Rabbits love eating carrots, so we feed our pet rabbit one every morning.","t":"兔子爱吃**胡萝卜**，所以我们每天早上喂宠物兔一根。"},
44301:{"w":"triangle","e":"The teacher drew a large triangle on the blackboard and asked us to measure its sides.","t":"老师在黑板上画了一个大**三角形**，让我们量出它的边长。"},
44302:{"w":"diagram","e":"He tossed the diagram of the bridge to Brian.","t":"他把桥的**结构图**扔给了布莱恩。"},
44303:{"w":"tray","e":"The waiter carried a tray of drinks carefully across the crowded room.","t":"服务员端着一**托盘**饮料，小心地穿过拥挤的房间。"},
44304:{"w":"literary","e":"Our school holds a literary contest every spring for students who love writing poems.","t":"我们学校每年春天都为爱写诗的学生举办一场**文学**比赛。"},
44305:{"w":"valid","e":"You don't want to get to your destination only to find you have the wrong visa, or worse, that your passport isn't valid any more.","t":"你不会想要等到了目的地却发现你带的是错误的签证，或者更糟糕的是，你的护照不再**有效**。"},
44306:{"w":"retain","e":"The young lady retained her tennis title for the third year.","t":"那个年轻女孩第三年仍**保住**了网球冠军的头衔。"},
44307:{"w":"jail","e":"The young thief was sent to jail for two years for stealing cars.","t":"那个年轻的小偷因偷车被送进**监狱**，关了两年。"},
44308:{"w":"copper","e":"These old coins are made of copper and are now worth a lot of money.","t":"这些旧硬币是**铜制**的，现在很值钱。"},
44309:{"w":"comb","e":"She took a comb out of her bag and quickly fixed her hair.","t":"她从包里拿出一把**梳子**，很快把头发梳理好。"},
44310:{"w":"design","e":"Architecture is the art and science of designing buildings and structures.","t":"建筑学是一门**设计**建筑物及其结构的艺术科学。"},
44311:{"w":"estimate","e":"The deal is estimated to be worth around £1.5 million.","t":"这笔交易**估计**价值150万英镑左右。"},
44312:{"w":"reference","e":"The teachers will not give the range of reference books.","t":"老师们不会给出**参考**书的范围。"},
44313:{"w":"script","e":"The actors read the script together before they started to practice the play.","t":"开始排练这出戏之前，演员们一起读了**剧本**。"},
44314:{"w":"carriage","e":"We finally found two empty seats in the last carriage of the crowded train.","t":"我们终于在拥挤的火车最后一节**车厢**里找到了两个空座位。"},
44315:{"w":"treatment","e":"People were dissatisfied with the treatment of animals at the zoo.","t":"动物园**对待**动物的方式令人不满。"},
44316:{"w":"corrupt","e":"The corrupt official was sent to prison for taking money from businessmen.","t":"那名**腐败**官员因收受商人钱财被送进了监狱。"},
44317:{"w":"mat","e":"Please wipe your feet on the mat before you come into the house.","t":"进屋前请在**垫子**上擦擦脚。"},
44318:{"w":"powerful","e":"The new engine is far more powerful than the old one and uses less fuel.","t":"新发动机比旧的**强大**得多，而且更省油。"},
44319:{"w":"diligent","e":"She is a diligent student who reviews her notes every evening after school.","t":"她是个**勤奋**的学生，每天放学后都复习笔记。"},
44320:{"w":"cashier","e":"The cashier at the supermarket counted the money twice before giving me my change.","t":"超市的**收银员**把钱数了两遍才找给我零钱。"},
44321:{"w":"owing","e":"There is still fifty dollars owing on my phone bill, so I must pay it today.","t":"我的电话费还有五十美元**未付**，所以今天必须交上。"},
44322:{"w":"bud","e":"In early spring, the trees in our garden are covered with small green buds.","t":"早春时节，我们花园里的树上长满了绿色的小**叶芽**。"},
44323:{"w":"sensible","e":"This week's lecture is on sensible eating.","t":"本周的讲座是关于**合理**饮食的。"},
44324:{"w":"positive","e":"Customer comments, both positive and negative, are recorded by staff.","t":"对于顾客的意见，无论是**肯定的**还是否定的，都由职员予以记录。"},
44325:{"w":"champagne","e":"They opened a bottle of champagne to celebrate their daughter's wedding last Saturday.","t":"上周六他们开了一瓶**香槟酒**庆祝女儿的婚礼。"},
44326:{"w":"faithful","e":"The old dog stayed faithful to its owner and waited for him at the station every day.","t":"那条老狗对主人很**忠诚**，每天都在车站等他。"},
44327:{"w":"appoint","e":"He is appointed to administer funds.","t":"他被**指派**去管理基金。"},
44328:{"w":"mop","e":"After the party, my mother asked me to mop the sticky kitchen floor before bed.","t":"聚会结束后，妈妈让我睡觉前把黏糊糊的厨房地板**拖干净**。"},
44329:{"w":"trap","e":"The farmer set a trap to catch the fox that had been stealing his chickens.","t":"农夫设了一个**捕捉器**，想抓住那只一直偷他鸡的狐狸。"},
44330:{"w":"project","e":"I think this project could be adapted to suit any age.","t":"我觉得可以将该**计划**加以改动以适合所有年龄的人群。"},
44331:{"w":"overwhelm","e":"She was overwhelmed by the kindness of strangers who helped her after the accident.","t":"事故发生后，陌生人纷纷帮助她，这份善意让她**不知所措**。"},
44332:{"w":"remedy","e":"Without remedies, the two men who ate poisonous mushrooms died within days.","t":"由于没有**药物**，那两个吃了毒蘑菇的人几天后就死了。"},
44333:{"w":"treaty","e":"The two countries signed a peace treaty and agreed to end the long war.","t":"两国签署了和平**条约**，同意结束这场漫长的战争。"},
44334:{"w":"chore","e":"Washing the dishes is the chore I hate most, so I usually cook instead.","t":"洗碗是我最讨厌的**家务活**，所以我一般负责做饭。"},
44335:{"w":"hearing","e":"My grandmother's hearing is getting worse, so we have to speak loudly to her.","t":"奶奶的**听力**越来越差，所以我们跟她说话得大声些。"},
44336:{"w":"artificial","e":"We use no artificial additives of any kind in our products.","t":"我们的产品绝不含任何**人工**添加剂。"},
44337:{"w":"password","e":"Never tell anyone your password, even if they say they work for your bank.","t":"永远不要把你的**密码**告诉任何人，即使对方说自己在你的银行工作。"},
44338:{"w":"sociology","e":"In the first semester you'll be taking four subjects: psychology, sociology, history and economics.","t":"第一学期你将学习四门课：心理学、**社会学**、历史学和经济学。"},
44339:{"w":"emphasis","e":"The President's statement gave emphasis to the crisis.","t":"总统在声明中**强调**了这次危机。"},
44340:{"w":"buckle","e":"Buildings, pipes and roads tend to buckle and crack because of the movement of the earth.","t":"由于地壳的运动，建筑物、地下管道以及道路等往往会**变形**甚至破裂。"},
44341:{"w":"decent","e":"You can't get anything decent under $15.","t":"花不到15美金不可能买到**像样**的东西。"},
44342:{"w":"select","e":"More and more employers are making use of what are called \"personality questionnaires\" to help them select new staff.","t":"越来越多的雇主正在利用所谓的“性格调查问卷”来帮助自己**挑选**新员工。"},
44343:{"w":"chef","e":"The chef at this restaurant is famous for his delicious fish soup.","t":"这家餐馆的**厨师**以拿手的鱼汤而出名。"},
44344:{"w":"historical","e":"Our teacher took us to a museum full of historical objects from the Tang dynasty.","t":"老师带我们去了一家博物馆，里面满是唐代的**历史**文物。"},
44345:{"w":"tremble","e":"Her hands began to tremble as she opened the letter from the university.","t":"她打开大学寄来的信时，手开始**发抖**。"},
44346:{"w":"broker","e":"My uncle works as a broker, helping his clients buy and sell stocks every day.","t":"我叔叔是一名**经纪人**，每天帮客户买卖股票。"},
44347:{"w":"opponent","e":"Our team's opponent in the final was very strong, but we still won by two goals.","t":"我们队在决赛中的**对手**很强，但我们最后还是净胜两球赢了。"},
44348:{"w":"saddle","e":"My bike saddle was too high, so my dad lowered it for me.","t":"我自行车的**车座**太高了，所以爸爸帮我调低了。"},
44349:{"w":"idle","e":"During the summer holiday, he spent most of his idle hours playing games on his phone.","t":"暑假里，他把大部分**空闲**时间都花在了用手机打游戏上。"},
44350:{"w":"tunnel","e":"The prisoner had escaped by tunnelling.","t":"犯人**挖地道**逃跑了。"},
44351:{"w":"lest","e":"She wrote down the phone number at once lest she should forget it.","t":"她马上把电话号码记了下来，**以免**忘记。"},
44352:{"w":"exchange","e":"Are you one of the exchange students?","t":"你是**交换**生之一吗？"},
44353:{"w":"site","e":"The site for the new hospital is next to the river, close to the city center.","t":"新医院的**地点**就在河边，靠近市中心。"},
44354:{"w":"creep","e":"I crept upstairs so as not to wake up other tenants.","t":"我**悄悄地爬**上楼，以免吵醒其他房客。"},
44355:{"w":"pledge","e":"The prime minister has pledged today that he will make 250 million dollars available to help the drought-stricken farmers.","t":"总理今天**承诺**将拨2.5亿美元帮助受旱灾影响的农民。"},
44356:{"w":"handy","e":"Keep a pen and some paper handy in case you need to take notes.","t":"把笔和纸放在**手边**，以便需要时做笔记。"},
44357:{"w":"afford","e":"They would not be able to afford cars or homes.","t":"他们**负担**不起汽车和房子。"},
44358:{"w":"emotion","e":"Doing sports can be a good way to release suppressed emotion.","t":"做运动是一个释放压抑**情绪**的好方法。"},
44359:{"w":"background","e":"The job requires applicants with a business background.","t":"这份工作要求求职者有商业**背景**。"},
44360:{"w":"trial","e":"The trial lasted for three days.","t":"**审讯**持续了三天。"},
44361:{"w":"harsh","e":"The report has harsh words for the countries that sold these weapons.","t":"这篇报道**严厉**谴责了出售这些武器的国家。"},
44362:{"w":"tutor","e":"Jane tutored this little girl in English.","t":"简给这个小女孩当英文**家教**。"},
44363:{"w":"inn","e":"We stayed at a small inn in the village, run by a friendly old couple.","t":"我们住在村里一家由一对友善的老夫妇经营的**小旅店**里。"},
44364:{"w":"saving","e":"She used all her savings to buy a new laptop before starting university.","t":"她用全部**积蓄**在上大学前买了一台新笔记本电脑。"},
44365:{"w":"sauce","e":"My mother makes a delicious tomato sauce for the noodles every Sunday.","t":"每个星期天，妈妈都会给面条做一种美味的番茄**酱汁**。"},
44366:{"w":"choke","e":"The thick smoke from the fire almost choked the people trapped in the building.","t":"大火冒出的浓烟差点让困在楼里的人**窒息**。"},
44367:{"w":"reasonable","e":"I think you'll find the methods very reasonable.","t":"我认为你会觉得这些方法很**合理**。"},
44368:{"w":"combine","e":"The next step was to combine the holder with a small camera.","t":"下一步是将支架和一台小型相机**连接**起来。"},
44369:{"w":"dental","e":"You should have a dental check-up every six months to keep your teeth healthy.","t":"你应该每六个月做一次**牙科**检查，保持牙齿健康。"},
44370:{"w":"trumpet","e":"He has played the trumpet in the school band for three years.","t":"他在学校乐队吹**小号**已经三年了。"},
44371:{"w":"pill","e":"Take one pill three times a day after meals, and drink plenty of water.","t":"每天三次，每次饭后吃一颗**药丸**，并多喝水。"},
44372:{"w":"council","e":"The student council meets every Friday to discuss ideas for school activities.","t":"学生**委员会**每周五开会，讨论学校活动的点子。"},
44373:{"w":"applause","e":"When the young pianist finished playing, the hall was filled with loud applause.","t":"年轻的钢琴家演奏完毕，大厅里响起了热烈的**掌声**。"},
44374:{"w":"bay","e":"We sat on the beach and watched the fishing boats sail into the bay.","t":"我们坐在沙滩上，看着渔船驶进**海湾**。"},
44375:{"w":"portion","e":"The energy system uses the visible portion of the solar spectrum to light buildings.","t":"该能源系统利用太阳光谱中的可见光**部分**来为建筑照明。"},
44376:{"w":"nonsense","e":"Don't listen to him. What he said about the exam being cancelled is complete nonsense.","t":"别听他的，他说考试取消了，那完全是**胡说**。"},
44377:{"w":"ceremony","e":"The graduation ceremony in many universities is an important occasion.","t":"在很多大学，毕业**典礼**都是重要的场合。"},
44378:{"w":"beneficial","e":"How beneficial do you think it would be to group students according to their level of ability?","t":"你认为把学生按照能力的高低分组的做法有多大**益处**？"},
44379:{"w":"fantasy","e":"Those pleasures were produced through daydreaming and fantasy.","t":"那些快乐是通过白日梦和**想象**产生的。"},
44380:{"w":"formula","e":"Our math teacher wrote the formula on the board and showed us how to use it.","t":"数学老师把**公式**写在黑板上，教我们怎么用。"},
44381:{"w":"lodge","e":"During the trip, we lodged with a friendly family in a small village.","t":"旅行期间，我们**借宿**在一个小村庄里一户友好的人家。"},
44382:{"w":"usage","e":"This dictionary gives many examples to explain the correct usage of each word.","t":"这本词典用大量例句来解释每个词的正确**用法**。"},
44383:{"w":"reservoir","e":"The city gets most of its drinking water from a large reservoir in the hills.","t":"这座城市的大部分饮用水来自山里的一座大**水库**。"},
44384:{"w":"troop","e":"The government sent troops to help people who were trapped by the flood.","t":"政府派出**部队**去救助被洪水围困的人。"},
44385:{"w":"finance","e":"Opponents of smoking financed this study.","t":"反对吸烟的人士为这一研究**提供了资金**。"},
44386:{"w":"delete","e":"I accidentally deleted all the photos from my trip, so I felt very sad.","t":"我不小心**删除**了旅行时拍的所有照片，非常难过。"},
44387:{"w":"vague","e":"He gave a vague answer and we couldn't understand what he meant.","t":"他的回答太**含糊**了，我们不明白他的意思。"},
44388:{"w":"exaggerate","e":"The witness exaggerated the seriousness of the accident.","t":"目击者**夸大**了事故的严重性。"},
44389:{"w":"pump","e":"The villagers were tired of getting water from several miles away, so they invented a machine for pumping groundwater.","t":"村民们厌倦了到几英里之外的地方打水，于是他们发明了一种可以**抽**地下水的机器。"},
44390:{"w":"tropical","e":"Tropical rainforests are home to more than half of the world's plant and animal species.","t":"**热带**雨林是世界上一半以上动植物物种的栖息地。"},
44391:{"w":"trunk","e":"The trunk of this old tree is so thick that three people cannot put their arms around it.","t":"这棵老树的**树干**粗得三个人都抱不过来。"},
44392:{"w":"backward","e":"He took a quick step backward when the big dog suddenly ran toward him.","t":"那条大狗突然向他冲过来，他赶紧**向后**退了一步。"},
44393:{"w":"coil","e":"He picked up a coil of rope and carried it down to the boat.","t":"他拿起**一卷**绳子，把它搬到了船上。"},
44394:{"w":"grocer","e":"The grocer on our street sells fresh fruit, vegetables, milk and bread.","t":"我们街上的那个**杂货商**卖新鲜水果、蔬菜、牛奶和面包。"},
44395:{"w":"twist","e":"He twisted his ankle while playing basketball and couldn't walk for a week.","t":"他打篮球时**扭伤**了脚踝，一个星期都走不了路。"},
44396:{"w":"benefit","e":"Increased leisure time would benefit two-career households.","t":"增加休息时间会使双职工家庭**受益**。"},
44397:{"w":"cruise","e":"We went on a cruise along the river and enjoyed the beautiful city lights at night.","t":"我们沿河**乘船游览**，欣赏了夜晚美丽的城市灯光。"},
44398:{"w":"range","e":"We'd like to produce the equipment with a range of sizes.","t":"我们想生产大小规格**不同**的设备。"},
44399:{"w":"troublesome","e":"Moving to a new city can be troublesome, especially when you have a lot of furniture.","t":"搬到一座新城市可能很**麻烦**，尤其是家具很多的时候。"},
44400:{"w":"initial","e":"Interest will be charged after the initial 60-day interest-free period.","t":"过了**最初**60天的免息期后，就要开始收取利息了。"},
44401:{"w":"niece","e":"My niece is five years old and has just started going to kindergarten.","t":"我**侄女**五岁了，刚开始上幼儿园。"},
44402:{"w":"female","e":"A cow produces only one calf a year whereas a female ostrich can lay an egg every other day.","t":"一头奶牛一年只能生一头小牛，而一只**雌**鸵鸟每隔一天就下一个蛋。"},
44403:{"w":"railroad","e":"The new railroad between the two cities will open to passengers next year.","t":"两座城市之间新建的**铁路**明年将向乘客开放。"},
44404:{"w":"protest","e":"Hundreds of students gathered outside the city hall to protest against the new rule.","t":"数百名学生聚集在市政厅外，**抗议**这项新规定。"},
44405:{"w":"pose","e":"Climate change poses a serious threat to many animals living near the North Pole.","t":"气候变化给生活在北极附近的许多动物**造成**了严重威胁。"},
44406:{"w":"density","e":"Hong Kong has one of the highest population densities in the world.","t":"香港是世界上人口**密度**最高的地区之一。"},
44407:{"w":"aisle","e":"In the supermarket, the end of an aisle is usually used for promoting special offers.","t":"超市**过道**的尽头常用来促销特价商品。"},
44408:{"w":"truly","e":"I am truly sorry that I forgot to come to your birthday party last week.","t":"上周忘了去参加你的生日聚会，我**真心**感到抱歉。"},
44409:{"w":"tube","e":"The doctor put a thin plastic tube into his nose to help him breathe.","t":"医生把一根细塑料**管子**插进他的鼻子，帮助他呼吸。"},
44410:{"w":"dime","e":"I found a dime under the sofa when I was cleaning the living room.","t":"我打扫客厅时在沙发下面找到一枚**十分硬币**。"},
44411:{"w":"peculiar","e":"There was a peculiar smell in the kitchen, so we checked whether the gas was turned off.","t":"厨房里有一股**奇怪**的味道，于是我们检查了煤气有没有关。"},
44412:{"w":"attain","e":"Sustainable development is to attain a perpetual balance between population, economic growth and the environment.","t":"可持续发展就是要**实现**人口、经济增长和环境三者之间的永久平衡。"},
44413:{"w":"buck","e":"I bought this old bike from my neighbor for just twenty bucks last summer.","t":"去年夏天我只花了二十**美元**就从邻居那里买下了这辆旧自行车。"},
44414:{"w":"export","e":"In Africa, the feathers of ostriches were used for tribal ceremonial dress and they were also exported to Europe and America.","t":"在非洲，鸵鸟毛被用于部落的典礼服饰，同时也**出口**到欧洲和美洲。"},
44415:{"w":"devise","e":"Ford devised the first moving auto assembly line.","t":"福特**发明**了第一条移动的汽车装配线。"},
44416:{"w":"cherish","e":"I will always cherish the happy days I spent with my classmates at school.","t":"我会永远**珍视**和同学们在学校度过的快乐时光。"},
44417:{"w":"resume","e":"He resumed his reading after a nap.","t":"小睡了一会儿后，他**继续**阅读。"},
44418:{"w":"tune","e":"Engines of old cars were tuned to reduce the exhausts they emitted.","t":"老式汽车的发动机得到了**调整**，以减少废气排放量。"},
44419:{"w":"biotechnology","e":"Many students choose to study biotechnology because they want to help develop new medicines.","t":"许多学生选择学习**生物技术**，因为他们想帮助研发新药。"},
44420:{"w":"portrait","e":"A large portrait of the school's first headmaster hangs on the wall of the main hall.","t":"礼堂的墙上挂着一幅学校第一任校长的大**画像**。"},
44421:{"w":"shrug","e":"Joey and Monica looked at each other and shrugged.","t":"乔伊和莫妮卡互相对视，**耸了耸肩**。"},
44422:{"w":"corps","e":"My grandfather joined the army medical corps and helped wounded soldiers during the war.","t":"我爷爷参加过陆军医疗**部队**，在战争期间救治受伤的士兵。"},
44423:{"w":"utter","e":"The school party was an utter failure because almost nobody came on time.","t":"这次学校聚会是一次**彻底的**失败，因为几乎没人准时到。"},
44424:{"w":"daylight","e":"The children played in the garden until the last of the daylight disappeared.","t":"孩子们在花园里一直玩到最后一缕**日光**消失。"},
44425:{"w":"productive","e":"Without irrigation many productive areas of the country would not be able to be farmed.","t":"如果没有灌溉，这个国家的很多**多产**地区将不能进行农业生产。"},
44426:{"w":"bacteria","e":"Not all bacteria are harmful; some of them help us digest our food.","t":"并非所有**细菌**都有害，有些能帮助我们消化食物。"},
44427:{"w":"source","e":"We understand a port as a centre of land-sea exchange, and as a major source of livelihood and a major force for cultural mixing.","t":"我们把港口看作海陆交换的中心、生计的主要**来源**以及推动文化融合的重要力量。"},
44428:{"w":"productivity","e":"This process enhanced our ability to improve productivity and quality.","t":"这一方法增强了我们提高**生产力**和质量的能力。"},
44429:{"w":"centimeter","e":"The little plant has grown about five centimeters since we bought it last week.","t":"自从我们上周买回来，这株小植物已经长了大约五**厘米**。"},
44430:{"w":"doubtful","e":"It is doubtful whether the football match will go ahead in this heavy rain.","t":"下这么大的雨，足球赛**不大可能**照常进行。"},
44431:{"w":"memorial","e":"A memorial was built in the park to remember the soldiers who died in the war.","t":"公园里建了一座**纪念碑**，纪念在战争中牺牲的士兵。"},
44432:{"w":"cholesterol","e":"Ostrich meat is much lower in fat and cholesterol than beef.","t":"鸵鸟肉中的脂肪和**胆固醇**含量比牛肉中的低很多。"},
44433:{"w":"predict","e":"The United Nations predicts that the global population may stabilise between 8 and 14 billion in the twenty-first century.","t":"联合国**预言**，在21世纪全球人口将稳定在80亿到140亿之间。"},
44434:{"w":"committee","e":"The committee's decisions are often determined by the members' vote.","t":"**委员会**的决议常常由委员投票决定。"},
44435:{"w":"faculty","e":"Here on this campus we have the faculties of Architecture and Law.","t":"这所大学里设有建筑**学院**和法学院。"},
44436:{"w":"dine","e":"We will dine at a small Italian restaurant near the river tonight.","t":"今晚我们将在河边一家意大利小餐馆**用餐**。"},
44437:{"w":"acquaintance","e":"It was in the United States that I made the acquaintance of Professor Jones.","t":"我是在美国**结识**琼斯教授的。"},
44438:{"w":"tyre","e":"On the way to school, my bike got a flat tyre, so I had to walk.","t":"去学校的路上，我的自行车**轮胎**没气了，我只好推着走。"},
44439:{"w":"dim","e":"The light in the old library was too dim for me to read.","t":"老图书馆里的光线太**昏暗**，我没法看书。"},
44440:{"w":"affluent","e":"Children from affluent families often have more chances to travel and learn music.","t":"来自**富裕**家庭的孩子往往有更多机会去旅行和学习音乐。"},
44441:{"w":"spider","e":"A small spider was making a web in the corner of the window.","t":"一只小**蜘蛛**正在窗户角落里结网。"},
44442:{"w":"ugly","e":"Everyone said the old building was ugly, but I liked its strange shape.","t":"大家都说那栋老楼很**丑陋**，但我喜欢它奇特的形状。"},
44443:{"w":"moreover","e":"The hotel was too expensive; moreover, it was far from the city center.","t":"那家酒店太贵了，**而且**离市中心很远。"},
44444:{"w":"dioxide","e":"Cars and factories send large amounts of carbon dioxide into the air every day.","t":"汽车和工厂每天向空气中排放大量**二氧化**碳。"},
44445:{"w":"counsel","e":"Her teacher counseled her to study a subject she truly loved when she went to university.","t":"老师**劝告**她上大学时选一门自己真正喜欢的专业。"},
44446:{"w":"parallel","e":"The expressway is parallel to the railway.","t":"这条高速公路与铁路**平行**。"},
44447:{"w":"earnest","e":"He is an earnest student who always listens carefully and does all his homework.","t":"他是个**认真的**学生，总是专心听讲，完成所有作业。"},
44448:{"w":"bitch","e":"Our old bitch gave birth to five healthy puppies in the garden shed last night.","t":"我们家那条老**母狗**昨晚在花园的棚子里生了五只健康的小狗。"},
44449:{"w":"learning","e":"Online learning has become very popular among students since the internet became faster and cheaper.","t":"自从网络变得更快更便宜，网上**学习**在学生中很流行。"},
44450:{"w":"cooperate","e":"It is meaningful for world nations to cooperate with each other.","t":"对世界各国来说，相互**合作**的意义重大。"},
44451:{"w":"heroic","e":"The firefighter made a heroic effort to save the child from the burning house.","t":"为了从着火的房子里救出孩子，消防员做出了**英勇**的努力。"},
44452:{"w":"dynasty","e":"The Great Wall was rebuilt during the Ming Dynasty to protect the country.","t":"长城在明**王朝**时期得到重建，用来保卫国家。"},
44453:{"w":"commit","e":"The police believe the man committed the crime late last night near the station.","t":"警方认为，这名男子是昨天深夜在车站附近**犯下**这起罪行的。"},
44454:{"w":"appetite","e":"My supper by this time was cold, and my appetite was gone.","t":"我的晚餐这时候已经凉了，我也没**胃口**了。"},
44455:{"w":"umbrella","e":"Don't forget to take an umbrella with you, because it may rain this afternoon.","t":"别忘了带把**雨伞**，今天下午可能会下雨。"},
44456:{"w":"ecology","e":"If the beetles successfully adapt to their new environment, they'll soon become a part of the local ecology.","t":"如果甲虫完全适应了新的环境，它们很快就会成为当地**生态环境**的一部分。"},
44457:{"w":"typewriter","e":"My grandfather wrote all his letters on an old typewriter before computers became common.","t":"在电脑普及之前，我爷爷的信都是用一台旧**打字机**写的。"},
44458:{"w":"impose","e":"The government has imposed a new tax on cigarettes to stop people from smoking.","t":"政府对香烟**征收**了一项新税，以劝阻人们吸烟。"},
44459:{"w":"orchestra","e":"Which orchestra do you think is the finest in our country?","t":"你觉得我国最棒的**管弦乐队**是哪一支？"},
44460:{"w":"hijack","e":"Two armed men tried to hijack the plane, but the passengers stopped them.","t":"两名持枪男子企图**劫持**这架飞机，但被乘客们制止了。"},
44461:{"w":"determination","e":"With great determination, she practiced every day and finally passed the driving test.","t":"凭着极大的**决心**，她每天练习，终于通过了驾驶考试。"},
44462:{"w":"nursery","e":"My little sister goes to a nursery near our home while my parents are at work.","t":"爸妈上班时，我妹妹就去家附近的一家**托儿所**。"},
44463:{"w":"arithmetic","e":"My little sister is good at arithmetic and can add numbers very quickly.","t":"我妹妹**算术**很好，加法算得飞快。"},
44464:{"w":"colon","e":"In English, we often use a colon before giving a list of things.","t":"在英语中，我们列举一系列事物之前常用**冒号**。"},
44465:{"w":"sin","e":"My grandmother always told us that wasting food was a sin when so many people are hungry.","t":"我奶奶总是告诉我们，有那么多人在挨饿，浪费食物是一种**罪过**。"},
44466:{"w":"invade","e":"Portugal was invaded by the French in 1807.","t":"法国人在1807年**入侵**葡萄牙。"},
44467:{"w":"basically","e":"The two phones are basically the same, but the black one is a little cheaper.","t":"这两部手机**基本上**一样，只是黑色的那部便宜一点。"},
44468:{"w":"profound","e":"Losing his job had a profound effect on the way he looked at life.","t":"失业对他看待生活的方式产生了**深远的**影响。"},
44469:{"w":"companion","e":"Tom was my only Chinese companion during my stay in Switzerland.","t":"汤姆是我在瑞士期间唯一的中国**伙伴**。"},
44470:{"w":"fraction","e":"The little boy has done only a fraction of his homework.","t":"那小男孩只做了**一小部分**家庭作业。"},
44471:{"w":"heel","e":"My new shoes are too tight and have hurt the back of my heel.","t":"我的新鞋太紧了，把**脚后跟**磨疼了。"},
44472:{"w":"destination","e":"The tourists rest there and then go to various destinations.","t":"游客们在那里稍事休息，然后去往不同的**目的地**。"},
44473:{"w":"cabinet","e":"Please put the clean cups back in the kitchen cabinet after you dry them.","t":"杯子擦干后，请把它们放回厨房的**柜子**里。"},
44474:{"w":"battery","e":"My phone battery is almost dead, so I need to find a place to charge it.","t":"我的手机**电池**快没电了，我得找个地方充电。"},
44475:{"w":"typical","e":"The typical farm in the North is a small, family-run concern, producing mainly wool and timber for the market.","t":"北部的**典型**农场规模小且由家庭经营，主要生产市场上所需的羊毛及木材。"},
44476:{"w":"amid","e":"The little girl found her mother amid the crowd at the busy train station.","t":"小女孩在繁忙火车站的人群**之中**找到了妈妈。"},
44477:{"w":"oblige","e":"Heavy snow obliged the school to close for three days last week.","t":"上周的大雪**迫使**学校停课三天。"},
44478:{"w":"donkey","e":"The old farmer used a donkey to carry vegetables to the market every morning.","t":"老农夫每天早上用一头**驴子**把蔬菜驮到集市上。"},
44479:{"w":"independence","e":"After finding her first job, Lucy enjoyed her new independence and moved into her own flat.","t":"找到第一份工作后，露西享受着新获得的**独立**，搬进了自己的公寓。"},
44480:{"w":"convict","e":"The jury convicted the man, and he was sentenced to twenty years in prison.","t":"陪审团给此人**定罪**，他被判入狱20年。"},
44481:{"w":"sow","e":"In spring, the farmers sow seeds in the fields and hope for plenty of rain.","t":"春天，农民们在田里**播种**，盼望着多下点雨。"},
44482:{"w":"academic","e":"She has won several academic prizes for her research on climate change.","t":"她因气候变化方面的研究获得过好几项**学术**奖。"},
44483:{"w":"respond","e":"Companies should respond to this kind of situation in an honest and open way.","t":"公司应该采取开诚布公的方式来**应对**这类情况。"},
44484:{"w":"frontier","e":"Many young people moved to the western frontier in search of land and a new life.","t":"许多年轻人搬到西部**边疆**，寻找土地和新生活。"},
44485:{"w":"evolve","e":"According to brain researchers, as the brain evolved, one side became specialised for fine control of movement.","t":"根据大脑研究人员的说法，随着大脑的**进化**，一边的脑半球专门用来精确控制动作。"},
44486:{"w":"cite","e":"In his essay, he cited several famous writers to support his ideas.","t":"在文章中，他**引用**了几位著名作家的话来支持自己的观点。"},
44487:{"w":"outlook","e":"The highly respected old man has a fairly positive outlook on life.","t":"这位德高望重的老人对待生活的**态度**非常乐观。"},
44488:{"w":"controversy","e":"There exists a controversy over the plan for a new teaching building.","t":"建造新教学楼的计划存在**争议**。"},
44489:{"w":"discard","e":"10% of the data was discarded as unreliable.","t":"10%的数据因不可靠而被**废弃**。"},
44490:{"w":"typist","e":"My aunt worked as a typist in a small office before computers became common.","t":"在电脑普及之前，我姑姑在一家小办公室当**打字员**。"},
44491:{"w":"exception","e":"Everyone in my family loves spicy food, with the exception of my little brother.","t":"我家人人都爱吃辣，只有弟弟是个**例外**。"},
44492:{"w":"grab","e":"She grabbed her bag and ran out of the door to catch the bus.","t":"她**抓起**包就冲出门去赶公交车。"},
44493:{"w":"apart","e":"Apart from the Second World War period, the Winter Olympics were held every four years.","t":"**除了**第二次世界大战期间，冬奥会每四年举行一次。"},
44494:{"w":"profession","e":"Teaching is a profession that needs a lot of patience and love for children.","t":"教书这个**职业**需要极大的耐心和对孩子的爱。"},
44495:{"w":"deceive","e":"Mary deceived the interviewer about her past experience.","t":"玛丽在自己的过去经历上对面试官**撒了谎**。"},
44496:{"w":"consequence","e":"If you don't study hard now, you will have to face the consequences later.","t":"如果你现在不努力学习，以后就得承担**后果**。"},
44497:{"w":"authority","e":"Only the local authorities have the power to close the school during bad weather.","t":"只有当地**当局**有权在恶劣天气时关闭学校。"},
44498:{"w":"senior","e":"Women who apply for jobs in the middle or senior management have a higher success rate than men, according to an employment survey.","t":"一项就业情况调查显示，申请从事中级或**高级**管理工作的女性比申请同等职位的男性就业成功率高。"},
44499:{"w":"nevertheless","e":"He was tired. Nevertheless he kept on working.","t":"他累了，**不过**他仍然继续工作。"},
44500:{"w":"deposit","e":"Overseas students must pay a deposit when they apply for a course at the college.","t":"外国学生如果申请这所大学的课程，需要付一定的**押金**。"},
44501:{"w":"modest","e":"Although she won first prize, she remained modest and thanked her teachers for their help.","t":"她虽然得了一等奖，却依然很**谦虚**，还感谢了老师们的帮助。"},
44502:{"w":"dirt","e":"The kids came home from the park with dirt all over their shoes and clothes.","t":"孩子们从公园回到家，鞋子和衣服上全是**泥土**。"},
44503:{"w":"enquiry","e":"The library staff answered every enquiry from new students about borrowing books and using the computers.","t":"图书馆工作人员回答了新生关于借书和使用电脑的每一个**询问**。"},
44504:{"w":"continuous","e":"The continuous rain for a week caused serious floods in the south.","t":"一周**连续不断的**降雨在南方造成了严重的洪灾。"},
44505:{"w":"lobby","e":"They were lobbying for stronger environmental protection.","t":"他们在为加强环境保护而进行**游说**。"},
44506:{"w":"differ","e":"French differs from English in this respect.","t":"法语在这方面**不同于**英语。"},
44507:{"w":"brutal","e":"The brutal war destroyed thousands of homes and forced many families to leave the country.","t":"这场**残暴的**战争摧毁了成千上万个家园，迫使许多家庭离开祖国。"},
44508:{"w":"comprise","e":"The hotel comprises 82 one-bedroom apartments and 12 suites.","t":"这家酒店**有**82间单人床位的公寓和12间套房。"},
44509:{"w":"underline","e":"You can underline new words encountered in your reading.","t":"你可以在阅读中遇到的新单词下面**画线**做标记。"},
44510:{"w":"poverty","e":"In this country people were experiencing poverty, unemployment and famine.","t":"在这个国家，人们正在经受**贫困**、失业和饥饿的煎熬。"},
44511:{"w":"revolve","e":"Fifteen satellites all revolve about the planet's equator.","t":"15颗卫星都绕着这颗行星的赤道**旋转**。"},
44512:{"w":"male","e":"Only about thirty percent of the nurses in this hospital are male.","t":"这家医院的护士中只有约百分之三十是**男性**。"},
44513:{"w":"rely","e":"Most inland farmers rely on underground water for irrigation.","t":"大部分内陆农民都**依靠**地下水灌溉土地。"},
44514:{"w":"expense","e":"I am sure you will be concerned about expenses such as books and uniforms when your child starts studying.","t":"我敢肯定，当你的孩子开始上学时，你会关心书本、制服等**花费**。"},
44515:{"w":"proceed","e":"Our work is proceeding slowly.","t":"我们的工作**进程**缓慢。"},
44516:{"w":"effort","e":"Henry has put a lot of effort into communicating with new friends.","t":"亨利非常**努力**地与新朋友进行交流。"},
44517:{"w":"campus","e":"Most first-year students live on campus, so they can walk to their classes.","t":"大多数一年级学生住在**校园**里，可以走路去上课。"},
44518:{"w":"force","e":"She'd like to finish the studies she was forced to give up earlier in life.","t":"她想完成自己早年**被迫**放弃的研究。"},
44519:{"w":"accumulate","e":"The debris that accumulated at the foot of the volcano reached a depth, in places, of 200 feet.","t":"**堆积**在火山脚下的岩屑在一些地方有200英尺厚。"},
44520:{"w":"mold","e":"If you leave bread in a warm, wet place for too long, mold will grow on it.","t":"如果把面包在温暖潮湿的地方放太久，上面就会长出**霉菌**。"},
44521:{"w":"hydrogen","e":"Scientists hope that hydrogen can one day become a clean fuel for cars.","t":"科学家希望**氢气**有一天能成为汽车的清洁燃料。"},
44522:{"w":"cheat","e":"Tour operators try to cheat tourists.","t":"旅行社的工作人员试图**欺骗**游客。"},
44523:{"w":"cash","e":"You can withdraw cash from a cashpoint machine with a cashcard.","t":"你可以用提款卡在取款机上提取**现金**。"},
44524:{"w":"fog","e":"The fog was so thick this morning that drivers could hardly see the road ahead.","t":"今天早上**雾气**很浓，司机几乎看不清前面的路。"},
44525:{"w":"rare","e":"The giant panda is a rare animal that lives mainly in the mountains of China.","t":"大熊猫是一种**稀有**动物，主要生活在中国的山区。"},
44526:{"w":"discrimination","e":"The new law protects workers from discrimination because of their age or sex.","t":"新法律保护工人不因年龄或性别而受到**歧视**。"},
44527:{"w":"nitrogen","e":"Nitrogen makes up about seventy-eight percent of the air that we breathe every day.","t":"**氮气**约占我们每天呼吸的空气的百分之七十八。"},
44528:{"w":"echo","e":"When we shouted in the empty cave, we could hear the echo of our voices.","t":"我们在空荡荡的山洞里大喊时，能听到自己声音的**回声**。"},
44529:{"w":"virtue","e":"Honesty is a virtue that my parents taught me when I was very young.","t":"诚实是一种**美德**，是我很小的时候父母教给我的。"},
44530:{"w":"fluid","e":"Doctors tell people with a cold to rest and drink plenty of fluids such as water and juice.","t":"医生建议感冒的人多休息，多喝水和果汁等**液体**。"},
44531:{"w":"rival","e":"The rival team lost by 12 points in the first round.","t":"第一轮比赛中，**对手**队以12分之差败北。"},
44532:{"w":"insure","e":"Before driving the new car, you must insure it against accidents and theft.","t":"开新车之前，你必须给它**投保**，以防事故和盗窃。"},
44533:{"w":"drill","e":"The workers drilled a hole in the wall to put up a shelf for books.","t":"工人们在墙上**钻孔**，好装一个放书的架子。"},
44534:{"w":"collapse","e":"The whole market collapsed, as a matter of fact, and coffee became cheaper than it had been for the previous 25 years.","t":"事实上，（咖啡）市场全盘**崩溃**，咖啡的售价跌到25年来的最低。"},
44535:{"w":"violent","e":"The violent storm last night blew down several trees along our street.","t":"昨晚**猛烈**的暴风雨刮倒了我们街上的好几棵树。"},
44536:{"w":"understanding","e":"The Human Genome Project will open up new understanding of many ailments that afflict humanity.","t":"人类基因工程将开启人们对于困扰人类的很多疾病的全新**认识**。"},
44537:{"w":"despite","e":"Los Angeles suffers from chronic highway blockages, despite efforts to encourage people to use public transport.","t":"**尽管**当局积极鼓励人们使用公共交通工具，洛杉矶仍然长期存在公路拥堵现象。"},
44538:{"w":"react","e":"How did your parents react when you told them you wanted to study abroad?","t":"你告诉父母想出国留学时，他们有什么**反应**？"},
44539:{"w":"commission","e":"He now has a new commission to design a glass sculpture for the headquarters of a pizza company.","t":"他现在有新的**委托事务**，为一家比萨公司的总部大楼设计一件玻璃雕塑。"},
44540:{"w":"corridor","e":"You will notice that at the end of each corridor there is another door, but these are fire doors.","t":"你会注意到在每一条**走廊**的尽头都有另一扇门，但这些是防火门。"},
44541:{"w":"odd","e":"We are attracted by the odd behavior of the boy.","t":"男孩**古怪**的行为吸引了我们。"},
44542:{"w":"undertake","e":"Mary undertook the organization of the whole scheme.","t":"玛丽**负责**整个计划的组织工作。"},
44543:{"w":"pit","e":"The workers dug a deep pit in the ground to plant the large tree.","t":"工人们在地上挖了一个深深的**土坑**，用来种那棵大树。"},
44544:{"w":"diverse","e":"Millions of years ago, changes in the Earth's climate gave rise to diverse species in the tropical rain forest.","t":"数百万年前，地球气候的变化导致了这片热带雨林物种的**多样**性。"},
44545:{"w":"salary","e":"She spends a third of her monthly salary on rent for her small flat.","t":"她把每月**薪水**的三分之一都花在了小公寓的房租上。"},
44546:{"w":"counter","e":"The woman behind the counter smiled and handed me my coffee and change.","t":"**柜台**后面的女士微笑着把咖啡和找的零钱递给我。"},
44547:{"w":"manual","e":"You should read the instruction manual carefully before fixing the air-conditioner.","t":"安装空调前你应该仔细阅读指导**手册**。"},
44548:{"w":"jaw","e":"He fell off his bike and hurt his jaw, so it was painful to eat.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，伤了**下颌**，吃东西都疼。"},
44549:{"w":"balcony","e":"From your cabin balcony you'll find that you cannot see anyone else and the only sound you should hear is the birds' singing.","t":"从你小屋的**阳台**看不到任何人，听到的只有鸟鸣。"},
44550:{"w":"uncover","e":"The reporter worked for months to uncover the truth about the factory's pollution.","t":"这名记者花了几个月时间**揭露**工厂污染的真相。"},
44551:{"w":"skilled","e":"The factory is looking for skilled workers who can repair old machines.","t":"这家工厂正在招聘会修理旧机器的**熟练**工人。"},
44552:{"w":"diplomatic","e":"The two countries have had good diplomatic relations for over fifty years.","t":"两国保持良好的**外交**关系已经五十多年了。"},
44553:{"w":"ban","e":"The city decided to ban smoking in all restaurants, offices and other public places.","t":"该市决定在所有餐馆、办公室和其他公共场所**禁止**吸烟。"},
44554:{"w":"merry","e":"The children sang merry songs around the Christmas tree on Christmas Eve.","t":"平安夜，孩子们围着圣诞树唱着**欢乐的**歌。"},
44555:{"w":"cigar","e":"My grandfather used to smoke a cigar after dinner, but he gave it up.","t":"我爷爷以前晚饭后会抽一支**雪茄**，但后来戒掉了。"},
44556:{"w":"confront","e":"She finally found the courage to confront her fears and speak in front of the class.","t":"她终于鼓起勇气**正视**自己的恐惧，在全班面前发言。"},
44557:{"w":"undo","e":"My fingers were so cold that I could not undo the buttons on my coat.","t":"我的手指冻僵了，怎么也没法**解开**大衣的扣子。"},
44558:{"w":"bathe","e":"Every evening my mother bathes the baby and then puts her to bed.","t":"每天晚上，妈妈先给宝宝**洗澡**，然后哄她睡觉。"},
44559:{"w":"undergo","e":"My grandmother will undergo an operation on her knee at the city hospital next week.","t":"我奶奶下周要在市医院**接受**膝盖手术。"},
44560:{"w":"precious","e":"Time with my family is precious to me, so I turn off my phone at dinner.","t":"和家人在一起的时间对我来说很**宝贵**，所以吃晚饭时我会关掉手机。"},
44561:{"w":"conquer","e":"Many people have made attempts to conquer the peaks of Everest.","t":"许多人都试图**征服**珠穆朗玛峰。"},
44562:{"w":"journal","e":"We are grateful to the author and the Asia Pacific Journal of Human Resources for allowing us to use the material.","t":"我们感激作者及《亚太人力资源》**杂志**允许我们使用这些材料。"},
44563:{"w":"undoubtedly","e":"She is undoubtedly the best player on our team, and everyone wants to learn from her.","t":"**毋庸置疑**，她是我们队最好的球员，大家都想向她学习。"},
44564:{"w":"inflation","e":"Inflation reduced the purchasing power of the families.","t":"**通货膨胀**降低了家庭的购买力。"},
44565:{"w":"emperor","e":"The emperor lived in a huge palace with hundreds of servants around him.","t":"**皇帝**住在一座巨大的宫殿里，身边有数百名仆人。"},
44566:{"w":"globe","e":"The teacher pointed to China on the globe and asked us to find our city.","t":"老师指着**地球仪**上的中国，让我们找出自己的城市。"},
44567:{"w":"bridegroom","e":"At the wedding, the bridegroom gave a short speech to thank all the guests.","t":"婚礼上，**新郎**做了简短的讲话，感谢所有来宾。"},
44568:{"w":"undergraduate","e":"The Universities of Oxford and Cambridge recently held joint conferences to discuss the noticeably rapid decline in literacy among undergraduates.","t":"牛津大学和剑桥大学近期召开了几次联合会议，讨论**本科生**文化水平显著快速下降的问题。"},
44569:{"w":"mosquito","e":"I couldn't sleep last night because a mosquito kept flying around my ear.","t":"昨晚我睡不着，因为有只**蚊子**一直在我耳边飞。"},
44570:{"w":"heir","e":"The man murdered the legal heir and disguised himself as his victim.","t":"该男子谋杀了合法**继承人**并冒名顶替。"},
44571:{"w":"circular","e":"We sat around a large circular table and talked about our plans for the summer.","t":"我们围坐在一张**圆形**大桌旁，谈论暑假的计划。"},
44572:{"w":"favourable","e":"The weather was favourable, so the farmers had a good harvest this year.","t":"今年天气条件**有利**，农民们获得了好收成。"},
44573:{"w":"brochure","e":"Please inform us of your trade terms and forward samples and a product brochure.","t":"请告知贵方的交易条款，并寄来货样及产品**小册子**。"},
44574:{"w":"dictate","e":"The manager dictated a letter to his secretary.","t":"经理向他的秘书**口述**一封信函。"},
44575:{"w":"sightseeing","e":"We spent the whole day sightseeing in the old part of the city.","t":"我们花了一整天在老城区**观光**。"},
44576:{"w":"chorus","e":"The chorus usually plays a large part in the music festival.","t":"**合唱**在音乐节上通常扮演着重要的角色。"},
44577:{"w":"inform","e":"Fancy Foods wishes to inform the public that pieces of metal have been found in some jars of Fancy Foods Chicken Curry (Spicy).","t":"美食公司希望**告知**大众，在他们生产的一些咖喱（辣）鸡块罐头中发现有金属碎片。"},
44578:{"w":"economic","e":"After years of fast economic growth, the city now has many new roads and buildings.","t":"经过多年的快速**经济**增长，这座城市现在有了许多新的道路和建筑。"},
44579:{"w":"deficient","e":"A diet that is deficient in vitamin C can make people feel weak and tired.","t":"**缺乏**维生素 C 的饮食会让人感到虚弱和疲倦。"},
44580:{"w":"underground","e":"Water from the underground rivers bubbles to the surface as springs.","t":"**地下**河的水以泉水的形式冒出地表。"},
44581:{"w":"endanger","e":"Driving too fast on wet roads can endanger your life and the lives of others.","t":"在湿滑的路上开快车会**危及**你和他人的生命。"},
44582:{"w":"hook","e":"Paul hooked his tractor to the car and pulled it to safety.","t":"保罗把他的拖拉机**挂**在那辆小汽车上，然后把它拖到安全的地方。"},
44583:{"w":"multiple","e":"Those devices have multiple purposes.","t":"那些装置具备**多重**功能。"},
44584:{"w":"circus","e":"The circus trainer snapped his whip.","t":"**马戏团**驯兽师把鞭子抽得啪啪响。"},
44585:{"w":"purity","e":"The company tests the purity of the water before selling it in bottles.","t":"公司在装瓶出售之前，会检测水是否**纯净**。"},
44586:{"w":"thermometer","e":"The thermometer outside the window showed that it was ten degrees below zero.","t":"窗外的**温度计**显示气温是零下十度。"},
44587:{"w":"cheerful","e":"Despite the bad weather, she stayed cheerful and kept smiling all day.","t":"尽管天气不好，她依然很**愉快**，一整天都面带微笑。"},
44588:{"w":"heave","e":"The two men heaved the heavy sofa up the stairs to the third floor.","t":"两个男人把沉重的沙发**用力抬**上了三楼。"},
44589:{"w":"worthwhile","e":"Visiting the old town is worthwhile, even though it takes three hours to get there.","t":"虽然要花三个小时才能到，但那个古镇还是**值得**一去。"},
44590:{"w":"advertise","e":"The total number of jobs advertised in the journal was 120.","t":"这本杂志上**刊登**了120个职位。"},
44591:{"w":"unless","e":"You will not pass the exam unless you start studying harder right now.","t":"**除非**你现在开始更努力地学习，否则考试会不及格。"},
44592:{"w":"scenery","e":"The scenery is as beautiful as a painting.","t":"这里**风景**美丽如画。"},
44593:{"w":"confidential","e":"The old man was accused of leaking national confidential information to foreign countries.","t":"这个老头因为向国外泄露国家**机密**而被指控。"},
44594:{"w":"excessive","e":"Each month, managers would analyse the pattern of absence of staff with excessive sick leave.","t":"每个月，经理们都会分析请**过多**病假的员工的缺勤模式。"},
44595:{"w":"terror","e":"The little girl screamed in terror when she saw a big snake in the garden.","t":"小女孩看到花园里有条大蛇，**惊恐**地尖叫起来。"},
44596:{"w":"unite","e":"The people of the two villages united to build a new road through the hills.","t":"两个村庄的人**联合**起来，修了一条穿过山区的新路。"},
44597:{"w":"marine","e":"Plastic waste in the sea kills thousands of marine animals every year.","t":"海里的塑料垃圾每年导致成千上万只**海洋**动物死亡。"},
44598:{"w":"average","e":"How many hours a day on average do you watch TV?","t":"你**平均**每天看几个小时电视？"},
44599:{"w":"secure","e":"The person won his eighth Olympic gold medal, and secured his place in history.","t":"那个人赢得了他的第八块奥运会金牌，**巩固**了其历史地位。"},
44600:{"w":"behalf","e":"He made an impassioned speech on behalf of his country.","t":"他**代表**他的国家发表了热情洋溢的演说。"},
44601:{"w":"democracy","e":"In a democracy, people choose their leaders by voting in free elections.","t":"在**民主国家**，人们通过自由选举投票选出领导人。"},
44602:{"w":"mineral","e":"Fresh fruit and vegetables are rich in vitamins and minerals that our bodies need.","t":"新鲜水果和蔬菜富含人体所需的维生素和**矿物质**。"},
44603:{"w":"advanced","e":"Prehistoric Amazonians developed technology and art that were advanced for their time.","t":"史前亚马孙人创造了当时**先进**的技术和艺术。"},
44604:{"w":"obstacle","e":"An obstacle, setback or delay means only one thing: it's not time for your goal to be completed yet.","t":"一个**障碍**、挫败或延迟只意味着一件事：现在还不是你实现目标的时候。"},
44605:{"w":"lane","e":"We walked slowly along a narrow country lane between the green fields.","t":"我们沿着绿油油的田野间一条窄窄的**乡间小路**慢慢地走着。"},
44606:{"w":"soda","e":"On hot days, the kids like to buy a bottle of cold soda after school.","t":"天热的时候，孩子们放学后喜欢买一瓶冰**汽水**。"},
44607:{"w":"slap","e":"My friend slapped me on the back and said, \"Well done, you passed the exam!\"","t":"朋友在我背上**拍了一下**，说：“干得好，你考过了！”"},
44608:{"w":"beloved","e":"The old man still keeps a photo of his beloved wife in his wallet.","t":"老人的钱包里至今还放着他**深爱的**妻子的照片。"},
44609:{"w":"adjust","e":"You can adjust the height of the chair by pulling this handle.","t":"拉这个把手就可以**调节**椅子的高度。"},
44610:{"w":"occur","e":"The accident occurred on a rainy night when the road was wet and dark.","t":"事故**发生**在一个雨夜，当时路面又湿又暗。"},
44611:{"w":"adapt","e":"All those older buildings in the city have been adapted for present-day use.","t":"城里的旧建筑已经全部经过**改造**，以作今日之用。"},
44612:{"w":"leader","e":"The team leader asked everyone to share their ideas at the weekly meeting.","t":"团队**领导**请每个人在每周例会上分享自己的想法。"},
44613:{"w":"nuisance","e":"The loud music from next door is a real nuisance when I am trying to study.","t":"我想学习的时候，隔壁传来的吵闹音乐真让人**讨厌**。"},
44614:{"w":"mislead","e":"Some advertisements mislead people into thinking that a product is healthier than it really is.","t":"有些广告**误导**人们，让他们以为某种产品比实际更健康。"},
44615:{"w":"accordingly","e":"The bus was late, and accordingly we missed the first part of the concert.","t":"公共汽车晚点了，**因此**我们错过了音乐会的开头部分。"},
44616:{"w":"significance","e":"The real significance of the first Kodak camera was that it was backed up by a developing and printing service.","t":"第一代柯达相机的真正**意义**在于它可以连接冲洗和打印设备。"},
44617:{"w":"drag","e":"The box was too heavy to carry, so we had to drag it across the floor.","t":"箱子太重搬不动，我们只好把它从地板上**拖**过去。"},
44618:{"w":"spelling","e":"Please check your spelling carefully before you hand in your English homework.","t":"交英语作业之前，请仔细检查一下**拼写**。"},
44619:{"w":"up-to-date","e":"This map is not up-to-date, so some of the new roads are missing.","t":"这张地图不是**最新的**，所以有些新修的路没有标出来。"},
44620:{"w":"flash","e":"The camera's flash was so bright that I closed my eyes in the photo.","t":"相机的**闪光灯**太亮了，我在照片里闭上了眼睛。"},
44621:{"w":"anxiety","e":"Many students feel a lot of anxiety in the weeks before their final exams.","t":"许多学生在期末考试前几周感到非常**焦虑**。"},
44622:{"w":"electric","e":"More and more people in China are buying electric cars because they are cheaper to run.","t":"中国越来越多的人购买**电动**汽车，因为使用成本更低。"},
44623:{"w":"immigrant","e":"This immigrant's citizenship was revoked because he had concealed his criminal record.","t":"这位**移民**因为隐瞒了犯罪记录而被取消了国籍。"},
44624:{"w":"ridiculous","e":"The fat old man looked ridiculous in his tight pink trousers.","t":"那个胖老头穿着粉色的紧身裤，显得**滑稽可笑**。"},
44625:{"w":"justify","e":"To justify this claim, the arguer provided a lot of evidence.","t":"为了**证明**这个主张是正当的，论证者提供了许多证据。"},
44626:{"w":"exclusive","e":"He is part of an exclusive social circle.","t":"他所属的社交圈子很**排外**。"},
44627:{"w":"divorce","e":"After ten years of marriage, they decided to get a divorce and live separately.","t":"结婚十年后，他们决定**离婚**，分开生活。"},
44628:{"w":"neglect","e":"After years of neglect, single speed cycles still manage to function, though not always too efficiently.","t":"在被**忽视**多年之后，单速自行车尽管往往效率不高，但依然发挥着作用。"},
44629:{"w":"increasingly","e":"In recent years, online shopping has become increasingly popular among older people.","t":"近年来，网购在老年人中**日益**流行。"},
44630:{"w":"headquarters","e":"The daily paper is compiled at the editorial headquarters.","t":"日报由编辑部**总部**编纂。"},
44631:{"w":"union","e":"The workers joined the union to ask for better pay and safer working conditions.","t":"工人们加入了**工会**，要求更高的工资和更安全的工作条件。"},
44632:{"w":"palm","e":"The little boy held a small bird gently in the palm of his hand.","t":"小男孩把一只小鸟轻轻地捧在**手掌**里。"},
44633:{"w":"commerce","e":"In the US, Washington is the seat of government and New York is the chief seat of commerce.","t":"在美国，华盛顿是政府所在地，纽约是主要的**商业**中心。"},
44634:{"w":"roller","e":"The huge roller can press melted metal into thin sheets which are the raw material of knives.","t":"大型**滚筒**可以将熔化的金属压成薄片，作为刀具的原材料。"},
44635:{"w":"namely","e":"Only two students passed the hard test, namely Tom and Lucy from Class Three.","t":"只有两名学生通过了这次很难的考试，**也就是**三班的汤姆和露西。"},
44636:{"w":"dropout","e":"As a high school dropout, he found it hard to get a good job in the city.","t":"作为一名高中**辍学生**，他发现在城里很难找到好工作。"},
44637:{"w":"formation","e":"The teacher explained the formation of clouds with a simple experiment in class.","t":"老师在课上用一个简单的实验讲解了云的**形成**。"},
44638:{"w":"indoor","e":"On rainy days, the children play indoor games such as chess and cards.","t":"下雨天，孩子们玩下棋、打牌之类的**室内**游戏。"},
44639:{"w":"contaminate","e":"Chemical fertilisers and pesticides may contaminate water supplies.","t":"化肥和杀虫剂可能会**污染**水源。"},
44640:{"w":"punctual","e":"Being punctual shows your clients that you respect their schedule and that you can be counted on.","t":"**守时**会让你的客户觉得，你尊重他们的安排，并且值得信赖。"},
44641:{"w":"universe","e":"Not only did the rocket solve a problem that had intrigued man for ages, but, more importantly, it literally opened the door to exploration of the universe.","t":"火箭不仅解决了困扰几代人的一个问题，更重要的是，它开启了探索**宇宙**的大门。"},
44642:{"w":"diplomat","e":"The young diplomat speaks four languages and has worked in many countries.","t":"这位年轻的**外交官**会说四种语言，在许多国家工作过。"},
44643:{"w":"relieve","e":"A cup of hot tea with honey can help relieve a sore throat.","t":"一杯加了蜂蜜的热茶能帮助**缓解**喉咙痛。"},
44644:{"w":"burst","e":"Water pipes often burst in cold weather.","t":"水管在寒冷的天气里经常冻**裂**。"},
44645:{"w":"cornerstone","e":"Trust is the cornerstone of a good friendship, so never lie to your friends.","t":"信任是美好友谊的**基础**，所以永远不要对朋友撒谎。"},
44646:{"w":"candy","e":"The children were given some candy after they finished cleaning the classroom.","t":"孩子们打扫完教室后，每人得到了一些**糖果**。"},
44647:{"w":"preferable","e":"I'm not sure the cure is preferable to the disease.","t":"我不太确定这种疗法是否比疾病本身**更可取**。"},
44648:{"w":"envelope","e":"Please write your address clearly on the front of the envelope before you post it.","t":"寄信之前，请在**信封**正面写清楚你的地址。"},
44649:{"w":"spokesman","e":"A spokesman for the company said the new product would be on sale next month.","t":"该公司的一位**发言人**说，新产品将于下个月上市。"},
44650:{"w":"filter","e":"We always filter the water from the river before we drink it at the camp.","t":"在营地，我们总是先把河水**过滤**一下再喝。"},
44651:{"w":"dove","e":"A white dove is often used as a symbol of peace around the world.","t":"在世界各地，白色的**鸽子**常被用作和平的象征。"},
44652:{"w":"employer","e":"Many employers prefer to hire graduates who already have some work experience.","t":"许多**雇主**更愿意雇用已有一些工作经验的毕业生。"},
44653:{"w":"anyhow","e":"It was raining hard, but we decided to go to the park anyhow.","t":"雨下得很大，但我们决定**无论如何**都要去公园。"},
44654:{"w":"contempt","e":"She looked at the rude man with contempt and walked away without a word.","t":"她**轻蔑**地看了那个粗鲁的男人一眼，一句话没说就走了。"},
44655:{"w":"unique","e":"Biometric security systems operate by storing a digitised record of some unique human features.","t":"生物测定安全系统通过储存某些**独特**的人类特征的数字化记录来运行。"},
44656:{"w":"score","e":"She scored ninety-five points in the English test and was the top student in class.","t":"她英语考试**得了**九十五分，是班上第一名。"},
44657:{"w":"diploma","e":"Tim got a diploma at a private college.","t":"蒂姆拿到了一所私立学院的**毕业证书**。"},
44658:{"w":"mathematics","e":"Mathematics was my weakest subject at school, but now I enjoy solving number puzzles.","t":"上学时**数学**是我最差的科目，可现在我喜欢解数字谜题。"},
44659:{"w":"qualify","e":"After four years of hard study, she finally qualified as a doctor last summer.","t":"经过四年的刻苦学习，她去年夏天终于**有资格**当医生了。"},
44660:{"w":"battalion","e":"A battalion of soldiers was sent to help the villagers after the flood.","t":"洪水过后，**一个营**的士兵被派去帮助村民。"},
44661:{"w":"herd","e":"A herd of cows was eating grass quietly on the green hill.","t":"**一群**奶牛正在绿色的山坡上安静地吃草。"},
44662:{"w":"global","e":"Does the media in your country pay more attention to global or national events?","t":"你们国家的媒体更关注**全球**事件还是国内事件？"},
44663:{"w":"recycle","e":"The man collects the waste bins and deposits the waste into a shredder for recycling.","t":"这个人把垃圾箱收集起来，把垃圾倒进搅碎机进行**回收利用**。"},
44664:{"w":"uneasy","e":"He was uneasy about the results of the final exams.","t":"他为期末考试成绩**忧心忡忡**。"},
44665:{"w":"flock","e":"Every evening a large flock of birds flies over the lake towards the forest.","t":"每天傍晚，**一大群**鸟飞过湖面，飞向森林。"},
44666:{"w":"campaign","e":"Local authorities in London campaigned to be allowed to enforce anti-pollution laws themselves.","t":"伦敦当地政权发起一场要求赋予他们执行反污染法案权力的**运动**。"},
44667:{"w":"torture","e":"Waiting two weeks for the exam results felt like torture to the nervous students.","t":"对紧张的学生们来说，等两周考试成绩简直是一种**折磨**。"},
44668:{"w":"largely","e":"His success was largely due to hard work rather than good luck.","t":"他的成功**大部分**归功于努力，而不是好运气。"},
44669:{"w":"psychological","e":"Losing a job can have serious psychological effects, such as anxiety and low self-esteem.","t":"失业可能带来严重的**心理**影响，比如焦虑和自卑。"},
44670:{"w":"fashion","e":"Short skirts were the fashion that summer, and almost every girl in town wore one.","t":"那年夏天短裙是**时尚**，镇上几乎每个女孩都穿。"},
44671:{"w":"protective","e":"All workers on the building site must wear protective helmets and strong boots.","t":"工地上的所有工人都必须戴**防护**头盔、穿结实的靴子。"},
44672:{"w":"contradiction","e":"There is a contradiction between what he says and what he actually does.","t":"他说的和他实际做的之间存在**矛盾**。"},
44673:{"w":"incident","e":"The police are asking anyone who saw the incident outside the bank to call them.","t":"警方请所有目睹银行门外那起**事件**的人给他们打电话。"},
44674:{"w":"utility","e":"One of many reforms came in the area of public utilities.","t":"众多改革措施中有一条涉及**公用事业**的变革。"},
44675:{"w":"dose","e":"Nick injected the dog with a strong dose of morphine.","t":"尼克给狗注射了**一剂**强效吗啡。"},
44676:{"w":"upset","e":"The coming final exam upsets the students a lot.","t":"期末考试即将来临，学生们**心烦意乱**。"},
44677:{"w":"jet","e":"A huge jet flew low over our house on its way to the airport.","t":"一架巨大的**喷气式飞机**低空飞过我家房子，飞往机场。"},
44678:{"w":"vacation","e":"She's going to Florida for vacation.","t":"她要去佛罗里达**度假**。"},
44679:{"w":"mud","e":"After the heavy rain, the children came home with mud all over their shoes.","t":"大雨过后，孩子们回家时鞋上沾满了**泥巴**。"},
44680:{"w":"coordinate","e":"The teacher coordinated the work of the three groups so the project finished on time.","t":"老师**协调**了三个小组的工作，让项目按时完成了。"},
44681:{"w":"immediately","e":"You go down to the end of this corridor and turn right. The computer lab is immediately on your right.","t":"走到走廊尽头向右拐，右手边**就**是机房。"},
44682:{"w":"underneath","e":"I found my lost keys underneath the sofa when I was cleaning the living room.","t":"我打扫客厅时，在沙发**底下**找到了丢失的钥匙。"},
44683:{"w":"restore","e":"The government has been trying to restore public confidence in its management of the economy since the breakout of economic crisis.","t":"自经济危机爆发以来，该政府就一直试图**重建**公众对其掌控经济能力的信心。"},
44684:{"w":"vacuum","e":"The vacuum flask can keep drinks hot.","t":"**真空**保温瓶可以保持饮料的温度。"},
44685:{"w":"recover","e":"After a few days of cough, my roommate began to recover.","t":"咳嗽了几天后，我的室友开始**康复**了。"},
44686:{"w":"receipt","e":"It is a common rule that goods will be delivered on receipt of payment.","t":"只有在**收到**货款后才可以交货，这是一条普遍的规则。"},
44687:{"w":"ore","e":"The workers dig iron ore out of the mountain and send it to the steel factory.","t":"工人们从山里挖出铁**矿石**，运到钢铁厂。"},
44688:{"w":"emphasize","e":"This report emphasizes that cancer is not caused by a single element in cigarette smoke.","t":"这一报告**强调**，癌症并不是由香烟烟雾中的某单一成分导致的。"},
44689:{"w":"contrary","e":"Contrary to what you might imagine, the size of the cycle is not determined by the size of the wheels, but by the size of the frame.","t":"与你可能想象的**相反**，自行车的大小不是由车轮的尺寸决定的，而是由车架的大小决定的。"},
44690:{"w":"cattle","e":"The farmer feeds his cattle fresh grass every morning before he goes to the fields.","t":"农夫每天早上下地前都给他的**牲口**喂新鲜的草。"},
44691:{"w":"theory","e":"Tom once put forward an attractive though unlikely theory.","t":"汤姆曾经提出一个具有吸引力但不太可能的**理论**。"},
44692:{"w":"hardware","e":"You can buy nails, tools and other hardware at the small shop on the corner.","t":"在街角那家小店里可以买到钉子、工具和其他**五金器具**。"},
44693:{"w":"barn","e":"The farmer keeps his cows in the old red barn behind the house.","t":"农夫把奶牛关在房子后面那座旧的红色**牲口棚**里。"},
44694:{"w":"myth","e":"Children love the old Greek myth about the boy who flew too close to the sun.","t":"孩子们喜欢那个讲男孩飞得离太阳太近的古希腊**神话**。"},
44695:{"w":"bloom","e":"The cherry trees in the park bloom every April, and many people come to see them.","t":"公园里的樱桃树每年四月**开花**，很多人都来观赏。"},
44696:{"w":"laser","e":"Doctors can now use a laser to treat some eye problems quickly and safely.","t":"医生现在可以用**激光**快速而安全地治疗一些眼病。"},
44697:{"w":"trim","e":"My father trims the bushes in front of our house every spring and autumn.","t":"我爸爸每年春天和秋天都会**修剪**我们家门前的灌木。"},
44698:{"w":"dragon","e":"The story is about a brave girl who saves her village from a fierce dragon.","t":"这个故事讲的是一个勇敢的女孩从一条凶猛的**巨龙**手中救下了村子。"},
44699:{"w":"initiative","e":"The major initiative by this car-manufacturing company was to adopt a totally multi-skilled workforce.","t":"这家汽车制造厂采取的主要**措施**是雇用掌握多种技能的工人。"},
44700:{"w":"relate","e":"That's the office that deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"那间就是负责处理所有**有关**学生福利待遇问题的办公室。"},
44701:{"w":"specimen","e":"Anton is observing the specimen with a magnifying glass.","t":"安东正在用放大镜观察这个**标本**。"},
44702:{"w":"compel","e":"The boss compels workers to spend more time on the job.","t":"老板**强迫**工人花更多的时间在工作上。"},
44703:{"w":"extraordinary","e":"It's extraordinary that he managed to sleep through the party.","t":"真**想不到**他竟然从聚会一开始一直睡到结束。"},
44704:{"w":"chew","e":"Rats like to chew on something hard.","t":"老鼠喜欢**咀嚼**硬物。"},
44705:{"w":"heroine","e":"The heroine of the novel is a young doctor who works in a poor village.","t":"这部小说的**女主角**是一位在贫困村庄工作的年轻医生。"},
44706:{"w":"debt","e":"It took him five years to pay off all his debts after he lost his job.","t":"他失业后花了五年时间才还清所有**债务**。"},
44707:{"w":"utmost","e":"This information is of the utmost importance, so please read it carefully.","t":"这条信息**极其**重要，所以请仔细阅读。"},
44708:{"w":"consensus","e":"The general consensus is that the reform is a good thing.","t":"改革是件好事，这是**共识**。"},
44709:{"w":"urge","e":"The doctor urged him to stop smoking and to take more exercise.","t":"医生**催促**他戒烟，多做运动。"},
44710:{"w":"original","e":"Their original house was converted into a residential college.","t":"他们**最初**的房子被改建成了一所寄宿学校。"},
44711:{"w":"infrastructure","e":"How does the port change a city's infrastructure?","t":"港口如何改变一个城市的**基础结构**？"},
44712:{"w":"qualification","e":"You can select someone—even a friend—who has the qualifications, degrees and certificates.","t":"你可以选有**资格**、学位和证书的人，甚至可以是朋友。"},
44713:{"w":"religion","e":"The speaker explained the relevance of the religion to the local people.","t":"演讲者说明了**宗教**对于当地人的重要意义。"},
44714:{"w":"consolidate","e":"Doing exercises after each class helps students consolidate what they have learned that day.","t":"每节课后做练习能帮助学生**巩固**当天学到的知识。"},
44715:{"w":"satellite","e":"Weather reports use pictures from satellites to show where the storms are moving.","t":"天气预报用**卫星**拍摄的图片来显示暴风雨的移动方向。"},
44716:{"w":"beyond","e":"The small village lies beyond the mountains, about two hours from the city by car.","t":"那个小村庄在山的**那边**，离城市大约两小时车程。"},
44717:{"w":"disable","e":"There were so many people disabled and killed in the war.","t":"这场战争造成了太多人的**伤残**和死亡。"},
44718:{"w":"urgent","e":"His car is in urgent need of repair.","t":"他的汽车**急需**修理。"},
44719:{"w":"vacant","e":"A vacant room is very difficult to find in this district after nine o'clock.","t":"九点之后，很难在这个区找到**空**房间。"},
44720:{"w":"bribe","e":"The officer was sent to prison for trying to take a bribe from a businessman.","t":"那名官员因企图收受一名商人的**贿赂**而被送进监狱。"},
44721:{"w":"cliff","e":"We stood at the edge of the cliff and looked down at the sea.","t":"我们站在**悬崖**边上，俯视着大海。"},
44722:{"w":"conclude","e":"After looking at all the evidence, the police concluded that the fire was an accident.","t":"看过所有证据后，警方**推断出**这场火灾是一场意外。"},
44723:{"w":"clarity","e":"This article was written with clarity.","t":"这篇文章思路**清晰**。"},
44724:{"w":"restrain","e":"The doctors restrained the patient from hurting himself.","t":"医生**制止**了病人的自残行为。"},
44725:{"w":"restrict","e":"A student loan is not restricted to those who receive a maintenance grant in this school.","t":"在这所学校，学生贷款并不**限于**那些领生活补助金的学生。"},
44726:{"w":"disapprove","e":"They disapprove of paying farmers who have not cultivated the land.","t":"他们**不赞成**付钱给未耕种土地的农民。"},
44727:{"w":"carpet","e":"Please take off your shoes before you walk on the new carpet in the living room.","t":"走上客厅的新**地毯**之前，请先脱鞋。"},
44728:{"w":"fairly","e":"I felt she hadn't treated me fairly.","t":"我觉得她没有**公平**地对待我。"},
44729:{"w":"proclaim","e":"It was the famous speech delivered by the President in which he proclaimed that the country was independent.","t":"正是在那次著名演说中，总统**宣布**该国独立了。"},
44730:{"w":"peer","e":"Teenagers often care more about what their peers think than about what their parents say.","t":"青少年往往更在乎**同龄人**的看法，而不是父母的话。"},
44731:{"w":"sailor","e":"The young sailor had never seen such a big storm in his life at sea.","t":"那个年轻的**水手**在海上从没见过这么大的风暴。"},
44732:{"w":"reunite","e":"The lost child was reunited with his parents in the police station.","t":"那个走失的孩子和他的父母在警察局**重聚**了。"},
44733:{"w":"highway","e":"There was a terrible accident on the highway this morning, and traffic was stopped for hours.","t":"今天早上**公路**上发生了一起严重事故，交通中断了好几个小时。"},
44734:{"w":"remark","e":"Several visitors remarked that the city was much cleaner than they had expected.","t":"好几位游客**评论**说，这座城市比他们想象的干净得多。"},
44735:{"w":"stride","e":"The teacher strode into the classroom and told everyone to sit down quietly.","t":"老师**大步走**进教室，让大家安静坐好。"},
44736:{"w":"breed","e":"Rabbits breed very quickly.","t":"兔子**繁殖**得非常快。"},
44737:{"w":"assure","e":"The young boy assured us of his ability to solve the problem.","t":"那个小男孩向我们**保证**他有能力解决这问题。"},
44738:{"w":"telecommunications","e":"Modern telecommunications make it easy to talk to friends on the other side of the world.","t":"现代**通信**技术让人们和世界另一端的朋友交谈变得很容易。"},
44739:{"w":"attempt","e":"She attempted to climb the mountain alone, but bad weather forced her to turn back.","t":"她**试图**独自攀登那座山，但恶劣的天气迫使她折返。"},
44740:{"w":"balance","e":"It is hard for many students to balance their studies and part-time jobs.","t":"对许多学生来说，在学业和兼职工作之间**取得平衡**很难。"},
44741:{"w":"seemingly","e":"The seemingly easy question turned out to be the hardest one in the whole exam.","t":"这道**看上去**简单的题，结果是整场考试中最难的一道。"},
44742:{"w":"basis","e":"Students are chosen for the team on the basis of their skills, not their age.","t":"学生入选球队的**根据**是技术，而不是年龄。"},
44743:{"w":"injection","e":"The nurse gave the little boy an injection in his arm, and he didn't even cry.","t":"护士在小男孩胳膊上**打了一针**，他连哭都没哭。"},
44744:{"w":"implement","e":"Policy makers struggle to define and implement appropriate legislation.","t":"政策制定者们致力于阐释和**执行**适当的法规。"},
44745:{"w":"contact","e":"For further details, contact Mr. Smith, please.","t":"欲知详情，请与史密斯先生**联系**。"},
44746:{"w":"laboratory","e":"Students must wear safety glasses when they do experiments in the chemistry laboratory.","t":"学生在化学**实验室**做实验时必须戴护目镜。"},
44747:{"w":"remind","e":"The notice reminds students that if they park a motor vehicle on university premises without a valid permit, they will be fined.","t":"这个通知**提醒**学生们：未经允许就在校园里停放机动车会被罚款。"},
44748:{"w":"guarantee","e":"The box is made of stainless steel which is guaranteed for 20 years.","t":"这个盒子是不锈钢的，品质**保证**期限为20年。"},
44749:{"w":"vanish","e":"The cat ran under the car and vanished before I could catch it.","t":"猫钻到车底下，我还没来得及抓住它，它就**消失**了。"},
44750:{"w":"inquiry","e":"The hotel received many inquiries about room prices after it opened its new swimming pool.","t":"酒店新游泳池开放后，收到了很多关于房价的**询问**。"},
44751:{"w":"rib","e":"He fell off his bike and broke a rib, so it hurt when he laughed.","t":"他从自行车上摔下来，摔断了一根**肋骨**，所以一笑就疼。"},
44752:{"w":"experimental","e":"The new medicine is still at the experimental stage and is not yet sold in shops.","t":"这种新药还处于**试验**阶段，尚未在药店出售。"},
44753:{"w":"pint","e":"Every morning my father drinks a pint of fresh milk with his bread.","t":"每天早上，爸爸吃面包时都要喝一**品脱**鲜牛奶。"},
44754:{"w":"obvious","e":"It was obvious from her red eyes that she had been crying.","t":"从她红红的眼睛看得出来，很**明显**她刚哭过。"},
44755:{"w":"sake","e":"For the sake of your health, you should go to bed earlier every night.","t":"**为了**你的健康，你每晚都应该早点睡。"},
44756:{"w":"engine","e":"The car would not start this morning because something was wrong with the engine.","t":"今天早上车发动不起来，因为**发动机**出了毛病。"},
44757:{"w":"geometry","e":"Reading novels during geometry class is a misuse of your time.","t":"在**几何**课上看小说是滥用你自己的时间。"},
44758:{"w":"keen","e":"Dogs have a keen sense of smell and can find people lost in the snow.","t":"狗的嗅觉很**敏锐**，能找到在雪地里迷路的人。"},
44759:{"w":"bid","e":"Our company made a bid for the new bridge project, but we lost to a bigger firm.","t":"我们公司为新大桥项目**投标**，但输给了一家更大的公司。"},
44760:{"w":"butcher","e":"My mother bought some fresh meat from the butcher at the market this morning.","t":"今天早上妈妈在市场上从**肉贩**那儿买了些新鲜的肉。"},
44761:{"w":"vapour","e":"When water is heated to 100 degrees, it turns into vapour and rises into the air.","t":"水被加热到100度时，就会变成**蒸汽**升到空中。"},
44762:{"w":"scout","e":"Both my brothers were scouts and I really want to join the scout troop.","t":"我的两个哥哥都曾是**童子军**成员，我也很想加入童子军。"},
44763:{"w":"humorous","e":"Our English teacher is so humorous that everyone laughs in her classes.","t":"我们的英语老师非常**幽默**，大家在她的课上都会笑。"},
44764:{"w":"haste","e":"In her haste to catch the bus, she left her keys on the kitchen table.","t":"她**急忙**去赶公共汽车，把钥匙落在了厨房桌子上。"},
44765:{"w":"avenue","e":"We walked down a wide avenue lined with tall old trees on both sides.","t":"我们沿着一条两旁种满高大老树的宽阔**林荫道**走去。"},
44766:{"w":"triumph","e":"I learned that courage was not the absence of fear, but the triumph over it.","t":"我认为拥有勇气并不代表没有恐惧，而是**战胜**恐惧。"},
44767:{"w":"magic","e":"There's no real magic in the world.","t":"这世界上没有真正的**魔法**。"},
44768:{"w":"format","e":"You can use a computer to format your disc.","t":"你可以用计算机将磁盘**格式化**。"},
44769:{"w":"maid","e":"The rich family hired a maid to clean the house and cook their meals.","t":"那个富裕的家庭雇了一个**女仆**打扫房子、做饭。"},
44770:{"w":"aid","e":"After the earthquake, many countries sent aid to the people who had lost their homes.","t":"地震后，许多国家向失去家园的人们送去了**帮助**。"},
44771:{"w":"instance","e":"This is just one instance of how the Internet has changed our lives.","t":"这只是互联网改变我们生活的一个**例子**。"},
44772:{"w":"eyesight","e":"Reading in bed with poor light can be bad for your eyesight.","t":"光线昏暗时躺在床上看书，会损害你的**视力**。"},
44773:{"w":"coach","e":"They play just as important a role as the coach in our team.","t":"在我们队里，他们扮演着和**教练**同等重要的角色。"},
44774:{"w":"career","e":"The idea of having a single career is becoming old fashioned.","t":"只从事一种**职业**的想法现在已经开始变得落伍了。"},
44775:{"w":"interview","e":"We will talk about how applicants are put through a short interview.","t":"我们将讨论求职者如何进行简短的**面试**。"},
44776:{"w":"decrease","e":"Do you think the cinema has increased or decreased in popularity in recent years?","t":"你认为近年来电影受欢迎的程度是提高了还是**降低**了？"},
44777:{"w":"fountain","e":"Children were playing around the fountain in the square on the hot summer afternoon.","t":"炎热的夏日午后，孩子们在广场的**喷泉**周围玩耍。"},
44778:{"w":"vain","e":"He made a vain attempt to catch the last bus, but it had already left.","t":"他**徒劳地**追赶末班车，可车已经开走了。"},
44779:{"w":"slight","e":"I had a slight headache this morning.","t":"今天早上我**有点**头疼。"},
44780:{"w":"correspond","e":"This person's characteristics correspond with the witness' description.","t":"这个人的特征与证人的描述**相符**。"},
44781:{"w":"paste","e":"Use some paste to stick the pictures onto the paper for your art project.","t":"用一些**糨糊**把图片粘到纸上，完成你的美术作业。"},
44782:{"w":"relief","e":"It was a great relief to hear that everyone on the boat was safe.","t":"听说船上的人都平安无事，我们感到非常**宽慰**。"},
44783:{"w":"bless","e":"Before the wedding, the old priest blessed the young couple and wished them a happy life.","t":"婚礼前，老牧师为这对年轻夫妇**祝福**，祝愿他们生活幸福。"},
44784:{"w":"soak","e":"We'll get you up to your room and soak your feet, and then you'll be okay.","t":"我们带你到房间里**泡泡**脚，这样你会感觉舒服些。"},
44785:{"w":"stare","e":"He stared at the word trying to remember what it meant.","t":"他**盯着**这个单词，努力想记住它的意思。"},
44786:{"w":"conscientious","e":"She is a conscientious worker who always checks her work twice before handing it in.","t":"她是个**勤勉认真**的员工，交活之前总要检查两遍。"},
44787:{"w":"exceed","e":"World population in the twenty-first century will probably exceed 8 billion.","t":"世界人口总数在21世纪有可能**超过**80亿。"},
44788:{"w":"grace","e":"The young dancer moved across the stage with such grace that everyone watched in silence.","t":"年轻的舞者在舞台上的动作如此**优雅**，所有人都静静地看着。"},
44789:{"w":"acquaint","e":"Films provide an ideal opportunity to acquaint viewers with something unknown.","t":"电影给观众提供了一个**了解**未知事物的绝佳机会。"},
44790:{"w":"boom","e":"Online shopping has enjoyed a boom in China over the past ten years.","t":"过去十年，中国的网购迎来了一轮**繁荣**。"},
44791:{"w":"band","e":"The drum band will be appearing on stage in the next show.","t":"下一个节目将是鼓**乐队**表演。"},
44792:{"w":"hectare","e":"The farm covers about fifty hectares of land and grows mainly rice and corn.","t":"这个农场占地约五十**公顷**，主要种植水稻和玉米。"},
44793:{"w":"item","e":"Please read each item of the agreement carefully before you sign your name at the bottom.","t":"在底部签名之前，请仔细阅读协议的每一**条款**。"},
44794:{"w":"considerate","e":"It was very considerate of you to bring me soup when I was ill.","t":"我生病时你给我送汤，真是太**体贴**了。"},
44795:{"w":"invariably","e":"He invariably arrives ten minutes early for class, so the teacher trusts him.","t":"他**总是**提前十分钟到教室，所以老师很信任他。"},
44796:{"w":"hammer","e":"He used a hammer to fix the loose nails in the old wooden chair.","t":"他用**锤子**把旧木椅上松动的钉子钉紧了。"},
44797:{"w":"ditch","e":"The car slid off the wet road and ended up in a ditch.","t":"汽车从湿滑的路上滑了出去，掉进了**水沟**里。"},
44798:{"w":"discriminate","e":"We must learn to discriminate right from wrong.","t":"我们必须学会**明辨**是非。"},
44799:{"w":"metric","e":"Most countries use the metric system, so they measure distance in kilometers.","t":"大多数国家使用**公制**，所以用公里来计量距离。"},
44800:{"w":"ignorance","e":"His ignorance of the local rules caused him a lot of trouble in his first week abroad.","t":"由于对当地规矩**一无所知**，他在国外的第一周遇到了很多麻烦。"},
44801:{"w":"eternal","e":"The poem is about eternal love that never changes, even after death.","t":"这首诗写的是至死不变的**永恒**爱情。"},
44802:{"w":"jar","e":"My grandmother keeps homemade jam in a glass jar on the kitchen shelf.","t":"奶奶把自制果酱装在一个玻璃**罐子**里，放在厨房的架子上。"},
44803:{"w":"balloon","e":"We filled the room with colorful balloons for my sister's tenth birthday party.","t":"我们用五颜六色的**气球**布置房间，给妹妹过十岁生日。"},
44804:{"w":"blond","e":"The little girl in the photo has long blond hair and big blue eyes.","t":"照片里的小女孩留着长长的**金发**，有一双蓝色的大眼睛。"},
44805:{"w":"resource","e":"How these countries can advance their economies without destroying their natural resources is a burning question.","t":"如何既发展经济又不破坏自然**资源**是这些国家面临的一个迫在眉睫的问题。"},
44806:{"w":"data","e":"You have to spend a bit of time making the data a lot clearer.","t":"你要花一点时间把这些**数据**整理得更清楚些。"},
44807:{"w":"pastime","e":"Fishing has been my grandfather's favorite pastime since he retired from his job.","t":"自从退休以后，钓鱼就成了我爷爷最喜欢的**消遣**。"},
44808:{"w":"compose","e":"All of the subjects which you undertake in the first year are composed of lectures and tutorials.","t":"你第一年所要学习的所有科目都由讲座和辅导课**构成**。"},
44809:{"w":"bake","e":"My mother bakes bread every Sunday morning, and the whole house smells wonderful.","t":"妈妈每个星期天早上都会**烘烤**面包，满屋子都香喷喷的。"},
44810:{"w":"blog","e":"She writes a blog about the food and people she meets on her travels.","t":"她写了一个**博客**，记录她旅途中遇到的美食和人。"},
44811:{"w":"military","e":"The country spends a lot of money on military planes and ships every year.","t":"这个国家每年在**军用**飞机和舰船上花很多钱。"},
44812:{"w":"gear","e":"Single-speed cycles are bikes with no gears.","t":"单速自行车就是没有变速**齿轮**的自行车。"},
44813:{"w":"stationary","e":"The bus was stationary at the traffic lights when a bike hit it from behind.","t":"公交车在红绿灯前**静止不动**时，一辆自行车从后面撞了上来。"},
44814:{"w":"package","e":"The packages were delivered to the wrong place.","t":"这些**包裹**被送错地方了。"},
44815:{"w":"brake","e":"The driver stepped on the brake when a little dog suddenly ran across the road.","t":"一只小狗突然跑过马路，司机一脚踩下了**刹车**。"},
44816:{"w":"van","e":"The workers loaded all our furniture into a large van and drove it to our new home.","t":"工人们把我们所有的家具装上一辆大**货车**，运到了新家。"},
44817:{"w":"patient","e":"The nurse was very patient with the old man who kept asking the same question.","t":"护士对那位一直问同一个问题的老人很**有耐心**。"},
44818:{"w":"besides","e":"Besides English, my cousin can also speak French and a little Japanese.","t":"我表姐**除了**英语，还会说法语和一点日语。"},
44819:{"w":"altitude","e":"One common type of coffee bean, called Robusta, is grown at altitudes below 600 metres.","t":"罗布斯塔咖啡豆是常见的一种咖啡豆，生长在**海拔**600米以下的地方。"},
44820:{"w":"clarify","e":"Talking to students about the requirements of a course helps to clarify what needs to be done.","t":"告诉学生课程要求有助于他们**弄清**自己所需要完成的工作。"},
44821:{"w":"instead","e":"The bus didn't come for an hour, so we decided to walk home instead.","t":"公交车一个小时都没来，所以我们决定**改成**走路回家。"},
44822:{"w":"sleeve","e":"The shirt fits well, but the sleeves are a little too long for my arms.","t":"这件衬衫很合身，就是**袖子**对我来说有点长。"},
44823:{"w":"mercy","e":"The soldiers showed no mercy to their enemies and burned the whole village.","t":"士兵们对敌人毫不**仁慈**，烧毁了整个村庄。"},
44824:{"w":"shell","e":"Anne removed the oyster from its shell and began to eat.","t":"安妮从**壳**里挖出牡蛎，吃了起来。"},
44825:{"w":"vehicle","e":"No vehicles are allowed to enter the city center on weekends, so people walk or cycle.","t":"周末所有**车辆**都不许进入市中心，所以人们步行或骑车。"},
44826:{"w":"expression","e":"From the expression on his face, I could tell that he had failed the exam.","t":"从他脸上的**表情**，我看得出他考试没及格。"},
44827:{"w":"drawer","e":"I always keep my passport and other important papers in the top drawer of my desk.","t":"我总是把护照和其他重要证件放在书桌最上面的**抽屉**里。"},
44828:{"w":"register","e":"You must remember to bring the ID card with you when you come to register.","t":"你来**登记**的时候一定要记得带上身份证。"},
44829:{"w":"decade","e":"In Tokyo builders are planning a massive underground city to be begun in the next decade.","t":"在东京，建筑师们正计划在今后的**十年**里大规模兴建地下城。"},
44830:{"w":"quote","e":"In her speech, the head teacher quoted a famous saying of Confucius about learning.","t":"校长在讲话中**引用**了孔子关于学习的一句名言。"},
44831:{"w":"apology","e":"He made an apology to his teacher for being rude in class the day before.","t":"他为前一天在课上的无礼向老师**道歉**。"},
44832:{"w":"exact","e":"What is the exact amount left in your savings account?","t":"你储蓄账户上的**准确**余额是多少？"},
44833:{"w":"depress","e":"The recession has depressed the housing market.","t":"经济衰退导致住房市场**不景气**。"},
44834:{"w":"luggage","e":"Please put your luggage on the shelf above your seat before the train leaves.","t":"火车开动前，请把**行李**放在座位上方的架子上。"},
44835:{"w":"dimension","e":"Good health is a major resource for social, economic and personal development and an important dimension of quality of life.","t":"健康是社会、经济和个人发展的重要源泉，同时也是体现生活质量的一个重要**方面**。"},
44836:{"w":"schedule","e":"The lectures are scheduled for Tuesday and Thursday.","t":"讲座**安排**在星期二和星期四。"},
44837:{"w":"venture","e":"Allan, a doctoral student in anthropology, ventured deep into the jungle to search for the primitive natives.","t":"艾伦是一名人类学博士生，他**冒险**深入丛林腹地寻找原始土著。"},
44838:{"w":"vision","e":"This type of tablet may cause problems with your vision.","t":"这类药品可能会给你带来**视力**问题。"},
44839:{"w":"limitation","e":"There is no limitation in the game, and you can use anything you want.","t":"比赛没有什么**限制**，你可以使用任何你想用的东西。"},
44840:{"w":"queue","e":"There was a long queue outside the cinema because everyone wanted to see the new film.","t":"电影院外排起了**长队**，因为大家都想看这部新电影。"},
44841:{"w":"skim","e":"My reading approach is to skim the book first to see what's important and what isn't. It saves hours.","t":"我的阅读方法是先**浏览**全书，看看什么是重点，什么不是，这样会节省很多时间。"},
44842:{"w":"disturb","e":"One of the most concerning elements of acid rain is that it disturbs the natural balance of lakes and rivers.","t":"在酸雨带来的破坏中，最令人担心的是它**破坏**了河流和湖泊的自然平衡。"},
44843:{"w":"reflect","e":"They must reflect on their own political interest.","t":"他们必须**仔细考虑**他们的政治利益。"},
44844:{"w":"vigorous","e":"The small group of the survivors was to become a vigorous, self-sustaining island population.","t":"那一小队幸存者成了**精力充沛**、自力更生的岛上居民。"},
44845:{"w":"cancer","e":"Smoking greatly increases the risk of lung cancer, so many people are trying to quit.","t":"吸烟会大大增加患肺部**癌症**的风险，所以很多人正在尝试戒烟。"},
44846:{"w":"billion","e":"The company spent one billion dollars building a new factory near the coast.","t":"这家公司花了**十亿**美元在海边建了一座新工厂。"},
44847:{"w":"offense","e":"Driving after drinking is a serious offense that can lead to prison in many countries.","t":"在许多国家，酒后驾车是一种严重的**违法行为**，可能会导致坐牢。"},
44848:{"w":"accord","e":"The two countries signed a peace accord after months of difficult talks.","t":"经过几个月艰难的谈判，两国签署了和平**协议**。"},
44849:{"w":"repeatedly","e":"The teacher repeatedly told us to check our names on the answer sheet.","t":"老师**再三**提醒我们检查答题卡上的名字。"},
44850:{"w":"severe","e":"The research completed last year found that in the United States soil erosion was almost as severe as in India.","t":"去年完成的调查显示，美国土壤侵蚀的状况和印度的一样**严重**。"},
44851:{"w":"industrial","e":"Many people moved from farms to industrial cities to look for work in factories.","t":"许多人从农村搬到**工业**城市，到工厂里找工作。"},
44852:{"w":"kindergarten","e":"My mother takes my little brother to kindergarten every morning on her way to work.","t":"妈妈每天早上上班路上送弟弟去**幼儿园**。"},
44853:{"w":"via","e":"We flew from Beijing to London via Dubai and spent a night there.","t":"我们从北京**途经**迪拜飞往伦敦，并在那里住了一晚。"},
44854:{"w":"preference","e":"Many people expressed a strong preference for the original plan.","t":"许多人强烈表示**喜欢**原先的计划。"},
44855:{"w":"verify","e":"Please verify your phone number before you place the order on our website.","t":"在我们网站下单前，请先**核实**你的电话号码。"},
44856:{"w":"improve","e":"In an English course with Atlas English Language College, you improve your language skills and make friends from all over the world!","t":"在阿特拉斯英语学院的英语课堂，你可以**提高**自己的英语水平，同时结识来自世界各地的朋友！"},
44857:{"w":"screen","e":"Everything on the screen interests those children.","t":"那些孩子觉得**屏幕**上的一切都很有趣。"},
44858:{"w":"reduction","e":"There has been a reduction in the number of traffic accidents since the new speed limit.","t":"自从实行新的限速规定以来，交通事故的数量有所**减少**。"},
44859:{"w":"variety","e":"The places we will visit offer a variety of shopping.","t":"我们将参观的地方可提供**各种**购物活动。"},
44860:{"w":"error","e":"Please check your answers carefully, because even a small error can cost you points.","t":"请仔细检查答案，因为哪怕一个小**错误**也会让你丢分。"},
44861:{"w":"version","e":"This scene was cut from the final version of the movie.","t":"那部电影的最终**版本**把这场戏删掉了。"},
44862:{"w":"expert","e":"The museum invited an expert to tell visitors about the history of the old paintings.","t":"博物馆请了一位**专家**给参观者讲解这些古画的历史。"},
44863:{"w":"gratitude","e":"She wrote a letter to her old teacher to express her gratitude for his help.","t":"她给老师写了一封信，对他的帮助表达**感激**之情。"},
44864:{"w":"accustomed","e":"I'm not accustomed to using a gas stove.","t":"我不**习惯**使用煤气炉。"},
44865:{"w":"dive","e":"The boys took turns to dive into the cool water of the lake on the hot afternoon.","t":"炎热的下午，男孩们轮流**跳水**，扎进凉爽的湖里。"},
44866:{"w":"slam","e":"She was so angry that she slammed the door and ran to her room.","t":"她气得**砰地关上**门，跑回了自己的房间。"},
44867:{"w":"helicopter","e":"There used to be a big factory manufacturing helicopter engines here.","t":"这里曾经有一家生产**直升飞机**引擎的大工厂。"},
44868:{"w":"various","e":"The professor has studied the languages of various countries.","t":"这位教授研究过**多个**国家的语言。"},
44869:{"w":"evil","e":"The story teaches children that good will always win over evil in the end.","t":"这个故事告诉孩子们，善良最终总会战胜**邪恶**。"},
44870:{"w":"normal","e":"It is normal to feel nervous before an important exam, so try to relax and sleep well.","t":"在重要考试前感到紧张是**正常的**，所以尽量放松，好好睡一觉。"},
44871:{"w":"rifle","e":"The soldier cleaned his rifle carefully every morning before going out on duty.","t":"那名士兵每天早上出去执勤前都会仔细擦拭他的**步枪**。"},
44872:{"w":"accent","e":"He speaks English with a strong French accent, so I can tell where he is from.","t":"他说英语带着浓重的法国**口音**，所以我能听出他是哪里人。"},
44873:{"w":"memorandum","e":"The manager circulated a memorandum to all staff outlining the new procedures for booking annual leave.","t":"经理向全体员工分发了一份**备忘录**，概述了申请年假的新流程。"},
44874:{"w":"stake","e":"He owns a large stake in the company, so its success is very important to him.","t":"他持有这家公司的大量**股份**，所以公司的成功对他非常重要。"},
44875:{"w":"imagination","e":"They need to train their powers of imagination.","t":"他们需要训练自己的**想象力**。"},
44876:{"w":"compulsory","e":"These counselling sessions are compulsory for all students.","t":"所有学生都**必须**学习这些咨询课。"},
44877:{"w":"corporation","e":"My father has worked for the same large corporation for nearly twenty years.","t":"我爸爸在同一家大**公司**工作了将近二十年。"},
44878:{"w":"elsewhere","e":"This shop is too expensive, so let's look for a cheaper one elsewhere.","t":"这家店太贵了，我们去**别处**找家便宜点的吧。"},
44879:{"w":"hereby","e":"I hereby declare the new school library open to all students and teachers.","t":"我**特此**宣布新的学校图书馆向全体师生开放。"},
44880:{"w":"vary","e":"The price of a bed in different hotels always varies so much.","t":"不同旅馆的床位价格总是**大不相同**。"},
44881:{"w":"champion","e":"She trained hard for years and finally became the national swimming champion.","t":"她刻苦训练多年，终于成了全国游泳**冠军**。"},
44882:{"w":"conform","e":"All students must conform to the school rules.","t":"所有的学生都必须**遵守**校规。"},
44883:{"w":"eagle","e":"We watched an eagle fly high above the mountains, looking for food below.","t":"我们看着一只**老鹰**在群山上空高高飞翔，寻找下方的食物。"},
44884:{"w":"framework","e":"The workers first built a steel framework, and then added the walls and roof.","t":"工人们先搭起钢铁**框架**，然后再加上墙壁和屋顶。"},
44885:{"w":"disintegrate","e":"The plane flew into a mountain and disintegrated on impact.","t":"飞机冲向一座山，撞得**粉碎**。"},
44886:{"w":"figure","e":"The most recent available figures show that about a quarter of a million people are incapacitated with back pain every day.","t":"最新**数字**显示，每天大约有25万人因受背部疼痛的折磨而无法正常工作与生活。"},
44887:{"w":"social","e":"Many teenagers spend hours every day on social media talking with their friends.","t":"许多青少年每天花好几个小时在**社交**媒体上和朋友聊天。"},
44888:{"w":"erase","e":"The teacher asked me to erase the answers from the board after class.","t":"老师让我下课后把黑板上的答案**擦掉**。"},
44889:{"w":"vast","e":"The desert covers a vast area, and you can drive for hours without seeing another car.","t":"这片沙漠面积**巨大**，你开车几个小时都可能看不到另一辆车。"},
44890:{"w":"endure","e":"The pain was almost too great to endure.","t":"这种疼痛几乎难以**忍受**。"},
44891:{"w":"heritage","e":"The highland games are part of Scotland's cultural heritage.","t":"高地竞技是苏格兰文化**遗产**的一部分。"},
44892:{"w":"simplify","e":"These self-help books are designed for people who want to simplify their lives.","t":"这些自助书籍是为那些想**简化**生活的人设计的。"},
44893:{"w":"gradual","e":"There has been a gradual rise in the number of students who walk to school.","t":"步行上学的学生人数在**逐渐**增加。"},
44894:{"w":"disrupt","e":"Work of any company may be disrupted by absence of its employees.","t":"任何一家公司的工作都可能因员工的旷工而**中断**。"},
44895:{"w":"initiate","e":"The government has initiated a programme of social welfare policy.","t":"政府已经在社会福利政策上**发起**一项新的计划。"},
44896:{"w":"doom","e":"Some people hold that if this kind of rare animal is not well protected, it will be doomed to extinction.","t":"一些人认为，如果这种珍稀动物得不到很好的保护，它**注定**会灭绝。"},
44897:{"w":"timely","e":"Thanks to the timely help of a doctor on the train, the sick passenger soon felt better.","t":"多亏火车上一位医生的**及时**帮助，那位生病的乘客很快好多了。"},
44898:{"w":"shiver","e":"The children were shivering in the cold wind while waiting for the school bus.","t":"孩子们等校车的时候，在寒风中冻得**发抖**。"},
44899:{"w":"fiction","e":"She enjoys reading science fiction, especially stories about travel to other planets.","t":"她喜欢读科幻**小说**，尤其是关于星际旅行的故事。"},
44900:{"w":"amaze","e":"We were amazed at how quickly the little boy learned to play the piano.","t":"我们很**惊讶**这个小男孩学钢琴学得这么快。"},
44901:{"w":"grasp","e":"Mary finally grasped the material after reading the textbook very carefully.","t":"在非常仔细地阅读了课本后，玛丽最终**领会**了这段材料的意思。"},
44902:{"w":"adopt","e":"Our school has adopted a new way of teaching English, with more speaking practice and less grammar.","t":"我们学校**采用**了一种新的英语教学方法，口语练习多了，语法少了。"},
44903:{"w":"despair","e":"After failing the exam three times, he almost gave up in despair.","t":"考试三次不及格后，他**绝望**得几乎放弃了。"},
44904:{"w":"economy","e":"Tourism plays an important role in the economy of this small island country.","t":"旅游业在这个小岛国的**经济**中起着重要作用。"},
44905:{"w":"navigation","e":"Before GPS, sailors used the stars for navigation when they were far out at sea.","t":"在有卫星定位之前，远在海上的水手们靠星星来**导航**。"},
44906:{"w":"victim","e":"The majority of the victims in this earthquake were children.","t":"这次地震中的主要**受害者**是儿童。"},
44907:{"w":"stadium","e":"More than fifty thousand fans filled the stadium to watch the final match.","t":"五万多名球迷挤满了**体育场**，观看决赛。"},
44908:{"w":"adventure","e":"Traveling alone across the desert was the greatest adventure of my uncle's life.","t":"独自穿越沙漠是我叔叔一生中最大的**冒险**。"},
44909:{"w":"possibility","e":"Is there any possibility that the meeting will be moved to next week?","t":"会议有没有**可能**改到下周？"},
44910:{"w":"rotten","e":"Throw those rotten apples away before they make the others go bad.","t":"把那些**腐烂的**苹果扔掉，免得其他苹果也坏掉。"},
44911:{"w":"float","e":"A piece of wood will float on water, but a stone sinks to the bottom.","t":"木头会**漂浮**在水面上，而石头会沉到水底。"},
44912:{"w":"viewpoint","e":"Try to understand the problem from your parents' viewpoint before you argue with them.","t":"在和父母争论之前，试着从他们的**观点**来理解这个问题。"},
44913:{"w":"dash","e":"When the rain started, we dashed into a shop to stay dry.","t":"雨一下起来，我们就**冲进**一家商店躲雨。"},
44914:{"w":"dynamic","e":"The market is so dynamic that the figures change almost every two weeks.","t":"这个市场很**活跃**，数据几乎每两周就会发生改变。"},
44915:{"w":"erect","e":"The town plans to erect a statue of the famous writer in the main square.","t":"镇上计划在中心广场为这位著名作家**竖立**一座雕像。"},
44916:{"w":"recently","e":"I haven't seen my old classmates recently because we are all busy with work.","t":"我**最近**没见过老同学，因为大家都忙于工作。"},
44917:{"w":"vibrate","e":"My phone began to vibrate in my pocket during the meeting, but I didn't answer it.","t":"开会时，我的手机在口袋里**震动**起来，但我没有接。"},
44918:{"w":"obey","e":"The young soldiers were trained to obey orders from their officers without asking any questions.","t":"这些年轻士兵受过训练，会毫不质疑地**服从**长官的命令。"},
44919:{"w":"concept","e":"The concept of health holds different meanings for different people and groups.","t":"健康**观念**因人和群体的不同而不同。"},
44920:{"w":"indifferent","e":"Tina seems to be totally indifferent to the exam result of the higher language course.","t":"蒂娜似乎对高级语言课程的考试结果毫**不关心**。"},
44921:{"w":"video","e":"My little brother likes watching funny videos of cats on his phone after dinner.","t":"我弟弟晚饭后喜欢用手机看猫咪的搞笑**视频**。"},
44922:{"w":"petrol","e":"We had to stop on the way to buy petrol because the car was almost empty.","t":"车快没油了，我们只好在半路停下来买**汽油**。"},
44923:{"w":"plot","e":"The plot of this film was too complicated for me.","t":"这部电影的**情节**对我来讲太复杂了。"},
44924:{"w":"rarely","e":"My grandfather rarely watches TV; he prefers reading the newspaper in the garden.","t":"我爷爷**很少**看电视，他更喜欢在花园里看报纸。"},
44925:{"w":"rigid","e":"The school has rigid rules about uniforms, and students cannot wear their own clothes.","t":"这所学校对校服有**严格**的规定，学生不能穿自己的衣服。"},
44926:{"w":"horror","e":"He was filled with horror at the sight of the dog.","t":"他看见狗就**不寒而栗**。"},
44927:{"w":"vinegar","e":"My mother added a little vinegar to the soup to make it taste better.","t":"妈妈往汤里加了一点**醋**，让它更好喝。"},
44928:{"w":"entertain","e":"The spectators go to be entertained rather than out of loyalty to a team.","t":"观众去观看体育比赛与其说是忠于某支球队，还不如说是为了**娱乐**。"},
44929:{"w":"fatigue","e":"After working for twelve hours, the doctor was suffering from fatigue and needed some rest.","t":"连续工作十二个小时后，医生感到非常**疲劳**，需要休息一下。"},
44930:{"w":"approach","e":"As autumn approaches, the beekeepers pack up their hives and go south.","t":"秋天**来临**，养蜂人收好蜂房前往南方。"},
44931:{"w":"vertical","e":"The climber managed to find a support on the vertical cliff.","t":"登山者成功地在**陡直**的峭壁上找到了一个支撑点。"},
44932:{"w":"consideration","e":"After a few moments' consideration, they refused the invitation.","t":"他们**考虑**片刻后，拒绝了邀请。"},
44933:{"w":"violate","e":"Drivers who violate traffic rules will have to pay a fine or even lose their license.","t":"**违反**交通规则的司机要交罚款，甚至会被吊销驾照。"},
44934:{"w":"evident","e":"It was evident from her smile that she had passed the driving test.","t":"从她的笑容可以**明显**看出，她通过了驾照考试。"},
44935:{"w":"vice","e":"Many people think that lying is a vice that can destroy trust between good friends.","t":"很多人认为撒谎是一种能摧毁好友之间信任的**恶习**。"},
44936:{"w":"holy","e":"Jerusalem is a holy city for people of several different religions around the world.","t":"对世界各地多个宗教的信徒来说，耶路撒冷都是一座**神圣**的城市。"},
44937:{"w":"vessel","e":"Sea ports have been transformed by the advent of powered vessels.","t":"机动**船只**的出现改变了海港的外观。"},
44938:{"w":"notebook","e":"I always carry a small notebook so I can write down new words.","t":"我总是随身带个小**笔记本**，好把生词记下来。"},
44939:{"w":"philosophy","e":"Try your best to succeed—that's my philosophy.","t":"竭尽全力，取得成功——这就是我的**人生哲学**。"},
44940:{"w":"scholar","e":"The database is collected not merely for scholars, but for people involved in a whole range of educational and artistic purposes.","t":"收集这些数据库不仅仅是为了给**学者**提供资料，也为所有从事教育和艺术工作的人们提供资料。"},
44941:{"w":"chop","e":"Please chop the onions and carrots into small pieces for the soup.","t":"请把洋葱和胡萝卜**切碎**，用来煮汤。"},
44942:{"w":"golf","e":"My father plays golf with his friends every Sunday morning to relax.","t":"我爸爸每个星期天上午都和朋友打**高尔夫球**放松一下。"},
44943:{"w":"costly","e":"Repairing the old car would be too costly, so we decided to buy a new one.","t":"修那辆旧车太**昂贵**了，所以我们决定买辆新的。"},
44944:{"w":"respect","e":"I respect you for your honesty.","t":"因为你为人诚实，所以我**尊敬**你。"},
44945:{"w":"outward","e":"The scientist warned the local population against being deceived by the volcano's outward calm.","t":"科学家警告当地居民不要被这座火山**表面**的平静所欺骗。"},
44946:{"w":"veteran","e":"As a veteran of twenty years in the newsroom, she trains young reporters to check every fact carefully.","t":"作为在新闻编辑部工作了二十年的**老手**，她培训年轻记者仔细核实每一个事实。"},
44947:{"w":"admission","e":"Admission to the city museum is free for all students on Sunday mornings.","t":"市博物馆星期天上午对所有学生**入场**免费。"},
44948:{"w":"section","e":"Please read the first section of the book carefully before next week's class.","t":"下周上课前，请仔细阅读这本书的第一**部分**。"},
44949:{"w":"glimpse","e":"From the window of the train, I caught a glimpse of the sea between the hills.","t":"从火车车窗望出去，我在群山之间**瞥见**了大海。"},
44950:{"w":"ignore","e":"If you ignore these instructions, this medicine could affect your heart rhythm.","t":"如果你**不顾**说明服药，这种药可能会影响你的心率。"},
44951:{"w":"penalty","e":"Drivers who drink and drive will face a heavy penalty, and may even go to prison.","t":"酒后驾车的司机将受到严厉**处罚**，甚至可能入狱。"},
44952:{"w":"finally","e":"After waiting for almost two hours, we finally got on the train to Beijing.","t":"等了将近两个小时，我们**终于**上了去北京的火车。"},
44953:{"w":"disease","e":"Washing your hands often is one of the best ways to stop the spread of disease.","t":"勤洗手是阻止**疾病**传播的最好方法之一。"},
44954:{"w":"compensate","e":"Nothing can compensate for the loss of one's health.","t":"失去的健康是无法**弥补**的。"},
44955:{"w":"approval","e":"The students need their parents' approval before they can join the school trip.","t":"学生们需要得到父母的**同意**才能参加学校的旅行。"},
44956:{"w":"infect","e":"Stay at home if you have a cold, or you might infect your classmates.","t":"感冒了就待在家里，否则你可能会**传染**同学。"},
44957:{"w":"dolphin","e":"We saw a group of dolphins jumping out of the water near our boat.","t":"我们看到一群**海豚**在船边跃出水面。"},
44958:{"w":"judgement","e":"In my judgement, we should wait until the weather gets better before we leave.","t":"依我的**判断**，我们应该等天气好转再出发。"},
44959:{"w":"confirm","e":"If a prediction based on a hypothesis is fulfilled, then the hypothesis is confirmed.","t":"如果基于某一假设的预测得到实现，那么该假设就被**证实**是正确的。"},
44960:{"w":"bowel","e":"The doctor said that eating more fruit and vegetables is good for your bowels.","t":"医生说多吃水果蔬菜对**肠道**有好处。"},
44961:{"w":"regulation","e":"Anyone who violates the regulations must be punished.","t":"任何违反**规定**的人都要受到惩罚。"},
44962:{"w":"harbour","e":"Dozens of small fishing boats were lying in the harbour, waiting for the storm to pass.","t":"几十条小渔船停在**港口**里，等待暴风雨过去。"},
44963:{"w":"silicon","e":"Silicon is used to make the tiny chips inside computers and mobile phones.","t":"**硅**被用来制造电脑和手机里的微型芯片。"},
44964:{"w":"cord","e":"She tied the box with a piece of strong cord before she posted it.","t":"她用一根结实的**细绳**把盒子捆好，然后寄了出去。"},
44965:{"w":"concrete","e":"The old wooden bridge across the river was replaced by a concrete bridge that can carry heavy lorries.","t":"河上的旧木桥被一座能承载重型卡车的**混凝土**桥取代了。"},
44966:{"w":"comply","e":"The patient was unwilling to comply with the physician's orders.","t":"这位病人不愿意**遵从**医生的嘱咐。"},
44967:{"w":"powder","e":"Mix two spoons of the powder with warm water and drink it after meals.","t":"将两勺**粉末**用温水调匀，饭后服用。"},
44968:{"w":"phase","e":"The first phase of the project will finish at the end of this month.","t":"这个项目的第一**阶段**将在本月底完成。"},
44969:{"w":"dizzy","e":"He is dizzy and confused and does not want to be here.","t":"他感到**眩晕**迷惑，不想待在这儿。"},
44970:{"w":"remote","e":"She grew up in a remote village in the mountains, far from any town.","t":"她在大山里一个**偏僻**的村子长大，离哪个镇都很远。"},
44971:{"w":"organic","e":"Dead leaves are organic matter that slowly becomes food for plants in the soil.","t":"落叶是**有机**物质，会在土壤里慢慢变成植物的养分。"},
44972:{"w":"unemployment","e":"The graph shows the unemployment rates in the U.S. and Japan between March 2013 and March 2019.","t":"这张图表显示了从2013年3月至2019年3月六年间美国和日本的**失业**率。"},
44973:{"w":"provide","e":"The hotel provides free breakfast for all guests who stay more than two nights.","t":"这家酒店为所有住两晚以上的客人**提供**免费早餐。"},
44974:{"w":"previous","e":"Coffee became cheaper than it had been for the previous years.","t":"咖啡的价格比**前**些年低。"},
44975:{"w":"rub","e":"He rubbed the dirty window with a cloth until he could see outside clearly.","t":"他用布**擦**着脏窗户，直到能清楚地看到外面。"},
44976:{"w":"helpless","e":"Without his glasses, my grandfather feels helpless and can hardly read anything.","t":"没戴眼镜时，爷爷觉得自己很**无助**，几乎什么都看不清。"},
44977:{"w":"dump","e":"Some factories still dump their waste water into the river late at night.","t":"一些工厂仍在深夜把废水**倾倒**进河里。"},
44978:{"w":"racial","e":"The school has clear rules against racial jokes and any unfair treatment of students.","t":"学校有明确规定，禁止开**种族**玩笑和任何不公平对待学生的行为。"},
44979:{"w":"solar","e":"Of all the planets in our own solar system, the Earth is the only one on which life can survive.","t":"在**太阳**系所有行星中，地球是唯一一颗生命可以存活的行星。"},
44980:{"w":"installation","e":"The installation of the new air conditioner took the workers about three hours.","t":"工人们**安装**新空调花了大约三个小时。"},
44981:{"w":"construction","e":"They spent years completing the construction of the new airport.","t":"他们花了数年的时间才**建**成新机场。"},
44982:{"w":"pronoun","e":"In English, a pronoun such as \"he\" or \"it\" is often used in place of a noun.","t":"在英语中，像 he 或 it 这样的**代词**常用来代替名词。"},
44983:{"w":"charge","e":"Drivers will be charged according to the roads they use.","t":"根据司机行驶的道路对其**收费**。"},
44984:{"w":"planet","e":"Mars is the planet most similar to Earth, so scientists hope to send people there one day.","t":"火星是与地球最相似的**行星**，所以科学家希望有一天能把人送上去。"},
44985:{"w":"flourish","e":"Research in Britain has shown the \"green consumers\" continue to flourish as a significant group amongst shoppers.","t":"英国的调查表明，作为购物人群重要组成部分的“绿色消费者”仍然很**活跃**。"},
44986:{"w":"internal","e":"The theory lacks internal consistency.","t":"这种理论缺乏**内在**统一性。"},
44987:{"w":"image","e":"The company wants to improve its image after the problems with its products last year.","t":"去年产品出问题后，这家公司想改善自己的**形象**。"},
44988:{"w":"property","e":"Please do not touch the paintings; they are the property of the city museum.","t":"请不要触摸这些画，它们是市博物馆的**财产**。"},
44989:{"w":"criticize","e":"The teacher never criticizes students in front of the class when they make mistakes.","t":"学生犯错时，这位老师从不当着全班的面**批评**他们。"},
44990:{"w":"blade","e":"Be careful when you wash the knife, because its blade is very sharp.","t":"洗刀的时候要小心，因为它的**刀刃**很锋利。"},
44991:{"w":"shave","e":"My father shaves every morning in the bathroom before he has breakfast and goes to work.","t":"我爸爸每天早上在浴室里**刮胡子**，然后吃早饭去上班。"},
44992:{"w":"disorder","e":"After the football match, the police were called to stop the disorder in the streets.","t":"足球赛结束后，警察被叫来制止街上的**骚乱**。"},
44993:{"w":"physicist","e":"Albert Einstein is often thought of as one of the greatest physicists of the twentieth century.","t":"阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦常被认为是20世纪最伟大的**物理学家**之一。"},
44994:{"w":"limited","e":"Some banks open for a limited time on Saturdays.","t":"一些银行在周六**限**时开放。"},
44995:{"w":"rocket","e":"The scientists watched the rocket rise into the sky, carrying a new satellite into space.","t":"科学家们看着**火箭**升上天空，把一颗新卫星送入太空。"},
44996:{"w":"sack","e":"The corn was stored in large sacks in the barn.","t":"谷物用大**麻袋**装着储存在粮仓里面。"},
44997:{"w":"enormous","e":"We grow an enormous number of bananas each year.","t":"我们每年都**大量**种植香蕉。"},
44998:{"w":"dispute","e":"The workers and the factory owner finally settled their dispute about pay after a long meeting.","t":"经过长时间的会谈，工人和工厂老板终于解决了关于工资的**争论**。"},
44999:{"w":"behave","e":"Managers often behave very differently outside the office.","t":"经理在办公室内外的**举止**经常判若两人。"},
45000:{"w":"impact","e":"Cigarette smoke has the same impact on smokers as it does on non-smokers.","t":"香烟烟雾对吸烟者和不吸烟者的**影响**是一样的。"},
45001:{"w":"butterfly","e":"A colorful butterfly landed on the flower and stayed there for a moment.","t":"一只五彩的**蝴蝶**落在花上，停了一会儿。"},
45002:{"w":"organism","e":"This insect is on a list of organisms known to be harmful.","t":"这种昆虫属于有害**生物**。"},
45003:{"w":"visible","e":"On a clear night, thousands of stars are visible from the top of the mountain.","t":"在晴朗的夜晚，从山顶上**看得见**成千上万颗星星。"},
45004:{"w":"circuit","e":"The lights went out because there was a problem in the electric circuit.","t":"灯灭了，因为**电路**出了问题。"},
45005:{"w":"shortly","e":"The plane will land shortly, so please return to your seats and fasten your seat belts.","t":"飞机**不久**就要降落了，请回到座位上系好安全带。"},
45006:{"w":"conceal","e":"She tried to conceal her anger, but her red face showed how she really felt.","t":"她努力**掩饰**自己的怒气，但涨红的脸暴露了她真实的感受。"},
45007:{"w":"dessert","e":"We had ice cream for dessert after a big dinner at my grandmother's house.","t":"在奶奶家吃完一顿丰盛的晚饭后，我们吃了冰淇淋作为**餐后甜食**。"},
45008:{"w":"interval","e":"There is a short interval of fifteen minutes between the two parts of the concert.","t":"音乐会上下半场之间有十五分钟的**幕间休息**。"},
45009:{"w":"earthquake","e":"Many old buildings in the town fell down during the strong earthquake last night.","t":"在昨晚的强烈**地震**中，镇上许多老房子倒塌了。"},
45010:{"w":"publication","e":"The writer was very happy about the publication of her first novel last year.","t":"去年她的第一部小说**出版**了，这位作家非常高兴。"},
45011:{"w":"appointment","e":"I have an appointment with the dentist at three o'clock tomorrow afternoon.","t":"我明天下午三点和牙医有个**预约**。"},
45012:{"w":"curriculum","e":"The teacher expects that the curriculum will successfully attract students.","t":"老师希望这种**课程**安排能成功地吸引学生。"},
45013:{"w":"frequent","e":"Frequent failures did not affect his morale.","t":"**屡屡**失败并未让他泄气。"},
45014:{"w":"murder","e":"The murder seemed planned.","t":"这场**谋杀**显然是蓄意策划的。"},
45015:{"w":"feature","e":"One important feature of this phone is that its battery can last for two days.","t":"这款手机的一个重要**特征**是电池能用两天。"},
45016:{"w":"depart","e":"Tom departs at sundown to fish.","t":"汤姆黄昏时分**出发**去捕鱼。"},
45017:{"w":"violin","e":"My sister has been learning to play the violin since she was six years old.","t":"我妹妹从六岁起就开始学拉**小提琴**。"},
45018:{"w":"loaf","e":"On the way home, I stopped at the bakery and bought a loaf of fresh bread.","t":"回家路上，我在面包店停下，买了**一条**新鲜面包。"},
45019:{"w":"lens","e":"Lenses can be used to concentrate the sun's rays.","t":"**透镜**可用来聚集太阳光。"},
45020:{"w":"perspective","e":"We were encouraged to see the issue from a different perspective.","t":"我们受到鼓励，从不同的**视角**来看待这个问题。"},
45021:{"w":"stain","e":"The ink stained his shirt blue.","t":"墨水给他的衬衫**染上**了蓝色。"},
45022:{"w":"sigh","e":"She gave a deep sigh when she heard that the trip had been cancelled.","t":"听说旅行被取消了，她深深地**叹了口气**。"},
45023:{"w":"laundry","e":"You should pay a laundry fee which covers the cleaning of bed linens and towels.","t":"你必须支付包括清洗床上用品和毛巾在内的所有**洗衣**费用。"},
45024:{"w":"demand","e":"Tall buildings were constructed to help meet the demand for more economical use of land.","t":"高层建筑的建造是为了满足节约用地的**需求**。"},
45025:{"w":"reserve","e":"We reserved the room a week ago.","t":"我们一星期前就**预订**了这个房间。"},
45026:{"w":"virtual","e":"Customers can design and order clothes directly from the virtual shops now.","t":"现在，顾客可以直接从**虚拟**商店设计和定做服装。"},
45027:{"w":"media","e":"Social media has changed the way young people get news about the world.","t":"社交**媒体**改变了年轻人获取世界新闻的方式。"},
45028:{"w":"aluminium","e":"Many drink cans are made of aluminium because it is light and easy to recycle.","t":"很多饮料罐都是**铝制**的，因为铝很轻，而且容易回收。"},
45029:{"w":"calculate","e":"Can you calculate how much money we will need for the whole trip?","t":"你能**计算**一下整个旅行我们需要多少钱吗？"},
45030:{"w":"invaluable","e":"The library's online database proved invaluable to students who were writing their final-year research projects.","t":"事实证明，图书馆的在线数据库对正在写毕业研究课题的学生**极其有用**。"},
45031:{"w":"hence","e":"The road was covered with ice, hence the large number of accidents this morning.","t":"路面结了冰，**因此**今天上午发生了很多交通事故。"},
45032:{"w":"meantime","e":"The country was urgently calling for peace while in the meantime secretly doing nuclear tests.","t":"该国急切呼吁和平，**同时**却又秘密进行核试验。"},
45033:{"w":"misfortune","e":"He had the misfortune to lose his job and his house in the same year.","t":"他很**不幸**，同一年里丢了工作又失去了房子。"},
45034:{"w":"pine","e":"Tall pine trees cover the hills behind our village and stay green all year.","t":"我们村后的山上长满了高大的**松树**，一年四季都是绿的。"},
45035:{"w":"confess","e":"After two hours of questioning, the young man finally confessed that he had stolen the bike.","t":"经过两个小时的审问，那个年轻人终于**供认**自己偷了自行车。"},
45036:{"w":"pave","e":"The workers will pave the road to the village with stones next month.","t":"下个月，工人们将用石块**铺设**通往村子的路。"},
45037:{"w":"opening","e":"There is an opening for a part-time cook at the restaurant near our school.","t":"我们学校附近那家餐馆有一个兼职厨师的**空缺**。"},
45038:{"w":"appearance","e":"His sudden appearance surprised me greatly.","t":"他的突然**出现**让我大吃一惊。"},
45039:{"w":"snack","e":"The sandwich shop for quick snacks is nearby.","t":"出售**快餐**的三明治店离这很近。"},
45040:{"w":"acid","e":"Be careful with this bottle of acid, because it can burn your skin and clothes.","t":"小心这瓶**酸液**，它会灼伤你的皮肤，弄坏你的衣服。"},
45041:{"w":"virus","e":"Wash your hands often, because a cold virus can live on door handles for hours.","t":"要勤洗手，因为感冒**病毒**能在门把手上存活好几个小时。"},
45042:{"w":"breakdown","e":"Gloomy people are likely to suffer from a nervous breakdown.","t":"忧郁的人容易精神**崩溃**。"},
45043:{"w":"hen","e":"Our hen lays an egg almost every morning in the box behind the house.","t":"我们家的**母鸡**几乎每天早上都在屋后的箱子里下一个蛋。"},
45044:{"w":"ambulance","e":"There is a car accident, please send an ambulance as soon as possible.","t":"这里发生了一起车祸，请尽快派**救护车**来。"},
45045:{"w":"clear-cut","e":"There is no clear-cut answer to this question, so we need to discuss it further.","t":"这个问题没有**明确的**答案，所以我们需要进一步讨论。"},
45046:{"w":"giant","e":"A giant tree had fallen across the road after the storm, so we had to go back.","t":"暴风雨过后，一棵**巨大的**树倒在路上，我们只好往回走。"},
45047:{"w":"liberty","e":"Many people in the past fought and even died for liberty and equal rights.","t":"过去，许多人为**自由**和平等权利而奋斗，甚至献出了生命。"},
45048:{"w":"payroll","e":"The small company now has more than 500 people on its payroll, twice as many as last year.","t":"这家小公司的**在职人员名单**上现在有500多人，是去年的两倍。"},
45049:{"w":"crystal","e":"My grandmother keeps a small crystal bird on the shelf in her bedroom.","t":"奶奶卧室的架子上放着一只小小的**水晶**鸟。"},
45050:{"w":"consequently","e":"Mr. Foster has never been to China. Consequently he knows very little about it.","t":"福斯特先生从未到过中国，**所以**对中国知之甚少。"},
45051:{"w":"smog","e":"The smog was so thick that we could hardly see the buildings across the street.","t":"**烟雾**太浓了，我们几乎看不见街对面的楼房。"},
45052:{"w":"operational","e":"We need some advanced operational staff.","t":"我们需要一些高级**操作**人员。"},
45053:{"w":"insist","e":"My mother insisted that I wear a coat because it was very cold outside.","t":"外面很冷，妈妈**坚持**要我穿上外套。"},
45054:{"w":"climax","e":"The climax of the film comes when the hero finally faces his enemy on the bridge.","t":"电影的**高潮**出现在主人公终于在桥上与敌人对峙的时候。"},
45055:{"w":"versus","e":"Tonight's football match is China versus Japan, and the tickets were sold out weeks ago.","t":"今晚的足球赛是中国**对阵**日本，门票几周前就卖光了。"},
45056:{"w":"ultimate","e":"For early explorers, it was the ultimate survival contest.","t":"对于早期探险家来说，这是**终极**生存竞赛。"},
45057:{"w":"outside","e":"The children are playing outside the classroom while they wait for the bell to ring.","t":"孩子们在教室**外面**玩，等着铃声响起。"},
45058:{"w":"refrigerator","e":"Put the milk back in the refrigerator, or it will go bad by tomorrow morning.","t":"把牛奶放回**冰箱**，不然到明天早上就坏了。"},
45059:{"w":"extent","e":"To some extent, the success of a team depends on how well its players work together.","t":"在某种**程度**上，一个队能否成功取决于队员们合作得好不好。"},
45060:{"w":"scatter","e":"The farmer scattered the seeds on the field.","t":"农民在地里**播**种。"},
45061:{"w":"keyboard","e":"My cat likes to walk across the keyboard while I am typing my homework.","t":"我打作业的时候，我的猫喜欢在**键盘**上走来走去。"},
45062:{"w":"massive","e":"In Tokyo builders are planning a massive underground city to be begun in the next decade.","t":"在东京，建筑者们正计划在接下来的十年里建造一个**大型**地下城。"},
45063:{"w":"owe","e":"I owed the bank rather a lot of money a few years ago.","t":"几年前，我**欠**了银行一大笔钱。"},
45064:{"w":"poison","e":"Keep the rat poison on a high shelf where small children cannot reach it.","t":"把灭鼠**毒药**放在小孩够不着的高架子上。"},
45065:{"w":"employment","e":"After months of looking, he finally found employment at a bank in the city.","t":"找了几个月后，他终于在城里一家银行找到了**工作**。"},
45066:{"w":"interfere","e":"Don't let computer games interfere with your schoolwork, especially during exam week.","t":"别让电脑游戏**妨碍**你的学业，尤其是在考试周。"},
45067:{"w":"mill","e":"The old mill by the river was used to turn wheat into flour.","t":"河边那座老**磨坊**过去用来把小麦磨成面粉。"},
45068:{"w":"medium","e":"Mary uses the medium of poetry to make her ideas known.","t":"玛丽使用诗歌这一**媒介**来表达思想。"},
45069:{"w":"burden","e":"Looking after three young children alone is a heavy burden for the young mother.","t":"独自照顾三个孩子，对这位年轻妈妈来说是个**重担**。"},
45070:{"w":"install","e":"We need to install new software on all the computers in the school library.","t":"我们需要给学校图书馆的所有电脑**安装**新软件。"},
45071:{"w":"urban","e":"The concentration of vehicles makes air quality in urban areas unpleasant.","t":"汽车大量集中在**市**区，使得这里的空气污浊不堪。"},
45072:{"w":"starve","e":"Thousands of people starved during the war.","t":"战争中，成千上万的人**饿死**。"},
45073:{"w":"output","e":"The factory has doubled its output since it bought the new machines last year.","t":"自从去年买了新机器，这家工厂的**产量**翻了一番。"},
45074:{"w":"engineering","e":"My brother is studying engineering at university because he loves building machines.","t":"我哥哥在大学学**工程**，因为他喜欢造机器。"},
45075:{"w":"bare","e":"Certain plants can cause irritation if you touch them with bare skin.","t":"某些植物直接接触**裸露的**皮肤时，会引起皮肤过敏。"},
45076:{"w":"ally","e":"During the war, the two countries were close allies and helped each other with food and weapons.","t":"战争期间，这两个国家是亲密的**同盟国**，在粮食和武器上互相帮助。"},
45077:{"w":"marvelous","e":"The doctor did a marvelous job and saved the life of the badly injured boy.","t":"医生干得**了不起**，救回了伤势严重的男孩的命。"},
45078:{"w":"compound","e":"The problems were compounded by severe food shortages.","t":"严重的食物短缺使问题进一步**恶化**了。"},
45079:{"w":"vocabulary","e":"Reading English stories every day is a good way to build your vocabulary.","t":"每天读英语故事是扩大**词汇量**的好方法。"},
45080:{"w":"event","e":"Your graduation from college is an important event.","t":"你大学毕业了，这是件**大事**。"},
45081:{"w":"simplicity","e":"For the sake of simplicity, the teacher might recommend the student to use this reference book.","t":"为**简便**起见，老师可向学生推荐使用这本参考书。"},
45082:{"w":"athlete","e":"Professional athletes usually follow a strict diet and training plan to stay in top physical condition.","t":"职业**运动员**通常会遵循严格的饮食和训练计划，以保持最佳的身体状态。"},
45083:{"w":"resolve","e":"Attempts are continually being made to resolve the problem of security in school.","t":"人们不断尝试着**解决**学校的安全问题。"},
45084:{"w":"orderly","e":"The students left the classroom in an orderly way when the fire alarm rang.","t":"火警铃响起时，学生们**有秩序**地离开了教室。"},
45085:{"w":"honourable","e":"He did the honourable thing and told the truth, even though it got him into trouble.","t":"他做了**正直的**事，说出了真相，尽管这给他惹了麻烦。"},
45086:{"w":"avoid","e":"Leave home early tomorrow so that you can avoid the heavy traffic on the main road.","t":"明天早点出门，这样就能**避开**大路上的拥堵车流。"},
45087:{"w":"learned","e":"My grandfather was a learned man who had read thousands of books in his life.","t":"我祖父是个**有学问**的人，一生读过几千本书。"},
45088:{"w":"brass","e":"A brass knocker was fixed on the door.","t":"门上装了一个**黄铜**门环。"},
45089:{"w":"respective","e":"After the meeting, the two managers went back to their respective offices.","t":"会议结束后，两位经理回到了**各自**的办公室。"},
45090:{"w":"shelter","e":"During the heavy storm, we found shelter under a large tree near the road.","t":"暴风雨中，我们在路边一棵大树下找到了一个**躲避处**。"},
45091:{"w":"engage","e":"Try to find humour in life and engage in activities that make you happy.","t":"试着从生活中寻找乐趣，**参与**那些使你快乐的活动。"},
45092:{"w":"boast","e":"She is always boasting about how wonderful her children are.","t":"她总是**夸耀**她的孩子们多么出色。"},
45093:{"w":"reporter","e":"A young reporter from the local newspaper came to our school to interview the headmaster.","t":"当地报社的一名年轻**记者**来我们学校采访校长。"},
45094:{"w":"sphere","e":"Mary's sphere of interests is very limited.","t":"玛丽兴趣**范围**不广。"},
45095:{"w":"sew","e":"My grandmother taught me how to sew a button onto my shirt.","t":"奶奶教我怎样把纽扣**缝**到衬衫上。"},
45096:{"w":"profile","e":"The successful entrepreneur's career is profiled in this month's journal.","t":"这期月刊**概述**了这位成功企业家的工作生涯。"},
45097:{"w":"purple","e":"She wore a purple dress to the party, which matched the flowers in her hair.","t":"她穿了一条**紫色**连衣裙去参加聚会，和她头发上的花很相配。"},
45098:{"w":"indicate","e":"The dark clouds in the west indicate that it is going to rain this afternoon.","t":"西边的乌云**表明**今天下午要下雨了。"},
45099:{"w":"shed","e":"Many trees shed their leaves in autumn and grow new ones in spring.","t":"许多树在秋天**脱落**叶子，春天再长出新叶。"},
45100:{"w":"volcano","e":"The volcano erupted last night, and thousands of people had to leave their homes.","t":"那座**火山**昨晚喷发了，成千上万的人不得不离开家园。"},
45101:{"w":"govern","e":"The discovery that language can be a barrier to communication is quickly made by all who travel, study, govern or sell.","t":"旅行者、学习者、**管理**人员或销售人员很快就会发现语言可能会成为他们交流的障碍。"},
45102:{"w":"necessarily","e":"As an international student you'll not necessarily be eligible for all the facilities offered to resident students.","t":"作为国际学生，你不**一定**有资格享受当地学生享有的所有便利。"},
45103:{"w":"decline","e":"Technological advances helped bring about the decline of rural industries and an increase in urban populations.","t":"技术进步加速了乡镇企业的**衰落**和城市人口的增长。"},
45104:{"w":"visual","e":"The exhibition of London Museum is largely visual, with a huge number of items on show.","t":"伦敦博物馆的展览以**视觉**展示为主，展出了大量物品。"},
45105:{"w":"vitamin","e":"Fresh fruit and vegetables contain many vitamins that help keep our bodies healthy.","t":"新鲜水果和蔬菜含有多种**维生素**，有助于保持身体健康。"},
45106:{"w":"classic","e":"This novel is a classic that young people still love to read after two hundred years.","t":"这部小说是一部**经典作品**，两百年后的年轻人仍然爱读。"},
45107:{"w":"utilize","e":"We should utilize the sun and wind to produce clean energy for our homes.","t":"我们应该**利用**太阳能和风能为家庭生产清洁能源。"},
45108:{"w":"reproduce","e":"Photographs, postcards and films enable memories to be endlessly reproduced.","t":"照片、明信片和电影让往事在脑海中不断**重现**。"},
45109:{"w":"stale","e":"There was a smell of stale vegetables in the air.","t":"空气中有一股**不新鲜**的蔬菜的味道。"},
45110:{"w":"chase","e":"The babysitter chased the kids around the yard.","t":"照看孩子的人**追着**孩子满院子地跑。"},
45111:{"w":"grateful","e":"I'd be grateful if you could tell me a little about your time since you've been here in Cambridge.","t":"如果你能够说说来剑桥以后的一些情况，我将不胜**感激**。"},
45112:{"w":"brandy","e":"After dinner, my uncle likes to drink a small glass of brandy by the fire.","t":"晚饭后，我叔叔喜欢坐在炉火旁喝一小杯**白兰地**。"},
45113:{"w":"prevail","e":"The use of horses for ploughing still prevails in this area.","t":"在这一地区用马耕地还很**普遍**。"},
45114:{"w":"convenience","e":"The newly-built apartment building provides gas, electricity and other modern conveniences.","t":"这幢新盖的公寓大楼提供煤气、电以及其他一些现代化**便利设施**。"},
45115:{"w":"cling","e":"The frightened child clung to his mother's arm when the big dog came near.","t":"大狗走近时，受惊的孩子**紧紧抓住**妈妈的胳膊。"},
45116:{"w":"heap","e":"There was a heap of dirty clothes on the floor of his bedroom.","t":"他卧室的地板上有**一堆**脏衣服。"},
45117:{"w":"vivid","e":"She gave such a vivid description of the city that I felt I had been there.","t":"她把那座城市描述得非常**生动**，我感觉自己好像去过那里。"},
45118:{"w":"plumbing","e":"The plumbing in this old building often breaks, so we sometimes have no hot water.","t":"这栋旧楼的**水管**经常坏，所以我们有时没有热水。"},
45119:{"w":"pillow","e":"I can't sleep well in hotels because the pillow is usually too soft for me.","t":"我在酒店里睡不好，因为那里的**枕头**对我来说通常太软了。"},
45120:{"w":"outset","e":"From the outset, she made it clear that she would not work at weekends.","t":"她从**一开始**就讲明了自己周末不上班。"},
45121:{"w":"clip","e":"It is said that the U.S. produces 300 million aluminium paper clips each day.","t":"据说美国每天生产三亿个铝制**回形针**。"},
45122:{"w":"variation","e":"Variations and combinations of these two hat shapes formed the basis of the pupil's final designs.","t":"这两种帽子外形的**改变**和相互融合构成了那个小学生最终设计的基础。"},
45123:{"w":"deserve","e":"These poor people deserve our help.","t":"这些可怜的人**值得**我们帮助。"},
45124:{"w":"intake","e":"It is important not to decrease salt intake too much, as sodium is an essential mineral for the body to function.","t":"钠是维持机体运转的重要矿物元素，因此避免过度减少食盐的**摄取量**非常重要。"},
45125:{"w":"primary","e":"The primary reason for advertising is to sell more goods.","t":"做广告的**首要**目的是要售出更多的货物。"},
45126:{"w":"assignment","e":"Have you been given any writing assignments yet?","t":"有人给你布置写作**作业**了吗？"},
45127:{"w":"pedestrian","e":"Two pedestrians were injured when a car skidded round them.","t":"一辆汽车失控滑向两名**路人**并将其撞伤。"},
45128:{"w":"dense","e":"The airport was closed because of the dense fog.","t":"机场因为**浓**雾而关闭了。"},
45129:{"w":"principal","e":"The Yellow River is one of the principal rivers of Asia.","t":"黄河是亚洲的**主要**河流之一。"},
45130:{"w":"riddle","e":"My little sister loves to tell riddles and make us guess the answers.","t":"我妹妹喜欢出**谜语**让我们猜答案。"},
45131:{"w":"packet","e":"He bought a packet of biscuits and a bottle of water at the station.","t":"他在车站买了**一小包**饼干和一瓶水。"},
45132:{"w":"enable","e":"The bank service enables you to withdraw cash from your account at any time.","t":"这种银行服务**使你能**随时从账户中取钱。"},
45133:{"w":"vulnerable","e":"Women are especially vulnerable to back pain because of pregnancy.","t":"由于怀孕，女性尤其**容易**背痛。"},
45134:{"w":"liberate","e":"The soldiers liberated the city after a long and hard battle in 1945.","t":"1945年，士兵们经过一场漫长而艰苦的战斗**解放**了这座城市。"},
45135:{"w":"omit","e":"Please do not omit any questions on the form, or your application may be refused.","t":"请不要**遗漏**表格上的任何问题，否则你的申请可能会被拒绝。"},
45136:{"w":"waken","e":"The loud noise of the traffic outside my window wakened me at five this morning.","t":"今天早上五点，窗外嘈杂的车声把我**吵醒**了。"},
45137:{"w":"standpoint","e":"From a teacher's standpoint, the new timetable gives students too little time to rest.","t":"从老师的**立场**来看，新的课程表给学生的休息时间太少了。"},
45138:{"w":"adequate","e":"Make sure the children get adequate sleep and healthy food during the exam weeks.","t":"考试那几周要确保孩子们有**足够的**睡眠和健康的饮食。"},
45139:{"w":"plunge","e":"The boy plunged into the cold lake to save his little dog.","t":"男孩**纵身跳进**冰冷的湖里去救他的小狗。"},
45140:{"w":"activity","e":"The school offers many after-class activities, such as music, painting and basketball.","t":"学校提供许多课外**活动**，比如音乐、绘画和篮球。"},
45141:{"w":"cop","e":"A cop stopped the driver because he was going too fast on the highway.","t":"一名**警察**拦下了那个司机，因为他在公路上开得太快了。"},
45142:{"w":"applicable","e":"This rule is applicable to all students, including those in the first year.","t":"这条规定**适用**于所有学生，包括一年级的学生。"},
45143:{"w":"volt","e":"In China, the electricity supply in most homes is about 220 volts, unlike in America.","t":"在中国，大多数家庭的供电电压约为220**伏特**，和美国不同。"},
45144:{"w":"according","e":"According to the weather report, it will rain heavily in our city tomorrow afternoon.","t":"**根据**天气预报，明天下午我们城市会下大雨。"},
45145:{"w":"wander","e":"They enjoyed wandering in this old town.","t":"他们喜欢在这个古镇上**闲逛**。"},
45146:{"w":"arrange","e":"The Language Institute activities coordinator can assist students to arrange any sport and leisure activities.","t":"语言学院的活动负责人可以帮助学生**安排**任何体育和休闲活动。"},
45147:{"w":"shift","e":"Fishermen protested, and the port was shifted a further five kilometres to the south.","t":"由于渔民的反对，港口又向南**移**了五公里。"},
45148:{"w":"luxury","e":"He saved some money for luxuries such as fine paintings.","t":"他积攒了一些钱，想买一些精品油画之类的**奢侈品**。"},
45149:{"w":"canal","e":"Boats carry visitors along the old canal that runs through the center of the town.","t":"游船载着游客沿着穿过镇中心的古**运河**游览。"},
45150:{"w":"chapter","e":"Each chapter of this book ends with a short summary and some questions.","t":"这本书的每个**章节**结尾都有一段简短的总结和几道问题。"},
45151:{"w":"readily","e":"She readily agreed to help me with my maths homework after school.","t":"她**欣然**同意放学后帮我做数学作业。"},
45152:{"w":"device","e":"A wide range of pollution control devices is in place at most modern mines.","t":"大多数现代矿井都配备了大量的污染控制**设备**。"},
45153:{"w":"sophisticated","e":"Space management is now a highly sophisticated method of manipulating the way we shop to ensure maximum profit.","t":"空间管理现在已成为一种非常**尖端**的技术，它通过控制我们的购物方式来实现利润最大化。"},
45154:{"w":"devil","e":"In the old story, the devil promised the farmer gold in exchange for his soul.","t":"在那个古老的故事里，**魔鬼**答应给农夫金子，换取他的灵魂。"},
45155:{"w":"angle","e":"If you look at the problem from a different angle, you may find a much easier answer.","t":"如果你从不同的**角度**看这个问题，也许会找到简单得多的答案。"},
45156:{"w":"damp","e":"The ground is very damp in the rainforest.","t":"热带雨林的地面非常**潮湿**。"},
45157:{"w":"border","e":"We passed the border into Mexico.","t":"我们穿越**边境**进入了墨西哥。"},
45158:{"w":"volume","e":"This liquid was 10 litres in volume.","t":"这一液体的**体积**为十升。"},
45159:{"w":"instruction","e":"The students must follow all instructions exactly.","t":"学生必须准确遵守所有的**指示**。"},
45160:{"w":"warmth","e":"We sat by the fire and enjoyed its warmth after a long walk in the snow.","t":"在雪地里走了很久之后，我们坐在火炉边享受它的**温暖**。"},
45161:{"w":"rhythm","e":"The children clapped their hands happily to the rhythm of the music.","t":"孩子们开心地跟着音乐的**节奏**拍手。"},
45162:{"w":"assumption","e":"The assumption has been shown to be incorrect by recent research.","t":"最近的研究证明这一**假设**不正确。"},
45163:{"w":"creative","e":"Our art teacher always encourages us to be creative and try new ways of painting.","t":"美术老师总是鼓励我们要有**创造性**，尝试新的画法。"},
45164:{"w":"bet","e":"Anyway I bet there are some things you didn't know about bananas.","t":"不管怎样，我**敢说**对于香蕉，你肯定有不知道的地方。"},
45165:{"w":"potential","e":"After the final interview, potential recruits were divided into three categories.","t":"经过最后一轮面试，**有可能**被录用的人被分成三类。"},
45166:{"w":"waterproof","e":"The waterproof match can still work after eight hours in water.","t":"**防水**火柴放在水里八小时后仍能使用。"},
45167:{"w":"spade","e":"The old man used a spade to dig a hole for the new tree.","t":"老人用**铁锹**挖了个坑，准备种新树。"},
45168:{"w":"fry","e":"The cook fried the fish in hot oil until it turned golden.","t":"厨师把鱼放进热油里**油炸**，直到变成金黄色。"},
45169:{"w":"cargo","e":"The ship carried rice and fruit as cargo from the south to the port.","t":"这艘船载着大米和水果等**货物**从南方驶往港口。"},
45170:{"w":"bore","e":"There is such a wide variety of cultures in this program that it is difficult to get bored.","t":"这次的节目中有很多关于不同文化的知识，因此不太容易使人感到**厌倦**。"},
45171:{"w":"permanent","e":"After two years of short-term jobs, he finally got a permanent position at a hospital.","t":"打了两年短工之后，他终于在一家医院得到了一份**固定**工作。"},
45172:{"w":"intangible","e":"Good health and happiness are intangible things that money cannot always buy.","t":"健康和幸福是**无形**的东西，金钱并不总能买到。"},
45173:{"w":"official","e":"English and French are both official languages of Canada, a large country in North America.","t":"英语和法语都是加拿大的**官方**语言，加拿大是北美的一个大国。"},
45174:{"w":"quit","e":"He quit his job in the bank last year to start his own small business.","t":"他去年**辞去**了银行的工作，自己开了一家小公司。"},
45175:{"w":"persevere","e":"If you persevere with your studies, you will surely pass the exam next year.","t":"如果你在学习上**坚持**下去，明年一定能通过考试。"},
45176:{"w":"beast","e":"In the old story, a brave young man saved the village from a terrible beast.","t":"在那个古老的故事里，一个勇敢的年轻人从一头可怕的**野兽**手中救下了村庄。"},
45177:{"w":"region","e":"Although the UK is a fairly small country, the geology and climate vary a good deal from region to region.","t":"尽管英国的国土面积很小，但是不同**地区**间的地况和气候却大相径庭。"},
45178:{"w":"bracket","e":"The teacher told us to put the extra information in brackets after the name.","t":"老师让我们把补充信息写在名字后面的**括号**里。"},
45179:{"w":"drum","e":"My brother practices the drums in his room for an hour every evening.","t":"我弟弟每天晚上在房间里练一小时**架子鼓**。"},
45180:{"w":"overseas","e":"Overseas students may enrol for a course at the college from their home country.","t":"**留学**生可以在本国报名学习大学的课程。"},
45181:{"w":"clown","e":"The children laughed loudly when the clown fell off his tiny bicycle at the circus.","t":"马戏团里，**小丑**从小自行车上摔下来时，孩子们哈哈大笑。"},
45182:{"w":"crash","e":"The two cars crashed into each other.","t":"两辆汽车猛烈**相撞**。"},
45183:{"w":"vote","e":"Everyone in the class will vote for a new monitor tomorrow morning.","t":"明天上午全班同学将**投票**选出新班长。"},
45184:{"w":"pessimism","e":"There is a lot of pessimism about the economy among young people who cannot find jobs.","t":"在找不到工作的年轻人中，对经济的**悲观情绪**很普遍。"},
45185:{"w":"boot","e":"You'd better take along a good pair of hiking boots if you want to take advantage of the wonderful trails in the mountains.","t":"如果想要领略在山中徒步旅行的惊险刺激，你最好带上一双好点儿的户外**长靴**。"},
45186:{"w":"furnace","e":"The workers heat the metal in a huge furnace until it turns red and soft.","t":"工人们在巨大的**熔炉**里加热金属，直到它变红变软。"},
45187:{"w":"siege","e":"The city was under siege for six months, and people had very little food.","t":"这座城市被**围困**了六个月，人们几乎没有食物。"},
45188:{"w":"charm","e":"The old town is full of charm, with its narrow streets and small cafes.","t":"这座古镇充满**魅力**，有狭窄的街道和小咖啡馆。"},
45189:{"w":"wagon","e":"In the old days, farmers used a wagon pulled by horses to carry their crops to town.","t":"过去，农民用马拉的**四轮马车**把庄稼运到镇上。"},
45190:{"w":"blossom","e":"In spring, the apple trees in our garden are covered with white blossom.","t":"春天，我们花园里的苹果树开满了白色的**花朵**。"},
45191:{"w":"volunteer","e":"Mary volunteered to work as a teacher in West Africa.","t":"玛丽**自愿**去西非做一名教师。"},
45192:{"w":"agriculture","e":"Agriculture still employs nearly half of the population in many developing countries, though the share is falling steadily.","t":"在许多发展中国家，**农业**仍然雇用着近一半的人口，尽管这一比例正在稳步下降。"},
45193:{"w":"sip","e":"As you sip the wine, you'll find something special in it.","t":"当你**小口啜饮**这种酒时，你会发现它的独特之处。"},
45194:{"w":"oval","e":"We sat around a large oval table and talked about our plans for the summer.","t":"我们围坐在一张大**椭圆形**桌子旁，聊着暑假计划。"},
45195:{"w":"oven","e":"Bake the bread in a hot oven for about thirty minutes until it turns brown.","t":"把面包放进高温的**烤箱**里烤三十分钟左右，直到变成棕色。"},
45196:{"w":"trifle","e":"Don't get angry with your best friend over such a trifle; it doesn't really matter.","t":"别为这样一件**小事**跟你最好的朋友生气，这真的无关紧要。"},
45197:{"w":"inspire","e":"A leader in a group is very important and his confident attitude will inspire his followers greatly.","t":"一个团队里的领导者是非常重要的，他自信的态度会极大地**鼓舞**团队成员。"},
45198:{"w":"waist","e":"These trousers are too big around the waist, so I need a belt.","t":"这条裤子**腰部**太大了，我需要系条皮带。"},
45199:{"w":"brag","e":"He always likes to brag about how much money his father makes every year.","t":"他总喜欢**吹嘘**他爸爸每年赚多少钱。"},
45200:{"w":"protection","e":"Wearing a helmet gives riders good protection against serious head injuries in an accident.","t":"戴头盔能为骑车人提供很好的**保护**，防止他们在事故中头部受重伤。"},
45201:{"w":"editor","e":"My sister works as an editor for a popular newspaper in Shanghai.","t":"我姐姐在上海一家很受欢迎的报社当**编辑**。"},
45202:{"w":"clone","e":"Dolly the sheep, born in 1996, was the first animal clone made from an adult cell.","t":"多莉羊生于 1996 年，是第一只用成年动物细胞培育出的**克隆动物**。"},
45203:{"w":"argue","e":"The study argues that the type of action needed against passive smoking should be similar to that being taken against other diseases.","t":"该研究**认为**人们需要采取类似防范其他疾病的行动来防范被动吸烟。"},
45204:{"w":"republican","e":"The Republican candidate promised to lower taxes if he won the election.","t":"这位**共和党**候选人承诺，如果当选就减税。"},
45205:{"w":"triple","e":"As a whole, European countries see forests as performing a triple function: biological, economic and recreational.","t":"整体来看，欧洲国家认为森林在以下**三方面**起到了作用：生物、经济以及休闲娱乐。"},
45206:{"w":"given","e":"It is often important that you make it clear what your particular role is at a given time.","t":"明确自己在**特定**时间内的特定角色通常很重要。"},
45207:{"w":"factor","e":"Hard work is the most important factor in her success at school.","t":"努力是她在学校取得成功的最重要**因素**。"},
45208:{"w":"likely","e":"It is likely to rain this afternoon, so you should take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**可能**会下雨，所以你应该带把伞。"},
45209:{"w":"hint","e":"She gave me a hint about the answer, but I still could not guess it.","t":"她给了我一点关于答案的**暗示**，但我还是没猜出来。"},
45210:{"w":"progressive","e":"The doctor said the disease is progressive and will slowly get worse over the years.","t":"医生说这种病是**渐进性**的，会在这几年里慢慢加重。"},
45211:{"w":"wealth","e":"He gained great wealth by running a small online shop for ten years.","t":"他经营一家小网店十年，积累了大量**财富**。"},
45212:{"w":"dissolve","e":"Keep stirring the coffee until the sugar completely dissolves in the hot water.","t":"不停搅拌咖啡，直到糖完全**溶解**在热水里。"},
45213:{"w":"resemble","e":"The little boy closely resembles his father, with the same eyes and the same smile.","t":"这个小男孩和他爸爸长得非常**相像**，眼睛和笑容都一模一样。"},
45214:{"w":"overall","e":"The overall absence rate of the company is 3.6 percent in the first year.","t":"公司第一年度的**总**缺勤率为3.6%。"},
45215:{"w":"splendid","e":"She married that rich man not merely because he is rich and has splendid houses.","t":"她嫁给那个富人，并不仅仅是因为他有钱和**豪华的**房子。"},
45216:{"w":"perception","e":"Living abroad for a year changed her perception of her own culture.","t":"在国外生活一年改变了她对本国文化的**看法**。"},
45217:{"w":"reputation","e":"The college has already established a national reputation for its excellence.","t":"该校凭借着自己的卓越表现已经**享誉**全国。"},
45218:{"w":"ribbon","e":"She tied her hair back with a red ribbon before the dance class.","t":"舞蹈课前，她用一根红**丝带**把头发扎了起来。"},
45219:{"w":"annoy","e":"The bathroom light which flickered quite badly annoyed me very much.","t":"浴室里的灯闪来闪去，真让我**心烦**。"},
45220:{"w":"ending","e":"I didn't like the ending of the film because the hero died in the last scene.","t":"我不喜欢这部电影的**结局**，因为主角在最后一幕死了。"},
45221:{"w":"scarce","e":"Many natural materials are becoming scarce.","t":"许多天然原料濒临**枯竭**。"},
45222:{"w":"residence","e":"Without permission, students may not be allowed to keep motor vehicles at their residence in this university.","t":"未经校方同意，学生不允许在校内的**住宿区**停放机动车辆。"},
45223:{"w":"spill","e":"The beer spilled from the glass.","t":"啤酒从玻璃杯里**溢出**来了。"},
45224:{"w":"politics","e":"My father reads the news every day because he is very interested in politics.","t":"我爸爸每天都看新闻，因为他对**政治**很感兴趣。"},
45225:{"w":"whichever","e":"You can choose whichever seat you like, because nobody else is coming today.","t":"你喜欢**哪个**座位都可以挑，因为今天不会有别人来了。"},
45226:{"w":"character","e":"The interview does give you a bit of information about an applicant's character.","t":"面试确实能给你提供一些和应聘者**性格**有关的信息。"},
45227:{"w":"alphabet","e":"Most children learn the English alphabet by singing a simple song at school.","t":"大多数孩子在学校通过唱一首简单的歌来学英语**字母表**。"},
45228:{"w":"rob","e":"Two men robbed a bank in the city center and escaped in a black car.","t":"两名男子**抢劫**了市中心的一家银行，然后开着一辆黑色汽车逃走了。"},
45229:{"w":"pollute","e":"Waste water from the factory has polluted the river, and most of the fish have died.","t":"工厂排出的废水**污染**了这条河，大部分鱼都死了。"},
45230:{"w":"performance","e":"Profits continue to grow, with strong performance in Asia and South America.","t":"利润持续增长，其中亚洲及南美市场**表现**尤为强劲。"},
45231:{"w":"whereas","e":"My brother loves sports, whereas I prefer staying at home with a good book.","t":"我哥哥热爱运动，**然而**我更喜欢待在家里看一本好书。"},
45232:{"w":"notify","e":"If the library is not notified and you are 15 minutes late, your time can be given to someone else.","t":"如果你没有**通知**图书馆，那么在你迟到15分钟后，你（预约）的时间就会分配给其他人。"},
45233:{"w":"clumsy","e":"These oversized clumsy cars would slow down traffic.","t":"这些体形硕大而**笨拙**的汽车会减缓交通的速度。"},
45234:{"w":"recommend","e":"As treatment for back pain the clinic mainly recommends relaxation therapy.","t":"至于背部疼痛的治疗，诊所主要**推荐**采用放松疗法。"},
45235:{"w":"persist","e":"If the pain persists for more than three days, you should see a doctor.","t":"如果疼痛**持续**三天以上，你就应该去看医生。"},
45236:{"w":"ax","e":"The farmer used an ax to cut the dead tree into small pieces.","t":"农夫用**斧子**把枯树劈成了小块。"},
45237:{"w":"pitch","e":"The boys played football on the pitch behind the school until it got dark.","t":"男孩们在学校后面的**球场**上踢足球，一直踢到天黑。"},
45238:{"w":"margin","e":"I've made some suggestions in the margins.","t":"我在**页边空白**处写了一些建议。"},
45239:{"w":"detect","e":"The robots can detect unauthorised personnel and alert security staff immediately.","t":"机器人能够**发现**未经允许擅自闯入的人员，并马上向保安人员发出警报。"},
45240:{"w":"vital","e":"The Department has a vital role to play in providing information to visitors and scholars.","t":"该部门在为来访者及学者提供信息方面发挥着**极其重要**的作用。"},
45241:{"w":"principle","e":"My father taught me an important principle: always tell the truth, even when it is difficult.","t":"父亲教给我一条重要的**原则**：永远说真话，即使这很难。"},
45242:{"w":"physician","e":"The physician said smoking was harmful to my health.","t":"那位**医生**说吸烟对我的健康有害。"},
45243:{"w":"perform","e":"Why did the divers perform worse in colder conditions?","t":"为什么在较冷的条件下潜水者会**表现**得差些呢？"},
45244:{"w":"regarding","e":"You are allowed to ask questions regarding the fees you are paying.","t":"你们可以**就**自己的付费问题进行提问。"},
45245:{"w":"guy","e":"The guy who sits next to me in class is really funny and friendly.","t":"班上坐我旁边的那个**家伙**又风趣又友善。"},
45246:{"w":"connect","e":"What special food and activities are connected with this festival?","t":"有什么特别的食物和活动与这个节日**相关**？"},
45247:{"w":"peak","e":"Traffic on this road is heaviest at peak hours, between seven and nine in the morning.","t":"这条路在早上七点到九点的**高峰**时段交通最拥堵。"},
45248:{"w":"administration","e":"The administration office is opposite the car park on the left.","t":"**管理**办公室在停车场对面的左边。"},
45249:{"w":"pilot","e":"They owed their lives to the skill of the pilots.","t":"是**飞行员**的技术挽救了他们的生命。"},
45250:{"w":"repetition","e":"Learning new words needs a lot of repetition, so review them every day.","t":"学习新单词需要大量**重复**，所以要每天复习。"},
45251:{"w":"frost","e":"When I woke up, the grass in the garden was white with frost.","t":"我醒来时，花园的草地上落满了白**霜**。"},
45252:{"w":"scold","e":"My mother scolded me for coming home late without calling her first.","t":"我回家晚了又没先打电话，妈妈**责骂**了我一顿。"},
45253:{"w":"spectacular","e":"Tyler and Vanessa are seated near floor-to-ceiling windows affording a spectacular view of the city.","t":"泰勒和瓦尼莎坐在落地窗边，**壮观**市景尽收眼底。"},
45254:{"w":"pirate","e":"Anybody can pirate our music and software without proper laws.","t":"如果没有适当的法规出台，任何人都可以**盗用**我们的音乐和软件。"},
45255:{"w":"intense","e":"Large thunderclouds generate the intense electrical fields that cause lightning flashes.","t":"巨大的雷雨云产生**极强**的电磁场，从而形成闪电。"},
45256:{"w":"humour","e":"Our English teacher has a good sense of humour and often makes the whole class laugh.","t":"我们的英语老师很有**幽默**感，常常逗得全班哈哈大笑。"},
45257:{"w":"compact","e":"The bag must be compact and light for easy transport.","t":"这个包必须**小巧**轻便以便于运输。"},
45258:{"w":"edition","e":"The new edition of this dictionary includes thousands of words connected with the internet.","t":"这本词典的新**版本**收录了数千个和互联网有关的词。"},
45259:{"w":"achievement","e":"Winning the national science prize was a remarkable achievement for such a young research team.","t":"对于这样一个年轻的研究团队来说，赢得国家科学奖是一项了不起的**成就**。"},
45260:{"w":"straightforward","e":"The instructions for the new phone are straightforward, so you can set it up in minutes.","t":"新手机的说明书**简单易懂**，几分钟就能设置好。"},
45261:{"w":"speculate","e":"I began to speculate about how she was spending her time.","t":"我开始**猜测**她是如何打发时光的。"},
45262:{"w":"fare","e":"According to Susan, air fares are the lowest.","t":"据苏珊说，机票**价格**是最便宜的。"},
45263:{"w":"ward","e":"After the operation, my uncle was moved to a quiet ward on the fifth floor.","t":"手术后，我叔叔被转到了五楼一间安静的**病房**。"},
45264:{"w":"dumb","e":"She was struck dumb with surprise when she heard she had won the prize.","t":"听说自己获奖了，她惊讶得**说不出话**来。"},
45265:{"w":"salad","e":"For lunch I had a big bowl of salad with tomatoes, eggs and cheese.","t":"午饭我吃了一大碗加了西红柿、鸡蛋和奶酪的**色拉**。"},
45266:{"w":"pistol","e":"The police found a small pistol hidden under the driver's seat of the car.","t":"警察在汽车驾驶座下面发现了一把藏着的小**手枪**。"},
45267:{"w":"handwriting","e":"The teacher could hardly read my homework because my handwriting was so messy.","t":"我的**笔迹**太潦草了，老师几乎看不清我的作业。"},
45268:{"w":"flame","e":"The house was in flames.","t":"房子失**火**了。"},
45269:{"w":"setback","e":"Losing the first game was a setback, but the team still won the championship.","t":"输掉第一场比赛是个**挫折**，但这支队伍最后还是夺得了冠军。"},
45270:{"w":"educate","e":"Parents should educate their children to be honest and kind to others.","t":"父母应该**教育**孩子诚实、善待他人。"},
45271:{"w":"convention","e":"The city's convention center is also a famous landmark in the country.","t":"该市的**会议**中心也是这个国家的一个著名地标。"},
45272:{"w":"compatible","e":"Accuracy is not always compatible with haste.","t":"准确与匆忙难以**兼容**，忙中难免出错。"},
45273:{"w":"landlord","e":"Our landlord said he would raise the rent of the flat next month.","t":"我们的**房东**说下个月要涨房租。"},
45274:{"w":"network","e":"The city has a good network of buses and subways, so getting around is easy.","t":"这座城市的公交和地铁**网络**很完善，出行很方便。"},
45275:{"w":"inland","e":"Today about 90 per cent of inland freight in the United Kingdom is carried by road.","t":"现在，公路承担了英国约90％的**内陆**运输。"},
45276:{"w":"glove","e":"It was so cold that I wore a thick pair of gloves to school.","t":"天太冷了，我戴了一副厚**手套**去上学。"},
45277:{"w":"reservation","e":"I was advised to make a reservation in advance for the seats.","t":"别人建议我提前**预订**座位。"},
45278:{"w":"slogan","e":"Their slogan is \"Deeds not words\".","t":"他们的**口号**是“要行动不要空话”。"},
45279:{"w":"scope","e":"The scope of the environmental problem facing the world's cities is immense.","t":"世界上的许多城市面临着大**范围**的环境问题。"},
45280:{"w":"plentiful","e":"Fresh fruit is plentiful and cheap in the market during the summer months.","t":"夏天几个月里，市场上的新鲜水果**充足**又便宜。"},
45281:{"w":"theft","e":"He reported the theft of his bike to the police the next morning.","t":"第二天早上，他向警察报告了自行车**被盗**的事。"},
45282:{"w":"weaken","e":"He weakened as the illness grew worse.","t":"他病情加重，身体日益**衰弱**。"},
45283:{"w":"classify","e":"The researcher has classified environmental tobacco smoke in the highest risk category for causing cancer.","t":"研究人员将环境香烟烟雾**归类**于最高风险致癌物。"},
45284:{"w":"refusal","e":"His refusal to help his friends with the move made everyone quite angry.","t":"他**拒绝**帮朋友搬家，让大家都很生气。"},
45285:{"w":"weapon","e":"The police found the weapon that the robber had thrown into the river.","t":"警方找到了劫匪扔进河里的**武器**。"},
45286:{"w":"weave","e":"She learned to weave baskets from her grandmother when she was a child.","t":"她小时候跟奶奶学会了**编织**篮子。"},
45287:{"w":"diameter","e":"The diameter of the pipe is three inches.","t":"这根管子的**直径**为三英寸。"},
45288:{"w":"weep","e":"The old woman began to weep when she heard that her son was safe after the earthquake.","t":"听说儿子在地震后平安无事，老太太激动得**流泪**了。"},
45289:{"w":"crane","e":"A huge crane lifted the heavy steel beams to the top of the new building.","t":"一台巨大的**起重机**把沉重的钢梁吊到了新楼顶部。"},
45290:{"w":"soar","e":"House prices in the city have soared in the past five years, and many young people cannot afford a home.","t":"过去五年，这座城市的房价**猛增**，很多年轻人买不起房子。"},
45291:{"w":"gallon","e":"My car uses about one gallon of petrol for every thirty miles I drive.","t":"我的车每开三十英里大约耗油一**加仑**。"},
45292:{"w":"muscle","e":"Swimming is a good way to build strong muscles without hurting your knees.","t":"游泳是锻炼强壮**肌肉**又不伤膝盖的好方法。"},
45293:{"w":"molecule","e":"Watson demonstrated the structure of the DNA molecule.","t":"沃森展示了DNA的**分子**结构。"},
45294:{"w":"convert","e":"The original house was converted into a residential college.","t":"原来的房子被**改建**成一所寄宿学院。"},
45295:{"w":"admire","e":"I really admire my mother for raising three children while working full time.","t":"我真心**钦佩**妈妈，她一边全职工作一边养大了三个孩子。"},
45296:{"w":"gaze","e":"The little girl gazed at the stars for a long time and dreamed of flying into space.","t":"小女孩**凝视**着星星很久，梦想着飞向太空。"},
45297:{"w":"publish","e":"Her first novel was published when she was only nineteen years old.","t":"她的第一部小说**出版**时她才十九岁。"},
45298:{"w":"exclude","e":"Thick curtains help to exclude street noises.","t":"厚窗帘有助于**阻挡**街上的噪音。"},
45299:{"w":"risk","e":"Driving too fast in the rain greatly increases the risk of an accident.","t":"雨天开快车会大大增加发生事故的**风险**。"},
45300:{"w":"market","e":"My mother goes to the market every morning to buy fresh fruit and vegetables.","t":"我妈妈每天早上去**市场**买新鲜的水果和蔬菜。"},
45301:{"w":"inquire","e":"I called the station to inquire about the time of the last train to Beijing.","t":"我打电话到车站**询问**去北京的末班车时间。"},
45302:{"w":"fee","e":"The school has raised its fee for next year by ten percent, which worries many parents.","t":"学校把明年的**费用**提高了百分之十，这让很多家长很担心。"},
45303:{"w":"kneel","e":"Mary knelt down to examine the damage to her car.","t":"玛丽**跪**下来仔细查看汽车的受损情况。"},
45304:{"w":"dialect","e":"The tourists were confused by the unfamiliar dialects in this area.","t":"游客被该地不熟悉的**方言**弄得满头雾水。"},
45305:{"w":"mature","e":"Jane is very mature for her age.","t":"简年龄不大，却很**成熟**。"},
45306:{"w":"postpone","e":"The sports meet was finally postponed because of the bad weather.","t":"由于天气恶劣，运动会最终被**推迟**了。"},
45307:{"w":"accident","e":"Three people were hurt in a traffic accident on the highway last night.","t":"昨晚高速公路上发生了一起交通**事故**，三人受伤。"},
45308:{"w":"reality","e":"Many young people find that the reality of working life is very different from their dreams.","t":"许多年轻人发现，工作生活的**现实**和他们的梦想大不相同。"},
45309:{"w":"click","e":"To open the file, just click on the small blue button at the top of the page.","t":"要打开文件，只要**点击**页面顶部那个蓝色小按钮就行。"},
45310:{"w":"identify","e":"She was able to identify the man who stole her bag from the photos the police showed her.","t":"她从警察给她看的照片里**认出**了偷她包的那个人。"},
45311:{"w":"provided","e":"I'll buy the cup, provided that the price is right.","t":"**倘若**价格合适，我就买这个杯子。"},
45312:{"w":"curiosity","e":"Children are full of curiosity and ask questions about almost everything they see.","t":"孩子们充满**好奇心**，看到几乎什么都要问。"},
45313:{"w":"liter","e":"Adults should drink about two liters of water a day, especially in hot weather.","t":"成年人每天应该喝大约两**公升**水，天热时尤其如此。"},
45314:{"w":"weed","e":"Every weekend we pull the weeds out of the garden so the flowers can grow.","t":"每个周末我们都会把花园里的**杂草**拔掉，好让花长得好。"},
45315:{"w":"organ","e":"The heart and the lungs are two of the most important organs in the human body.","t":"心脏和肺是人体最重要的两个**器官**。"},
45316:{"w":"convince","e":"That man tries to convince the employer that any shortcomings he has will not prevent him from doing a good job.","t":"那个男人努力让雇主**相信**，他身上的任何缺点都不会妨碍他做好工作。"},
45317:{"w":"instrument","e":"We use questionnaires as our main research instrument.","t":"我们将问卷调查作为主要的研究**手段**。"},
45318:{"w":"grind","e":"Tension may cause you to chew too forcefully or grind your teeth when you are sleeping.","t":"紧张可能导致你在睡觉时用力咀嚼或是**磨**牙。"},
45319:{"w":"headline","e":"What sort of national events make headlines in your country?","t":"在贵国，哪种类型的国内事件会成为**头条新闻**呢？"},
45320:{"w":"scratch","e":"There is a small scratch on my bag.","t":"我的包上有一道不长的**划痕**。"},
45321:{"w":"harmony","e":"All his brothers and sisters are living together in perfect harmony.","t":"他的兄弟姐妹们生活在一起并相处得非常**融洽**。"},
45322:{"w":"disaster","e":"The flood was a disaster for the village, destroying hundreds of homes and farms.","t":"这场洪水对村子来说是一场**灾难**，毁掉了数百座房屋和农田。"},
45323:{"w":"dependent","e":"Many small island nations are heavily dependent on tourism, so a fall in visitors can damage their economies.","t":"许多小岛国严重**依赖**旅游业，因此游客减少会损害它们的经济。"},
45324:{"w":"lamb","e":"In spring, the farmer's sheep gave birth to five lambs on the hill.","t":"春天，农场主的羊在山坡上生了五只**小羊**。"},
45325:{"w":"welfare","e":"The office deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"该办公室专门处理与学生**福利**相关的各种事务。"},
45326:{"w":"moral","e":"Altering our genetic inheritance is a moral problem.","t":"改变我们的遗传基因是一个**伦理**问题。"},
45327:{"w":"column","e":"The old library has tall white stone columns at its front entrance.","t":"这座老图书馆的正门前立着几根高大的白色**圆柱**。"},
45328:{"w":"pierce","e":"The bullet pierced the police officer's vest.","t":"子弹**打穿**了警官的防弹衣。"},
45329:{"w":"individual","e":"The food is served in individual portions.","t":"食物是按**一人**一份供给的。"},
45330:{"w":"weekly","e":"The school library holds a weekly reading club for students who love stories.","t":"学校图书馆为喜欢故事的学生举办**每周**一次的读书会。"},
45331:{"w":"ankle","e":"She hurt her ankle while playing basketball and could not walk for a week.","t":"她打篮球时伤了**脚踝**，一个星期都走不了路。"},
45332:{"w":"loan","e":"Does this mean I'm not eligible for a student loan?","t":"这是不是意味着我不符合学生**贷款**的条件？"},
45333:{"w":"riot","e":"The police were called when the angry crowd started a riot outside the football stadium.","t":"愤怒的人群在足球场外引发了**骚乱**，警察被叫来了。"},
45334:{"w":"radiation","e":"Too much radiation from the sun can damage your skin, so wear a hat in summer.","t":"太阳的**辐射**过多会损伤皮肤，所以夏天要戴帽子。"},
45335:{"w":"divide","e":"All the students will be divided into groups of 12 to 15 students.","t":"所有的学生将被**分成**小组，每组12到15人。"},
45336:{"w":"being","e":"Scientists are still looking for signs of living beings on other planets.","t":"科学家们仍在其他星球上寻找**生物**存在的迹象。"},
45337:{"w":"origin","e":"The origins of what is now generally known as modern architecture can be traced back to the social and technological changes of the 18th and 19th centuries.","t":"通常意义上的现代建筑学的**起源**可以追溯到18、19世纪的社会和科技变革。"},
45338:{"w":"chin","e":"He sat at his desk with his chin in his hand, thinking about the problem.","t":"他坐在桌前，手托着**下巴**，思考着这个问题。"},
45339:{"w":"plus","e":"Ten plus five equals fifteen, as every child in the first grade knows.","t":"十**加上**五等于十五，这是每个一年级小孩都知道的。"},
45340:{"w":"well-known","e":"The city is well-known for its delicious food and beautiful old buildings.","t":"这座城市因美食和美丽的老建筑而**闻名**。"},
45341:{"w":"minimum","e":"The minimum speed on the freeway is 45 km/h.","t":"这条高速公路上的**最低**时速为45公里。"},
45342:{"w":"nightmare","e":"Traveling on the bad mountain roads is a nightmare.","t":"在崎岖的山路上旅行真是件**可怕的事**。"},
45343:{"w":"exhaust","e":"She was exhausted by her four kids.","t":"四个孩子让她**筋疲力尽**。"},
45344:{"w":"lump","e":"After he hit his head on the door, a lump appeared on his forehead.","t":"他的头撞到门后，额头上起了个**肿块**。"},
45345:{"w":"budget","e":"I'm going to talk about ways of making sure that you eat well while at the same time staying within your budget.","t":"我将会谈到一些方法，让你在不超过**预算**的前提下吃好。"},
45346:{"w":"hardship","e":"The family faced great hardship after the father lost his job last winter.","t":"去年冬天父亲失业后，这家人陷入了极大的**困苦**。"},
45347:{"w":"shield","e":"She held up her hand to shield her eyes from the strong sun.","t":"她举起手**遮挡**眼睛，避开强烈的阳光。"},
45348:{"w":"chart","e":"The first chart shows the reasons why adults decide to study.","t":"第一张**图表**显示成年人决定进行学习的原因。"},
45349:{"w":"stool","e":"There are no chairs in the small kitchen, only two wooden stools by the window.","t":"小厨房里没有椅子，只有窗边的两张木**凳子**。"},
45350:{"w":"loose","e":"The soil in which coffee is grown must be rich, moist and sufficiently loose to allow rapid drainage.","t":"种植咖啡的土壤必须肥沃、潮湿且土质十分**疏松**以便迅速排水。"},
45351:{"w":"porter","e":"A porter at the station helped the old man carry his heavy bags to the train.","t":"车站的一名**搬运工**帮老人把沉重的包搬上了火车。"},
45352:{"w":"booth","e":"In our company, we work in separate booths.","t":"在公司里，我们在**隔间**里工作。"},
45353:{"w":"scissors","e":"Can I borrow your scissors for a minute? I need to cut out this picture.","t":"我能借用一下你的**剪刀**吗？我要剪下这张图片。"},
45354:{"w":"dusk","e":"You can catch a glimpse of some more of the rainforest's wildlife as it comes out at dusk to feed.","t":"**黄昏**时分，当雨林中的野生动物出来觅食时，你能看见更多的野生动物。"},
45355:{"w":"coherent","e":"The archaeologist has to develop a picture of the past, just as the scientist has to develop a coherent view of the natural world.","t":"考古学家需要提供一张过去的图片，就如同科学家需要描绘出自然世界的**连贯**图景。"},
45356:{"w":"somewhat","e":"I was somewhat surprised that he passed the exam without studying at all.","t":"他一点没复习就通过了考试，我**有点儿**吃惊。"},
45357:{"w":"souvenir","e":"I bought a small model of the Eiffel Tower as a souvenir of my trip to Paris.","t":"我买了一个埃菲尔铁塔的小模型，作为巴黎之行的**纪念品**。"},
45358:{"w":"plague","e":"In the 14th century, the plague killed millions of people across Europe.","t":"十四世纪，**鼠疫**夺去了欧洲数百万人的生命。"},
45359:{"w":"skip","e":"She skips the difficult words when she reads English novels.","t":"看英文小说时她经常**跳过**难词。"},
45360:{"w":"bubble","e":"The water in the pan was beginning to bubble.","t":"锅里的水开始**冒泡**。"},
45361:{"w":"deliberate","e":"Wilson has a slow, deliberate way of acting.","t":"威尔逊动作缓慢而**谨慎**。"},
45362:{"w":"glow","e":"The lamp in the window gave off a warm glow that made the room feel cozy.","t":"窗边的台灯发出温暖的**光亮**，让房间显得很舒适。"},
45363:{"w":"intimate","e":"The dance studio provides a smaller, more intimate space, which we use for ballet, modern dance and martial arts.","t":"舞蹈室为我们练习芭蕾、现代舞和武术提供了一个更小、更**私密**的空间。"},
45364:{"w":"catalog","e":"I found a nice jacket in the shop's online catalog and ordered it right away.","t":"我在这家店的网上**目录**里看中了一件漂亮的夹克，马上就下了单。"},
45365:{"w":"injure","e":"Three people were injured in the car accident, but luckily nobody was killed.","t":"有三人在这起车祸中**受伤**，幸好没有人死亡。"},
45366:{"w":"defeat","e":"Now both coaches know semifinal defeat could cost them their jobs.","t":"现在双方的教练都很清楚，半决赛**失败**可能会让他们丢掉工作。"},
45367:{"w":"salesman","e":"The salesman showed us several new cars and explained the price of each one.","t":"**推销员**给我们看了几辆新车，并逐一介绍了价格。"},
45368:{"w":"objective","e":"The objective of the Human Genome Project is simple to state.","t":"人类基因工程的**目标**很容易说明。"},
45369:{"w":"bacon","e":"For breakfast, my father likes eggs and bacon with a cup of black coffee.","t":"早餐时，我爸爸喜欢吃鸡蛋和**培根**，再配一杯黑咖啡。"},
45370:{"w":"liver","e":"Doctors say that drinking too much alcohol for many years can seriously damage your liver.","t":"医生说，多年过量饮酒会严重损害你的**肝脏**。"},
45371:{"w":"alter","e":"We may be able to alter our genetic inheritance if we so choose.","t":"如果愿意，我们可以**改变**自己的基因遗传。"},
45372:{"w":"creature","e":"The ocean is home to many strange creatures that people have never seen before.","t":"海洋里生活着许多人们从未见过的奇怪**生物**。"},
45373:{"w":"inevitable","e":"Making mistakes is inevitable when you are learning a new language, so don't be afraid.","t":"学习一门新语言时犯错是**不可避免的**，所以不要害怕。"},
45374:{"w":"electricity","e":"The storm cut off the electricity, so we had to use candles for the whole evening.","t":"暴风雨切断了**电力**，我们只好点了一晚上蜡烛。"},
45375:{"w":"probable","e":"It is probable that the train will be late because of the heavy snow.","t":"因为下大雪，火车**很可能**会晚点。"},
45376:{"w":"deck","e":"We stood on the deck of the ship and watched the sun go down.","t":"我们站在船的**甲板**上看着太阳落下。"},
45377:{"w":"apparent","e":"This tendency was apparent in the late 1980s.","t":"这种趋势在20世纪80年代末很**明显**。"},
45378:{"w":"fuss","e":"My grandmother always fusses when we come home a little late from school.","t":"我们放学回家稍晚一点，奶奶总是**大惊小怪**。"},
45379:{"w":"arrangement","e":"We have made all the arrangements for the school trip, including buses and lunch.","t":"我们已经为学校郊游做好了一切**安排**，包括大巴和午饭。"},
45380:{"w":"occupy","e":"The enemy army occupied the small city for three years during the war.","t":"战争期间，敌军**占领**了这座小城三年。"},
45381:{"w":"wax","e":"My mother lit a candle, and the hot wax slowly ran down onto the table.","t":"妈妈点了一支蜡烛，滚烫的**蜡油**慢慢流到了桌上。"},
45382:{"w":"forbid","e":"The school rules forbid students to use their mobile phones during the exam.","t":"校规**禁止**学生在考试时使用手机。"},
45383:{"w":"hunt","e":"In the past, people in this area had to hunt wild animals for food.","t":"过去，这一带的人们得靠**捕猎**野生动物来获取食物。"},
45384:{"w":"financial","e":"The government introduced new rules to protect the financial system after several banks collapsed during the crisis.","t":"在危机中几家银行倒闭后，政府出台了新规来保护**金融**体系。"},
45385:{"w":"account","e":"Coal is expected to account for almost 27 percent of the world's energy needs.","t":"预计对煤炭的需求将几乎**占**世界能源需求的27%。"},
45386:{"w":"arrow","e":"Follow the red arrows on the floor and you will find the way to the exit.","t":"沿着地上的红色**箭头**走，你就能找到出口。"},
45387:{"w":"sequence","e":"Scientists were able to analyse the sequence of events.","t":"科学家能够分析事件发生的**先后顺序**。"},
45388:{"w":"operator","e":"The machine operator must wear gloves and glasses while he is working.","t":"机器**操作人员**工作时必须戴手套和护目镜。"},
45389:{"w":"poll","e":"The team is conducting a poll among freshmen.","t":"这个小组正在新生中进行一次**民意调查**。"},
45390:{"w":"concede","e":"The defeated side had to concede some of their territory to the enemy.","t":"战败的一方不得不把部分领土**割让**给敌人。"},
45391:{"w":"whilst","e":"Whilst I was waiting for the bus, it suddenly started to rain very heavily.","t":"我在等公交车**的时候**，突然下起了大雨。"},
45392:{"w":"grape","e":"My grandfather grows grapes in his garden and makes juice from them every autumn.","t":"我爷爷在园子里种**葡萄**，每年秋天都用它们榨汁。"},
45393:{"w":"brand","e":"What brand of cola do you like?","t":"你喜欢喝什么**牌子**的可乐？"},
45394:{"w":"lid","e":"Put the lid back on the jar so the cookies stay fresh and crisp.","t":"把**盖子**盖回罐子上，这样饼干才能保持新鲜酥脆。"},
45395:{"w":"capacity","e":"Without genetic variability a species lacks the capacity to evolve and cannot adapt to changes in its environment.","t":"如果没有遗传的多样性，物种就会缺乏进化的**能力**，也就不能适应其环境的变化。"},
45396:{"w":"junior","e":"She started as a junior clerk and became the manager of the bank ten years later.","t":"她从一名**资历较浅的**职员做起，十年后当上了银行经理。"},
45397:{"w":"humble","e":"Although he is a famous scientist, he is very humble and polite to everyone.","t":"尽管他是位著名科学家，但他非常**谦逊**，对谁都很有礼貌。"},
45398:{"w":"refresh","e":"My job is to make sure that you all feel relaxed and refreshed.","t":"我的工作就是保证你们都感觉放松且**精力充沛**。"},
45399:{"w":"whale","e":"We took a boat out to sea and saw a huge whale jumping out of the water.","t":"我们乘船出海，看到一头巨大的**鲸鱼**跃出水面。"},
45400:{"w":"descend","e":"The plane began to descend slowly as we got close to the airport.","t":"快到机场时，飞机开始慢慢**下降**。"},
45401:{"w":"applicant","e":"We have interviewed twenty-six applicants and none of them are qualified.","t":"我们已经面试了26个**申请者**，没一人符合条件。"},
45402:{"w":"crust","e":"My little brother always cuts off the crust before eating his bread at breakfast.","t":"我弟弟早饭吃面包前总要把**面包皮**切掉。"},
45403:{"w":"furniture","e":"We bought some new furniture for the living room, including a sofa and two chairs.","t":"我们给客厅买了一些新**家具**，包括一张沙发和两把椅子。"},
45404:{"w":"guidance","e":"Under the guidance of their teacher, the students finished the science project in two weeks.","t":"在老师的**指导**下，学生们用两周完成了这个科学项目。"},
45405:{"w":"mention","e":"He mentioned in his letter that he might be moving abroad.","t":"他在信中**提到**他可能要移居国外。"},
45406:{"w":"aggressive","e":"Our neighbor's dog is quite aggressive and often barks at people passing by.","t":"邻居家的狗很**好斗**，经常冲着路人叫。"},
45407:{"w":"ounce","e":"This bag of tea weighs only four ounces, but it is very expensive.","t":"这袋茶叶只有四**盎司**重，却非常贵。"},
45408:{"w":"guideline","e":"These standards are based on guidelines set out by the major control boards.","t":"这些标准是基于主管委员会拟定的**指导方针**制定的。"},
45409:{"w":"invent","e":"Do you know who invented the telephone more than one hundred years ago?","t":"你知道一百多年前是谁**发明**了电话吗？"},
45410:{"w":"ashamed","e":"I felt ashamed of myself for lying to my best friend about the broken phone.","t":"我因为手机摔坏的事对好朋友撒了谎，感到很**惭愧**。"},
45411:{"w":"insight","e":"Her book gives readers an insight into the lives of poor families in the city.","t":"她的书让读者得以**洞悉**城市贫困家庭的生活。"},
45412:{"w":"plantation","e":"Many workers on the tea plantation start picking leaves early in the morning.","t":"茶叶**种植园**的许多工人一大早就开始采茶。"},
45413:{"w":"draft","e":"You must think a great deal before you start writing your draft.","t":"你在开始打**草稿**之前一定要考虑周全。"},
45414:{"w":"nuclear","e":"France derives three quarters of its electricity from nuclear power.","t":"法国四分之三的电来自**核**能。"},
45415:{"w":"accurate","e":"The forecast was soon proved accurate.","t":"不久，预言就被证明是**正确**的。"},
45416:{"w":"whip","e":"Whip the cream until it becomes thick, and then spread it over the top of the cake.","t":"把奶油**搅打**到浓稠，然后抹在蛋糕上面。"},
45417:{"w":"seminar","e":"You should prepare before you attend this seminar.","t":"参加这次**研讨会**之前你应该准备一下。"},
45418:{"w":"mankind","e":"The invention of the computer was one of the greatest steps forward for mankind.","t":"计算机的发明是**人类**最伟大的进步之一。"},
45419:{"w":"greenhouse","e":"My grandfather grows tomatoes in a small greenhouse so he can eat them even in winter.","t":"爷爷在一个小**温室**里种西红柿，这样冬天也能吃到。"},
45420:{"w":"colony","e":"Australia was once a British colony, so English became its main language.","t":"澳大利亚曾是英国的**殖民地**，所以英语成了它的主要语言。"},
45421:{"w":"log","e":"The earliest peoples probably stored fire by keeping slow burning logs alight.","t":"早期的人类很可能是通过让**原木**保持缓慢燃烧的状态来保存火种的。"},
45422:{"w":"coinage","e":"The word selfie is a fairly recent coinage that spread quickly through social media.","t":"selfie 这个词是近年**新创的词语**，通过社交媒体迅速传开。"},
45423:{"w":"jeans","e":"He usually wears jeans and a T-shirt when he goes out with friends.","t":"他和朋友出去时通常穿**牛仔裤**和T恤。"},
45424:{"w":"neighbourhood","e":"There are several good schools and a large park in our neighbourhood.","t":"我们家**附近**有好几所好学校和一个大公园。"},
45425:{"w":"shuttle","e":"The shuttle can carry devices for scientific inquiry.","t":"这架**航天飞机**能携带科学考察装置。"},
45426:{"w":"collaborate","e":"I hope your department could collaborate with me on the new project.","t":"我希望你们部门能够在新项目上**配合**我工作。"},
45427:{"w":"preview","e":"We watched a preview of the new film before it came out in cinemas.","t":"新电影在影院上映前，我们看了它的**预映**。"},
45428:{"w":"skeleton","e":"The museum shows the skeleton of a huge dinosaur that lived millions of years ago.","t":"博物馆展出了一具生活在数百万年前的巨型恐龙**骨骼**。"},
45429:{"w":"thesis","e":"She spent a whole year writing her thesis on the history of tea in China.","t":"她花了整整一年写关于中国茶叶历史的**论文**。"},
45430:{"w":"competitive","e":"Tom is very competitive and always wants to finish first, even in friendly games with his classmates.","t":"汤姆很**好胜**，即使是和同学玩友谊游戏也总想拿第一。"},
45431:{"w":"resist","e":"Bugs and weeds will begin to resist poisons.","t":"害虫和野草会开始产生**抗**药性。"},
45432:{"w":"widen","e":"The city plans to widen the main road to reduce traffic jams in the morning.","t":"市里计划**加宽**主干道，以减少早上的交通堵塞。"},
45433:{"w":"destroy","e":"The big fire destroyed more than fifty houses in the small mountain village.","t":"这场大火**毁掉**了这个小山村里的五十多所房子。"},
45434:{"w":"genius","e":"Everyone says the boy is a genius because he could play the piano at the age of three.","t":"大家都说这个男孩是个**天才**，因为他三岁就会弹钢琴。"},
45435:{"w":"era","e":"Dallas is a very wealthy city in Texas which has grown up in an era when cars were considered essential to move about.","t":"达拉斯是得克萨斯州一个非常富裕的城市，兴起于汽车成为基本交通工具的**时代**。"},
45436:{"w":"application","e":"I think this invention has many useful applications.","t":"我认为这项发明非常有用，会被广泛**应用**。"},
45437:{"w":"hut","e":"The farmer lived alone in a small wooden hut at the foot of the mountain.","t":"那位农夫独自住在山脚下的一间木头**小屋**里。"},
45438:{"w":"arise","e":"Problems may arise if you don't read the instructions carefully before you start.","t":"如果开始之前不仔细阅读说明，就可能**出现**问题。"},
45439:{"w":"impatient","e":"The passengers grew impatient when the train was delayed for more than an hour.","t":"火车晚点了一个多小时，乘客们变得**不耐烦**了。"},
45440:{"w":"community","e":"Our local community has built a new library and a small park for children.","t":"我们当地的**社区**新建了一座图书馆和一个儿童小公园。"},
45441:{"w":"poem","e":"Every student had to learn a short poem by heart for the class.","t":"每个学生都得为这堂课背一首简短的**诗歌**。"},
45442:{"w":"logic","e":"Miranda holds the belief that science and logic will unlock the mysteries of the plague.","t":"米兰达坚信科学和**逻辑**会解开这场瘟疫的未解之谜。"},
45443:{"w":"isolate","e":"Sick patients are isolated from others so that the disease does not spread.","t":"病人被**隔离**起来，以免疾病传播。"},
45444:{"w":"width","e":"Please measure the width of the window before you buy new curtains.","t":"买新窗帘之前，请先量一下窗户的**宽度**。"},
45445:{"w":"negotiate","e":"By no means does everyone in the world know English well enough to negotiate in it.","t":"要让世界上每个人的英语都好得可以用它来进行**谈判**是不可能的。"},
45446:{"w":"whoever","e":"Whoever finishes the test first can leave the classroom a little early today.","t":"今天**无论谁**先做完测试，都可以早点离开教室。"},
45447:{"w":"grammar","e":"Reading English books every day helps me learn new words and improve my grammar.","t":"每天读英文书帮我学到新单词，也提高了我的**语法**水平。"},
45448:{"w":"whisper","e":"I saw Peter whisper something to Michael.","t":"我看见彼得跟迈克尔**小声说**了些什么。"},
45449:{"w":"snap","e":"The heavy snow storm snapped tree branches and power lines.","t":"暴风雪**折断**了树枝和电线。"},
45450:{"w":"wisdom","e":"My grandmother has the wisdom that comes from a long life full of ups and downs.","t":"我奶奶拥有历经一生起伏得来的**智慧**。"},
45451:{"w":"germ","e":"Wash your hands before meals so that germs do not get into your body.","t":"饭前要洗手，这样**细菌**就不会进入你的身体。"},
45452:{"w":"ache","e":"After the long walk up the mountain, my legs ached for two days.","t":"爬了很长一段山路之后，我的双腿**疼痛**了两天。"},
45453:{"w":"insult","e":"He felt insulted when his boss laughed at his idea in front of everyone.","t":"老板当着大家的面嘲笑他的想法，他觉得受到了**侮辱**。"},
45454:{"w":"withdraw","e":"The general ordered his soldiers to withdraw from the town before the enemy arrived.","t":"将军命令士兵在敌人到来之前从镇上**撤退**。"},
45455:{"w":"optical","e":"We'll discuss optical fibres and how they could be used in the future to improve optical instruments.","t":"我们将讨论光纤以及将来如何把它们用于改善**光学**仪器等问题。"},
45456:{"w":"freight","e":"Heavy freight could only be carried by water or rail.","t":"大型**货物**只能通过水路或铁路来运输。"},
45457:{"w":"aspect","e":"Money is important, but it is only one aspect of a happy life.","t":"钱很重要，但它只是幸福生活的一个**方面**。"},
45458:{"w":"alarm","e":"Every time when you leave your house, make sure the windows and doors are shut, and set the burglar alarm.","t":"每次出门时都应确定门窗已关好，并打开防盗**警铃**。"},
45459:{"w":"physical","e":"Doctors say regular physical exercise is good for both your body and your mind.","t":"医生说，经常进行**身体**锻炼对身心都有好处。"},
45460:{"w":"require","e":"Every house built near the airport requires the exterior walls to be double-brick to reduce noise.","t":"所有建造在机场附近的住房都**要求**采用双层砖的外墙来降低噪音。"},
45461:{"w":"wholly","e":"I am not wholly sure that his plan will work, but we can try it.","t":"我不**完全**确定他的计划行得通，但我们可以试一试。"},
45462:{"w":"wit","e":"Everyone enjoys his talks because of his quick wit and funny stories.","t":"大家都喜欢听他讲话，因为他机智**风趣**，故事也有意思。"},
45463:{"w":"beam","e":"The little girl beamed a warm smile at him.","t":"那个小女孩冲他热情地**微笑**。"},
45464:{"w":"semester","e":"We will have six courses and two important exams in the first semester.","t":"第一**学期**我们有六门课和两次重要考试。"},
45465:{"w":"hostile","e":"The new boy felt lonely because some classmates were hostile to him in his first week.","t":"新来的男孩很孤独，因为第一周有些同学对他很**不友善**。"},
45466:{"w":"smash","e":"The boy kicked his ball too hard and smashed the kitchen window.","t":"男孩踢球太用力，**打碎**了厨房的窗户。"},
45467:{"w":"impress","e":"Those uniforms for the military were originally intended to impress and even terrify the enemy.","t":"最初设计军装是为了给敌人**留下深刻的印象**，甚至威慑敌人。"},
45468:{"w":"reject","e":"They are cheap because they are rejects.","t":"它们是**不合格品**，所以便宜。"},
45469:{"w":"responsible","e":"You are responsible for looking after your little sister while I am at work.","t":"我上班的时候，由你**负责**照顾妹妹。"},
45470:{"w":"fate","e":"He believed it was fate that brought him and his wife together at the train station.","t":"他相信是**命运**让他和妻子在火车站相遇。"},
45471:{"w":"purchase","e":"If you'd like to purchase any of George's books or other souvenirs, leave the house by the side entrance.","t":"如果你想**购买**乔治的书或其他纪念品，请从房子的侧门离开。"},
45472:{"w":"affection","e":"The old couple still show great affection for each other after fifty years of marriage.","t":"这对老夫妻结婚五十年了，仍然对彼此怀有深厚的**感情**。"},
45473:{"w":"maximum","e":"Students on a visitor visa or work permit may study for a maximum of 3 months.","t":"持旅行签证或工作许可证的学生**最多**可有三个月的学习时间。"},
45474:{"w":"commute","e":"Eventually, it is predicted that many people may be able to work at home instead of commuting to the office in the future.","t":"据预测，在未来许多人最终可以在家办公，而不用乘公交**往返上下班**。"},
45475:{"w":"detail","e":"I'll put up a notice with details of the restaurant and the menu.","t":"我会张贴一份有关饭店和菜单内容的**详细**通知。"},
45476:{"w":"wicked","e":"Of course, at the end of the story, the wicked witch gets killed.","t":"当然，**邪恶**的女巫在故事的最后被杀死了。"},
45477:{"w":"installment","e":"We bought the new car and will pay for it in monthly installments over three years.","t":"我们买了这辆新车，将在三年内按月**分期付款**。"},
45478:{"w":"accompany","e":"My father always accompanies my grandmother when she goes to see the doctor.","t":"奶奶去看病时，爸爸总是**陪着**她。"},
45479:{"w":"possess","e":"She possesses a great talent for music and can play four instruments.","t":"她**拥有**很高的音乐天赋，会演奏四种乐器。"},
45480:{"w":"spouse","e":"How your child adapts to your divorce is largely dependent on how you and your spouse act.","t":"你的孩子如何适应你的离婚主要取决于你和你**配偶**的行为举止。"},
45481:{"w":"whistle","e":"This is where you whistle so the key holder will open the door for you.","t":"你在这里**吹口哨**，这样看门人就会给你开门。"},
45482:{"w":"widespread","e":"The use of friction to make fire was also widespread in Europe.","t":"摩擦生火的办法在欧洲也**广为流传**。"},
45483:{"w":"trolley","e":"I put the heavy bags on a trolley and pushed it to the check-in desk at the airport.","t":"我把沉重的包放到**手推车**上，推到了机场的值机柜台。"},
45484:{"w":"refugee","e":"Thousands of refugees crossed the border to escape the war in their country.","t":"成千上万的**难民**越过边境，逃离本国的战争。"},
45485:{"w":"active","e":"My grandfather is still very active and goes swimming three times a week.","t":"我爷爷仍然很**活跃**，每周游泳三次。"},
45486:{"w":"warehouse","e":"The company keeps all its new computers in a large warehouse near the port.","t":"这家公司把所有新电脑存放在港口附近的一个大**仓库**里。"},
45487:{"w":"embarrass","e":"My mother embarrassed me by showing my baby photos to all my friends.","t":"妈妈把我小时候的照片拿给所有朋友看，让我十分**窘迫**。"},
45488:{"w":"beard","e":"My grandfather has a long white beard and looks like Father Christmas.","t":"我爷爷留着长长的白**胡子**，看起来像圣诞老人。"},
45489:{"w":"intact","e":"She hopes that her honor could remain intact.","t":"她希望自己的名誉依旧能够**无损**。"},
45490:{"w":"inhabitant","e":"The natural history of the Amazon is to a surprising extent tied to the activities of its prehistoric inhabitants.","t":"亚马孙河的自然历史与其史前**居民**的活动有着极为密切的关系。"},
45491:{"w":"postage","e":"How much is the postage for sending this parcel to my aunt in Canada?","t":"把这个包裹寄给我在加拿大的姨妈要多少**邮费**？"},
45492:{"w":"podcast","e":"I often listen to an English podcast on my way to school in the morning.","t":"早上上学路上，我常听一个英语**播客**。"},
45493:{"w":"collective","e":"The decision, made by the board of directors, is the result of collective agreement.","t":"董事会做出的决定是**集体**同意的结果。"},
45494:{"w":"widow","e":"After her husband died, the widow lived alone with her two cats.","t":"丈夫去世后，这位**寡妇**和她的两只猫独自生活。"},
45495:{"w":"spontaneous","e":"When the singer appeared on stage, the crowd burst into spontaneous applause before she had sung a note.","t":"歌手一出现在舞台上，还没开口唱，观众就**自发**地鼓起掌来。"},
45496:{"w":"ruin","e":"The heavy rain ruined our picnic, so we had to eat lunch in the car.","t":"大雨**毁掉**了我们的野餐，我们只好在车里吃午饭。"},
45497:{"w":"happen","e":"Nobody knows exactly what happened on the night the old bridge fell down.","t":"没人确切知道老桥倒塌那晚**发生**了什么。"},
45498:{"w":"whisky","e":"He poured a glass of whisky and sat by the fire to read.","t":"他倒了一杯**威士忌**，坐在炉火边看书。"},
45499:{"w":"province","e":"My parents came from a small town in another province to work in Shanghai.","t":"我父母来自另一个**省份**的小镇，后来到上海工作。"},
45500:{"w":"element","e":"Hard work is an important element of success, but good luck also plays a part.","t":"努力是成功的一个重要**要素**，但好运气也起一定作用。"},
45501:{"w":"toss","e":"He tossed the empty bottle into the bin and walked back to his desk.","t":"他把空瓶子**扔**进垃圾桶，走回了自己的桌子。"},
45502:{"w":"bonus","e":"Every worker got a bonus at the end of the year because sales were good.","t":"因为销量好，每个工人年底都拿到了一笔**奖金**。"},
45503:{"w":"tuition","e":"Her parents work two jobs to pay her university tuition and living costs.","t":"她父母打两份工来支付她的大学**学费**和生活费。"},
45504:{"w":"ware","e":"Farmers from nearby villages come to the market every Sunday to sell their wares.","t":"附近村子的农民每周日来集市上卖他们的**货物**。"},
45505:{"w":"commence","e":"Most courses commence at 9 a.m. and run until 3 p.m.","t":"大部分课程上午9点**开始**，下午3点结束。"},
45506:{"w":"weird","e":"I heard a weird noise outside my window in the middle of the night.","t":"半夜里，我听到窗外有一种**古怪的**声音。"},
45507:{"w":"jewel","e":"The queen wore a golden crown covered with shining jewels at the ceremony.","t":"女王在典礼上戴着一顶镶满闪亮**宝石**的金冠。"},
45508:{"w":"owner","e":"The owner of the lost dog offered a reward to anyone who could find it.","t":"走失小狗的**主人**表示，谁能找到它就给谁报酬。"},
45509:{"w":"mixture","e":"Today, scientists continue to experiment with new glass mixtures.","t":"如今，科学家们继续对新型的玻璃**混合物**进行试验。"},
45510:{"w":"preliminary","e":"The preliminary results of the survey show that most students want a longer lunch break.","t":"调查的**初步**结果显示，大多数学生希望午休时间更长一些。"},
45511:{"w":"passive","e":"Instead of being passive in class, try to ask questions and share your ideas.","t":"上课时不要**被动**听讲，试着提问并分享你的想法。"},
45512:{"w":"currency","e":"Before the trip, I changed some money into the local currency at the bank.","t":"出发前，我在银行把一些钱换成了当地**货币**。"},
45513:{"w":"withstand","e":"A desert animal can withstand high body temperatures.","t":"生活在沙漠中的动物可以**忍受**较高的体温。"},
45514:{"w":"chaos","e":"The house was in chaos after the Christmas party.","t":"圣诞晚会过后，房间**一片狼藉**。"},
45515:{"w":"outlet","e":"Playing football is a good outlet for the boys' energy after a long day at school.","t":"在学校待了一整天之后，踢足球是男孩们**发泄**精力的好途径。"},
45516:{"w":"insect","e":"Bees are useful insects because they help flowers and fruit trees grow.","t":"蜜蜂是有益的**昆虫**，因为它们帮助花和果树生长。"},
45517:{"w":"motive","e":"The police couldn't find a motive for the murder.","t":"警方未能找出这起谋杀的**动机**。"},
45518:{"w":"facility","e":"There are facilities for high-energy particle experiments in our research centre.","t":"我们的研究中心有高能粒子实验**设备**。"},
45519:{"w":"civil","e":"Personality questionnaires were used by the ancient Chinese for picking out civil servants.","t":"古代中国人用性格问卷来挑选**政府文职**人员。"},
45520:{"w":"attract","e":"We kept the price low to attract more visitors here.","t":"我们保持低价以**吸引**更多的游客前来。"},
45521:{"w":"attorney","e":"She called her attorney as soon as the police asked her to answer some questions.","t":"警察一要求她回答问题，她就给自己的**律师**打了电话。"},
45522:{"w":"scrape","e":"He scraped the mud off his shoes with the knife.","t":"他用小刀**刮去**鞋上的泥土。"},
45523:{"w":"revise","e":"I need to revise my essay before I hand it in to the teacher on Friday.","t":"周五交给老师之前，我得把作文**修改**一下。"},
45524:{"w":"regulate","e":"More than 300 dams regulate river flows around the country.","t":"有300多座大坝**控制**着全国的河水流量。"},
45525:{"w":"blast","e":"The workers had to blast through the rock to build the new road.","t":"为了修新路，工人们不得不**爆破**岩石。"},
45526:{"w":"senate","e":"The new law must be passed by the Senate before it can take effect.","t":"这项新法律必须经**参议院**通过才能生效。"},
45527:{"w":"intend","e":"I intend to visit my grandparents in the countryside during the winter holiday.","t":"寒假期间我**打算**去乡下看望爷爷奶奶。"},
45528:{"w":"witness","e":"Tom witnessed the accident.","t":"汤姆**目睹**了那起意外事故。"},
45529:{"w":"observe","e":"Scientists spent months in the forest observing how the young birds learned to fly.","t":"科学家们在森林里花了几个月**观察**幼鸟是怎样学会飞的。"},
45530:{"w":"brick","e":"The old school was built with red bricks more than a hundred years ago.","t":"这所老学校是一百多年前用红色**砖块**建成的。"},
45531:{"w":"melt","e":"Salt helps melt ice.","t":"盐可以使冰**融化**。"},
45532:{"w":"alcohol","e":"Doctors say that drinking too much alcohol is bad for both your body and your mind.","t":"医生说，摄入过多**酒精**对身体和精神都有害。"},
45533:{"w":"measure","e":"The nurse measured my height and weight before I saw the doctor.","t":"看医生之前，护士给我**测量**了身高和体重。"},
45534:{"w":"scream","e":"The students screamed in excitement.","t":"学生们激动得**尖叫**起来。"},
45535:{"w":"radar","e":"The plane disappeared from the radar screen soon after it took off.","t":"飞机起飞后不久就从**雷达**屏幕上消失了。"},
45536:{"w":"claw","e":"Be careful with that cat, because its sharp claws can easily hurt your hands.","t":"小心那只猫，它锋利的**爪子**很容易抓伤你的手。"},
45537:{"w":"hopeless","e":"The situation seemed hopeless, but the doctors never stopped trying to save him.","t":"情况看起来**没有希望**了，但医生们从未停止抢救他。"},
45538:{"w":"gum","e":"Please do not chew gum in class or leave it under your desk.","t":"上课时请不要嚼**口香糖**，也不要把它粘在课桌下面。"},
45539:{"w":"rat","e":"We found a big rat in the kitchen and called someone to catch it.","t":"我们在厨房里发现了一只大**老鼠**，就找人来抓它。"},
45540:{"w":"wolf","e":"The farmer built a high fence to keep the wolf away from his sheep.","t":"农民建了一道高高的栅栏，防止**野狼**靠近他的羊。"},
45541:{"w":"worm","e":"After the rain, many worms came out of the ground and onto the path.","t":"雨后，许多**虫子**从地里钻出来，爬到了小路上。"},
45542:{"w":"feasible","e":"Better integration of transport systems is made more feasible by modern computers.","t":"现代计算机的应用使得交通系统**有可能**得到更好的统筹。"},
45543:{"w":"sacrifice","e":"Linda's parents made sacrifices so that she could have a good education abroad.","t":"为了让琳达能在国外接受良好的教育，琳达的父母做出了**牺牲**。"},
45544:{"w":"grip","e":"She gripped on to the railing with both hands.","t":"她双手**紧紧抓住**栏杆。"},
45545:{"w":"parcel","e":"I went to the post office to send a parcel of books to my cousin.","t":"我去邮局给表弟寄了一个装着书的**包裹**。"},
45546:{"w":"forge","e":"The man was caught when he tried to forge his boss's name on the document.","t":"那个男人试图在文件上**伪造**老板的签名，结果被抓住了。"},
45547:{"w":"optimistic","e":"Psychologists have conducted studies showing that people become more optimistic when the weather is sunny.","t":"心理学家已进行的研究表明，人们在阳光灿烂的日子里会更加**乐观**。"},
45548:{"w":"worthless","e":"The old painting turned out to be worthless, because it was only a copy.","t":"那幅旧画原来**毫无价值**，因为它只是一件复制品。"},
45549:{"w":"lover","e":"My uncle is a great lover of classical music and goes to concerts every month.","t":"我叔叔是古典音乐的忠实**爱好者**，每个月都去听音乐会。"},
45550:{"w":"nature","e":"We spent the weekend in the countryside, enjoying the beauty of nature.","t":"我们在乡下过周末，欣赏**大自然**的美。"},
45551:{"w":"leap","e":"The athlete tensed his muscles for the leap.","t":"运动员绷紧肌肉准备**跳跃**。"},
45552:{"w":"connection","e":"Scientists have found a connection between lack of sleep and poor memory.","t":"科学家发现缺少睡眠和记忆力差之间存在**联系**。"},
45553:{"w":"brilliant","e":"That's a brilliant solution to the problem.","t":"那可真是一个解决问题的**绝妙**办法。"},
45554:{"w":"horizon","e":"We watched the sun slowly sink below the horizon as the sky turned orange and red.","t":"我们看着太阳慢慢沉到**地平线**以下，天空变成了橙红色。"},
45555:{"w":"wool","e":"My grandmother knitted me a warm scarf with soft wool last winter.","t":"去年冬天，奶奶用柔软的**毛线**给我织了一条暖和的围巾。"},
45556:{"w":"worldwide","e":"The internet has made it easy to build a worldwide network of friends.","t":"互联网让建立一个**遍及全球的**朋友圈变得很容易。"},
45557:{"w":"socialism","e":"The students learned about the history of socialism in their politics class this term.","t":"这学期学生们在政治课上学习了**社会主义**的历史。"},
45558:{"w":"identical","e":"The two sisters look identical, so even their teachers often mix them up.","t":"这两姐妹长得**一模一样**，连老师都常常把她们搞混。"},
45559:{"w":"inferior","e":"In general, schooling in suburbs is inferior to that in downtown, interior regions to coastal ones.","t":"一般而言，城郊的学校教育**不如**市中心的，内陆的不如沿海的。"},
45560:{"w":"premier","e":"The premier was injured in a bomb attack.","t":"**总理**在一次炸弹袭击中受伤。"},
45561:{"w":"preceding","e":"As I explained in the preceding chapter, the city was founded more than 500 years ago.","t":"正如我在**前一**章中所说，这座城市建于五百多年前。"},
45562:{"w":"audio","e":"Teams of typists transcribed the audio tapes to produce a computerised database of ten million words.","t":"一组组打字员把**录音**磁带转录下来，制成包含一千万个单词的电脑数据库。"},
45563:{"w":"sparkle","e":"The lake sparkled in the bright morning sun as we walked along the shore.","t":"我们沿着湖岸散步时，湖水在明亮的晨光下**闪闪发光**。"},
45564:{"w":"workshop","e":"Our school held a two-day workshop to help teachers use computers in class.","t":"我们学校举办了一个为期两天的**讲习班**，帮助老师在课堂上使用电脑。"},
45565:{"w":"circulate","e":"Fresh air circulates through the whole room when we open both windows at night.","t":"晚上我们把两扇窗户都打开时，新鲜空气就在整个房间里**流通**。"},
45566:{"w":"commonplace","e":"Mobile phones are now commonplace, even among old people in small villages.","t":"手机现在已经很**普通**了，连小村庄里的老人都在用。"},
45567:{"w":"entry","e":"Entry to the city museum is free for all students on Monday afternoons.","t":"每周一下午，所有学生都可以免费**进入**市博物馆参观。"},
45568:{"w":"abandon","e":"She and her tribe had to abandon their lands and retreat to Canada.","t":"她和她的部落被迫**放弃**了土地，退到加拿大。"},
45569:{"w":"transit","e":"They wish to put mass transit systems into and around cities and promote small low emission cars for urban use.","t":"他们希望将**公共交通**系统用于城市和城际交通，而将排气量低的小汽车用于市区交通。"},
45570:{"w":"digest","e":"Chemists were searching for a fat that could be digested more easily by infants.","t":"药剂师们正在寻找一种婴儿能更容易**消化**的脂肪。"},
45571:{"w":"pattern","e":"How do you think the Internet has affected buying patterns in the past few years?","t":"你认为在过去几年内互联网如何影响了购买**模式**？"},
45572:{"w":"wrinkle","e":"My grandmother has many wrinkles on her face, but her smile is still beautiful.","t":"奶奶脸上有很多**皱纹**，但她的笑容依然很美。"},
45573:{"w":"rate","e":"Prices in this city are rising at a rate that worries many young families.","t":"这座城市的物价正以令许多年轻家庭担忧的**速度**上涨。"},
45574:{"w":"assist","e":"The Student Union is intended to assist in teachers' work.","t":"学生会旨在**协助**老师的工作。"},
45575:{"w":"commune","e":"In the 1960s, many young people left the cities to live together in communes.","t":"二十世纪六十年代，许多年轻人离开城市，一起住进了**公社**。"},
45576:{"w":"define","e":"Health in the physical sense has been defined as the absence of disease or illness.","t":"就身体而言，健康的**意思是**不受疾病的困扰。"},
45577:{"w":"index","e":"If you want to find a word quickly, look it up in the index at the back of the book.","t":"想快速找到一个词，就去查书后面的**索引**。"},
45578:{"w":"splash","e":"I refreshed myself by splashing cold water on my face.","t":"我往脸上**扑**冷水让自己精神起来。"},
45579:{"w":"fulfill","e":"She worked hard for years and finally fulfilled her dream of becoming a doctor.","t":"她努力了很多年，终于**实现**了当医生的梦想。"},
45580:{"w":"worship","e":"Every Sunday morning, many families in the village go to the church for worship.","t":"每个星期天早上，村里很多家庭都去教堂做**礼拜**。"},
45581:{"w":"transaction","e":"The teller told me that the computer system was temporarily down, so they couldn't do any transactions.","t":"出纳员告诉我计算机系统临时出故障了，所以他们不能进行任何**交易**。"},
45582:{"w":"generous","e":"People in disaster-affected areas received generous aid from the government.","t":"受灾地区的人民从政府那里得到了**大量的**救济物资。"},
45583:{"w":"fleet","e":"A large fleet of ships left the harbor early in the morning and came back at sunset.","t":"一支庞大的**船队**清晨驶离港口，日落时才返回。"},
45584:{"w":"influence","e":"What factors do you think influence these decisions?","t":"你认为**影响**这些决定的因素有哪些？"},
45585:{"w":"deaf","e":"My grandfather is a little deaf, so I have to speak loudly to him.","t":"我爷爷有点**耳聋**，所以我得大声跟他说话。"},
45586:{"w":"halt","e":"That country halted most oil exports.","t":"该国**暂停**了大部分的石油出口。"},
45587:{"w":"document","e":"Please bring all the important documents with you when you apply for a passport.","t":"申请护照时，请随身携带所有重要**文件**。"},
45588:{"w":"spoil","e":"Some parents spoil their only child by buying him everything he asks for.","t":"有些父母**宠坏**了自己的独生子，他要什么就给他买什么。"},
45589:{"w":"complex","e":"The new sports complex has everything needed for many different activities.","t":"新建的**综合**体育馆能为多种活动提供所需的一切设施。"},
45590:{"w":"worthy","e":"I would praise him, but he is not worthy.","t":"我想表扬他，但他不**值得**。"},
45591:{"w":"wrist","e":"She wore a beautiful silver watch that her father gave her on her left wrist.","t":"她左**手腕**上戴着一块父亲送给她的漂亮银表。"},
45592:{"w":"ghost","e":"My little brother is afraid that a ghost lives in the old house next door.","t":"我弟弟害怕隔壁那座老房子里住着**鬼魂**。"},
45593:{"w":"dot","e":"The town looked like a tiny dot on the map, far away from any big city.","t":"地图上那个小镇看起来就像一个小**圆点**，离任何大城市都很远。"},
45594:{"w":"invisible","e":"Could there be another planet there, essentially similar to our own, but always invisible?","t":"那里会不会有另一颗星球和我们的星球很相似，但我们却一直**看不见**呢？"},
45595:{"w":"coarse","e":"It's good for you to walk on the coarse sand with bare feet.","t":"光脚在**粗**沙上走动对你有好处。"},
45596:{"w":"heading","e":"The heading of the article was printed in large red letters across the top.","t":"这篇文章的**标题**用大号红字印在页面顶端。"},
45597:{"w":"writer","e":"My favorite writer has just published a new novel about a family living in the countryside.","t":"我最喜欢的**作家**刚出版了一部新小说，讲的是一个住在乡下的家庭。"},
45598:{"w":"patch","e":"My grandmother sewed a colorful patch over the hole in my old jeans.","t":"奶奶在我旧牛仔裤的破洞上缝了一块彩色**补丁**。"},
45599:{"w":"oxygen","e":"At the top of a high mountain there is less oxygen, so breathing becomes harder.","t":"在高山顶上，**氧气**比较少，所以呼吸会变得更困难。"},
45600:{"w":"civilian","e":"Many civilians lost their homes during the war, though they had nothing to do with the fighting.","t":"战争期间，许多**平民**失去了家园，尽管他们与战斗毫无关系。"},
45601:{"w":"favourite","e":"My favourite subject at school is history, because I love stories about the past.","t":"我在学校**最喜欢的**科目是历史，因为我喜欢关于过去的故事。"},
45602:{"w":"roar","e":"We could hear the lion roar from the other side of the zoo.","t":"我们在动物园的另一头都能听到狮子**吼叫**。"},
45603:{"w":"writing","e":"Her writing has improved a lot since she started keeping a diary in English.","t":"自从她开始用英语写日记，她的**写作**进步了很多。"},
45604:{"w":"await","e":"Thousands of students are nervously awaiting the results of the national exam they took last month.","t":"成千上万的学生正紧张地**等待**着上个月全国考试的成绩。"},
45605:{"w":"fluent","e":"She is fluent in English and French because she grew up in Canada.","t":"她在加拿大长大，所以英语和法语都很**流利**。"},
45606:{"w":"X-ray","e":"The doctor took an X-ray of my arm to see whether the bone was broken.","t":"医生给我的手臂拍了**X光片**，看看骨头有没有断。"},
45607:{"w":"rust","e":"If you leave your bike out in the rain, it will start to rust very quickly.","t":"如果把自行车放在外面淋雨，它很快就会**生锈**。"},
45608:{"w":"poet","e":"Li Bai is one of the most famous poets in Chinese history, and children still learn his poems.","t":"李白是中国历史上最著名的**诗人**之一，孩子们至今仍在学他的诗。"},
45609:{"w":"gaol","e":"The thief was caught by the police and sent to gaol for two years.","t":"小偷被警察抓住，被关进**监狱**两年。"},
45610:{"w":"acquire","e":"In the process of evolution, monkeys have not acquired the art of speech.","t":"在进化的过程中，猴子未能**获得**语言能力。"},
45611:{"w":"gym","e":"I go to the gym after work three times a week to keep fit.","t":"我每周下班后去三次**健身房**锻炼身体。"},
45612:{"w":"hire","e":"She was hired three years ago.","t":"她是三年前被**录用**的。"},
45613:{"w":"prejudice","e":"Some people still have a prejudice against women who work as engineers or pilots.","t":"有些人对当工程师或飞行员的女性仍然抱有**偏见**。"},
45614:{"w":"resign","e":"The minister was forced to resign in 2019.","t":"2019年，该部长被迫**辞职**。"},
45615:{"w":"confuse","e":"I'm afraid I'm a bit confused by what you said just now.","t":"恐怕我被你刚才说的话弄得有点**糊涂**。"},
45616:{"w":"yield","e":"Higher yields have been achieved by increased irrigation and better crop breeding.","t":"已通过增加灌溉和提高育种质量实现了**产量**的增长。"},
45617:{"w":"accuracy","e":"The technician placed the machine in the correct spot with complete accuracy.","t":"技术员**分毫不差**地将机器安放在正确的位置。"},
45618:{"w":"wrap","e":"I will wrap all of your birthday gifts.","t":"我会把你所有的生日礼物都**包**起来。"},
45619:{"w":"garbage","e":"Please take out the garbage before you leave for work in the morning.","t":"早上去上班前请把**垃圾**拿出去。"},
45620:{"w":"generate","e":"Compared with ordinary coal, new \"clean coals\" may generate power more efficiently.","t":"和普通煤相比，新型的“高纯度”煤可以提高**发**电效率。"},
45621:{"w":"sexual","e":"The company has strict rules against sexual discrimination when it hires new staff.","t":"公司在招聘新员工时严格禁止**性别**歧视。"},
45622:{"w":"overtake","e":"It is dangerous to overtake another car on a narrow and winding mountain road.","t":"在狭窄弯曲的山路上**超过**别的车很危险。"},
45623:{"w":"bolt","e":"Before going to bed, my father always pushes the bolt across the back door.","t":"睡觉前，爸爸总会把后门的**插销**插上。"},
45624:{"w":"endless","e":"The long meeting seemed endless, and many people began to look at their watches.","t":"这场长会似乎**无休止**地开下去，很多人开始看表。"},
45625:{"w":"gravity","e":"Because of gravity, an apple falls to the ground instead of flying up into the sky.","t":"因为有**重力**，苹果会落到地上，而不是飞向天空。"},
45626:{"w":"gallery","e":"We'll go to the Picture Gallery with a marvellous collection of paintings all by Australian artists.","t":"我们将前往**美术馆**，那里收藏了一些优秀的画作，它们全部出自澳大利亚画家之手。"},
45627:{"w":"occupation","e":"Please state your name, age and occupation on the form.","t":"请在表格里填写姓名、年龄和**职业**。"},
45628:{"w":"yawn","e":"The movie was so boring that I couldn't stop yawning in my seat.","t":"电影太无聊了，我坐在座位上不停地**打哈欠**。"},
45629:{"w":"existence","e":"Scientists still argue about the existence of life on other planets far away from Earth.","t":"科学家们仍在争论遥远的其他星球上是否**存在**生命。"},
45630:{"w":"extra","e":"Today, almost all companies have employees work overtime rather than hire extra personnel.","t":"如今，几乎所有的公司宁愿让员工加班也不愿意雇用**额外**的职员。"},
45631:{"w":"sideways","e":"The sofa was too wide, so we had to carry it sideways through the door.","t":"沙发太宽了，我们只好**侧着**把它搬进门。"},
45632:{"w":"percentage","e":"What percentage of the workforce was employed in agriculture in this country in the mid 1900s?","t":"在20世纪中期，这个国家从事农业的劳动力在总劳动力中占多大**比例**？"},
45633:{"w":"intensive","e":"Intensive English classes are taught in four-week blocks throughout the year.","t":"**强化**英语班全年授课，四周为一期。"},
45634:{"w":"bundle","e":"She tied the old newspapers into a bundle and put it by the door.","t":"她把旧报纸扎成**一捆**，放在门边。"},
45635:{"w":"specific","e":"Do you have any specific studying goals for this year?","t":"今年你有**具体的**学习目标吗？"},
45636:{"w":"candidate","e":"These forms have to be filled out by the candidates.","t":"这些表格需要由**申请者**来填写。"},
45637:{"w":"leather","e":"These shoes are made of real leather, so they are more expensive than the others.","t":"这双鞋是用真正的**皮革**做的，所以比别的鞋贵。"},
45638:{"w":"youngster","e":"The old man enjoys teaching the youngsters in his village how to play chess.","t":"老人喜欢教村里的**年轻人**下棋。"},
45639:{"w":"wreck","e":"The storm wrecked dozens of houses along the coast, and many families had nowhere to live.","t":"暴风雨**毁坏**了沿海的几十座房屋，许多家庭无处可住。"},
45640:{"w":"concentration","e":"This concentration of vehicles makes air quality in urban areas unpleasant and sometimes dangerous to breathe.","t":"交通工具的**集中**造成城市地区空气质量的恶劣，有时甚至不宜呼吸。"},
45641:{"w":"tram","e":"I am watching for my tram because sometimes it comes early.","t":"我正留意我要坐的那班**有轨电车**，因为它有时候会早到。"},
45642:{"w":"aboard","e":"All the passengers aboard the plane were safe after it landed in the storm.","t":"飞机在暴风雨中降落后，**机上**所有乘客都安然无恙。"},
45643:{"w":"portable","e":"This portable radio is small enough to carry in your pocket when you go hiking.","t":"这台**便携式**收音机很小，徒步时可以放在口袋里带着。"},
45644:{"w":"warfare","e":"Modern warfare uses computers and drones as much as soldiers and guns.","t":"现代**战争**既用士兵和枪炮，也大量使用电脑和无人机。"},
45645:{"w":"festival","e":"During the festival, the streets are full of lanterns, music and happy families.","t":"**节日**期间，街道上到处是灯笼、音乐和快乐的家庭。"},
45646:{"w":"elegant","e":"She wore an elegant black dress to the concert and looked like a movie star.","t":"她穿着一条**优雅**的黑裙子去听音乐会，看起来像个电影明星。"},
45647:{"w":"blur","e":"Without my glasses, the words on the blackboard are just a blur to me.","t":"不戴眼镜的话，黑板上的字在我看来就是一片**模糊**。"},
45648:{"w":"single","e":"My aunt is still single and lives alone in a small flat in the city.","t":"我姨妈至今**单身**，一个人住在城里的一套小公寓里。"},
45649:{"w":"spray","e":"Farmers are spraying the crops with pesticide.","t":"农民们正在给庄稼**喷洒**杀虫剂。"},
45650:{"w":"commodity","e":"Nowadays, the airlines are treating their seats like a commodity.","t":"现在，航空公司把客机的席位看作是一种**商品**（进行出售）。"},
45651:{"w":"federal","e":"I opened a current account at the Federal Bank.","t":"我在**联邦**银行开了一个活期账户。"},
45652:{"w":"yearly","e":"Our yearly family trip to the beach is the thing I look forward to most.","t":"我们家**每年**一次的海边旅行是我最期待的事。"},
45653:{"w":"intrude","e":"I'm sorry to intrude, but could I ask you a quick question about the meeting?","t":"抱歉**打扰**一下，我能问您一个关于会议的简单问题吗？"},
45654:{"w":"microscope","e":"Under the microscope, the students could see tiny living things in the water.","t":"在**显微镜**下，学生们能看到水中微小的生物。"},
45655:{"w":"funeral","e":"Many friends and neighbors came to the old man's funeral to say goodbye.","t":"许多朋友和邻居来参加老人的**葬礼**，向他告别。"},
45656:{"w":"preach","e":"My grandfather likes to preach about saving money, but he spends a lot himself.","t":"我爷爷总爱**宣传**省钱的好处，可他自己花钱却不少。"},
45657:{"w":"attach","e":"They attached the coupon to the front of the letter.","t":"他们把优惠券**附**在信的正面。"},
45658:{"w":"acute","e":"Dogs have very acute hearing.","t":"狗的听觉很**灵敏**。"},
45659:{"w":"startle","e":"The sudden knock on the door startled me, and I dropped my cup.","t":"突然的敲门声把我**吓了一跳**，我把杯子掉在了地上。"},
45660:{"w":"zone","e":"There are many different climatic zones in Australia.","t":"澳大利亚有很多不同的气候**带**。"},
45661:{"w":"token","e":"Please accept this small gift as a token of our thanks for your help.","t":"请收下这份小礼物，作为我们感谢您帮助的**标志**。"}
});
